#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:1
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-pubcloud.adoc:29
#, no-wrap
msgid "Activation Keys"
msgstr "Kunci Aktivasi"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:2
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-pubcloud.adoc:30
msgid "Activation keys are used to ensure that your clients have the correct software entitlements, are connecting to the appropriate channels, and are subscribed to the relevant groups.  Each activation key is bound to an organization, which you can set when you create the key."
msgstr "Kunci aktivasi digunakan untuk memastikan bahwa klien Anda memiliki hak penggunaan perangkat lunak yang benar, terhubung ke saluran yang sesuai, dan berlangganan grup yang relevan.  Setiap kunci aktivasi terikat pada suatu organisasi, yang dapat Anda tetapkan saat membuat kunci."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:3
msgid "In {productname}, an activation key is a group of configuration settings with a label.  You can apply all configuration settings associated with an activation key by adding its label as a parameter to a bootstrap script.  We recommend you use an activation key label in combination with a bootstrap script.  When the bootstrap script is executed all configuration settings associated with the label are applied to the system the script is run on."
msgstr "Dalam {productname}, kunci aktivasi adalah sekumpulan pengaturan konfigurasi yang diberi label.  Anda dapat menerapkan semua pengaturan konfigurasi yang terkait dengan kunci aktivasi dengan menambahkan labelnya sebagai parameter ke skrip bootstrap.  Kami menyarankan agar Anda menggunakan label kunci aktivasi bersama skrip bootstrap.  Saat skrip bootstrap dijalankan, semua pengaturan konfigurasi yang terkait dengan label tersebut diterapkan pada sistem tempat skrip dijalankan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:4
msgid "An activation key can specify:"
msgstr "Kunci aktivasi dapat menentukan:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:5
msgid "Channel assignment"
msgstr "Penetapan saluran"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:6
msgid "System types or add-on entitlements"
msgstr "Jenis sistem atau hak penggunaan add-on"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:7
msgid "Contact method"
msgstr "Metode kontak"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:8
msgid "Configuration files"
msgstr "Berkas konfigurasi"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:9
msgid "Packages to be installed"
msgstr "Paket yang akan diinstal"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:10
msgid "AppStreams to be enabled"
msgstr "AppStreams yang akan diaktifkan"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:11
msgid "System group assignment"
msgstr "Penetapan grup sistem"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:12
msgid "Activation keys are used at the time a client is registered, and not used again.  After the client has been registered, the client can be changed in any way, regardless of what the activation key specifies.  The association between the activation key and the client is recorded only for historical purposes."
msgstr "Kunci aktivasi digunakan saat klien didaftarkan dan tidak digunakan lagi setelahnya.  Setelah klien terdaftar, klien dapat diubah dengan cara apa pun, terlepas dari pengaturan yang ditentukan oleh kunci aktivasi.  Hubungan antara kunci aktivasi dan klien dicatat hanya untuk keperluan riwayat."

#. type: Target for macro image
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "provision-config-keys.png"
msgstr "provision-config-keys.png"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:14
msgid "When the activation key creation is completed, additional tabs appear at the top of the page.  Use them to check and set additional features.  These tabs are:"
msgstr "Setelah pembuatan kunci aktivasi selesai, tab tambahan akan muncul di bagian atas halaman.  Gunakan tab tersebut untuk memeriksa dan mengatur fitur tambahan.  Tab tersebut adalah:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:15
msgid "`Packages`"
msgstr "`Paket`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:16
msgid "`Configuration`"
msgstr "`Konfigurasi`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:17
msgid "`Groups`"
msgstr "`Grup`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:18
msgid "`Activated Systems`"
msgstr "`Sistem yang Diaktifkan`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:19
msgid "`AppStreams` (available whenever a modular channel is associated with the activation key)"
msgstr "`AppStreams` (tersedia setiap kali saluran modular dikaitkan dengan kunci aktivasi)"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:20
#, no-wrap
msgid "Reactivation Keys"
msgstr "Kunci Aktivasi Ulang"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:21
msgid "Reactivation keys can be used once only to re-register a client and regain all {productname} settings.  Reactivation keys are client-specific, and include the system ID, history, groups, and channels."
msgstr "Kunci aktivasi ulang hanya dapat digunakan satu kali untuk mendaftarkan ulang klien dan memulihkan semua pengaturan {productname}.  Kunci aktivasi ulang bersifat khusus untuk setiap klien dan mencakup ID sistem, riwayat, grup, serta saluran."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:22
msgid "To create a reactivation key, navigate to `Systems`, click the client to create a reactivation key for, and navigate to the menu:Details[Reactivation] tab.  Click btn:[Generate New Key] to create the reactivation key.  Record the details of the key for later use.  Unlike typical activation keys, which are not associated with a specific system ID, keys created here do not show up on the menu:Systems[Activation Keys] page."
msgstr "Untuk membuat kunci aktivasi ulang, buka `Sistem`, klik klien yang akan dibuatkan kunci aktivasi ulang, lalu buka tab menu:Details[Reactivation].  Klik btn:[Generate New Key] untuk membuat kunci aktivasi ulang.  Catat detail kunci tersebut untuk digunakan nanti.  Tidak seperti kunci aktivasi biasa yang tidak terkait dengan ID sistem tertentu, kunci yang dibuat di sini tidak ditampilkan pada halaman menu:Systems[Activation Keys]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:23
msgid "After you have created a reactivation key, you can use it as the `management_key` grain in `/etc/venv-salt-minion/minion.d/susemanager.conf` (or `/etc/salt/minion.d/susemanager.conf` for traditional clients).  For example:"
msgstr "Setelah membuat kunci aktivasi ulang, Anda dapat menggunakannya sebagai grain `management_key` di `/etc/venv-salt-minion/minion.d/susemanager.conf` (atau `/etc/salt/minion.d/susemanager.conf` untuk klien tradisional).  Contohnya:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:24
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"grains:\n"
"    susemanager:\n"
"        management_key: \"re-1-daf44db90c0853edbb5db03f2b37986e\"\n"
msgstr ""
"grains:\n"
"    susemanager:\n"
"        management_key: \"re-1-daf44db90c0853edbb5db03f2b37986e\"\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:25
msgid "Restart the `venv-salt-minion` or `salt-minion` process to apply the reactivation key."
msgstr "Mulai ulang proses `venv-salt-minion` atau `salt-minion` untuk menerapkan kunci aktivasi ulang."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:26
msgid "You can use a reactivation key with a bootstrap script.  For more information about bootstrap scripts, see xref:client-configuration:registration-bootstrap.adoc[]."
msgstr "Anda dapat menggunakan kunci aktivasi ulang dengan skrip bootstrap.  Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang skrip bootstrap, lihat xref:client-configuration:registration-bootstrap.adoc[]."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:27
msgid "If you autoinstall a client with its existing {productname} profile, the profile uses the reactivation key to re-register the system and restore its settings.  Do not regenerate, delete, or use this key while a profile-based autoinstallation is in progress.  Doing so causes the autoinstallation to fail."
msgstr "Jika Anda menginstal klien secara otomatis menggunakan profil {productname} yang sudah ada, profil tersebut menggunakan kunci aktivasi ulang untuk mendaftarkan ulang sistem dan memulihkan pengaturannya.  Jangan membuat ulang, menghapus, atau menggunakan kunci ini selama instalasi otomatis berbasis profil berlangsung.  Tindakan tersebut menyebabkan instalasi otomatis gagal."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:28
#, no-wrap
msgid "Reactivation Key Warnings and Behaviors"
msgstr "Peringatan dan Perilaku Kunci Aktivasi Ulang"

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:29
#, no-wrap
msgid "System Deletion"
msgstr "Penghapusan Sistem"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:30
msgid "Deleting a registered client from the server permanently invalidates its reactivation key. Do not delete the server record if you only intend to re-register or rebootstrap the client."
msgstr "Menghapus klien yang terdaftar dari server akan membatalkan validitas kunci aktivasi ulangnya secara permanen. Jangan hapus catatan di server jika Anda hanya bermaksud mendaftarkan ulang atau melakukan bootstrap ulang pada klien."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:31
#, no-wrap
msgid "Client-Side Unregistration"
msgstr "Pembatalan Pendaftaran dari Sisi Klien"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:32
msgid "To rebootstrap without losing system history, unregister from the client side only (stop the minion service, purge local keys/configs), keeping the server record intact so the reactivation key can re-associate the system ID."
msgstr "Untuk melakukan bootstrap ulang tanpa kehilangan riwayat sistem, batalkan pendaftaran hanya dari sisi klien (hentikan layanan minion, hapus seluruh kunci/konfigurasi lokal), dan pertahankan catatan di server agar kunci aktivasi ulang dapat mengaitkan kembali ID sistem."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:33
#, no-wrap
msgid "Salt Key Conflicts"
msgstr "Konflik Kunci Salt"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:34
msgid "Re-bootstrapping fails if the old Salt key remains on the server. Delete the existing key via menu:Systems[Keys] in the {webui} or with `salt-key -d <minion_id>` on the server CLI before bootstrapping."
msgstr "Bootstrap ulang akan gagal jika kunci Salt lama masih ada di server. Hapus kunci yang ada melalui menu:Systems[Keys] di {webui} atau dengan `salt-key -d <minion_id>` melalui CLI server sebelum melakukan bootstrap."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:35
#, no-wrap
msgid "Minion ID and Name Reversion"
msgstr "Pengembalian ID Minion dan Nama"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:36
msgid "Bootstrapping with a reactivation key reverts any client-side or Web UI changes to the Minion ID and System Name back to their original values recorded during initial registration. The active client hostname is updated dynamically in System Info."
msgstr "Bootstrap menggunakan kunci aktivasi ulang akan mengembalikan setiap perubahan pada ID Minion dan Nama Sistem yang dilakukan dari sisi klien atau Antarmuka Web ke nilai awal yang dicatat saat pendaftaran pertama. Nama host klien yang aktif diperbarui secara dinamis di Informasi Sistem."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:37
#, no-wrap
msgid "Combining Activation Keys"
msgstr "Menggabungkan Kunci Aktivasi"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:38
msgid "Specifying both activation and reactivation keys appends the activation key's system groups and configuration channels to the reactivation profile rather than overwriting them. Leaving the activation key field at `None` has no negative impact."
msgstr "Menentukan kunci aktivasi dan kunci aktivasi ulang sekaligus akan menambahkan grup sistem dan saluran konfigurasi dari kunci aktivasi ke profil aktivasi ulang, bukan menimpanya. Membiarkan kolom kunci aktivasi bernilai `None` tidak menimbulkan dampak negatif."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:39
#, no-wrap
msgid "Activation Key Best Practices"
msgstr "Praktik Terbaik Kunci Aktivasi"

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:40
#, no-wrap
msgid "Default Parent Channel"
msgstr "Saluran Induk Bawaan"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:41
msgid "Avoid using the `{productname} Default` parent channel.  This setting forces {productname} to choose a parent channel that best corresponds to the installed operating system, which can sometimes lead to unexpected behavior.  Instead, we recommend you create activation keys specific to each distribution and architecture."
msgstr "Hindari penggunaan saluran induk `{productname} Default`.  Pengaturan ini memaksa {productname} memilih saluran induk yang paling sesuai dengan sistem operasi yang terinstal, yang terkadang dapat menyebabkan perilaku tak terduga.  Sebagai gantinya, kami menyarankan agar Anda membuat kunci aktivasi khusus untuk setiap distribusi dan arsitektur."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:42
#, no-wrap
msgid "Bootstrapping With Activation Keys"
msgstr "Bootstrap Menggunakan Kunci Aktivasi"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:43
msgid "If you are using bootstrap scripts, consider creating an activation key for each script.  This helps you align channel assignments, package installation, system group memberships, and configuration channel assignments.  You also need less manual interaction with your system after registration."
msgstr "Jika Anda menggunakan skrip bootstrap, pertimbangkan untuk membuat kunci aktivasi bagi setiap skrip.  Hal ini membantu Anda menyelaraskan penetapan saluran, instalasi paket, keanggotaan grup sistem, dan penetapan saluran konfigurasi.  Anda juga tidak perlu melakukan banyak interaksi manual dengan sistem setelah pendaftaran."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:44
#, no-wrap
msgid "Bootstrapping LTSS Clients"
msgstr "Bootstrap Klien LTSS"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:45
msgid "If you are boostrapping clients with LTSS subscription, include the LTSS channels during activation key creation."
msgstr "Jika Anda melakukan bootstrap pada klien dengan langganan LTSS, sertakan saluran LTSS saat membuat kunci aktivasi."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:46
#, no-wrap
msgid "Bandwidth Requirements"
msgstr "Kebutuhan Bandwidth"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:47
msgid "Using activation keys might result in automatic downloading of software at registration time, which might not be desirable in environments where bandwidth is constrained."
msgstr "Penggunaan kunci aktivasi dapat menyebabkan pengunduhan perangkat lunak secara otomatis saat pendaftaran, yang mungkin tidak diinginkan di lingkungan dengan bandwidth terbatas."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:48
msgid "These options create bandwidth usage:"
msgstr "Opsi berikut menyebabkan penggunaan bandwidth:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:49
msgid "Assigning a SUSE Product Pool channel results in the automatic installation of the corresponding product descriptor package."
msgstr "Penetapan saluran SUSE Product Pool menyebabkan paket deskriptor produk yang sesuai diinstal secara otomatis."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:50
msgid "Any package in the `Packages` section is installed."
msgstr "Setiap paket di bagian `Paket` akan diinstal."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:51
msgid "Any Salt state from the `Configuration` section might trigger downloads depending on its contents."
msgstr "Setiap Salt state dari bagian `Konfigurasi` dapat memicu pengunduhan, bergantung pada isinya."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:52
#, no-wrap
msgid "Key Label Naming"
msgstr "Penamaan Label Kunci"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:53
msgid "If you do not enter a human-readable name for your activation keys, the system automatically generates a number string, which can make it difficult to manage your keys."
msgstr "Jika Anda tidak memasukkan nama yang mudah dipahami untuk kunci aktivasi, sistem akan secara otomatis menghasilkan deretan angka, yang dapat menyulitkan pengelolaan kunci."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:54
msgid "Consider a naming scheme for your activation keys to help you keep track of them.  Creating names which are associated with your organization's infrastructure makes it easier for you when performing more complex operations."
msgstr "Pertimbangkan skema penamaan kunci aktivasi agar Anda lebih mudah melacaknya.  Membuat nama yang berkaitan dengan infrastruktur organisasi akan memudahkan Anda saat melakukan operasi yang lebih kompleks."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:55
msgid "When creating key labels, consider these tips:"
msgstr "Saat membuat label kunci, pertimbangkan kiat berikut:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:56
msgid "OS naming (mandatory): Keys should always refer to the OS they provide settings for"
msgstr "Penamaan OS (wajib): Kunci harus selalu merujuk pada OS yang pengaturannya disediakan oleh kunci tersebut"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:57
msgid "Architecture naming (recommended): Unless your company is running on one architecture only, for example x86_64, then providing labels with an architecture type is a good idea."
msgstr "Penamaan arsitektur (disarankan): Jika perusahaan Anda tidak hanya menggunakan satu arsitektur, misalnya x86_64, sebaiknya cantumkan jenis arsitektur pada label."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:58
msgid "Server type naming: What is this server being used for?"
msgstr "Penamaan jenis server: Untuk apa server ini digunakan?"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:59
msgid "Location naming: Where is the server located? Room, building, or department?"
msgstr "Penamaan lokasi: Di mana server berada? Ruangan, gedung, atau departemen?"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:60
msgid "Date naming: Maintenance windows, quarter, etc."
msgstr "Penamaan tanggal: Jadwal pemeliharaan, kuartal, dan sebagainya."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:61
msgid "Custom naming: What naming scheme suits your organizations needs?"
msgstr "Penamaan kustom: Skema penamaan apa yang sesuai dengan kebutuhan organisasi Anda?"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:62
msgid "Example activation key label names:"
msgstr "Contoh nama label kunci aktivasi:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:63
#, no-wrap
msgid "sles15-sp4-web_server-room_129-x86_64\n"
msgstr "sles15-sp4-web_server-room_129-x86_64\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:64
#, no-wrap
msgid "sles15-sp4-test_packages-blg_502-room_21-ppc64le\n"
msgstr "sles15-sp4-test_packages-blg_502-room_21-ppc64le\n"

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:65
#, no-wrap
msgid "Included Channels"
msgstr "Saluran yang Disertakan"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:66
msgid "When creating activation keys you also need to keep in mind which software channels are associated with it.  Keys should have a specific base channel assigned to them.  Using the default base channel is not recommended.  For more information, see the client operating system you are installing at xref:client-configuration:registration-overview.adoc[]."
msgstr "Saat membuat kunci aktivasi, Anda juga perlu memperhatikan saluran perangkat lunak yang terkait dengannya.  Setiap kunci harus memiliki saluran dasar tertentu yang ditetapkan.  Penggunaan saluran dasar bawaan tidak disarankan.  Untuk informasi selengkapnya, lihat sistem operasi klien yang Anda instal di xref:client-configuration:registration-overview.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/appstreams.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "AppStream Modules"
msgstr "Modul AppStream"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/appstreams.adoc:2
msgid "If you are managing a client that is subscribed to an AppStream channel, {productname} will filter packages available to the client depending on its currently enabled set of AppStream modules."
msgstr "Jika Anda mengelola klien yang berlangganan saluran AppStream, {productname} akan memfilter paket yang tersedia bagi klien berdasarkan kumpulan modul AppStream yang saat ini diaktifkan pada klien tersebut."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-cdrom.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install via a CD-ROM or a USB Key"
msgstr "Instal Melalui CD-ROM atau Flashdisk USB"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-cdrom.adoc:2
msgid "For clients that are not yet registered to {productname}, and if network boot over PXE is not an option, a bootable CD-ROM or USB key can be used to install the system."
msgstr "Untuk klien yang belum terdaftar di {productname}, dan jika boot jaringan melalui PXE tidak dapat digunakan, CD-ROM atau flashdisk USB yang dapat di-boot dapat digunakan untuk menginstal sistem."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-cdrom.adoc:3
msgid "One option to prepare such a removable medium is to use {cobbler}.  For information about using {cobbler} to prepare an ISO image, see xref:client-configuration:autoinst-cdrom.adoc#build-iso-with-cobbler[Build an ISO Image With {cobbler}]."
msgstr "Salah satu cara menyiapkan media lepas-pasang tersebut adalah menggunakan {cobbler}.  Untuk informasi tentang penggunaan {cobbler} untuk menyiapkan image ISO, lihat xref:client-configuration:autoinst-cdrom.adoc#build-iso-with-cobbler[Membuat Image ISO dengan {cobbler}]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-cdrom.adoc:4
msgid "For {suse} systems, it is often recommended to prepare an ISO image using KIWI.  For more information, see xref:client-configuration:autoinst-cdrom.adoc#build-iso-with-kiwi[Build a SUSE ISO Image With KIWI]."
msgstr "Untuk sistem {suse}, penyiapan image ISO menggunakan KIWI sering disarankan.  Untuk informasi selengkapnya, lihat xref:client-configuration:autoinst-cdrom.adoc#build-iso-with-kiwi[Membuat Image ISO SUSE dengan KIWI]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-cdrom.adoc:5
msgid "In all cases, you use the resulting image to burn a CD-ROM or prepare a USB key."
msgstr "Dalam semua kasus, gunakan image yang dihasilkan untuk membakar CD-ROM atau menyiapkan flashdisk USB."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-cdrom.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Build an ISO Image With {cobbler}"
msgstr "Membuat Image ISO dengan {cobbler}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-cdrom.adoc:7
msgid "{cobbler} can create ISO boot images that contain a set of distributions, kernels, and a menu that works in a similar way to a PXE installation."
msgstr "{cobbler} dapat membuat image ISO boot yang berisi sekumpulan distribusi, kernel, dan menu yang bekerja dengan cara serupa dengan instalasi PXE."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-cdrom.adoc:8
msgid "Building ISOs with {cobbler} is not supported on {ibmz}."
msgstr "Pembuatan ISO dengan {cobbler} tidak didukung pada {ibmz}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-cdrom.adoc:9
msgid "In order to prepare an ISO image with {cobbler}, you need to prepare a distribution and a profile, similar to using network boot over PXE.  For information about creating a distribution, see xref:client-configuration:autoinst-distributions.adoc[Autoinstallable Distributions].  For information about creating a profile, see xref:client-configuration:autoinst-profiles.adoc[Autoinstallation Profiles]."
msgstr "Untuk menyiapkan image ISO dengan {cobbler}, Anda perlu menyiapkan distribusi dan profil, seperti saat menggunakan boot jaringan melalui PXE.  Untuk informasi tentang pembuatan distribusi, lihat xref:client-configuration:autoinst-distributions.adoc[Distribusi yang Dapat Diinstal Secara Otomatis].  Untuk informasi tentang pembuatan profil, lihat xref:client-configuration:autoinst-profiles.adoc[Profil Instalasi Otomatis]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-cdrom.adoc:10
msgid "The {cobbler} `buildiso` command takes parameters to define the name and output location of the boot ISO.  Specifying the distribution with `--distro` is mandatory when running `buildiso` command.  `--iso` is the output location:"
msgstr "Perintah `buildiso` pada {cobbler} menerima parameter untuk menentukan nama dan lokasi keluaran ISO boot.  Distribusi wajib ditentukan dengan `--distro` saat menjalankan perintah `buildiso`.  `--iso` menentukan lokasi keluaran:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-cdrom.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgrctl exec -- cobbler buildiso --iso=/path/to/boot.iso --distro=<your-distro-label>\n"
msgstr "mgrctl exec -- cobbler buildiso --iso=/path/to/boot.iso --distro=<your-distro-label>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-cdrom.adoc:12
msgid "You must use distribution and profile labels as listed by {cobbler}, and not simply as shown in the {webui}.  To list the names of distributions and profiles stored by {cobbler}, run the commands:"
msgstr "Anda harus menggunakan label distribusi dan profil sebagaimana tercantum di {cobbler}, bukan hanya sebagaimana ditampilkan di {webui}.  Untuk menampilkan daftar nama distribusi dan profil yang disimpan oleh {cobbler}, jalankan perintah berikut:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-cdrom.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mgrctl exec -- cobbler distro list\n"
"mgrctl exec -- cobbler profile list\n"
msgstr ""
"mgrctl exec -- cobbler distro list\n"
"mgrctl exec -- cobbler profile list\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-cdrom.adoc:14
msgid "The boot ISO includes all profiles and systems by default.  You can limit which profiles and systems are used with the `--profiles` and `--systems` options:"
msgstr "Secara bawaan, ISO boot menyertakan semua profil dan sistem.  Anda dapat membatasi profil dan sistem yang digunakan dengan opsi `--profiles` dan `--systems`:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-cdrom.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mgrctl exec -- cobbler buildiso --systems=\"system1 system2 system3\" \\\n"
"  --profiles=\"<your-profile1-label> <your-profile2-label> <your-profile3-label>\" \\\n"
"  --distro=<your-distro-label>\n"
msgstr ""
"mgrctl exec -- cobbler buildiso --systems=\"system1 system2 system3\" \\\n"
"  --profiles=\"<your-profile1-label> <your-profile2-label> <your-profile3-label>\" \\\n"
"  --distro=<your-distro-label>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-cdrom.adoc:16
msgid "With `--esp` you can enable the built boot ISOs with Secure Boot.  You explicitly specify the EFI System Partition (ESP).  By default, {cobbler} generates the ESP partition, which disables Secure Boot."
msgstr "Dengan `--esp`, Anda dapat mengaktifkan dukungan Secure Boot pada ISO boot yang dibuat.  Anda menentukan EFI System Partition (ESP) secara eksplisit.  Secara bawaan, {cobbler} membuat partisi ESP, yang menonaktifkan Secure Boot."

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-cdrom.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mgrctl exec -- cobbler buildiso \\\n"
"  --esp=\"/usr/share/tftpboot-installation/SLE-15-SP6-x86_64/boot/x86_64/efi\" \\\n"
"  --iso=/path/to/boot.iso --distro=<your-distro-label>\n"
msgstr ""
"mgrctl exec -- cobbler buildiso \\\n"
"  --esp=\"/usr/share/tftpboot-installation/SLE-15-SP6-x86_64/boot/x86_64/efi\" \\\n"
"  --iso=/path/to/boot.iso --distro=<your-distro-label>\n"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-cdrom.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Finding `efi`"
msgstr "Prosedur: Menemukan `efi`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-cdrom.adoc:19
msgid "On the container host, execute the following command to get the `distro` name:"
msgstr "Pada host kontainer, jalankan perintah berikut untuk mendapatkan nama `distro`:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-cdrom.adoc:20
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgrctl exec -- cobbler distro list\n"
msgstr "mgrctl exec -- cobbler distro list\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-cdrom.adoc:21
msgid "This command outputs strings such as `sles15-sp6:1:SUSE`."
msgstr "Perintah ini menghasilkan string seperti `sles15-sp6:1:SUSE`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-cdrom.adoc:22
msgid "On the container host, execute the following command to get information about the `distro` files location:"
msgstr "Pada host kontainer, jalankan perintah berikut untuk mendapatkan informasi tentang lokasi berkas `distro`:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-cdrom.adoc:23
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgrctl exec -- cobbler distro report --name sles15-sp6:1:SUSE\n"
msgstr "mgrctl exec -- cobbler distro report --name sles15-sp6:1:SUSE\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-cdrom.adoc:24
msgid "This command outputs a report such as the following:"
msgstr "Perintah ini menghasilkan laporan seperti berikut:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-cdrom.adoc:25
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Name                  : sles15-sp6:1:SUSE\n"
"Architecture          : x86_64\n"
"...output omitted...\n"
"Initrd                : /usr/share/tftpboot-installation/SLE-15-SP6-x86_64/boot/x86_64/loader/initrd\n"
"Kernel                : /usr/share/tftpboot-installation/SLE-15-SP6-x86_64/boot/x86_64/loader/linux\n"
"...output omitted...\n"
msgstr ""
"Name                  : sles15-sp6:1:SUSE\n"
"Architecture          : x86_64\n"
"...output omitted...\n"
"Initrd                : /usr/share/tftpboot-installation/SLE-15-SP6-x86_64/boot/x86_64/loader/initrd\n"
"Kernel : /usr/share/tftpboot-installation/SLE-15-SP6-x86_64/boot/x86_64/loader/linux\n"
"...output omitted...\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-cdrom.adoc:26
msgid "See the contents of the boot directory.  In the example above, the boot partition is the `/usr/share/tftpboot-installation/SLE-15-SP6-x86_64/boot/x86_64/efi` file, but this can differ based on the ISO distributor."
msgstr "Lihat isi direktori boot.  Pada contoh di atas, partisi boot adalah berkas `/usr/share/tftpboot-installation/SLE-15-SP6-x86_64/boot/x86_64/efi`, tetapi hal ini dapat berbeda tergantung pada distributor ISO."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-cdrom.adoc:27
msgid "If you cannot write an ISO image to a public `tmp` directory, check your systemd settings in `/usr/lib/systemd/system/cobblerd.service`."
msgstr "Jika Anda tidak dapat menulis image ISO ke direktori `tmp` publik, periksa pengaturan systemd di `/usr/lib/systemd/system/cobblerd.service`."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-cdrom.adoc:28
#, no-wrap
msgid "Build a SUSE ISO Image With KIWI"
msgstr "Membuat Image ISO SUSE dengan KIWI"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-cdrom.adoc:29
msgid "KIWI is an image creation system.  You can use KIWI to create a bootable ISO image to be used by the target system for installation of a {suse} system.  When the system is rebooted or switched on, it boots from the image, loads the {ay} configuration from your {productname}, and installs {sles} according to the {ay} profile."
msgstr "KIWI adalah sistem pembuatan image.  Anda dapat menggunakan KIWI untuk membuat image ISO yang dapat di-boot untuk digunakan oleh sistem target dalam instalasi sistem {suse}.  Saat sistem dimulai ulang atau dinyalakan, sistem melakukan boot dari image tersebut, memuat konfigurasi {ay} dari {productname} Anda, dan menginstal {sles} sesuai dengan profil {ay}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-cdrom.adoc:30
msgid "To use the ISO image, boot the system and type `autoyast` at the prompt (assuming you left the label for the {ay} boot as `autoyast`).  Press kbd:[Enter] to begin the {ay} installation."
msgstr "Untuk menggunakan image ISO, lakukan boot pada sistem dan ketik `autoyast` pada prompt (dengan asumsi Anda membiarkan label boot {ay} tetap sebagai `autoyast`).  Tekan kbd:[Enter] untuk memulai instalasi {ay}."

#. we would love a bit more details - ebischoff
#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-cdrom.adoc:31
msgid "For more information about KIWI, see http://doc.opensuse.org/projects/kiwi/doc/."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang KIWI, lihat http://doc.opensuse.org/projects/kiwi/doc/."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-cdrom.adoc:32
#, no-wrap
msgid "Build a Red Hat ISO Image With {cobbler}"
msgstr "Membuat Image ISO Red Hat dengan {cobbler}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-cdrom.adoc:33
msgid "For more information, see xref:client-configuration:autoinst-cdrom.adoc#build-iso-with-cobbler[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya, lihat xref:client-configuration:autoinst-cdrom.adoc#build-iso-with-cobbler[]."

#
#
#
#
#. [[build-iso-with-mkisofs]]
#. == Build a RedHat ISO Image With mkisofs
#. You can use `mkisofs` to create a bootable ISO image to be used by the target system for installation of a {redhat} system.
#. When the system is rebooted or switched on, it boots from the image, loads the {kickstart} configuration from your {productname}, and installs {rhel} according to the {kickstart} profile.
#. .Procedure: Building a Bootable ISO With mkisofs
#. . Copy the contents of `/isolinux` from the first CD-ROM of the target distribution.
#. . Edit the `isolinux.cfg` file to default to 'ks'.
#.   Change the 'ks' section to read:
#. +
#. ----
#. label ks
#. kernel vmlinuz
#.   append text ks=`url` initrd=initrd.img lang= devfs=nomount #.     ramdisk_size=16438 `ksdevice`
#. ----
#. +
#. IP address-based {kickstart} URLs look like this:
#. +
#. ----
#. http://`my.manager.server`/kickstart/ks/mode/ip_range
#. ----
#. +
#. The {kickstart} distribution defined via the IP range should match the distribution from which you are building, to prevent errors occurring.
#. . OPTIONAL: If you want to use the `ksdevice`, it looks like this:
#. +
#. ----
#. ksdevice=eth0
#. ----
#. +
#. It is possible to change the distribution for a Kickstart profile within a family, such as {rhel} AS 4 to {rhel} ES 4, by specifying the new distribution label.
#. Note that you cannot move between versions (4 to 5) or between updates (U1 to U2).
#. . Customize `isolinux.cfg` further as required.
#.   For example, you can add multiple options, different boot messages, or shorter timeout periods.
#. . Create the ISO with this command:
#. +
#. ----
#. mkisofs -o file.iso -b isolinux.bin -c boot.cat -no-emul-boot #.   -boot-load-size 4 -boot-info-table -R -J -v -T isolinux/
#. ----
#. +
#. Note that `isolinux/` is the relative path to the directory containing the modified isolinux files copied from the distribution CD, while `file.iso` is the output ISO file, which is placed into the current directory.
#. . Burn the ISO to CD-ROM and insert the disk.
#.   Alternatively prepare an USB key and insert it.
#. . Boot the system and type `ks` at the prompt (if you left the label for the Kickstart boot as 'ks').
#. . Press kbd:[Enter] to start {kickstart}.
#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Autoinstallable Distributions"
msgstr "Distribusi yang Dapat Diinstal Secara Otomatis"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:2
msgid "The autoinstallation process relies on an several files to initiate the installation.  These files include the Linux kernel, an initial RAM disk, and other files required to boot the operating system in installation mode."
msgstr "Proses instalasi otomatis bergantung pada beberapa berkas untuk memulai instalasi.  Berkas tersebut mencakup kernel Linux, disk RAM awal, dan berkas lain yang diperlukan untuk melakukan boot sistem operasi dalam mode instalasi."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:3
msgid "{productname} uses the `mgradm` tool to copy the installation file from the source to the server container."
msgstr "{productname} menggunakan alat `mgradm` untuk menyalin berkas instalasi dari sumber ke kontainer server."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:4
msgid "You can extract the needed files from a DVD image.  For information, see xref:client-configuration:autoinst-distributions.adoc#based-on-iso-image[Distribution Based on an ISO Image]."
msgstr "Anda dapat mengekstrak berkas yang diperlukan dari image DVD.  Untuk informasi selengkapnya, lihat xref:client-configuration:autoinst-distributions.adoc#based-on-iso-image[Distribusi Berbasis Image ISO]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:5
msgid "Alternatively, you can install the `tftpboot-installation` package.  For information, see xref:client-configuration:autoinst-distributions.adoc#based-on-rpm-package[Distribution Based on a RPM Package]."
msgstr "Sebagai alternatif, Anda dapat menginstal paket `tftpboot-installation`.  Untuk informasi selengkapnya, lihat xref:client-configuration:autoinst-distributions.adoc#based-on-rpm-package[Distribusi Berbasis Paket RPM]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:6
msgid "You must also have a base channel synchronized on your {productname} Server for the same operating system version as those files."
msgstr "Anda juga harus memiliki saluran dasar yang telah disinkronkan di Server {productname} untuk versi sistem operasi yang sama dengan berkas tersebut."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:7
msgid "When you have the files ready, and the base channel synchronized, you need to declare the distribution.  This operation associates the installation files to the base channel.  The distribution can be referred to by one or more installation profiles.  For information, see xref:client-configuration:autoinst-distributions.adoc#declare-distribution[Declare an Autoinstallable Distribution]."
msgstr "Setelah berkas siap dan saluran dasar telah disinkronkan, Anda perlu mendeklarasikan distribusi.  Operasi ini mengaitkan berkas instalasi dengan saluran dasar.  Distribusi tersebut dapat dirujuk oleh satu atau beberapa profil instalasi.  Untuk informasi selengkapnya, lihat xref:client-configuration:autoinst-distributions.adoc#declare-distribution[Mendeklarasikan Distribusi yang Dapat Diinstal Secara Otomatis]."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "Distribution Based on an ISO Image"
msgstr "Distribusi Berbasis Image ISO"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:9
msgid "This method assumes you have installation media for the operating system you want to install on the clients.  This is usually a DVD `.iso` image that contains the Linux kernel, an `initrd` file, and other files required to boot the operating system in installation mode."
msgstr "Metode ini mengasumsikan bahwa Anda memiliki media instalasi untuk sistem operasi yang ingin diinstal pada klien.  Media ini biasanya berupa image DVD `.iso` yang berisi kernel Linux, berkas `initrd`, dan berkas lain yang diperlukan untuk melakukan boot sistem operasi dalam mode instalasi."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Importing Files from Installation Media"
msgstr "Prosedur: Mengimpor Berkas dari Media Instalasi"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:11
msgid "Use `mgradm` to import installation data from the ISO image:"
msgstr "Gunakan `mgradm` untuk mengimpor data instalasi dari image ISO:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid "# mgradm distribution copy <image_name>.iso <image_name>\n"
msgstr "# mgradm distribution copy <image_name>.iso <image_name>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:13
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:16
msgid "Take a note of the distribution path reported by `mgradm`.  You will need it when you declare the distribution to {productname}."
msgstr "Catat jalur distribusi yang dilaporkan oleh `mgradm`.  Anda akan memerlukannya saat mendeklarasikan distribusi ke {productname}."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "Distribution autodetection and registration"
msgstr "Deteksi otomatis dan pendaftaran distribusi"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:15
msgid "`mgradm` is able to automatically detect distribution name and register it to the server.  Provided ISO image needs to contain a `.treeinfo` file."
msgstr "`mgradm` dapat mendeteksi nama distribusi secara otomatis dan mendaftarkannya ke server.  Image ISO yang disediakan harus berisi berkas `.treeinfo`."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Import distribution file with autodetection and registration"
msgstr "Prosedur: Mengimpor berkas distribusi dengan deteksi otomatis dan pendaftaran"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:17
msgid "Use `mgradm`:"
msgstr "Gunakan `mgradm`:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "# mgradm distribution copy --api-user <username> --api-password <password> <image_name>.iso\n"
msgstr "# mgradm distribution copy --api-user <username> --api-password <password> <image_name>.iso\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:19
#, no-wrap
msgid "Distribution Based on a RPM Package"
msgstr "Distribusi Berbasis Paket RPM"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:20
msgid "This method works on {suse} systems.  It is simpler than importing contents from an installation media, because it uses prepackaged files for your installation system."
msgstr "Metode ini dapat digunakan pada sistem {suse}.  Metode ini lebih sederhana daripada mengimpor isi media instalasi karena menggunakan berkas yang telah dikemas untuk sistem instalasi Anda."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Extracting Files from an Installation Package"
msgstr "Prosedur: Mengekstrak Berkas dari Paket Instalasi"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:22
msgid "On the {productname} Server, install the package whose name starts with `tftpboot-installation`.  You can determine its exact name with the command `zypper se tftpboot-installation`"
msgstr "Pada Server {productname}, instal paket yang namanya diawali dengan `tftpboot-installation`.  Anda dapat menentukan nama lengkapnya dengan perintah `zypper se tftpboot-installation`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:23
msgid "You can install the package to different root to avoid need for restart using following command:"
msgstr "Anda dapat menginstal paket ke direktori root yang berbeda agar tidak perlu memulai ulang sistem menggunakan perintah berikut:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:24
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# mkdir /opt/tftpinstall\n"
"# zypper --installroot /opt/tftpinstall install tftpboot-installation-SLE-Micro-5.5-x86_64\n"
msgstr ""
"# mkdir /opt/tftpinstall\n"
"# zypper --installroot /opt/tftpinstall install tftpboot-installation-SLE-Micro-5.5-x86_64\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:25
msgid "Find the installation files with the command `ls -d /opt/tftpinstall/usr/share/tftpboot-installation/*`."
msgstr "Temukan berkas instalasi dengan perintah `ls -d /opt/tftpinstall/usr/share/tftpboot-installation/*`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:26
msgid "Copy installation files using `mgradm`:"
msgstr "Salin berkas instalasi menggunakan `mgradm`:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:27
#, no-wrap
msgid "# mgradm distribution copy /opt/tftpinstall/usr/share/tftpboot-installation/SLE-Micro-5.5-x86_64 SLE-Micro-5.5-x86_64\n"
msgstr "# mgradm distribution copy /opt/tftpinstall/usr/share/tftpboot-installation/SLE-Micro-5.5-x86_64 SLE-Micro-5.5-x86_64\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:28
msgid "Take a note of the distribution path reported by `mgradm` tool.  You will need it when you declare the distribution to {productname}."
msgstr "Catat jalur distribusi yang dilaporkan oleh alat `mgradm`.  Anda akan memerlukannya saat mendeklarasikan distribusi ke {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:29
msgid "After `mgradm` tool finishes, you can remove `/opt/tftpinstall` directory."
msgstr "Setelah alat `mgradm` selesai dijalankan, Anda dapat menghapus direktori `/opt/tftpinstall`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:30
msgid "This procedure prepares the installation of the same operating system version as the one that powers your {productname} Server.  If you want to install a different operating system or version on the client, you need to manually get the package `tftpboot-installation-*` from the distribution it belongs to.  In the `Package Search` input box {productname}, search the packages whose names start with `tftpboot-installation`, then look at the package's details.  They show the local path below `/var/spacewalk/`."
msgstr "Prosedur ini menyiapkan instalasi versi sistem operasi yang sama dengan yang digunakan pada Server {productname} Anda.  Jika Anda ingin menginstal sistem operasi atau versi yang berbeda pada klien, Anda perlu mendapatkan paket `tftpboot-installation-*` secara manual dari distribusi asalnya.  Di kotak masukan `Pencarian Paket` pada {productname}, cari paket yang namanya diawali dengan `tftpboot-installation`, lalu lihat detail paket tersebut.  Detail tersebut menampilkan jalur lokal di bawah `/var/spacewalk/`."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:31
#, no-wrap
msgid "Declare an Autoinstallable Distribution"
msgstr "Mendeklarasikan Distribusi yang Dapat Diinstal Secara Otomatis"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:32
msgid "The next step after extracting the autoinstallation files is to declare an autoinstallable distribution."
msgstr "Langkah berikutnya setelah mengekstrak berkas instalasi otomatis adalah mendeklarasikan distribusi yang dapat diinstal secara otomatis."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:33
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Declaring an Autoinstallable Distribution"
msgstr "Prosedur: Mendeklarasikan Distribusi yang Dapat Diinstal Secara Otomatis"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:34
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:21
msgid "In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Systems[Autoinstallation > Distributions]."
msgstr "Di {webui} {productname}, buka menu:Systems[Autoinstallation > Distributions]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:35
msgid "Click `Create Distribution`, and complete these fields:"
msgstr "Klik `Buat Distribusi`, lalu lengkapi kolom berikut:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:36
msgid "In the `Distribution Label` field, enter a name to identify your autoinstallable distribution."
msgstr "Di kolom `Label Distribusi`, masukkan nama untuk mengidentifikasi distribusi yang dapat diinstal secara otomatis."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:37
msgid "In the `Tree Path` field, enter the path to the installation media saved on your {productname} Server."
msgstr "Di kolom `Jalur Pohon Direktori`, masukkan jalur ke media instalasi yang disimpan di Server {productname} Anda."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:38
msgid "Select the matching `Base Channel`.  This must match the installation media."
msgstr "Pilih `Saluran Dasar` yang sesuai.  Saluran ini harus sesuai dengan media instalasi."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:39
msgid "Select the `Installer Generation`.  This must match the installation media."
msgstr "Pilih `Generasi Penginstal`.  Generasi ini harus sesuai dengan media instalasi."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:40
msgid "OPTIONAL: Specify kernel options to use when booting this distribution.  There are multiple ways to provide kernel options.  Only add options here that are generic for the distribution."
msgstr "OPSIONAL: Tentukan opsi kernel yang akan digunakan saat melakukan boot distribusi ini.  Ada beberapa cara untuk memberikan opsi kernel.  Tambahkan hanya opsi yang berlaku umum untuk distribusi tersebut di sini."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:41
msgid "Click btn:[Create Autoinstallable Distribution]."
msgstr "Klik btn:[Create Autoinstallable Distribution]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:42
msgid "The installation files that you prepared might not contain the packages you need to install.  If they are not included, add `useonlinerepo=1` to the `Kernel Options` field."
msgstr "Berkas instalasi yang Anda siapkan mungkin tidak berisi paket yang perlu diinstal.  Jika paket tersebut tidak disertakan, tambahkan `useonlinerepo=1` ke kolom `Opsi Kernel`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:43
msgid "The package repositories contain metadata that can be unsigned.  If the metadata is unsigned, add `insecure=1` to the `Kernel Options` field, or use your own GPG key as explained in xref:client-configuration:autoinst-owngpgkey.adoc[Use Your Own GPG Key]."
msgstr "Repositori paket berisi metadata yang mungkin tidak ditandatangani.  Jika metadata tidak ditandatangani, tambahkan `insecure=1` ke kolom `Opsi Kernel`, atau gunakan kunci GPG Anda sendiri seperti yang dijelaskan di xref:client-configuration:autoinst-owngpgkey.adoc[Gunakan Kunci GPG Anda Sendiri]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:44
msgid "These kernel options are needed for example when you use the \"online installer\" ISO images instead of the full DVD, or when you use the `tpboot-installation` package."
msgstr "Opsi kernel ini diperlukan, misalnya, saat Anda menggunakan image ISO \"penginstal daring\" alih-alih DVD lengkap, atau saat Anda menggunakan paket `tpboot-installation`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:45
msgid "Navigate to menu:Systems[Autoinstallation > Distributions] to manage your autoinstallable distributions."
msgstr "Buka menu:Systems[Autoinstallation > Distributions] untuk mengelola distribusi yang dapat diinstal secara otomatis."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:46
msgid "You can autoinstall {productname} Proxy 4.3 in the same way as {sle} clients.  Make sure you use the {sle} installation media, and choose the `SLE-Product-SUSE-Manager-Proxy-4.3-Pool for x86_64` base channel."
msgstr "Anda dapat menginstal {productname} Proxy 4.3 secara otomatis dengan cara yang sama seperti klien {sle}.  Pastikan Anda menggunakan media instalasi {sle} dan memilih saluran dasar `SLE-Product-SUSE-Manager-Proxy-4.3-Pool for x86_64`."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:47
#, no-wrap
msgid "Handling Kernel Options for Distributions and Profiles"
msgstr "Menangani Opsi Kernel untuk Distribusi dan Profil"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:48
msgid "{productname} is able to combine the kernel options that you assign.  This is done using a special inheritance logic.  There are three object types that are relevant for this:"
msgstr "{productname} dapat menggabungkan opsi kernel yang Anda tetapkan.  Penggabungan ini dilakukan menggunakan logika pewarisan khusus.  Ada tiga jenis objek yang relevan:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:49
msgid "Distributions (or short \"Distros\")"
msgstr "Distribusi (atau disingkat \"Distro\")"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:50
msgid "Profiles"
msgstr "Profil"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:51
msgid "Systems"
msgstr "Sistem"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:52
msgid "As a fourth special point of influence on the final kernel options is the Cobbler settings file `/etc/cobbler/settings.yaml`.  The Cobbler settings file defines default kernel options for all distributions.  This is not supported in the context of {productname}."
msgstr "Faktor khusus keempat yang memengaruhi opsi kernel akhir adalah berkas pengaturan Cobbler `/etc/cobbler/settings.yaml`.  Berkas pengaturan Cobbler menentukan opsi kernel bawaan untuk semua distribusi.  Hal ini tidak didukung dalam konteks {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:53
msgid "Understanding raw and resolved values is crucial for managing kernel options effectively."
msgstr "Memahami nilai mentah dan nilai hasil resolusi sangat penting untuk mengelola opsi kernel secara efektif."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:54
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Raw values**: These refer to values attached directly to a specific Cobbler item and stored as-is in Cobbler's internal database.\n"
msgstr "**Nilai mentah**: Nilai yang ditetapkan langsung pada item Cobbler tertentu dan disimpan apa adanya dalam basis data internal Cobbler.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:55
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Resolved values**: These values are dynamically generated at runtime, respecting the inheritance hierarchy of Cobbler items.\n"
msgstr "**Nilai hasil resolusi**: Nilai yang dihasilkan secara dinamis saat dijalankan, dengan mengikuti hierarki pewarisan item Cobbler.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:56
msgid "If you prefix an option with `!` then the option will be removed from the final kernel command line."
msgstr "Jika Anda menambahkan awalan `!` pada suatu opsi, opsi tersebut akan dihapus dari baris perintah kernel akhir."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:57
msgid "{productname} will manage the kernel options for both Profiles and Systems for you.  As such you may only edit the kernel options for Distros."
msgstr "{productname} akan mengelola opsi kernel untuk Profil dan Sistem bagi Anda.  Oleh karena itu, Anda hanya dapat mengedit opsi kernel untuk Distro."

