#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-intro.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Operating System Installation"
msgstr "Instalasi Sistem Operasi"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-intro.adoc:2
msgid "Generally, you register clients that are already running.  You might have installed these machines manually just before registering them to {productname}, or they might be pre-existing systems that were installed before you added {productname} to your environment."
msgstr "Umumnya, Anda mendaftarkan klien yang sudah berjalan.  Anda mungkin telah menginstal mesin tersebut secara manual tepat sebelum mendaftarkannya ke {productname}, atau mesin tersebut merupakan sistem yang sudah diinstal sebelum Anda menambahkan {productname} ke lingkungan Anda."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-intro.adoc:3
msgid "Alternatively, you can use {productname} to help you install an operating system and register it to {productname} in one go.  This method is partially or totally automated, so you can save time answering installer questions, and is especially useful if you have many clients you want to install and register."
msgstr "Sebagai alternatif, Anda dapat menggunakan {productname} untuk membantu menginstal sistem operasi sekaligus mendaftarkannya ke {productname}.  Metode ini diotomatisasi sebagian atau sepenuhnya sehingga Anda dapat menghemat waktu dalam menjawab pertanyaan penginstal, dan sangat berguna jika Anda ingin menginstal dan mendaftarkan banyak klien."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-intro.adoc:4
msgid "There are several ways to install an operating system from {productname}:"
msgstr "Ada beberapa cara untuk menginstal sistem operasi melalui {productname}:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-intro.adoc:5
msgid "in-place, on clients that are already registered;"
msgstr "secara langsung pada klien yang sudah terdaftar;"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-intro.adoc:6
msgid "over the network, using PXE boot;"
msgstr "melalui jaringan menggunakan boot PXE;"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-intro.adoc:7
msgid "preparing an installation CD-ROM or an USB key, and then going to the machine to boot on that medium;"
msgstr "dengan menyiapkan CD-ROM instalasi atau flashdisk USB, lalu mendatangi mesin untuk melakukan boot dari media tersebut;"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-intro.adoc:8
msgid "as part of the {productname} {smr} solution."
msgstr "sebagai bagian dari solusi {productname} {smr}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-intro.adoc:9
msgid "The in-place reinstallation method assumes that a previous operating system has already been installed on the client, and that the client has already been registered to {productname}."
msgstr "Metode instalasi ulang secara langsung mengasumsikan bahwa sistem operasi sebelumnya sudah diinstal pada klien dan klien tersebut sudah terdaftar di {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-intro.adoc:10
msgid "For information about the in-place installation method, see xref:client-configuration:autoinst-reinstall.adoc[Reinstall Registered Systems]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi tentang metode instalasi secara langsung, lihat xref:client-configuration:autoinst-reinstall.adoc[Instal Ulang Sistem yang Terdaftar]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-intro.adoc:11
msgid "The network boot installation method works on unformatted machines.  However, it can only be performed in certain network configurations:"
msgstr "Metode instalasi melalui boot jaringan dapat digunakan pada mesin yang belum diformat.  Namun, metode ini hanya dapat dilakukan dalam konfigurasi jaringan tertentu:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-intro.adoc:12
msgid "the {productname} Server, or one of its proxies, are on the same local network as the machine you want to install, or you have a DHCP relay that allows you to cross all routers in between;"
msgstr "Server {productname}, atau salah satu proksinya, berada di jaringan lokal yang sama dengan mesin yang ingin Anda instal, atau Anda memiliki relai DHCP yang memungkinkan komunikasi melewati semua router di antaranya;"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-intro.adoc:13
msgid "you are able to set up a new DHCP server or to configure an existing one;"
msgstr "Anda dapat menyiapkan server DHCP baru atau mengonfigurasi server DHCP yang sudah ada;"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-intro.adoc:14
msgid "the client to install is able to boot with PXE, and you can configure it to do so."
msgstr "klien yang akan diinstal dapat melakukan boot dengan PXE, dan Anda dapat mengonfigurasinya untuk melakukan hal tersebut."

#. For information about the network boot method, see xref:client-configuration:autoinst-pxeboot.adoc[Install via the Network].
#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-intro.adoc:15
msgid "The removable medium method allows you to bypass these network constraints.  However, it assumes the machine is able to read CD-ROMs or USB keys, and boot from them.  It also requires physical access to the client machine."
msgstr "Metode media lepas-pasang memungkinkan Anda menghindari batasan jaringan tersebut.  Namun, metode ini mengasumsikan bahwa mesin dapat membaca CD-ROM atau flashdisk USB dan melakukan boot dari media tersebut.  Metode ini juga memerlukan akses fisik ke mesin klien."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-intro.adoc:16
msgid "For information about the removable media method, see xref:client-configuration:autoinst-cdrom.adoc[Install via a CD-ROM or a USB key]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi tentang metode media lepas-pasang, lihat xref:client-configuration:autoinst-cdrom.adoc[Instal Melalui CD-ROM atau Flashdisk USB]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-intro.adoc:17
msgid "For information about the {productname} {smr} approach, see xref:retail:retail-overview.adoc[Retail Guide]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi tentang pendekatan {productname} {smr}, lihat xref:retail:retail-overview.adoc[Panduan Ritel]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-intro.adoc:18
msgid "For information about the {productname} {smr} approach, see xref:retail:uyuni-retail-overview.adoc[Retail Guide]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi tentang pendekatan {productname} {smr}, lihat xref:retail:uyuni-retail-overview.adoc[Panduan Ritel]."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-intro.adoc:19
msgid "Autoinstallation of {ubuntu} and {debian} clients is not supported.  These operating systems must be installed manually."
msgstr "Instalasi otomatis klien {ubuntu} dan {debian} tidak didukung.  Sistem operasi ini harus diinstal secara manual."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-intro.adoc:20
msgid "The autoinstallation features of {productname} are based on a software named {cobbler}.  For more information about {cobbler}, see https://cobbler.readthedocs.io."
msgstr "Fitur instalasi otomatis {productname} didasarkan pada perangkat lunak bernama {cobbler}.  Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang {cobbler}, lihat https://cobbler.readthedocs.io."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-intro.adoc:21
msgid "{suse} only supports {cobbler} functions that are available in the {productname} {webui}, or through the {productname} API.  The sole command-line command supported by Cobbler is `buildiso`.  Only supported features are documented here."
msgstr "{suse} hanya mendukung fungsi {cobbler} yang tersedia di {webui} {productname} atau melalui API {productname}.  Satu-satunya perintah baris perintah yang didukung oleh Cobbler adalah `buildiso`.  Hanya fitur yang didukung yang didokumentasikan di sini."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-owngpgkey.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use Your Own GPG Key"
msgstr "Gunakan Kunci GPG Anda Sendiri"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-owngpgkey.adoc:2
msgid "If the repositories you are using for autoinstallation have unsigned metadata, you usually have to use the `insecure=1` kernel parameter as an option of the autoinstallable distribution, and use a `spacewalk/sles_no_signature_checks` code snippet in the {ay} installation file."
msgstr "Jika repositori yang Anda gunakan untuk instalasi otomatis memiliki metadata yang tidak ditandatangani, biasanya Anda harus menggunakan parameter kernel `insecure=1` sebagai opsi distribusi yang dapat diinstal secara otomatis, serta menggunakan cuplikan kode `spacewalk/sles_no_signature_checks` dalam berkas instalasi {ay}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-owngpgkey.adoc:3
msgid "A safer alternative is to provide your own GPG key."
msgstr "Alternatif yang lebih aman adalah menyediakan kunci GPG Anda sendiri."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-owngpgkey.adoc:4
msgid "This technique applies to {suse} clients only."
msgstr "Teknik ini hanya berlaku untuk klien {suse}."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-owngpgkey.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Include Your Own GPG Key"
msgstr "Prosedur: Menyertakan Kunci GPG Anda Sendiri"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-owngpgkey.adoc:6
msgid "Create a GPG key."
msgstr "Buat kunci GPG."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-owngpgkey.adoc:7
msgid "Use it to sign the package's metadata."
msgstr "Gunakan kunci tersebut untuk menandatangani metadata paket."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-owngpgkey.adoc:8
msgid "Add it to the initial RAM disk of your installation media."
msgstr "Tambahkan kunci tersebut ke disk RAM awal pada media instalasi Anda."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-owngpgkey.adoc:9
msgid "To upload the GPG key to the server use `mgrctl gpg upload <PATH_TO_KEY_FILE_OR_URL>`.  This command calls the {productname} API to add the key to the customer keyring. Valid administrator credentials are required."
msgstr "Untuk mengunggah kunci GPG ke server, gunakan `mgrctl gpg upload <PATH_TO_KEY_FILE_OR_URL>`.  Perintah ini memanggil API {productname} untuk menambahkan kunci ke keyring pelanggan. Kredensial administrator yang valid diperlukan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-owngpgkey.adoc:10
msgid "Run command `mgradm restart`.  This command creates a unique keyring using the SUSE and the customer keyring."
msgstr "Jalankan perintah `mgradm restart`.  Perintah ini membuat keyring unik menggunakan keyring SUSE dan keyring pelanggan."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-owngpgkey.adoc:11
msgid "When you signed the metadata with your new GPG key, any already onboarded client will not know about the new key.  Ideally, you should sign the metadata before you register any client."
msgstr "Setelah Anda menandatangani metadata dengan kunci GPG baru, klien yang sudah terdaftar tidak akan mengenali kunci baru tersebut.  Idealnya, Anda harus menandatangani metadata sebelum mendaftarkan klien apa pun."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-owngpgkey.adoc:12
msgid "For already onboarded clients that use those repositories, the workaround is to disable GPG key checking on them."
msgstr "Untuk klien yang sudah terdaftar dan menggunakan repositori tersebut, solusi sementaranya adalah menonaktifkan pemeriksaan kunci GPG pada klien tersebut."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Autoinstallation Profiles"
msgstr "Profil Instalasi Otomatis"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:2
msgid "Within {productname}, you can use two different types of profiles, depending on the operating system of the clients you want to install:"
msgstr "Di {productname}, Anda dapat menggunakan dua jenis profil yang berbeda, bergantung pada sistem operasi klien yang ingin diinstal:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:3
msgid "For {sle} or {opensuse} clients, use {ay}."
msgstr "Untuk klien {sle} atau {opensuse}, gunakan {ay}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:4
msgid "For {rhel} clients, use {kickstart}."
msgstr "Untuk klien {rhel}, gunakan {kickstart}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:5
msgid "An autoinstallation profile determines how the operating system will be installed.  For example, you can specify additional kernel parameters to be passed to the installer."
msgstr "Profil instalasi otomatis menentukan cara sistem operasi akan diinstal.  Misalnya, Anda dapat menentukan parameter kernel tambahan yang akan diteruskan ke penginstal."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:6
msgid "The most important part of the profile is the *autoinstallation file*.  When you perform an installation manually, you must provide information to the installer, such as partitioning and networking information and user details.  The autoinstallation file is a method of providing this information in a scripted form.  This type of file is sometimes also referred to as an *answers file*."
msgstr "Bagian terpenting dari profil adalah *berkas instalasi otomatis*.  Saat melakukan instalasi secara manual, Anda harus memberikan informasi kepada penginstal, seperti informasi partisi dan jaringan serta detail pengguna.  Berkas instalasi otomatis merupakan cara untuk menyediakan informasi ini dalam bentuk skrip.  Jenis berkas ini terkadang juga disebut *berkas jawaban*."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:7
msgid "You can use both {ay} and {kickstart} profiles if you want to install clients with different operating systems."
msgstr "Anda dapat menggunakan profil {ay} dan {kickstart} sekaligus jika ingin menginstal klien dengan sistem operasi yang berbeda."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:8
msgid "For information about how to declare profiles, see xref:client-configuration:autoinst-profiles.adoc#declare-profile[Declare the Profile]"
msgstr "Untuk informasi tentang cara mendeklarasikan profil, lihat xref:client-configuration:autoinst-profiles.adoc#declare-profile[Mendeklarasikan Profil]"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:9
msgid "For information about {ay} profiles, see xref:client-configuration:autoinst-profiles.adoc#autoyast[{ay} Profiles]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi tentang profil {ay}, lihat xref:client-configuration:autoinst-profiles.adoc#autoyast[Profil {ay}]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:10
msgid "For information about {kickstart} profiles, see xref:client-configuration:autoinst-profiles.adoc#kickstart[Kickstart Profiles]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi tentang profil {kickstart}, lihat xref:client-configuration:autoinst-profiles.adoc#kickstart[Profil Kickstart]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:11
msgid "The autoinstallation file contained in the profile can include variables and code snippets.  For information about variables and code snippets, see xref:client-configuration:autoinst-profiles.adoc#templates-syntax[Templates Syntax]."
msgstr "Berkas instalasi otomatis yang terdapat dalam profil dapat menyertakan variabel dan cuplikan kode.  Untuk informasi tentang variabel dan cuplikan kode, lihat xref:client-configuration:autoinst-profiles.adoc#templates-syntax[Sintaks Templat]."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid "Declare the Profile"
msgstr "Mendeklarasikan Profil"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:13
msgid "When you have prepared an autoinstallation file and distribution, you can create profiles to manage autoinstallation on your {productname} Server.  The profile will determine how to install this distribution you selected.  One way to create a profile is to upload an {ay} or {kickstart} file.  Alternatively, for {kickstart} only, you can use the {webui} wizard."
msgstr "Setelah menyiapkan berkas instalasi otomatis dan distribusi, Anda dapat membuat profil untuk mengelola instalasi otomatis di Server {productname} Anda.  Profil tersebut akan menentukan cara menginstal distribusi yang Anda pilih.  Salah satu cara membuat profil adalah dengan mengunggah berkas {ay} atau {kickstart}.  Sebagai alternatif, khusus untuk {kickstart}, Anda dapat menggunakan wizard {webui}."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating an Autoinstallation Profile by Upload"
msgstr "Prosedur: Membuat Profil Instalasi Otomatis melalui Unggahan"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:15
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:24
msgid "In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Systems[Autoinstallation > Profiles]."
msgstr "Di {webui} {productname}, buka menu:Systems[Autoinstallation > Profiles]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:16
msgid "Click btn:[Upload Kickstart/{ay} File]."
msgstr "Klik btn:[Upload Kickstart/{ay} File]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:17
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:26
msgid "In the `Label` field, type a name for the profile.  Do not use spaces."
msgstr "Di kolom `Label`, ketik nama profil.  Jangan gunakan spasi."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:18
msgid "In the `Autoinstall Tree` field, select the autoinstallable distribution to use for this profile."
msgstr "Di kolom `Pohon Instalasi Otomatis`, pilih distribusi yang dapat diinstal secara otomatis untuk digunakan pada profil ini."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:19
msgid "In the `Virtualization Type` field, select the type of virtualization to use for this profile, or select `None` if you do not want to use this profile to create a new virtual machine."
msgstr "Di kolom `Jenis Virtualisasi`, pilih jenis virtualisasi yang akan digunakan pada profil ini, atau pilih `None` jika Anda tidak ingin menggunakan profil ini untuk membuat mesin virtual baru."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:20
msgid "Copy the contents of your autoinstallation file into the `File Contents` field, or upload the file directly using the `File to Upload` field."
msgstr "Salin isi berkas instalasi otomatis Anda ke kolom `Isi Berkas`, atau unggah berkas secara langsung menggunakan kolom `Berkas yang Akan Diunggah`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:21
msgid "For more information about the details to include here, see xref:client-configuration:autoinst-profiles.adoc#autoyast[{ay} Profiles] or xref:client-configuration:autoinst-profiles.adoc#kickstart[Kickstart Profiles]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang detail yang perlu disertakan di sini, lihat xref:client-configuration:autoinst-profiles.adoc#autoyast[Profil {ay}] atau xref:client-configuration:autoinst-profiles.adoc#kickstart[Profil Kickstart]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:22
msgid "Click btn:[Create] to create the profile."
msgstr "Klik btn:[Create] untuk membuat profil."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:23
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating a {kickstart} Profile by Wizard"
msgstr "Prosedur: Membuat Profil {kickstart} Menggunakan Wizard"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:25
msgid "Click btn:[Create Kickstart Profile]."
msgstr "Klik btn:[Create Kickstart Profile]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:27
msgid "In the `Base Channel` field, select the base channel to use for this profile.  This field is populated from the distributions available.  If the base channel you need is not available, check that you have created the distribution correctly."
msgstr "Di kolom `Saluran Dasar`, pilih saluran dasar yang akan digunakan pada profil ini.  Pilihan dalam kolom ini diisi berdasarkan distribusi yang tersedia.  Jika saluran dasar yang Anda perlukan tidak tersedia, pastikan Anda telah membuat distribusi dengan benar."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:28
msgid "In the `Virtualization Type` field, select the type of virtualization to use for this profile, or select `None` for no virtualization."
msgstr "Di kolom `Jenis Virtualisasi`, pilih jenis virtualisasi yang akan digunakan pada profil ini, atau pilih `None` jika tidak menggunakan virtualisasi."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:29
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:31
msgid "Click btn:[Next]."
msgstr "Klik btn:[Next]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:30
msgid "In the `Distribution File Location` type the path to the installation media installed on the {productname} Server."
msgstr "Di kolom `Lokasi Berkas Distribusi`, ketik jalur ke media instalasi yang terpasang di Server {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:32
msgid "Provide a password for the root user on the client."
msgstr "Tetapkan kata sandi untuk pengguna root pada klien."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:33
msgid "Click btn:[Finish]."
msgstr "Klik btn:[Finish]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:34
msgid "Review the details of your new profile, and customize as required."
msgstr "Tinjau detail profil baru Anda dan sesuaikan sesuai kebutuhan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:35
msgid "When you are creating your autoinstallation profile, you can check `Always use the newest Tree for this base channel`.  This setting allows {productname} to automatically pick the latest distribution that is associated with the specified base channel.  If you add new distributions later, {productname} uses the most recently created or modified."
msgstr "Saat membuat profil instalasi otomatis, Anda dapat mencentang `Selalu gunakan Pohon terbaru untuk saluran dasar ini`.  Pengaturan ini memungkinkan {productname} memilih secara otomatis distribusi terbaru yang terkait dengan saluran dasar yang ditentukan.  Jika Anda menambahkan distribusi baru di kemudian hari, {productname} akan menggunakan distribusi yang paling baru dibuat atau diubah."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:36
msgid "Changing the `Virtualization Type` usually requires changes to the profile bootloader and partition options.  This can overwrite your customization.  Verify new or changed settings before saving them, by navigating to the `Partitioning` tab."
msgstr "Mengubah `Jenis Virtualisasi` biasanya memerlukan perubahan pada opsi bootloader dan partisi profil.  Hal ini dapat menimpa penyesuaian Anda.  Verifikasi pengaturan baru atau yang diubah sebelum menyimpannya dengan membuka tab `Partisi`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:37
msgid "The kernel options from the distribution and the profile are combined."
msgstr "Opsi kernel dari distribusi dan profil digabungkan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:38
msgid "You can change the details and settings of your autoinstallation profiles by navigating to menu:Systems[Autoinstallation > Profiles] and clicking the name of the profile you want to edit.  Alternatively, navigate to menu:Systems[System List], select the client you want to provision, and navigate to the menu:Provisioning[Autoinstallation] subtab."
msgstr "Anda dapat mengubah detail dan pengaturan profil instalasi otomatis dengan membuka menu:Systems[Autoinstallation > Profiles] dan mengeklik nama profil yang ingin diedit.  Sebagai alternatif, buka menu:Systems[System List], pilih klien yang ingin Anda siapkan, lalu buka subtab menu:Provisioning[Autoinstallation]."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:39
#, no-wrap
msgid "{ay} Profiles"
msgstr "Profil {ay}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:40
msgid "An {ay} profile consists of a `Label` that identifies the profile, an `Autoinstall Tree` that points to an autoinstallable distribution, various options, and, most importantly, an {ay} installation file."
msgstr "Profil {ay} terdiri atas `Label` yang mengidentifikasi profil, `Pohon Instalasi Otomatis` yang mengarah ke distribusi yang dapat diinstal secara otomatis, berbagai opsi, dan yang terpenting, berkas instalasi {ay}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:41
msgid "The {ay} installation file is an XML file that give directions to the {ay} installer.  {ay} calls it a \"control file.\" For the full syntax of {ay} installation files, see https://doc.opensuse.org/projects/autoyast/#cha-configuration-installation-options."
msgstr "Berkas instalasi {ay} adalah berkas XML yang memberikan instruksi kepada penginstal {ay}.  {ay} menyebutnya \"berkas kontrol.\" Untuk sintaks lengkap berkas instalasi {ay}, lihat https://doc.opensuse.org/projects/autoyast/#cha-configuration-installation-options."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:42
msgid "{suse} provides templates of {ay} installation files that you can use as a starting point for your own custom files.  You will find the templates at https://github.com/SUSE/manager-build-profiles in the `AutoYast` directory.  Each of these profiles requires you to set some variables before you use it.  Check the `README` file included with the script to determine which variables you need.  For more information about using variables in {ay} scripts, see xref:client-configuration:autoinst-profiles#variables[Variables]."
msgstr "{suse} menyediakan templat berkas instalasi {ay} yang dapat Anda gunakan sebagai dasar untuk membuat berkas kustom sendiri.  Anda dapat menemukan templat tersebut di https://github.com/SUSE/manager-build-profiles dalam direktori `AutoYast`.  Setiap profil ini mengharuskan Anda menetapkan beberapa variabel sebelum menggunakannya.  Periksa berkas `README` yang disertakan dengan skrip untuk menentukan variabel yang Anda perlukan.  Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang penggunaan variabel dalam skrip {ay}, lihat xref:client-configuration:autoinst-profiles#variables[Variabel]."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:43
msgid "Provided {ay} templates do not set any user password.  Consider setting up root and other user accounts and passwords or other means of authentication.  For more information about user accounts in the {ay} profiles, see https://doc.opensuse.org/projects/autoyast/#Configuration-Security-users-and-groups."
msgstr "Templat {ay} yang disediakan tidak menetapkan kata sandi pengguna apa pun.  Pertimbangkan untuk menyiapkan akun root dan akun pengguna lainnya beserta kata sandi atau metode autentikasi lain.  Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang akun pengguna dalam profil {ay}, lihat https://doc.opensuse.org/projects/autoyast/#Configuration-Security-users-and-groups."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:44
msgid "These are the most important sections in the {ay} installation file for installing with {productname}:"
msgstr "Berikut adalah bagian terpenting dalam berkas instalasi {ay} untuk instalasi menggunakan {productname}:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:45
msgid "`<add-on>` allows to add child channels to the installation.  For an example, see https://doc.opensuse.org/projects/autoyast/#Software-Selections-additional."
msgstr "`<add-on>` memungkinkan penambahan saluran turunan ke instalasi.  Untuk contohnya, lihat https://doc.opensuse.org/projects/autoyast/#Software-Selections-additional."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:46
msgid "`<general>$SNIPPET('spacewalk/sles_no_signature_checks')</general>` disables signature checks"
msgstr "`<general>$SNIPPET('spacewalk/sles_no_signature_checks')</general>` menonaktifkan pemeriksaan tanda tangan"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:47
msgid "`<software>` allows to specify product for the {unifiedinstaller}"
msgstr "`<software>` memungkinkan penentuan produk untuk {unifiedinstaller}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:48
msgid "See https://doc.opensuse.org/projects/autoyast/#CreateProfile-Software with a \"<software>\" example"
msgstr "Lihat https://doc.opensuse.org/projects/autoyast/#CreateProfile-Software untuk contoh \"<software>\""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:49
msgid "`<init-scripts config:type=\"list\">$SNIPPET('spacewalk/minion_script')</init-scripts>` allows the client to register to {productname} as a Salt client."
msgstr "`<init-scripts config:type=\"list\">$SNIPPET('spacewalk/minion_script')</init-scripts>` memungkinkan klien mendaftar ke {productname} sebagai klien Salt."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:50
msgid "`<pre-scripts config:type=\"list\">$SNIPPET('spacewalk/root_ca')</pre-scripts>` will copy and deploy the server SSL CA certificate on the new machine."
msgstr "`<pre-scripts config:type=\"list\">$SNIPPET('spacewalk/root_ca')</pre-scripts>` akan menyalin dan memasang sertifikat CA SSL server pada mesin baru."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:51
msgid "`<add-on><add_on_products config:type=\"list\">$SNIPPET('spacewalk/autoyast_channels')</add_on_products></add-on>` automatically adds all the channels of the selected distribution as sources.  For more information about {ay}, see https://doc.opensuse.org/projects/autoyast/."
msgstr "`<add-on><add_on_products config:type=\"list\">$SNIPPET('spacewalk/autoyast_channels')</add_on_products></add-on>` secara otomatis menambahkan semua saluran dari distribusi yang dipilih sebagai sumber.  Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang {ay}, lihat https://doc.opensuse.org/projects/autoyast/."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:52
msgid "A more recent, {salt}-based alternative to {ay}, is Yomi.  For information about Yomi, see xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-yomi.adoc[Install with Yomi]."
msgstr "Alternatif yang lebih baru untuk {ay} dan berbasis {salt} adalah Yomi. Untuk informasi tentang Yomi, lihat xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-yomi.adoc[Instal dengan Yomi]."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:53
#, no-wrap
msgid "Kickstart Profiles"
msgstr "Profil Kickstart"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:54
msgid "{kickstart} profiles offer a large number of configuration options.  To create these profiles, you can upload them, or use a dedicated wizard."
msgstr "Profil {kickstart} menawarkan banyak opsi konfigurasi.  Untuk membuat profil ini, Anda dapat mengunggahnya atau menggunakan wizard khusus."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:55
msgid "{kickstart} profiles allow you to use file preservation lists.  If you have many custom configuration files located on a client you want to reinstall with {kickstart}, you can save them as a list, and associate that list with the {kickstart} profile."
msgstr "Profil {kickstart} memungkinkan Anda menggunakan daftar berkas yang dipertahankan.  Jika terdapat banyak berkas konfigurasi kustom pada klien yang ingin Anda instal ulang dengan {kickstart}, Anda dapat menyimpannya dalam sebuah daftar dan mengaitkan daftar tersebut dengan profil {kickstart}."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:56
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating a File Preservation List"
msgstr "Prosedur: Membuat Daftar Berkas yang Dipertahankan"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:57
msgid "In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Systems[Autoinstallation > File Preservation] and click btn:[Create File Preservation List]."
msgstr "Di {webui} {productname}, buka menu:Systems[Autoinstallation > File Preservation] dan klik btn:[Create File Preservation List]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:58
msgid "Enter a suitable label, and list absolute paths to all files and directories you want to save."
msgstr "Masukkan label yang sesuai, lalu cantumkan jalur absolut ke semua berkas dan direktori yang ingin Anda simpan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:59
msgid "Click btn:[Create List]."
msgstr "Klik btn:[Create List]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:60
msgid "Include the file preservation list in your {kickstart} profile."
msgstr "Sertakan daftar berkas yang dipertahankan dalam profil {kickstart} Anda."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:61
msgid "Navigate to menu:Systems[Autoinstallation > Profiles] and select the profile you want to edit, go to the menu:System Details[File Preservation] subtab, and select the file preservation list to include."
msgstr "Buka menu:Systems[Autoinstallation > Profiles] dan pilih profil yang ingin diedit, buka subtab menu:System Details[File Preservation], lalu pilih daftar berkas yang dipertahankan untuk disertakan."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:62
msgid "File preservation lists are limited to a total size of 1{nbsp}MB.  Special devices like `/dev/hda1` and `/dev/sda1` cannot be preserved.  Only use file and directory names, you cannot use regular expression wildcards."
msgstr "Daftar berkas yang dipertahankan dibatasi hingga ukuran total 1{nbsp}MB.  Perangkat khusus seperti `/dev/hda1` dan `/dev/sda1` tidak dapat dipertahankan.  Gunakan hanya nama berkas dan direktori; Anda tidak dapat menggunakan wildcard ekspresi reguler."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:63
msgid "For more information about Kickstart, see the Red Hat documentation."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang Kickstart, lihat dokumentasi Red Hat."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:64
#, no-wrap
msgid "Templates Syntax"
msgstr "Sintaks Templat"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:65
msgid "Parts of your installation file are replaced during the installation.  Variables are replaced with single values, and code snippets are replaced with whole sections of text.  Escaped symbols or sections are not replaced."
msgstr "Bagian-bagian berkas instalasi Anda diganti selama instalasi.  Variabel diganti dengan nilai tunggal, sedangkan cuplikan kode diganti dengan seluruh bagian teks.  Simbol atau bagian yang diberi escape tidak diganti."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:66
msgid "A template engine called Cheetah allows {cobbler} to do these replacements.  This mechanism allows you to reinstall large numbers of systems, without having to manually create profiles for each of them."
msgstr "Mesin templat bernama Cheetah memungkinkan {cobbler} melakukan penggantian ini.  Mekanisme ini memungkinkan Anda menginstal ulang banyak sistem tanpa harus membuat profil secara manual untuk setiap sistem."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:67
msgid "You can create autoinstallation variables and code snippets within the {productname} {webui}.  Within a profile, the `Autoinstallation File` tab allows you to see the result of the substitutions."
msgstr "Anda dapat membuat variabel instalasi otomatis dan cuplikan kode di {webui} {productname}.  Di dalam profil, tab `Berkas Instalasi Otomatis` memungkinkan Anda melihat hasil substitusi."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:68
msgid "For information about variables, see xref:client-configuration:autoinst-profiles#variables[Variables]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi tentang variabel, lihat xref:client-configuration:autoinst-profiles#variables[Variabel]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:69
msgid "For information about code snippets, see xref:client-configuration:autoinst-profiles#code-snippets[Code Snippets]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi tentang cuplikan kode, lihat xref:client-configuration:autoinst-profiles#code-snippets[Cuplikan Kode]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:70
msgid "For information about escaping symbols or text blocks, see xref:client-configuration:autoinst-profiles#escaping[Escaping]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi tentang pemberian escape pada simbol atau blok teks, lihat xref:client-configuration:autoinst-profiles#escaping[Escape]."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:71
#, no-wrap
msgid "Variables"
msgstr "Variabel"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:72
msgid "Autoinstallation variables can be used to substitute values into {kickstart} and {ay} profiles.  To define a variable, from the profile, navigate to the `Variables` subtab, and create a `name=value` pair in the text box."
msgstr "Variabel instalasi otomatis dapat digunakan untuk menyubstitusikan nilai ke dalam profil {kickstart} dan {ay}.  Untuk menentukan variabel, dari profil, buka subtab `Variables`, lalu buat pasangan `name=value` di kotak teks."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:73
msgid "For example, you could create a variable that holds the IP address of the client, and another that holds the address of its gateway.  Those variables can then be defined for all the clients installed from the same profile.  To do that, add these lines to the `Variables` text box:"
msgstr "Misalnya, Anda dapat membuat variabel yang menyimpan alamat IP klien dan variabel lain yang menyimpan alamat gateway-nya.  Variabel tersebut kemudian dapat ditentukan untuk semua klien yang diinstal dari profil yang sama.  Untuk melakukannya, tambahkan baris berikut ke kotak teks `Variables`:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:74
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"ipaddr=192.168.0.28\n"
"gateway=192.168.0.1\n"
msgstr ""
"ipaddr=192.168.0.28\n"
"gateway=192.168.0.1\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:75
msgid "To use the variable, prepend a `$` sign in the profile to substitute the value.  For example, the `network` part of a {kickstart} file may look like the following:"
msgstr "Untuk menggunakan variabel, tambahkan tanda `$` di depan nama variabel dalam profil untuk menyubstitusikan nilainya.  Misalnya, bagian `network` pada berkas {kickstart} dapat terlihat seperti berikut:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:76
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"network --bootproto=static --device=eth0 --onboot=on --ip=$ipaddr \\\n"
"  --gateway=$gateway\n"
msgstr ""
"network --bootproto=static --device=eth0 --onboot=on --ip=$ipaddr \\\n"
"  --gateway=$gateway\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:77
msgid "The `$ipaddr` is resolved to `192.168.0.28`, and the `$gateway` to `192.168.0.1`."
msgstr "`$ipaddr` diganti dengan `192.168.0.28`, dan `$gateway` dengan `192.168.0.1`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:78
msgid "In installation files, variables use a hierarchy.  System variables take precedence over profile variables, which in turn take precedence over distribution variables."
msgstr "Dalam berkas instalasi, variabel menggunakan hierarki.  Variabel sistem lebih diutamakan daripada variabel profil, yang pada gilirannya lebih diutamakan daripada variabel distribusi."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:79
#, no-wrap
msgid "Code Snippets"
msgstr "Cuplikan Kode"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:80
msgid "{productname} comes with a large number of predefined code snippets.  Navigate to menu:Systems[Autoinstallation > Autoinstallation Snippets] to see the list of existing snippets."
msgstr "{productname} dilengkapi dengan banyak cuplikan kode yang telah ditentukan sebelumnya.  Buka menu:Systems[Autoinstallation > Autoinstallation Snippets] untuk melihat daftar cuplikan yang tersedia."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:81
msgid "Use a snippet by inserting the `$SNIPPET()` macro in your autoinstallation file.  For example, in {kickstart}:"
msgstr "Gunakan cuplikan dengan menyisipkan makro `$SNIPPET()` ke dalam berkas instalasi otomatis Anda.  Misalnya, dalam {kickstart}:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:82
#, no-wrap
msgid "$SNIPPET('spacewalk/redhat_register_using_salt')\n"
msgstr "$SNIPPET('spacewalk/redhat_register_using_salt')\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:83
msgid "Or, in {ay}:"
msgstr "Atau, dalam {ay}:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:84
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<init-scripts config:type=\"list\">\n"
"  $SNIPPET('spacewalk/minion_script')\n"
"</init-scripts>\n"
msgstr ""
"<init-scripts config:type=\"list\">\n"
"  $SNIPPET('spacewalk/minion_script')\n"
"</init-scripts>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:85
msgid "The macro is parsed by {cobbler} and substituted with the contents of the snippet.  You can also store your own code snippets to use in autoinstallation files later on.  Click btn:[Create Snippet] to create a new code snippet."
msgstr "Makro tersebut diurai oleh {cobbler} dan diganti dengan isi cuplikan.  Anda juga dapat menyimpan cuplikan kode sendiri untuk digunakan dalam berkas instalasi otomatis di kemudian hari.  Klik btn:[Create Snippet] untuk membuat cuplikan kode baru."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:86
msgid "This example sets up a {kickstart} snippet for a common hard drive partition configuration:"
msgstr "Contoh ini menyiapkan cuplikan {kickstart} untuk konfigurasi partisi hard disk yang umum:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:87
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"clearpart --all\n"
"part /boot --fstype ext3 --size=150 --asprimary\n"
"part / --fstype ext3 --size=40000 --asprimary\n"
"part swap --recommended\n"
msgstr ""
"clearpart --all\n"
"part /boot --fstype ext3 --size=150 --asprimary\n"
"part / --fstype ext3 --size=40000 --asprimary\n"
"part swap --recommended\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:88
#, no-wrap
msgid "part pv.00 --size=1 --grow\n"
msgstr "part pv.00 --size=1 --grow\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:89
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"volgroup vg00 pv.00\n"
"logvol /var --name=var vgname=vg00 --fstype ext3 --size=5000\n"
msgstr ""
"volgroup vg00 pv.00\n"
"logvol /var --name=var vgname=vg00 --fstype ext3 --size=5000\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:90
msgid "Use the snippet with, for example:"
msgstr "Gunakan cuplikan tersebut, misalnya dengan:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:91
#, no-wrap
msgid "$SNIPPET('my_partition')\n"
msgstr "$SNIPPET('my_partition')\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:92
#, no-wrap
msgid "Escaping"
msgstr "Escape"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:93
msgid "If the autoinstallation file contains shell script variables like `$(example)`, the content needs to be escaped with a backslash: `\\$(example)`.  Escaping the `$` symbol prevents the templating engine from evaluating the symbol as an internal variable."
msgstr "Jika berkas instalasi otomatis berisi variabel skrip shell seperti `$(example)`, konten tersebut perlu diberi karakter escape berupa garis miring terbalik: `$(example)`.  Pemberian karakter escape pada simbol `$` mencegah mesin templat mengevaluasi simbol tersebut sebagai variabel internal."

#.  FIXME 2023-09-12, ke: "#raw" or "#end raw"?
#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:94
msgid "Text blocks such as code fragments or scripts can be escaped by wrapping them with the `\\#raw` and `\\#end raw` directives.  For example:"
msgstr "Blok teks seperti fragmen kode atau skrip dapat diberi escape dengan mengapitnya menggunakan direktif `#raw` dan `#end raw`.  Misalnya:"

#.  FIXME 2023-09-12, ke: "#raw" or "#end raw"?
#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:95
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"#raw\n"
"#!/bin/bash\n"
"for i in {0..2}; do\n"
" echo \"$i - Hello World!\"\n"
"done\n"
"#end raw\n"
msgstr ""
"#raw\n"
"#!/bin/bash\n"
"for i in {0..2}; do\n"
" echo \"$i - Hello World!\"\n"
"done\n"
"#end raw\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:96
msgid "Any line with a `#` symbol followed by a whitespace is treated as a comment and is therefore not evaluated.  For example:"
msgstr "Setiap baris dengan simbol `#` yang diikuti oleh karakter spasi putih diperlakukan sebagai komentar sehingga tidak dievaluasi.  Misalnya:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-profiles.adoc:97
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# start some section (this is a comment)\n"
"echo \"Hello, world\"\n"
"# end some section (this is a comment)\n"
msgstr ""
"# start some section (this is a comment)\n"
"echo \"Hello, world\"\n"
"# end some section (this is a comment)\n"

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-pxeboot.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install via the Network (PXE Boot)"
msgstr "Instalasi melalui Jaringan (Boot PXE)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-pxeboot.adoc:2
msgid "During a network boot installation:"
msgstr "Selama instalasi melalui boot jaringan:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-pxeboot.adoc:3
msgid "The client boots in PXE mode."
msgstr "Klien melakukan boot dalam mode PXE."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-pxeboot.adoc:4
msgid "A Dhcpd server provides the client with an IP address and mask, the address of an installation server, and the name of a bootloader file on that server."
msgstr "Server Dhcpd menyediakan alamat IP dan subnet mask, alamat server instalasi, serta nama berkas bootloader pada server tersebut kepada klien."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-pxeboot.adoc:5
msgid "The client downloads the bootloader file via the TFTP protocol from the installation server and executes it."
msgstr "Klien mengunduh berkas bootloader melalui protokol TFTP dari server instalasi dan menjalankannya."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-pxeboot.adoc:6
msgid "The client is presented with a choice of possible profiles to install from a menu, or starts automatically installing one of the profiles."
msgstr "Klien diberi pilihan profil yang dapat digunakan untuk instalasi melalui menu, atau secara otomatis mulai melakukan instalasi menggunakan salah satu profil."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-pxeboot.adoc:7
msgid "The client downloads via the TFTP protocol a kernel and an initial RAM disk for the distribution matching that profile."
msgstr "Klien mengunduh kernel dan initial RAM disk untuk distribusi yang sesuai dengan profil tersebut melalui protokol TFTP."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-pxeboot.adoc:8
msgid "The installation kernel starts an installation program, either {kickstart} or {ay}.  From now on it uses resources provided on the server via the HTTP protocol."
msgstr "Kernel instalasi menjalankan program instalasi, baik {kickstart} maupun {ay}.  Mulai saat ini, program tersebut menggunakan sumber daya yang disediakan di server melalui protokol HTTP."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-pxeboot.adoc:9
msgid "The distribution is installed automatically according to the {kickstart} or {ay} profile."
msgstr "Distribusi diinstal secara otomatis sesuai dengan profil {kickstart} atau {ay}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-pxeboot.adoc:10
msgid "The profile calls a code snippet that registers the client to the {productname} Server."
msgstr "Profil memanggil cuplikan kode yang mendaftarkan klien ke Server {productname}."

#. type: Target for macro image
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-pxeboot.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "cobbler_menu.png"
msgstr "cobbler_menu.png"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-pxeboot.adoc:12
msgid "Starting with {productname} {productnumber}, using a {productname} Proxy as the installation TFTP server is the recommended approach.  The proxy deploys the TFTP service container (`uyuni-proxy-tftpd`) by default.  The {productname} Server no longer deploys the TFTP container by default, and running TFTP directly on the server is discouraged.  However, for server-only deployments without a proxy, you can enable TFTP directly on the server by supplying the `--tftpd-enable` flag to `mgradm install` or `mgradm upgrade`.  During an upgrade from version 5.1 to 5.2, `mgradm upgrade` only deploys the TFTP container on the server if TFTP was already enabled on the previous installation."
msgstr "Mulai {productname} {productnumber}, penggunaan Proxy {productname} sebagai server TFTP instalasi merupakan pendekatan yang direkomendasikan.  Secara default, proxy men-deploy kontainer layanan TFTP (`uyuni-proxy-tftpd`).  Server {productname} tidak lagi men-deploy kontainer TFTP secara default, dan menjalankan TFTP langsung di server tidak disarankan.  Namun, untuk deployment yang hanya menggunakan server tanpa proxy, Anda dapat mengaktifkan TFTP langsung di server dengan menambahkan flag `--tftpd-enable` pada `mgradm install` atau `mgradm upgrade`.  Selama peningkatan dari versi 5.1 ke 5.2, `mgradm upgrade` hanya men-deploy kontainer TFTP di server jika TFTP sudah diaktifkan pada instalasi sebelumnya."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-pxeboot.adoc:13
msgid "The Dhcpd server may also provide other configuration information to the client, like a host name, the address of a router and the address of a domain name server.  Some of this information might be needed for the autoinstallation, for example if you specify the installation server by its domain name."
msgstr "Server Dhcpd juga dapat menyediakan informasi konfigurasi lain kepada klien, seperti nama host, alamat router, dan alamat server nama domain.  Sebagian informasi ini mungkin diperlukan untuk instalasi otomatis, misalnya jika Anda menentukan server instalasi berdasarkan nama domainnya."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-pxeboot.adoc:14
msgid "In the PXE boot menu, the first choice is `Local boot`.  If you select this, the boot process continues from the local disk drives.  This option is selected automatically if no profile was selected after a certain time.  This is a security measure to prevent from starting an autoinstallation if no human operator is there to select one of the profiles."
msgstr "Dalam menu boot PXE, pilihan pertama adalah `Local boot`.  Jika Anda memilihnya, proses boot dilanjutkan dari drive disk lokal.  Opsi ini dipilih secara otomatis jika tidak ada profil yang dipilih setelah jangka waktu tertentu.  Ini merupakan langkah pengamanan untuk mencegah dimulainya instalasi otomatis jika tidak ada operator yang memilih salah satu profil."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-pxeboot.adoc:15
msgid "Alternatively, the installation can start automatically from one of the profiles without manual intervention.  This is called \"unattended provisioning.\""
msgstr "Sebagai alternatif, instalasi dapat dimulai secara otomatis dari salah satu profil tanpa intervensi manual.  Proses ini disebut \"provisioning tanpa pengawasan.\""

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-pxeboot.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Installing with PXE boot"
msgstr "Prosedur: Instalasi dengan boot PXE"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-pxeboot.adoc:17
msgid "Prepare the Kea server, see xref:client-configuration:autoinst-pxeboot.adoc#prepare-the-dhcp-server[Prepare the Dhcpd Server]."
msgstr "Siapkan server Kea, lihat xref:client-configuration:autoinst-pxeboot.adoc#prepare-the-dhcp-server[Prepare the Dhcpd Server]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-pxeboot.adoc:18
msgid "Prepare an autoinstallable distribution, see xref:client-configuration:autoinst-distributions.adoc[Autoinstallable Distributions]."
msgstr "Siapkan distribusi yang dapat diinstal secara otomatis, lihat xref:client-configuration:autoinst-distributions.adoc[Autoinstallable Distributions]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-pxeboot.adoc:19
msgid "Prepare an autoinstallation profile, see xref:client-configuration:autoinst-profiles.adoc[Autoinstallation Profiles]."
msgstr "Siapkan profil instalasi otomatis, lihat xref:client-configuration:autoinst-profiles.adoc[Autoinstallation Profiles]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-pxeboot.adoc:20
msgid "Reboot the client, and chose a profile to install."
msgstr "Boot ulang klien, lalu pilih profil untuk instalasi."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-pxeboot.adoc:21
msgid "Some other steps are optional."
msgstr "Beberapa langkah lainnya bersifat opsional."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-pxeboot.adoc:22
msgid "For unattended provisioning, see xref:client-configuration:autoinst-unattended.adoc[Unattended provisioning]."
msgstr "Untuk provisioning tanpa pengawasan, lihat xref:client-configuration:autoinst-unattended.adoc[Unattended provisioning]."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-pxeboot.adoc:23
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prepare the Dhcpd server"
msgstr "Menyiapkan server Dhcpd"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-pxeboot.adoc:24
msgid "The PXE boot process uses Dhcpd to find the TFTP server.  The {productname} Proxy (recommended) or the {productname} Server (when deployed with `--tftpd-enable`) can act as this TFTP server."
msgstr "Proses boot PXE menggunakan Dhcpd untuk menemukan server TFTP.  Proxy {productname} (direkomendasikan) atau Server {productname} (jika di-deploy dengan `--tftpd-enable`) dapat bertindak sebagai server TFTP ini."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-pxeboot.adoc:25
msgid "You must have administrative access to the network’s Dhcpd server.  Edit the Dhcpd configuration file so that it points to the installation server as the TFTP boot server."
msgstr "Anda harus memiliki akses administratif ke server Dhcpd jaringan.  Edit berkas konfigurasi Dhcpd agar mengarah ke server instalasi sebagai server boot TFTP."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-pxeboot.adoc:26
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Configuring the Kea Dhcpd server"
msgstr "Prosedur: Mengonfigurasi server Kea Dhcpd"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-pxeboot.adoc:27
msgid "On the Dhcpd server, as root, open the `/etc/dhcpd.conf` file."
msgstr "Pada server Dhcpd, sebagai root, buka berkas `/etc/dhcpd.conf`."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-pxeboot.adoc:28
msgid "Modify the declaration for your client:"
msgstr "Ubah deklarasi untuk klien Anda:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-pxeboot.adoc:29
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  host myclient { (...)\n"
"                  next-server 192.168.2.1;\n"
"                  filename \"grub/grub.0\"; }\n"
msgstr ""
"  host myclient { (...)\n"
"                  next-server 192.168.2.1;\n"
"                  filename \"grub/grub.0\"; }\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-pxeboot.adoc:30
msgid "Save the file and restart the `dhcpd` service."
msgstr "Simpan berkas dan mulai ulang layanan `dhcpd`."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-pxeboot.adoc:31
msgid "This example directs the PXE client `myclient` to the installation server at `192.168.2.1` and instructs it to retrieve the `grub/grub.0` bootloader file."
msgstr "Contoh ini mengarahkan klien PXE `myclient` ke server instalasi di `192.168.2.1` dan memerintahkannya untuk mengambil berkas bootloader `grub/grub.0`."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-pxeboot.adoc:32
msgid "Alternatively, if your Dhcpd server is registered at {productname}, you can configure it using the Dhcpd formula instead:"
msgstr "Sebagai alternatif, jika server Dhcpd Anda terdaftar di {productname}, Anda dapat mengonfigurasinya menggunakan formula Dhcpd:"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-pxeboot.adoc:33
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Configuring the Kea Dhcpd server using the Dhcpd formula"
msgstr "Prosedur: Mengonfigurasi server Kea Dhcpd menggunakan formula Dhcpd"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-pxeboot.adoc:34
msgid "Navigate to menu:Systems[System List], select the client you want to change, and go to the `Formulas` tab to enable the Dhcpd formula."
msgstr "Buka menu:Systems[System List], pilih klien yang ingin Anda ubah, lalu buka tab `Formulas` untuk mengaktifkan formula Dhcpd."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-pxeboot.adoc:35
msgid "Go to the formula's `Dhcpd` tab, and in the `Next Server` field, enter the hostname or IP address of the installation server."
msgstr "Buka tab `Dhcpd` pada formula tersebut, lalu masukkan nama host atau alamat IP server instalasi di kolom `Next Server`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-pxeboot.adoc:36
msgid "In the `Filename EFI` field, type `grub/shim.efi` to enable EFI PXE support."
msgstr "Di kolom `Filename EFI`, ketik `grub/shim.efi` untuk mengaktifkan dukungan PXE EFI."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-pxeboot.adoc:37
msgid "In the `Filename` field, type `grub/grub.0` to enable legacy BIOS support."
msgstr "Di kolom `Filename`, ketik `grub/grub.0` untuk mengaktifkan dukungan BIOS lama."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-pxeboot.adoc:38
msgid "Click btn:[Save Formula] to save your configuration."
msgstr "Klik btn:[Save Formula] untuk menyimpan konfigurasi Anda."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-pxeboot.adoc:39
msgid "Apply the highstate."
msgstr "Terapkan highstate."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-pxeboot.adoc:40
msgid "If you do not use Secure Boot, type `grub/grubx86.efi` instead of `grub/shim.efi` in the `Filename EFI` field."
msgstr "Jika Anda tidak menggunakan Secure Boot, ketik `grub/grubx86.efi` sebagai pengganti `grub/shim.efi` di kolom `Filename EFI`."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-pxeboot.adoc:41
msgid "For different architectures, see table <<grub-efi-arch>>."
msgstr "Untuk arsitektur lain, lihat tabel <<grub-efi-arch>>."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-pxeboot.adoc:42
msgid "Using {cobbler} managed Dhcpd is unsupported with {productname}."
msgstr "Penggunaan Dhcpd yang dikelola oleh {cobbler} tidak didukung pada {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-pxeboot.adoc:43
msgid "This sets up a global PXE server for all the hosts, you can also have per-host settings.  For more information about the Dhcpd formula, see xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-formula-dhcpd.adoc[Dhcpd Formula]."
msgstr "Konfigurasi ini menyiapkan server PXE global untuk semua host, tetapi Anda juga dapat memiliki pengaturan per host.  Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang formula Dhcpd, lihat xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-formula-dhcpd.adoc[Dhcpd Formula]."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-pxeboot.adoc:44
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-pxeboot.adoc:45
#, no-wrap
msgid "GRUB EFI binary names for different architectures"
msgstr "Nama biner GRUB EFI untuk berbagai arsitektur"

#. type: Table
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-pxeboot.adoc:46
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Architecture | GRUB EFI binary name\n"
"| aarch64      | grubaa64.efi\n"
"| x86-64       | grubx86.efi\n"
"| ppc64le      | grub.ppc64le\n"
msgstr ""
"| Arsitektur | Nama biner GRUB EFI\n"
"| aarch64      | grubaa64.efi\n"
"| x86-64       | grubx86.efi\n"
"| ppc64le      | grub.ppc64le\n"

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-reinstall.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Reinstall Registered Systems"
msgstr "Menginstal Ulang Sistem Terdaftar"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-reinstall.adoc:2
msgid "The in-place reinstallation starts from the local client system.  There is therefore no need for the client to be able to boot over network with PXE."
msgstr "Instalasi ulang di tempat dimulai dari sistem klien lokal.  Oleh karena itu, klien tidak perlu memiliki kemampuan untuk melakukan boot melalui jaringan dengan PXE."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-reinstall.adoc:3
msgid "To reinstall a registered client in-place, you must define an autoinstallable distribution and an autoinstallation profile.  For information, see xref:client-configuration:autoinst-distributions.adoc[Autoinstallable Distributions] and xref:client-configuration:autoinst-profiles.adoc[Autoinstallation Profiles]."
msgstr "Untuk menginstal ulang klien terdaftar di tempat, Anda harus menentukan distribusi yang dapat diinstal secara otomatis dan profil instalasi otomatis.  Untuk informasi selengkapnya, lihat xref:client-configuration:autoinst-distributions.adoc[Autoinstallable Distributions] dan xref:client-configuration:autoinst-profiles.adoc[Autoinstallation Profiles]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-reinstall.adoc:4
msgid "When you have defined the autoinstallation profile and distribution, you can perform the reinstallation."
msgstr "Setelah menentukan profil instalasi otomatis dan distribusi, Anda dapat melakukan instalasi ulang."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-reinstall.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Reinstall an Already Registered Client"
msgstr "Prosedur: Menginstal Ulang Klien yang Sudah Terdaftar"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-reinstall.adoc:6
msgid "In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Systems[Systems List], select the client to reinstall, and go to the menu:Provisioning[Autoinstallation > Schedule] subtab."
msgstr "Di {webui} {productname}, buka menu:Systems[Systems List], pilih klien yang akan diinstal ulang, lalu buka subtab menu:Provisioning[Autoinstallation > Schedule]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-reinstall.adoc:7
msgid "Select the autoinstallation profile that you prepared, select a proxy if needed, and click btn:[Schedule Autoinstallation and Finish]."
msgstr "Pilih profil instalasi otomatis yang telah Anda siapkan, pilih proxy jika diperlukan, lalu klik btn:[Schedule Autoinstallation and Finish]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-reinstall.adoc:8
msgid "You can monitor progress of the installation by navigating to menu:Provisioning[Autoinstallation > Session Status], or on the client directly.  The client reboots, and in the boot menu selects a new choice called `reinstall-system`."
msgstr "Anda dapat memantau progres instalasi dengan membuka menu:Provisioning[Autoinstallation > Session Status], atau langsung pada klien.  Klien melakukan boot ulang, lalu memilih opsi baru bernama `reinstall-system` dalam menu boot."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-reinstall.adoc:9
msgid "The installation then proceeds over HTTP protocol."
msgstr "Instalasi kemudian dilanjutkan melalui protokol HTTP."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-unattended.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Unattended Provisioning"
msgstr "Provisioning Tanpa Pengawasan"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-unattended.adoc:2
msgid "You can use an API call to declare an association between a client identified by its MAC address and an autoinstallation profile.  Next time the system reboots, it starts the installation based on the specified profile."
msgstr "Anda dapat menggunakan panggilan API untuk menetapkan hubungan antara klien yang diidentifikasi berdasarkan alamat MAC-nya dan profil instalasi otomatis.  Saat sistem melakukan boot ulang berikutnya, instalasi dimulai berdasarkan profil yang ditentukan."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-unattended.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Reinstallation From a Manually Declared Profile"
msgstr "Prosedur: Instalasi Ulang dari Profil yang Ditetapkan Secara Manual"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-unattended.adoc:4
msgid "On the {productname} Server, at the command prompt, use the `system.createSystemRecord` API call.  In this example, replace `name` with the name of your client, `<profile>` with the profile label, `<iface>` with the name of the interface on the client such as `eth0`, and `<hw_addr>` with its hardware address such as `00:25:22:71:e7:c6`:"
msgstr "Pada Server {productname}, di prompt perintah, gunakan panggilan API `system.createSystemRecord`.  Dalam contoh ini, ganti `name` dengan nama klien Anda, `<profile>` dengan label profil, `<iface>` dengan nama antarmuka pada klien seperti `eth0`, dan `<hw_addr>` dengan alamat perangkat kerasnya seperti `00:25:22:71:e7:c6`:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-unattended.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$ spacecmd api -- --args '[\"<name>\", \"<profile>\", \"\", \"\", \\\n"
"  [ {\"name\": \"<iface>\", \"mac\": \"<hw_addr>\"} ]]' \\\n"
"  system.createSystemRecord\n"
msgstr ""
"$ spacecmd api -- --args '[\"<name>\", \"<profile>\", \"\", \"\", \\\n"
"  [ {\"name\": \"<iface>\", \"mac\": \"<hw_addr>\"} ]]' \\\n"
"  system.createSystemRecord\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-unattended.adoc:6
msgid "Power on the client.  It boots from the network, and the correct profile is selected for installation."
msgstr "Nyalakan klien.  Klien melakukan boot dari jaringan, dan profil yang sesuai dipilih untuk instalasi."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-unattended.adoc:7
msgid "This command creates a system record at {cobbler}.  You may also specify additional parameters, like kernel options, the IP address of the client, and its domain name.  For more information, see the API documentation for `createSystemRecord call`."
msgstr "Perintah ini membuat catatan sistem di {cobbler}.  Anda juga dapat menentukan parameter tambahan, seperti opsi kernel, alamat IP klien, dan nama domainnya.  Untuk informasi selengkapnya, lihat dokumentasi API untuk `createSystemRecord call`."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/automatic-client-registration.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Automatic Registration of Clients Created by Terraform"
msgstr "Pendaftaran Otomatis Klien yang Dibuat oleh Terraform"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/automatic-client-registration.adoc:2
msgid "New clients created by Terraform can be automatically registered to {productname}.  Registration can be achieved in two ways:"
msgstr "Klien baru yang dibuat oleh Terraform dapat didaftarkan secara otomatis ke {productname}.  Pendaftaran dapat dilakukan dengan dua cara:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/automatic-client-registration.adoc:3
msgid "`cloud-init` based registration"
msgstr "Pendaftaran berbasis `cloud-init`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/automatic-client-registration.adoc:4
msgid "remote execution provisioner based registration"
msgstr "pendaftaran berbasis provisioner eksekusi jarak jauh"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/automatic-client-registration.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "`cloud-init` Based Client Registration"
msgstr "Pendaftaran Klien Berbasis `cloud-init`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/automatic-client-registration.adoc:6
msgid "Registering by leveraging `cloud-init` is the preferred way of automatic registering of the newly created virtual machines.  This solution avoids configuring an SSH connection to the host.  It can also be used regardless of the tool used for client creation."
msgstr "Pendaftaran dengan memanfaatkan `cloud-init` merupakan cara yang direkomendasikan untuk mendaftarkan mesin virtual yang baru dibuat secara otomatis.  Solusi ini tidak memerlukan konfigurasi koneksi SSH ke host.  Solusi ini juga dapat digunakan terlepas dari alat yang digunakan untuk membuat klien."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/automatic-client-registration.adoc:7
msgid "User can pass the set of user data when deploying the image with Terraform, to automatically register the machine to {productname}.  `user_data` is run only once at bootstrap, and only the first time the machine is started."
msgstr "Pengguna dapat meneruskan sekumpulan data pengguna saat men-deploy image dengan Terraform untuk mendaftarkan mesin secara otomatis ke {productname}.  `user_data` hanya dijalankan satu kali saat bootstrap, dan hanya saat mesin pertama kali dinyalakan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/automatic-client-registration.adoc:8
msgid "Before using `cloud-init` to register clients, the user must configure:"
msgstr "Sebelum menggunakan `cloud-init` untuk mendaftarkan klien, pengguna harus mengonfigurasi:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/automatic-client-registration.adoc:9
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/automatic-client-registration.adoc:21
msgid "Bootstrap script.  For more information, see xref:client-configuration:registration-bootstrap.adoc[]."
msgstr "Skrip bootstrap.  Untuk informasi selengkapnya, lihat xref:client-configuration:registration-bootstrap.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/automatic-client-registration.adoc:10
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/automatic-client-registration.adoc:22
msgid "Activation keys.  For more information, see xref:client-configuration:activation-keys.adoc[]."
msgstr "Kunci aktivasi.  Untuk informasi selengkapnya, lihat xref:client-configuration:activation-keys.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/automatic-client-registration.adoc:11
msgid "The following command will download the bootstrap script and register the new machine when it is created.  It should be added to the `cloud-init` configuration:"
msgstr "Perintah berikut akan mengunduh skrip bootstrap dan mendaftarkan mesin baru saat mesin tersebut dibuat.  Perintah ini harus ditambahkan ke konfigurasi `cloud-init`:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/automatic-client-registration.adoc:12
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/automatic-client-registration.adoc:24
#, no-wrap
msgid "curl -s http://hub-server.tf.local/pub/bootstrap/bootstrap-default.sh | bash -s\n"
msgstr "curl -s http://hub-server.tf.local/pub/bootstrap/bootstrap-default.sh | bash -s\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/automatic-client-registration.adoc:13
msgid "Any time `user_data` is updated to change the provisioning, Terraform will destroy and then recreate the machines with a new IP, etc."
msgstr "Setiap kali `user_data` diperbarui untuk mengubah provisioning, Terraform akan menghapus lalu membuat ulang mesin dengan IP baru, dan sebagainya."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/automatic-client-registration.adoc:14
msgid "For more information about `cloud-init` on AWS, see https://registry.terraform.io/providers/hashicorp/template/latest/docs/data-sources/cloudinit_config."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang `cloud-init` di AWS, lihat https://registry.terraform.io/providers/hashicorp/template/latest/docs/data-sources/cloudinit_config."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/automatic-client-registration.adoc:15
msgid "For a `cloud-init` example, see https://registry.terraform.io/providers/hashicorp/cloudinit/latest/docs/data-sources/cloudinit_config#example-usage."
msgstr "Untuk contoh `cloud-init`, lihat https://registry.terraform.io/providers/hashicorp/cloudinit/latest/docs/data-sources/cloudinit_config#example-usage."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/automatic-client-registration.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "`remote-exec` Provisioner Based Registration"
msgstr "Pendaftaran Berbasis Provisioner `remote-exec`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/automatic-client-registration.adoc:17
msgid "The second solution for automatic registering of the newly created virtual machines uses Terraform's `remote-exec` provisioner."
msgstr "Solusi kedua untuk mendaftarkan mesin virtual yang baru dibuat secara otomatis menggunakan provisioner `remote-exec` Terraform."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/automatic-client-registration.adoc:18
msgid "`remote-exec` provisioner interacts with the newly created machines.  It opens an SSH connection and can run commands on that machine."
msgstr "Provisioner `remote-exec` berinteraksi dengan mesin yang baru dibuat.  Provisioner ini membuka koneksi SSH dan dapat menjalankan perintah pada mesin tersebut."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/automatic-client-registration.adoc:19
msgid "When using `remote-exec` provisioner to register clients, the user must ensure that the machine running Terraform will have access to the new virtual machine after its creation."
msgstr "Saat menggunakan provisioner `remote-exec` untuk mendaftarkan klien, pengguna harus memastikan bahwa mesin yang menjalankan Terraform dapat mengakses mesin virtual baru setelah dibuat."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/automatic-client-registration.adoc:20
msgid "The remaining requirements are the same as when using <<cloud-init-based-client-registration>>:"
msgstr "Persyaratan lainnya sama seperti saat menggunakan <<cloud-init-based-client-registration>>:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/automatic-client-registration.adoc:23
msgid "The following command will download the bootstrap script and register the new machine when it is created.  It should be defined as the remote command to run:"
msgstr "Perintah berikut akan mengunduh skrip bootstrap dan mendaftarkan mesin baru saat mesin tersebut dibuat.  Perintah ini harus ditetapkan sebagai perintah jarak jauh yang akan dijalankan:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/automatic-client-registration.adoc:25
msgid "For more information about `remote-exec` provisioner, see https://www.terraform.io/docs/provisioners/remote-exec.html."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang provisioner `remote-exec`, lihat https://www.terraform.io/docs/provisioners/remote-exec.html."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/bootstrap-repository.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Bootstrap repository"
msgstr "Repositori bootstrap"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/bootstrap-repository.adoc:2
msgid "A bootstrap repository contains required packages for registering clients during bootstrapping.  When products are synchronized, bootstrap repositories are automatically created and regenerated on the {productname} Server."
msgstr "Repositori bootstrap berisi paket yang diperlukan untuk mendaftarkan klien selama proses bootstrap.  Saat produk disinkronkan, repositori bootstrap secara otomatis dibuat dan dibuat ulang pada Server {productname}."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/bootstrap-repository.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prepare to create a bootstrap repository"
msgstr "Persiapan untuk membuat repositori bootstrap"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/bootstrap-repository.adoc:4
msgid "When you select a product for synchronization, the bootstrap repository is automatically created as soon as all mandatory channels are fully mirrored."
msgstr "Saat Anda memilih produk untuk disinkronkan, repositori bootstrap secara otomatis dibuat segera setelah semua saluran wajib selesai dicerminkan sepenuhnya."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/bootstrap-repository.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Options for automatic mode"
msgstr "Opsi untuk mode otomatis"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/bootstrap-repository.adoc:6
msgid "You can change how the automated bootstrap repository creation works.  This section details the various settings."
msgstr "Anda dapat mengubah cara kerja pembuatan repositori bootstrap otomatis.  Bagian ini menjelaskan berbagai pengaturan yang tersedia."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/bootstrap-repository.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "Flush mode"
msgstr "Mode pengosongan"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/bootstrap-repository.adoc:8
msgid "By default, existing repositories are updated only with the latest packages.  You can configure it to always start with an empty repository instead.  To enable this behavior, add or edit this value in `/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`:"
msgstr "Secara default, repositori yang ada hanya diperbarui dengan paket terbaru.  Anda dapat mengonfigurasinya agar selalu dimulai dengan repositori kosong.  Untuk mengaktifkan perilaku ini, tambahkan atau edit nilai berikut di `/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/bootstrap-repository.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "server.susemanager.bootstrap_repo_flush = 1\n"
msgstr "server.susemanager.bootstrap_repo_flush = 1\n"

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/bootstrap-repository.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "Automatic mode"
msgstr "Mode otomatis"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/bootstrap-repository.adoc:11
msgid "By default, automated regeneration of the bootstrap repositories is enabled.  To disable it, add or edit this value in `/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`:"
msgstr "Secara default, pembuatan ulang repositori bootstrap secara otomatis diaktifkan.  Untuk menonaktifkannya, tambahkan atau edit nilai berikut di `/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/bootstrap-repository.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid "server.susemanager.auto_generate_bootstrap_repo = 0\n"
msgstr "server.susemanager.auto_generate_bootstrap_repo = 0\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/bootstrap-repository.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "Configure bootstrap data file"
msgstr "Mengonfigurasi berkas data bootstrap"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/bootstrap-repository.adoc:14
msgid "The tool uses a data file with information about which packages are required for each distribution.  The data file is stored at `/usr/share/susemanager/mgr_bootstrap_data.py`.  {suse} updates this file regularly.  If you want to makes changes to this file, do not edit it directly.  Instead, create a copy in persistent directory and edit your copy:"
msgstr "Alat ini menggunakan berkas data yang berisi informasi tentang paket yang diperlukan untuk setiap distribusi.  Berkas data tersebut disimpan di `/usr/share/susemanager/mgr_bootstrap_data.py`.  {suse} memperbarui berkas ini secara berkala.  Jika Anda ingin mengubah berkas ini, jangan mengeditnya secara langsung.  Sebagai gantinya, buat salinan di direktori persisten dan edit salinan tersebut:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/bootstrap-repository.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "cp /usr/share/susemanager/mgr_bootstrap_data.py /srv/susemanager/my_data.py\n"
msgstr "cp /usr/share/susemanager/mgr_bootstrap_data.py /srv/susemanager/my_data.py\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/bootstrap-repository.adoc:16
msgid "When you have made your changes, configure {productname} to use the new file.  Add or edit this value in `/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`:"
msgstr "Setelah melakukan perubahan, konfigurasikan {productname} untuk menggunakan berkas baru tersebut.  Tambahkan atau edit nilai berikut di `/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/bootstrap-repository.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid "server.susemanager.bootstrap_repo_datamodule = my_data\n"
msgstr "server.susemanager.bootstrap_repo_datamodule = my_data\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/bootstrap-repository.adoc:18
msgid "On the next update, the new data from {suse} overwrites the original data file, not the new one.  You need to keep the new file up to date with changes provided by {suse}."
msgstr "Pada pembaruan berikutnya, data baru dari {suse} akan menimpa berkas data asli, bukan berkas baru tersebut.  Anda perlu menjaga agar berkas baru tetap mutakhir dengan menerapkan perubahan yang disediakan oleh {suse}."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/bootstrap-repository.adoc:19
#, no-wrap
msgid "Manually generate a bootstrap repository"
msgstr "Membuat repositori bootstrap secara manual"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/bootstrap-repository.adoc:20
msgid "By default, bootstrap repositories are regenerated daily.  You can manually create the bootstrap repository from the command prompt."
msgstr "Secara default, repositori bootstrap dibuat ulang setiap hari.  Anda dapat membuat repositori bootstrap secara manual dari prompt perintah."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/bootstrap-repository.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Generating the bootstrap repository for {sle}"
msgstr "Prosedur: Membuat repositori bootstrap untuk {sle}"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/bootstrap-repository.adoc:22
msgid "At the command prompt on the {productname} Server, as root, list the available distributions to create bootstrap repositories for:"
msgstr "Pada prompt perintah di Server {productname}, sebagai root, tampilkan daftar distribusi yang tersedia untuk dibuatkan repositori bootstrap:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/bootstrap-repository.adoc:23
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgr-create-bootstrap-repo -l\n"
msgstr "mgr-create-bootstrap-repo -l\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/bootstrap-repository.adoc:24
msgid "Create the bootstrap repository, using the appropriate repository name as the product label:"
msgstr "Buat repositori bootstrap menggunakan nama repositori yang sesuai sebagai label produk:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/bootstrap-repository.adoc:25
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgr-create-bootstrap-repo -c SLE-version-x86_64\n"
msgstr "mgr-create-bootstrap-repo -c SLE-version-x86_64\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/bootstrap-repository.adoc:26
msgid "Alternatively, use the number shown next to the distribution name in the list of available distributions."
msgstr "Sebagai alternatif, gunakan nomor yang ditampilkan di samping nama distribusi dalam daftar distribusi yang tersedia."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/bootstrap-repository.adoc:27
msgid "The client repository is located in `/srv/www/htdocs/pub/repositories/`."
msgstr "Repositori klien berada di `/srv/www/htdocs/pub/repositories/`."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/bootstrap-repository.adoc:28
msgid "If you have mirrored more than one product (for example, SLES and SLES for SAP), or if you use custom channels, you might need to specify the parent channel to use when creating the bootstrap repository.  This is not required in every situation.  For example, some SLES{nbsp}15 versions have common code bases, so there is no need to specify a parent channel.  Use this procedure only if your environment requires it."
msgstr "Jika Anda telah mencerminkan lebih dari satu produk (misalnya, SLES dan SLES for SAP), atau jika Anda menggunakan saluran kustom, Anda mungkin perlu menentukan saluran induk yang akan digunakan saat membuat repositori bootstrap.  Hal ini tidak diperlukan dalam setiap situasi.  Misalnya, beberapa versi SLES{nbsp}15 memiliki basis kode yang sama, sehingga tidak perlu menentukan saluran induk.  Gunakan prosedur ini hanya jika lingkungan Anda memerlukannya."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/bootstrap-repository.adoc:29
#, no-wrap
msgid "OPTIONAL Procedure: Specifying a parent channel for a bootstrap repository"
msgstr "Prosedur OPSIONAL: Menentukan saluran induk untuk repositori bootstrap"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/bootstrap-repository.adoc:30
msgid "Check which parent channels you have available:"
msgstr "Periksa saluran induk yang tersedia:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/bootstrap-repository.adoc:31
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mgr-create-bootstrap-repo -c SLE-15-x86_64\n"
"Multiple options for parent channel found. Please use option\n"
"--with-parent-channel <label> and choose one of:\n"
"- sle-product-sles15-pool-x86_64\n"
"- sle-product-sles_sap15-pool-x86_64\n"
"- sle-product-sled15-pool-x86_64\n"
msgstr ""
"mgr-create-bootstrap-repo -c SLE-15-x86_64\n"
"Multiple options for parent channel found. Please use option\n"
"--with-parent-channel <label> and choose one of:\n"
"- sle-product-sles15-pool-x86_64\n"
"- sle-product-sles_sap15-pool-x86_64\n"
"- sle-product-sled15-pool-x86_64\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/bootstrap-repository.adoc:32
msgid "Specify the appropriate parent channel:"
msgstr "Tentukan saluran induk yang sesuai:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/bootstrap-repository.adoc:33
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgr-create-bootstrap-repo -c SLE-15-x86_64 --with-parent-channel sle-product-sled15-pool-x86_64\n"
msgstr "mgr-create-bootstrap-repo -c SLE-15-x86_64 --with-parent-channel sle-product-sled15-pool-x86_64\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/bootstrap-repository.adoc:34
#, no-wrap
msgid "Repositories with multiple architectures"
msgstr "Repositori dengan beberapa arsitektur"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/bootstrap-repository.adoc:35
msgid "If you are creating bootstrap repositories that include multiple different architectures, you need to be careful that all architectures are updated correctly.  For example, the {x86_64} and {ibmz} architectures for {slea} use the same bootstrap repository URL at `/srv/www/htdocs/pub/repositories/sle/15/2/bootstrap/`."
msgstr "Jika Anda membuat repositori bootstrap yang mencakup beberapa arsitektur berbeda, Anda perlu memastikan bahwa semua arsitektur diperbarui dengan benar.  Misalnya, arsitektur {x86_64} dan {ibmz} untuk {slea} menggunakan URL repositori bootstrap yang sama di `/srv/www/htdocs/pub/repositories/sle/15/2/bootstrap/`."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/bootstrap-repository.adoc:36
msgid "When the `flush` option is enabled, and you attempt to generate the bootstrap repository for multiple architectures, only one architecture is generated.  To avoid this, use the `--no-flush` option at the command prompt when creating additional architectures.  For example:"
msgstr "Saat opsi `flush` diaktifkan dan Anda mencoba membuat repositori bootstrap untuk beberapa arsitektur, repositori hanya dibuat untuk satu arsitektur.  Untuk menghindari hal ini, gunakan opsi `--no-flush` pada prompt perintah saat menambahkan arsitektur lain.  Misalnya:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/bootstrap-repository.adoc:37
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mgr-create-bootstrap-repo -c SLE-15-SP2-x86_64\n"
"mgr-create-bootstrap-repo --no-flush -c SLE-15-SP2-s390x\n"
msgstr ""
"mgr-create-bootstrap-repo -c SLE-15-SP2-x86_64\n"
"mgr-create-bootstrap-repo --no-flush -c SLE-15-SP2-s390x\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/bootstrap-repository.adoc:38
#, no-wrap
msgid "Bootstrap and custom channels"
msgstr "Bootstrap dan saluran kustom"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/bootstrap-repository.adoc:39
msgid "If you are using custom channels, you can use the `--with-custom-channels` option with the `mgr-create-bootstrap-repo` command.  In this case, you also need to specify the parent channel to use."
msgstr "Jika Anda menggunakan saluran kustom, Anda dapat menggunakan opsi `--with-custom-channels` dengan perintah `mgr-create-bootstrap-repo`.  Dalam hal ini, Anda juga perlu menentukan saluran induk yang akan digunakan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/bootstrap-repository.adoc:40
msgid "Automatic creation of a bootstrap repository might fail if you are using custom channels.  In this case, you need to create the repository manually."
msgstr "Pembuatan repositori bootstrap secara otomatis mungkin gagal jika Anda menggunakan saluran kustom.  Dalam hal ini, Anda perlu membuat repositori secara manual."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/bootstrap-repository.adoc:41
msgid "For more information about custom channels, see xref:administration:custom-channels.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang saluran kustom, lihat xref:administration:custom-channels.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/channels.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Software Channels"
msgstr "Saluran Perangkat Lunak"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/channels.adoc:2
msgid "Channels are a method of grouping software packages.  Software packages are provided by repositories, and repositories are associated with channels.  Subscribing a client to a software channel allows the client to install and update any of the software associated with it."
msgstr "Saluran merupakan metode untuk mengelompokkan paket perangkat lunak.  Paket perangkat lunak disediakan oleh repositori, dan repositori dikaitkan dengan saluran.  Mendaftarkan klien ke suatu saluran perangkat lunak memungkinkan klien menginstal dan memperbarui perangkat lunak apa pun yang terkait dengan saluran tersebut."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/channels.adoc:3
msgid "In {productname}, channels are divided into base channels and child channels.  Organizing channels in this way ensures that only compatible packages are installed on each system.  A client must be subscribed to only one base channel, assigned during registration based on the client operating system and architecture.  For paid channels provided by a vendor, you must have an associated subscription."
msgstr "Di {productname}, saluran dibagi menjadi saluran dasar dan saluran anak.  Pengelompokan saluran dengan cara ini memastikan bahwa hanya paket yang kompatibel yang diinstal pada setiap sistem.  Klien harus terdaftar hanya ke satu saluran dasar, yang ditetapkan selama pendaftaran berdasarkan sistem operasi dan arsitektur klien.  Untuk saluran berbayar yang disediakan oleh vendor, Anda harus memiliki langganan yang sesuai."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/channels.adoc:4
msgid "A base channel consists of packages built for a specific operating system type, version, and architecture.  For example, the {sles}{nbsp}15 {x86_64} base channel contains only software compatible with that operating system and architecture."
msgstr "Saluran dasar terdiri atas paket yang dibuat untuk jenis, versi, dan arsitektur sistem operasi tertentu.  Misalnya, saluran dasar {sles}{nbsp}15 {x86_64} hanya berisi perangkat lunak yang kompatibel dengan sistem operasi dan arsitektur tersebut."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/channels.adoc:5
msgid "A child channel is associated with a base channel and provides only packages that are compatible with the base channel.  A system can be subscribed to multiple child channels of its base channel.  When a system has been assigned to a base channel, it is only possible for that system to install the related child channels.  For example, if a system has been assigned to the {sles}{nbsp}15 `x86_64` base channel, they can only install or update packages made available through the compatible base channel, or any of its associated child channels."
msgstr "Saluran anak dikaitkan dengan saluran dasar dan hanya menyediakan paket yang kompatibel dengan saluran dasar tersebut.  Sistem dapat didaftarkan ke beberapa saluran anak dari saluran dasarnya.  Setelah sistem ditetapkan ke suatu saluran dasar, sistem tersebut hanya dapat menginstal paket dari saluran anak yang terkait.  Misalnya, jika sistem telah ditetapkan ke saluran dasar {sles}{nbsp}15 `x86_64`, sistem tersebut hanya dapat menginstal atau memperbarui paket yang tersedia melalui saluran dasar yang kompatibel atau saluran anak mana pun yang terkait dengannya."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/channels.adoc:6
msgid "In the {productname} {webui} you can browse your available channels by navigating to menu:Software[Channel List > All].  You can modify or create new channels by navigating to menu:Software[Manage > Channels]."
msgstr "Di {webui} {productname}, Anda dapat menelusuri saluran yang tersedia dengan membuka menu:Software[Channel List > All].  Anda dapat mengubah atau membuat saluran baru dengan membuka menu:Software[Manage > Channels]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/channels.adoc:7
msgid "For more on using channels, including custom channels, see xref:administration:channel-management.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang penggunaan saluran, termasuk saluran kustom, lihat xref:administration:channel-management.adoc[]."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/channels.adoc:8
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-overview.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Handling the Installer Updates Channel after Bootstrapping"
msgstr "Menangani Saluran Pembaruan Penginstal setelah Bootstrap"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/channels.adoc:9
msgid "Once a client system has been bootstrapped, the **Installer Updates** channel should be removed. The standard update channel already includes the necessary updates, making this channel redundant."
msgstr "Setelah proses bootstrap sistem klien selesai, saluran **Installer Updates** harus dihapus. Saluran pembaruan standar sudah mencakup pembaruan yang diperlukan, sehingga saluran ini tidak lagi diperlukan."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/channels.adoc:10
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-overview.adoc:8
msgid "Additionally, during migrations, this channel is unnecessary and should not be used."
msgstr "Selain itu, selama migrasi, saluran ini tidak diperlukan dan tidak boleh digunakan."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/channels.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "Packages Provided by {phub}"
msgstr "Paket yang Disediakan oleh {phub}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/channels.adoc:12
msgid "{phub} is an extension to {sle} products that provides additional open source software provided by the {opensuse} community."
msgstr "{phub} adalah ekstensi untuk produk {sle} yang menyediakan perangkat lunak sumber terbuka tambahan dari komunitas {opensuse}."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/channels.adoc:13
msgid "The packages in {phub} are provided by the {opensuse} community.  They are not supported by {suse}."
msgstr "Paket dalam {phub} disediakan oleh komunitas {opensuse}.  Paket tersebut tidak didukung oleh {suse}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/channels.adoc:14
msgid "If you are using {sle} operating systems on your clients, you can enable the {phub} extension to access these additional packages.  This provides the {phub} channels, which you can subscribe your clients to."
msgstr "Jika Anda menggunakan sistem operasi {sle} pada klien, Anda dapat mengaktifkan ekstensi {phub} untuk mengakses paket tambahan tersebut.  Ekstensi ini menyediakan saluran {phub}, yang dapat Anda gunakan untuk mendaftarkan klien."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/channels.adoc:15
msgid "{phub} provides a large number of packages, which can take a long time to synchronize and consume a large amount of disk space.  Do not enable {phub} unless you require the packages it provides."
msgstr "{phub} menyediakan banyak paket, sehingga sinkronisasinya dapat memerlukan waktu lama dan menghabiskan banyak ruang disk.  Jangan aktifkan {phub} kecuali Anda memerlukan paket yang disediakannya."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/channels.adoc:16
msgid "To avoid unintentionally installing or updating unsupported packages, we recommend that you implement a content lifecycle management strategy that initially denies all {phub} packages.  You can then explicitly enable the specific packages you require.  For more information about content lifecycle management, see xref:administration:content-lifecycle.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk menghindari instalasi atau pembaruan paket yang tidak didukung secara tidak sengaja, kami menyarankan agar Anda menerapkan strategi pengelolaan siklus hidup konten yang pada awalnya menolak semua paket {phub}.  Anda kemudian dapat secara eksplisit mengaktifkan paket tertentu yang diperlukan.  Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang pengelolaan siklus hidup konten, lihat xref:administration:content-lifecycle.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/channels.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid "Packages Provided by AppStream"
msgstr "Paket yang Disediakan oleh AppStream"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/channels.adoc:18
msgid "For {redhat} based clients, additional packages are available through AppStream.  In most cases, the AppStream packages are required to ensure that you have all the software you need."
msgstr "Untuk klien berbasis {redhat}, paket tambahan tersedia melalui AppStream.  Dalam kebanyakan kasus, paket AppStream diperlukan untuk memastikan bahwa semua perangkat lunak yang Anda butuhkan tersedia."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/channels.adoc:19
#, no-wrap
msgid "Packages Provided by EPEL"
msgstr "Paket yang Disediakan oleh EPEL"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/channels.adoc:20
msgid "For {redhat} based clients, additional packages are available through EPEL (extra packages for enterprise Linux).  EPEL is an optional package repository that provides additional software."
msgstr "Untuk klien berbasis {redhat}, paket tambahan tersedia melalui EPEL (paket tambahan untuk Linux enterprise).  EPEL adalah repositori paket opsional yang menyediakan perangkat lunak tambahan."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/channels.adoc:21
msgid "The packages in EPEL are provided by the Fedora community.  They are not supported by {suse}."
msgstr "Paket dalam EPEL disediakan oleh komunitas Fedora.  Paket tersebut tidak didukung oleh {suse}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/channels.adoc:22
msgid "If you are using {redhat} operating systems on your clients, you can enable the EPEL extension to access these additional packages.  This provides the EPEL channels, which you can subscribe your clients to."
msgstr "Jika Anda menggunakan sistem operasi {redhat} pada klien, Anda dapat mengaktifkan ekstensi EPEL untuk mengakses paket tambahan tersebut.  Ekstensi ini menyediakan saluran EPEL, yang dapat Anda gunakan untuk mendaftarkan klien."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/channels.adoc:23
msgid "EPEL provides a large number of packages, which can take a long time to synchronize and consume a large amount of disk space.  Do not enable the EPEL repositories unless you require the packages it provides."
msgstr "EPEL menyediakan banyak paket, sehingga sinkronisasinya dapat memerlukan waktu lama dan menghabiskan banyak ruang disk.  Jangan aktifkan repositori EPEL kecuali Anda memerlukan paket yang disediakannya."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/channels.adoc:24
msgid "To avoid unintentionally installing or updating unsupported packages, we recommended that you implement a content lifecycle management (CLM) strategy that initially denies all EPEL packages.  You can then explicitly enable the specific packages you require.  For more information about content lifecycle management, see xref:administration:content-lifecycle.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk menghindari instalasi atau pembaruan paket yang tidak didukung secara tidak sengaja, kami menyarankan agar Anda menerapkan strategi pengelolaan siklus hidup konten (CLM) yang pada awalnya menolak semua paket EPEL.  Anda kemudian dapat secara eksplisit mengaktifkan paket tertentu yang diperlukan.  Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang pengelolaan siklus hidup konten, lihat xref:administration:content-lifecycle.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/channels.adoc:25
#, no-wrap
msgid "{unifiedinstaller} Updates Channels on {sle} Clients"
msgstr "Saluran Pembaruan {unifiedinstaller} pada Klien {sle}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/channels.adoc:26
msgid "This channel is used by the {unifiedinstaller} to ensure it is up to date before it installs the operating system.  All {sle} products should have access to the installer updates channel during installation."
msgstr "Saluran ini digunakan oleh {unifiedinstaller} untuk memastikan bahwa penginstal tersebut sudah mutakhir sebelum menginstal sistem operasi.  Semua produk {sle} harus memiliki akses ke saluran pembaruan penginstal selama instalasi."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/channels.adoc:27
msgid "For {sles} clients the installer updates channel is synchronized by default when you add a product that contains them, and are enabled when you create an autoinstallable distribution with these product channels."
msgstr "Untuk klien {sles}, saluran pembaruan penginstal disinkronkan secara default saat Anda menambahkan produk yang menyertakannya, dan diaktifkan saat Anda membuat distribusi yang dapat diinstal secara otomatis menggunakan saluran produk tersebut."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/channels.adoc:28
msgid "For all other {sle} variants, including {sle} for SAP, you must add the installer updates channel manually.  To do this, clone the appropriate {sles} installer updates channel below the base channel of these {sle} variants.  When creating an autoinstallable distribution for these {sle} variants after the channel was cloned, it is used automatically."
msgstr "Untuk semua varian {sle} lainnya, termasuk {sle} for SAP, Anda harus menambahkan saluran pembaruan penginstal secara manual.  Untuk melakukannya, kloning saluran pembaruan penginstal {sles} yang sesuai di bawah saluran dasar varian {sle} tersebut.  Saat Anda membuat distribusi yang dapat diinstal secara otomatis untuk varian {sle} tersebut setelah saluran dikloning, saluran itu digunakan secara otomatis."

