#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-config-overview.adoc:13
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-config-overview.adoc:24
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/uyuni-client-config-overview.adoc:8
