#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-config-overview.adoc:15
msgid "Client Configuration Guide | {productname} {productnumber}"
msgstr "Panduan Konfigurasi Klien | {productname} {productnumber}"

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-operations.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Client Operations"
msgstr "Operasi Klien"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-operations.adoc:2
msgid "In addition to registering, upgrading, installing software, or deleting clients other operations can be performed.  {productname} clients can be managed individually or as a set of clients.  A set of clients can grouped with System Set Manager for a one time action or permanently with System Groups."
msgstr "Selain pendaftaran, peningkatan versi, instalasi perangkat lunak, atau penghapusan klien, operasi lain juga dapat dilakukan.  Klien {productname} dapat dikelola secara individual atau sebagai sekumpulan klien.  Sekumpulan klien dapat dikelompokkan menggunakan System Set Manager untuk tindakan satu kali atau secara permanen menggunakan System Groups."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-operations.adoc:3
msgid "For advanced client configuratin options general Configuration Management is available.  You can obtain Custom System Information, power on or off, and reboot clients using the {productname} {webui}.  For transactional systems, see xref:client-configuration:transactional-systems.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk opsi konfigurasi klien tingkat lanjut, tersedia Configuration Management umum.  Anda dapat memperoleh Informasi Sistem Kustom, menyalakan atau mematikan, serta melakukan boot ulang klien menggunakan {webui} {productname}.  Untuk sistem transaksional, lihat xref:client-configuration:transactional-systems.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-operations.adoc:4
msgid "The following sections contain detailed descriptions for each of these operations."
msgstr "Bagian berikut memuat penjelasan terperinci untuk setiap operasi tersebut."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-cli.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Register Clients to a Proxy on the Command Line"
msgstr "Mendaftarkan Klien ke Proxy melalui Baris Perintah"

#.  FIXME: 2023-10-24, ke: is preinstalled Salt still required?  Salt bundle?
#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-cli.adoc:2
msgid "Instead of the {webui}, you can use the command line to register a client to a proxy.  This procedure requires that you have installed the Salt package on the client before registration.  For SLE 12 based clients, you also must have activated the `Advanced Systems Management` module."
msgstr "Sebagai pengganti {webui}, Anda dapat menggunakan baris perintah untuk mendaftarkan klien ke proxy.  Prosedur ini mengharuskan Anda menginstal paket Salt pada klien sebelum pendaftaran.  Untuk klien berbasis SLE 12, Anda juga harus mengaktifkan modul `Advanced Systems Management`."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-cli.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Registering Clients to a Proxy Using the Command Line"
msgstr "Prosedur: Mendaftarkan Klien ke Proxy Menggunakan Baris Perintah"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-cli.adoc:4
msgid "Choose a client configuration file located at:"
msgstr "Pilih berkas konfigurasi klien yang berada di:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-cli.adoc:5
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-cli.adoc:42
#, no-wrap
msgid "/etc/salt/minion\n"
msgstr "/etc/salt/minion\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-cli.adoc:6
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-cli.adoc:21
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-cli.adoc:43
msgid "or:"
msgstr "atau:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-cli.adoc:7
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-cli.adoc:44
#, no-wrap
msgid "/etc/salt/minion.d/NAME.conf\n"
msgstr "/etc/salt/minion.d/NAME.conf\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-cli.adoc:8
msgid "This is sometimes also called a minion file."
msgstr "Berkas ini terkadang juga disebut berkas minion."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-cli.adoc:9
msgid "Add the proxy FQDN as the `master` to the client configuration file:"
msgstr "Tambahkan FQDN proxy sebagai `master` ke berkas konfigurasi klien:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-cli.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "master: PROXY123.EXAMPLE.COM\n"
msgstr "master: PROXY123.EXAMPLE.COM\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-cli.adoc:11
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-cli.adoc:49
msgid "Restart the `salt-minion` service:"
msgstr "Mulai ulang layanan `salt-minion`:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-cli.adoc:12
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-cli.adoc:50
#, no-wrap
msgid "systemctl restart salt-minion\n"
msgstr "systemctl restart salt-minion\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-cli.adoc:13
msgid "On the server, accept the new client key; replace `<client>` with the name of your client:"
msgstr "Pada server, terima kunci klien baru; ganti `<client>` dengan nama klien Anda:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-cli.adoc:14
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-cli.adoc:32
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-cli.adoc:52
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt-key -a '<client>'\n"
msgstr "salt-key -a '<client>'\n"

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-script.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Register Clients  to a Proxy with a Bootstrap Script"
msgstr "Mendaftarkan Klien ke Proxy dengan Skrip Bootstrap"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-script.adoc:2
msgid "Clients can be registered through the {productname} Proxy with a bootstrap script.  This is done almost the same way as registering clients directly with the {productname} Server."
msgstr "Klien dapat didaftarkan melalui Proxy {productname} dengan skrip bootstrap.  Prosesnya hampir sama dengan mendaftarkan klien langsung ke Server {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-script.adoc:3
msgid "Create the bootstrap script in the {productname} Server container with the `mgr-bootstrap` command line tool.  `mgr-bootstrap` requires parameters such as the fully qualified domain name (FQDN) of the proxy, activation keys, or GPG keys.  FQDN of the proxy is mandatory.  All other parameters depend on the specific setup."
msgstr "Buat skrip bootstrap di dalam kontainer Server {productname} menggunakan alat baris perintah `mgr-bootstrap`.  `mgr-bootstrap` memerlukan parameter seperti nama domain yang sepenuhnya memenuhi syarat (FQDN) proxy, kunci aktivasi, atau kunci GPG.  FQDN proxy wajib ditentukan.  Semua parameter lainnya bergantung pada konfigurasi spesifik."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-script.adoc:4
msgid "The bootstrap script then deploys all necessary information to the clients."
msgstr "Skrip bootstrap kemudian menerapkan semua informasi yang diperlukan ke klien."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-script.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Registering Clients to a Proxy with a Bootstrap Script"
msgstr "Prosedur: Mendaftarkan Klien ke Proxy dengan Skrip Bootstrap"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-script.adoc:6
msgid "Create a client activation key on the {productname} Server using the {webui}.  For more information, see xref:client-configuration:activation-keys.adoc[]."
msgstr "Buat kunci aktivasi klien pada Server {productname} menggunakan {webui}.  Untuk informasi selengkapnya, lihat xref:client-configuration:activation-keys.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-script.adoc:7
msgid "On the container host of the server, start a terminial in the container:"
msgstr "Pada host kontainer server, buka terminal di dalam kontainer:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-script.adoc:8
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc:43
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-bootstrap.adoc:17
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-bootstrap.adoc:42
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-bootstrap.adoc:64
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgrctl term\n"
msgstr "mgrctl term\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-script.adoc:9
msgid "In the container, to create the bootstrap script, execute the `mgr-bootstrap` command, for example, with these options:"
msgstr "Di dalam kontainer, untuk membuat skrip bootstrap, jalankan perintah `mgr-bootstrap`, misalnya dengan opsi berikut:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-script.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mgr-bootstrap --hostname=MLM_PROXY --activation-keys=ACTIVATION_KEY \\\n"
"  --script bootstrap-MLM_PROXY.sh\n"
msgstr ""
"mgr-bootstrap --hostname=MLM_PROXY --activation-keys=ACTIVATION_KEY \\\n"
"  --script bootstrap-MLM_PROXY.sh\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-script.adoc:11
msgid "Replace `MLM_PROXY` with the host name of your proxy."
msgstr "Ganti `MLM_PROXY` dengan nama host proxy Anda."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-script.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"With the `--script` option you save the bootstrap script with a descriptive name.\n"
"   If needed, use additional command line options to customize your bootstrap script.\n"
"   To view available options type `mgr-bootstrap --help` from the command line.\n"
msgstr ""
"Dengan opsi `--script`, Anda menyimpan skrip bootstrap dengan nama yang deskriptif.\n"
"   Jika diperlukan, gunakan opsi baris perintah tambahan untuk menyesuaikan skrip bootstrap Anda.\n"
"   Untuk melihat opsi yang tersedia, ketik `mgr-bootstrap --help` pada baris perintah.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-script.adoc:13
msgid "OPTIONAL: Edit the resulting bootstrap script."
msgstr "OPSIONAL: Edit skrip bootstrap yang dihasilkan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-script.adoc:14
msgid "Execute the bootstrap script.  There are two options:"
msgstr "Jalankan skrip bootstrap.  Tersedia dua opsi:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-script.adoc:15
msgid "Transfer the script to the client and run it directly on the clients.  Alternatively, because the proxy forwards requests to the server, the client can download it from http://MLM_PROXY/pub/bootstrap-MLM_PROXY.sh.  Replace `MLM_PROXY` with the host name of your proxy."
msgstr "Transfer skrip ke klien dan jalankan langsung pada klien.  Sebagai alternatif, karena proxy meneruskan permintaan ke server, klien dapat mengunduhnya dari http://MLM_PROXY/pub/bootstrap-MLM_PROXY.sh.  Ganti `MLM_PROXY` dengan nama host proxy Anda."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-script.adoc:16
msgid "Execute the script from the proxy with `ssh`.  Replace `MLM_PROXY` with the host name of the proxy and ` <client.example.com>` with the host name of the client:"
msgstr "Jalankan skrip dari proxy menggunakan `ssh`.  Ganti `MLM_PROXY` dengan nama host proxy dan ` <client.example.com>` dengan nama host klien:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-script.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid "cat /srv/www/htdocs/pub/bootstrap/bootstrap-MLM_PROXY.sh | ssh root@<client.example.com> /bin/bash\n"
msgstr "cat /srv/www/htdocs/pub/bootstrap/bootstrap-MLM_PROXY.sh | ssh root@<client.example.com> /bin/bash\n"

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-webui.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Register Clients to a Proxy With the {webui}"
msgstr "Mendaftarkan Klien ke Proxy dengan {webui}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-webui.adoc:2
msgid "You can register clients to the {productname} Proxy using the {webui}."
msgstr "Anda dapat mendaftarkan klien ke Proxy {productname} menggunakan {webui}."

#. A bootstrap repository offers packages for installing {salt} on clients and for registering {salt} clients.
#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-webui.adoc:3
msgid "A bootstrap repository is needed for non-SLE clients in general and for SLE clients before version 15."
msgstr "Repositori bootstrap diperlukan untuk klien non-SLE secara umum dan untuk klien SLE sebelum versi 15."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-webui.adoc:4
msgid "For information about creating a bootstrap repository, see xref:client-configuration:bootstrap-repository.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi tentang pembuatan repositori bootstrap, lihat xref:client-configuration:bootstrap-repository.adoc[]."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-webui.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Registering Clients to a Proxy with the {webui}"
msgstr "Prosedur: Mendaftarkan Klien ke Proxy dengan {webui}"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-webui.adoc:6
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-webui.adoc:9
msgid "In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Systems[Bootstrapping]."
msgstr "Di {webui} {productname}, buka menu:Systems[Bootstrapping]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-webui.adoc:7
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-webui.adoc:10
msgid "In the `Host` field, type the fully qualified domain name (FQDN) of the client to be bootstrapped."
msgstr "Di kolom `Host`, ketik nama domain yang sepenuhnya memenuhi syarat (FQDN) klien yang akan menjalani proses bootstrap."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-webui.adoc:8
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-webui.adoc:11
msgid "In the `SSH Port` field, type the SSH port number to use to connect and bootstrap the client."
msgstr "Di kolom `SSH Port`, ketik nomor port SSH yang akan digunakan untuk menghubungkan dan menjalankan proses bootstrap pada klien."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-webui.adoc:9
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-webui.adoc:12
msgid "By default, the SSH port is `22`."
msgstr "Secara default, port SSH adalah `22`."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-webui.adoc:10
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-webui.adoc:13
msgid "In the `User` field, type the username to log in to the client."
msgstr "Di kolom `User`, ketik nama pengguna untuk masuk ke klien."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-webui.adoc:11
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-webui.adoc:14
msgid "By default, the username is `root`."
msgstr "Secara default, nama pengguna adalah `root`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-webui.adoc:12
msgid "In the `Authentication Method` field, select the authentication method to use for bootstrapping the client."
msgstr "Di kolom `Authentication Method`, pilih metode autentikasi yang akan digunakan untuk menjalankan proses bootstrap pada klien."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-webui.adoc:13
msgid "For password authentication, in the `Password` field, type password to log in to the client."
msgstr "Untuk autentikasi kata sandi, di kolom `Password`, ketik kata sandi untuk masuk ke klien."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-webui.adoc:14
msgid "For SSH Private key authentication, enter the private key and the associated passphrase."
msgstr "Untuk autentikasi kunci privat SSH, masukkan kunci privat dan frasa sandi yang terkait."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-webui.adoc:15
msgid "The key is only stored for as long as the bootstrapping process takes to complete."
msgstr "Kunci hanya disimpan selama proses bootstrap berlangsung hingga selesai."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-webui.adoc:16
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-webui.adoc:19
msgid "In the `Activation Key` field, select the activation key that is associated with the software channel you want to use to bootstrap the client."
msgstr "Di kolom `Activation Key`, pilih kunci aktivasi yang terkait dengan saluran perangkat lunak yang ingin Anda gunakan untuk menjalankan proses bootstrap pada klien."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-webui.adoc:17
msgid "In the `Proxy` field, select the proxy server you want to register to."
msgstr "Di kolom `Proxy`, pilih server proxy tujuan pendaftaran."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-webui.adoc:18
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-webui.adoc:24
msgid "By default, the `Disable SSH Strict Key Host Checking` checkbox is selected."
msgstr "Secara default, kotak centang `Disable SSH Strict Key Host Checking` dipilih."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-webui.adoc:19
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-webui.adoc:25
msgid "This allows the bootstrap process to automatically accept SSH host keys without requiring you to manually authenticate."
msgstr "Hal ini memungkinkan proses bootstrap menerima kunci host SSH secara otomatis tanpa mengharuskan Anda melakukan autentikasi secara manual."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-webui.adoc:20
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-webui.adoc:26
msgid "OPTIONAL: Check the `Manage System Completely via SSH` checkbox."
msgstr "OPSIONAL: Pilih kotak centang `Manage System Completely via SSH`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-webui.adoc:21
msgid "If you check this option, the client is configured to use SSH for its connection to the server, and no other connection method is configured."
msgstr "Jika Anda memilih opsi ini, klien dikonfigurasi untuk menggunakan SSH sebagai koneksinya ke server, dan tidak ada metode koneksi lain yang dikonfigurasi."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-webui.adoc:22
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltssh.adoc:17
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-webui.adoc:29
msgid "Click btn:[Bootstrap] to begin registration."
msgstr "Klik btn:[Bootstrap] untuk memulai pendaftaran."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-webui.adoc:23
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-webui.adoc:30
msgid "When the bootstrap process has completed, your client is listed at menu:Systems[System List]."
msgstr "Setelah proses bootstrap selesai, klien Anda tercantum di menu:Systems[System List]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Client Registration to a Proxy"
msgstr "Pendaftaran Klien ke Proxy"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy.adoc:2
msgid "Proxy servers can act as a broker and package cache for clients.  Registering clients to a proxy is similar to registering them directly to the {productname} Server, with a few key differences."
msgstr "Server proxy dapat bertindak sebagai perantara dan cache paket untuk klien.  Mendaftarkan klien ke proxy serupa dengan mendaftarkannya langsung ke Server {productname}, dengan beberapa perbedaan penting."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy.adoc:3
msgid "These sections contain information on registering clients to a proxy using the {webui}, commands on the command line, or a bootstrap script.  There are also procedures how you can move clients from one {productname} Proxy to another one or to the {productname} Server."
msgstr "Bagian ini memuat informasi tentang pendaftaran klien ke proxy menggunakan {webui}, perintah pada baris perintah, atau skrip bootstrap.  Tersedia juga prosedur untuk memindahkan klien dari satu Proxy {productname} ke proxy lainnya atau ke Server {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy.adoc:4
msgid "Within the {webui}, proxy pages show information about clients.  You can see a list of clients that are connected to a proxy by clicking the name of the proxy in menu:Systems[System List > Proxy], then select the `Proxy` subtab of the `Details` tab."
msgstr "Di {webui}, halaman proxy menampilkan informasi tentang klien.  Anda dapat melihat daftar klien yang terhubung ke proxy dengan mengeklik nama proxy di menu:Systems[System List > Proxy], lalu memilih subtab `Proxy` pada tab `Details`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy.adoc:5
msgid "A list of chained proxies for a client can be seen by clicking the name of the client in menu:Systems[All], then select the `Connection` subtab of the `Details` tab."
msgstr "Daftar proxy berantai untuk suatu klien dapat dilihat dengan mengeklik nama klien di menu:Systems[All], lalu memilih subtab `Connection` pada tab `Details`."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Move Clients Between Proxies"
msgstr "Memindahkan Klien Antarproxy"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy.adoc:7
msgid "You can move clients ({salt}) and {salt} SSH push clients between proxies without the need to repeat the registration process."
msgstr "Anda dapat memindahkan klien ({salt}) dan klien push SSH {salt} antarproxy tanpa perlu mengulangi proses pendaftaran."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy.adoc:8
msgid "You cannot move chained proxies.  Instead of moving a chained proxy, create a new proxy, move the clients, and delete the old proxy."
msgstr "Anda tidak dapat memindahkan proxy berantai.  Alih-alih memindahkan proxy berantai, buat proxy baru, pindahkan klien, lalu hapus proxy lama."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Moving Clients or {salt} SSH Push Client Between Proxies"
msgstr "Prosedur: Memindahkan Klien atau Klien Push SSH {salt} Antarproxy"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy.adoc:10
msgid "In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to the `System Details` page for the client you want to move between proxies."
msgstr "Di {webui} {productname}, buka halaman `System Details` untuk klien yang ingin Anda pindahkan antarproxy."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy.adoc:11
msgid "Navigate to the `Connection` tab.  Then follow the `Change proxy` link to see the drop-down menu."
msgstr "Buka tab `Connection`.  Lalu ikuti tautan `Change proxy` untuk melihat menu tarik-turun."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy.adoc:12
msgid "From the `New Proxy` drop-down menu select the proxy you want the client to move to, and click btn:[Change Proxy]."
msgstr "Dari menu tarik-turun `New Proxy`, pilih proxy tujuan pemindahan klien, lalu klik btn:[Change Proxy]."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Moving Multiple Clients or {salt} SSH Push Clients Between Proxies with SSM"
msgstr "Prosedur: Memindahkan Beberapa Klien atau Klien Push SSH {salt} Antarproxy dengan SSM"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy.adoc:14
msgid "In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Systems[System List] and check each client to move, this adds the clients to the system set manager."
msgstr "Di {webui} {productname}, buka menu:Systems[System List], lalu centang setiap klien yang akan dipindahkan. Tindakan ini menambahkan klien ke System Set Manager."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy.adoc:15
msgid "Navigate to menu:Systems[System Set Manager], and go to the menu:Misc[Proxy] tab."
msgstr "Buka menu:Systems[System Set Manager], lalu buka tab menu:Misc[Proxy]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy.adoc:16
msgid "From the `New Proxy` drop-down menu select the proxy you want the clients to move to, and click btn:[Change Proxy]."
msgstr "Dari menu tarik-turun `New Proxy`, pilih proxy tujuan pemindahan klien, lalu klik btn:[Change Proxy]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy.adoc:17
msgid "The same functionality is also available with the `system.changeProxy` API call."
msgstr "Fungsi yang sama juga tersedia melalui panggilan API `system.changeProxy`."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy.adoc:18
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-slemicro.adoc:39
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-slmicro.adoc:40
#, no-wrap
msgid "Background Information"
msgstr "Informasi Latar Belakang"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy.adoc:19
msgid "The effect of this function differs between normal Salt clients and Salt SSH push clients."
msgstr "Efek fungsi ini berbeda antara klien Salt biasa dan klien push SSH Salt."

#. type: Title ====
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy.adoc:20
#, no-wrap
msgid "Default Clients"
msgstr "Klien Default"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy.adoc:21
msgid "The function schedules a {salt} state action, which modifies `master:` setting in the `susemanager.conf` {salt} client configuration file to point to the new proxy.  Then the function restarts the {salt} client."
msgstr "Fungsi ini menjadwalkan tindakan state {salt}, yang mengubah pengaturan `master:` dalam berkas konfigurasi klien {salt} `susemanager.conf` agar mengarah ke proxy baru.  Kemudian fungsi ini memulai ulang klien {salt}."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy.adoc:22
msgid "Changing `master:` by manually editing the `susemanager.conf` file has the same effect and is supported, too."
msgstr "Mengubah `master:` dengan mengedit berkas `susemanager.conf` secara manual memberikan efek yang sama dan juga didukung."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy.adoc:23
msgid "When the client restarts and reconnects via the new proxy, the server updates the proxy path in the database and schedules another action for refreshing the channel URLs."
msgstr "Saat klien dimulai ulang dan terhubung kembali melalui proxy baru, server memperbarui jalur proxy dalam basis data dan menjadwalkan tindakan lain untuk memperbarui URL saluran."

#. type: Title ====
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy.adoc:24
#, no-wrap
msgid "{salt} SSH Push Clients"
msgstr "Klien Push SSH {salt}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy.adoc:25
msgid "The function updates the proxy path immediately in the database and new action for refreshing the channel URLs is scheduled."
msgstr "Fungsi ini langsung memperbarui jalur proxy dalam basis data dan menjadwalkan tindakan baru untuk memperbarui URL saluran."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy.adoc:26
#, no-wrap
msgid "Move Clients from Proxies to the Server"
msgstr "Memindahkan Klien dari Proxy ke Server"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy.adoc:27
msgid "If you want to move a client from a proxy to the server, select `None` from proxy list."
msgstr "Jika Anda ingin memindahkan klien dari proxy ke server, pilih `None` dari daftar proxy."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Upgrade Using the Content Lifecycle Manager"
msgstr "Meningkatkan Versi Menggunakan Content Lifecycle Manager"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc:2
msgid "When you have many {sles} clients to manage, you can automate in-place upgrades using the content lifecycle manager."
msgstr "Jika Anda mengelola banyak klien {sles}, Anda dapat mengotomatiskan peningkatan versi di tempat menggunakan Content Lifecycle Manager."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc:3
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-uyuni.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prepare to Upgrade"
msgstr "Persiapan Peningkatan Versi"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc:4
msgid "Before you can upgrade your clients, you need to make these preparations:"
msgstr "Sebelum dapat meningkatkan versi klien, Anda perlu melakukan persiapan berikut:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc:5
msgid "Create a content lifecycle project"
msgstr "Membuat proyek siklus hidup konten"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc:6
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:9
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:29
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-almalinux.adoc:26
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rocky.adoc:25
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create an activation key"
msgstr "Membuat kunci aktivasi"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc:7
msgid "Create an autoinstallable distribution"
msgstr "Membuat distribusi yang dapat diinstal secara otomatis"

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc:8
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:10
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:31
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create an autoinstallation profile"
msgstr "Membuat profil instalasi otomatis"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating a Content Lifecycle Project"
msgstr "Prosedur: Membuat Proyek Siklus Hidup Konten"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc:10
msgid "Create a content lifecycle project for your distribution."
msgstr "Buat proyek siklus hidup konten untuk distribusi Anda."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc:11
msgid "For more information, see xref:administration:content-lifecycle.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya, lihat xref:administration:content-lifecycle.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc:12
msgid "Ensure you a choose a short but descriptive name for your project."
msgstr "Pastikan Anda memilih nama proyek yang singkat tetapi deskriptif."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc:13
msgid "Include all source channel modules that you require for your distribution."
msgstr "Sertakan semua modul saluran sumber yang diperlukan untuk distribusi Anda."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc:14
msgid "Add filters as required, and set up at least one environment."
msgstr "Tambahkan filter sesuai kebutuhan, lalu siapkan setidaknya satu lingkungan."

#.  This snippet is reusable across multiple guides.
#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc:15
#: en/modules/client-configuration/partials/snippet-creating-activation-key.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating an Activation Key"
msgstr "Prosedur: Membuat Kunci Aktivasi"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc:16
msgid "Create an activation key for your distribution."
msgstr "Buat kunci aktivasi untuk distribusi Anda."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc:17
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-webui.adoc:20
msgid "For more information, see xref:client-configuration:activation-keys.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi lebih lanjut, lihat xref:client-configuration:activation-keys.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc:18
msgid "Ensure your activation key includes all filtered project channels."
msgstr "Pastikan kunci aktivasi Anda mencakup semua saluran proyek yang telah difilter."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc:19
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating an Autoinstallable Distribution"
msgstr "Prosedur: Membuat Distribusi yang Dapat Diinstal Secara Otomatis"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc:20
msgid "Create an autoinstallable distribution for every base channel you want to migrate."
msgstr "Buat distribusi yang dapat diinstal secara otomatis untuk setiap saluran dasar yang ingin Anda migrasikan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc:21
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:18
msgid "For more information, see xref:client-configuration:autoinst-distributions.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya, lihat xref:client-configuration:autoinst-distributions.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc:22
msgid "Give your distribution a label that references the name of the content lifecycle project."
msgstr "Beri distribusi Anda label yang merujuk pada nama proyek siklus hidup konten."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc:23
msgid "In the `Installer Generation` field, select the SLES version you are using."
msgstr "Di kolom `Installer Generation`, pilih versi SLES yang Anda gunakan."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc:24
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:34
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating an Autoinstallation Profile"
msgstr "Prosedur: Membuat Profil Instalasi Otomatis"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc:25
msgid "Create an autoinstallation profile for every target distribution and service pack you want to upgrade to."
msgstr "Buat profil instalasi otomatis untuk setiap distribusi dan service pack tujuan peningkatan versi."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc:26
msgid "For more information, see xref:client-configuration:autoinst-profiles.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya, lihat xref:client-configuration:autoinst-profiles.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc:27
msgid "You can use variables in the profile to distinguish between the different lifecycle environments."
msgstr "Anda dapat menggunakan variabel dalam profil untuk membedakan berbagai lingkungan siklus hidup."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc:28
msgid "For example autoinstallation profiles, see https://github.com/SUSE/manager-build-profiles/tree/master/AutoYaST."
msgstr "Untuk contoh profil instalasi otomatis, lihat https://github.com/SUSE/manager-build-profiles/tree/master/AutoYaST."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc:29
msgid "Use these variables in your autointallation profiles for automating in-place upgrades:"
msgstr "Gunakan variabel berikut dalam profil instalasi otomatis Anda untuk mengotomatiskan peningkatan versi di tempat:"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc:30
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example: Variables for Use in Autoinstallation Profiles"
msgstr "Contoh: Variabel untuk Digunakan dalam Profil Instalasi Otomatis"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc:31
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"registration_key=1-15sp1-demo-test\n"
"org=1\n"
"channel_prefix=15sp1-demo-test\n"
"distro_label=15sp1-demo-test\n"
msgstr ""
"registration_key=1-15sp1-demo-test\n"
"org=1\n"
"channel_prefix=15sp1-demo-test\n"
"distro_label=15sp1-demo-test\n"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc:32
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example: Entry for Use in Autoinstallation Profiles"
msgstr "Contoh: Entri untuk Digunakan dalam Profil Instalasi Otomatis"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc:33
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" <listentry>\n"
"     <ask_on_error config:type=\"boolean\">true</ask_on_error>\n"
"     <media_url>https://$redhat_management_server/ks/dist/child/$channel_prefix-sle-module-web-scripting15-sp1-pool-x86_64/$distro_label</media_url>\n"
"     <name>$channel_prefix SLE-Module-Web-Scripting15-SP1 Pool for x86_64 </name>\n"
"     <product>Web Scripting Module 15 SP1 x86_64 Pool</product>\n"
"</listentry>\n"
msgstr ""
" <listentry>\n"
"     <ask_on_error config:type=\"boolean\">true</ask_on_error>\n"
"     <media_url>https://$redhat_management_server/ks/dist/child/$channel_prefix-sle-module-web-scripting15-sp1-pool-x86_64/$distro_label</media_url>\n"
"     <name>$channel_prefix SLE-Module-Web-Scripting15-SP1 Pool for x86_64 </name>\n"
"     <product>Web Scripting Module 15 SP1 x86_64 Pool</product>\n"
"</listentry>\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc:34
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-uyuni.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "Upgrade"
msgstr "Peningkatan Versi"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc:35
msgid "When you have prepared the server for the upgrade, you can provision the clients."
msgstr "Setelah menyiapkan server untuk peningkatan versi, Anda dapat melakukan provisioning klien."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc:36
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Provisioning the Clients"
msgstr "Prosedur: Melakukan Provisioning Klien"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc:37
msgid "In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Systems[System List], and select the clients you want to provision to add them to the system set manager."
msgstr "Di {webui} {productname}, buka menu:Systems[System List], lalu pilih klien yang ingin Anda provisioning untuk menambahkannya ke System Set Manager."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc:38
msgid "Navigate to menu:Systems[System Set Manager > Overview] and click the `Provisioning` tab."
msgstr "Buka menu:Systems[System Set Manager > Overview], lalu klik tab `Provisioning`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc:39
msgid "Select the autoinstallation profile to use."
msgstr "Pilih profil instalasi otomatis yang akan digunakan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc:40
msgid "For clients that are able to use PXE, the migration is automated as soon as you have provisioned them.  For all other clients, you can use {cobbler} to perform the upgrade."
msgstr "Untuk klien yang dapat menggunakan PXE, migrasi berjalan secara otomatis segera setelah Anda melakukan provisioning.  Untuk semua klien lainnya, Anda dapat menggunakan {cobbler} untuk melakukan peningkatan versi."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc:41
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Using {cobbler} to Upgrade Clients"
msgstr "Prosedur: Menggunakan {cobbler} untuk Meningkatkan Versi Klien"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc:42
msgid "At the command prompt, as root, to get to a shell inside the container, run:"
msgstr "Pada prompt perintah, sebagai root, jalankan perintah berikut untuk mengakses shell di dalam kontainer:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc:44
msgid "Check the available {cobbler} profiles:"
msgstr "Periksa profil {cobbler} yang tersedia:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc:45
#, no-wrap
msgid "cobbler profile list\n"
msgstr "cobbler profile list\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc:46
msgid "Build the ISO file with your chosen profile and distribution:"
msgstr "Buat berkas ISO dengan profil dan distribusi yang Anda pilih:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc:47
#, no-wrap
msgid "cobbler buildiso --iso=/tmp/SLE_15-sp1.iso --profiles=SLE_15-sp1:1:Example --distro=SLE_15-sp1\n"
msgstr "cobbler buildiso --iso=/tmp/SLE_15-sp1.iso --profiles=SLE_15-sp1:1:Example --distro=SLE_15-sp1\n"

#.  FIXME: 2024-05-06, ke: Do we want to use /tmp here within the container?
#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc:48
msgid "For more information about using CD-ROMs to provision clients, see xref:client-configuration:autoinst-cdrom.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang penggunaan CD-ROM untuk melakukan provisioning klien, lihat xref:client-configuration:autoinst-cdrom.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Major Version Upgrade"
msgstr "Peningkatan Versi Mayor"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:2
msgid "This method covers major version upgrades such as {sles}{nbsp}12 to {sles}{nbsp}15.  The upgrade is controlled by {yast} and {ay}, it does not use Zypper."
msgstr "Metode ini mencakup peningkatan versi mayor seperti dari {sles}{nbsp}12 ke {sles}{nbsp}15.  Peningkatan versi dikendalikan oleh {yast} dan {ay}, bukan menggunakan Zypper."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:3
msgid "The clients must have the latest available service pack (SP) for the installed operating system, with all the latest updates applied.  Before you start, ensure that the system is up to date and all updates have been installed successfully."
msgstr "Klien harus menggunakan service pack (SP) terbaru yang tersedia untuk sistem operasi yang terinstal, dengan semua pembaruan terbaru telah diterapkan.  Sebelum memulai, pastikan sistem sudah mutakhir dan semua pembaruan telah berhasil diinstal."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:4
msgid "This method does not apply to the upgrade from {sles}{nbsp}15 to {sles}{nbsp}16.  To upgrade from {sles}{nbsp}15 to {sles}{nbsp}16, use product migration instead.  For more information, see xref:client-configuration:client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc[]."
msgstr "Metode ini tidak berlaku untuk peningkatan versi dari {sles}{nbsp}15 ke {sles}{nbsp}16.  Untuk meningkatkan versi dari {sles}{nbsp}15 ke {sles}{nbsp}16, gunakan migrasi produk.  Untuk informasi selengkapnya, lihat xref:client-configuration:client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prepare to migrate"
msgstr "Persiapan migrasi"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:6
msgid "Before you can migrate your client from SLE{nbsp}12 to SLE{nbsp}15, you need to:"
msgstr "Sebelum dapat memigrasikan klien dari SLE{nbsp}12 ke SLE{nbsp}15, Anda perlu:"

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:7
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prepare installation media"
msgstr "Menyiapkan media instalasi"

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:8
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:19
#, no-wrap
msgid "Declare an autoinstallation distribution"
msgstr "Mendeklarasikan distribusi instalasi otomatis"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Preparing Installation Media"
msgstr "Prosedur: Menyiapkan Media Instalasi"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:13
msgid "On the container host, download an ISO image with the installation sources."
msgstr "Pada host kontainer, unduh image ISO yang berisi sumber instalasi."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:14
msgid "Use `mgradm` to import the installation data from the ISO image:"
msgstr "Gunakan `mgradm` untuk mengimpor data instalasi dari image ISO:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgradm distribution copy <image_name>.iso <image_name>\n"
msgstr "mgradm distribution copy <image_name>.iso <image_name>\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:17
msgid "This image can be used for multiple autoinstallation distributions."
msgstr "Image ini dapat digunakan untuk beberapa distribusi instalasi otomatis."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:20
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Declaring an Autoinstallation Distribution"
msgstr "Prosedur: Mendeklarasikan Distribusi Instalasi Otomatis"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:22
msgid "Click `Create Distribution` , and complete these fields:"
msgstr "Klik `Create Distribution` , lalu lengkapi kolom berikut:"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:23
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"In the `Distribution Label` field, enter a name to identify your autoinstallation distribution.\n"
"  For example, `sles15sp6-x86_64`.\n"
msgstr ""
"Di kolom `Distribution Label`, masukkan nama untuk mengidentifikasi distribusi instalasi otomatis Anda.\n"
"  Misalnya, `sles15sp6-x86_64`.\n"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:24
#, no-wrap
msgid "In the `Tree Path` field, enter the path to the installation media you already saved.\n"
msgstr "Di kolom `Tree Path`, masukkan jalur ke media instalasi yang telah Anda simpan.\n"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:25
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Select the matching `Base Channel`.\n"
"This must match the installation media.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pilih `Base Channel` yang sesuai.\n"
"Saluran ini harus sesuai dengan media instalasi.\n"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:26
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Select the `Installer Generation`.\n"
"This must match the installation media.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pilih `Installer Generation`.\n"
"Pilihan ini harus sesuai dengan media instalasi.\n"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:27
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"OPTIONAL: Specify kernel options to use when booting this distribution.\n"
"There are multiple ways to provide kernel options.\n"
"Only add options here that are generic for the distribution.\n"
msgstr ""
"OPSIONAL: Tentukan opsi kernel yang akan digunakan saat melakukan boot distribusi ini.\n"
"Ada beberapa cara untuk menentukan opsi kernel.\n"
"Tambahkan hanya opsi yang berlaku umum untuk distribusi ini di sini.\n"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:28
#, no-wrap
msgid "Click btn:[Create Autoinstallable Distribution].\n"
msgstr "Klik btn:[Create Autoinstallable Distribution].\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:30
msgid "For example, to switch from the old SLE{nbsp}12 base channel to the new SLE{nbsp}15 channel, you need an activation key."
msgstr "Misalnya, untuk beralih dari saluran dasar SLE{nbsp}12 yang lama ke saluran SLE{nbsp}15 yang baru, Anda memerlukan kunci aktivasi."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:32
msgid "Autoinstallation profiles contain all the installation and configuration data needed to install a system.  They can also contain scripts to be executed after the installation is complete.  For example scripts that you can use as a starting point, see https://github.com/SUSE/manager-build-profiles/tree/master/AutoYaST."
msgstr "Profil instalasi otomatis berisi semua data instalasi dan konfigurasi yang diperlukan untuk menginstal sistem.  Profil ini juga dapat berisi skrip yang akan dijalankan setelah instalasi selesai.  Untuk contoh skrip yang dapat Anda gunakan sebagai titik awal, lihat https://github.com/SUSE/manager-build-profiles/tree/master/AutoYaST."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:33
msgid "For valid {ay} upgrade settings, see https://doc.opensuse.org/projects/autoyast/#CreateProfile-upgrade."
msgstr "Untuk pengaturan peningkatan versi {ay} yang valid, lihat https://doc.opensuse.org/projects/autoyast/#CreateProfile-upgrade."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:35
msgid "In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Systems[Autoinstallation > Profiles] and upload your autoinstallation profile script."
msgstr "Di {webui} {productname}, buka menu:Systems[Autoinstallation > Profiles], lalu unggah skrip profil instalasi otomatis Anda."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:36
msgid "For example scripts that you can use as a starting point, see:"
msgstr "Untuk contoh skrip yang dapat Anda gunakan sebagai titik awal, lihat:"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:37
msgid "https://github.com/SUSE/manager-build-profiles/tree/master/AutoYaST."
msgstr "https://github.com/SUSE/manager-build-profiles/tree/master/AutoYaST."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:38
msgid "In the `Kernel Options` field, type `autoupgrade=1`."
msgstr "Di kolom `Kernel Options`, ketik `autoupgrade=1`."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:39
msgid "Optionally, you can also include the `Y2DEBUG=1` option.  The debug setting is not required but can help with investigating any future problems you might encounter."
msgstr "Secara opsional, Anda juga dapat menyertakan opsi `Y2DEBUG=1`.  Pengaturan debug tidak wajib, tetapi dapat membantu menyelidiki masalah yang mungkin Anda temui di kemudian hari."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:40
msgid "Clients running in Azure cloud must add `textmode=1 console=ttyS0` to `Kernel Options`."
msgstr "Klien yang berjalan di cloud Azure harus menambahkan `textmode=1 console=ttyS0` ke `Kernel Options`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:41
msgid "Paste the autoinstallation profile or use the file upload field."
msgstr "Tempelkan profil instalasi otomatis atau gunakan kolom unggah berkas."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:42
msgid "Click btn:[Create] to save."
msgstr "Klik btn:[Create] untuk menyimpan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:43
msgid "When the uploaded profile requires variables to be set, navigate to menu:Systems[Autoinstallation > Profiles], select the profile to edit, and navigate to the `Variables` tab."
msgstr "Jika profil yang diunggah memerlukan penetapan variabel, buka menu:Systems[Autoinstallation > Profiles], pilih profil yang akan diedit, lalu buka tab `Variables`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:44
msgid "Specify the required variables, using this format:"
msgstr "Tentukan variabel yang diperlukan menggunakan format berikut:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:45
#, no-wrap
msgid "<key>=<value>\n"
msgstr "<key>=<value>\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:46
#, no-wrap
msgid "Migration"
msgstr "Migrasi"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:47
msgid "Before you begin, check that all the channels referenced in the autoinstallation profile are available and fully synchronized."
msgstr "Sebelum memulai, pastikan semua saluran yang dirujuk dalam profil instalasi otomatis tersedia dan telah disinkronkan sepenuhnya."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:48
msgid "You can monitor the mirroring progress in `/var/log/rhn/reposync/<channel-label>.log`."
msgstr "Anda dapat memantau progres pencerminan di `/var/log/rhn/reposync/<channel-label>.log`."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:49
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Migrating"
msgstr "Prosedur: Melakukan Migrasi"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:50
msgid "In the {productname} Server {webui}, navigate to `Systems` and select the client to be upgraded."
msgstr "Di {webui} Server {productname}, buka `Systems`, lalu pilih klien yang akan ditingkatkan versinya."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:51
msgid "Navigate to the `Provisioning` tab, and select the autoinstallation profile you uploaded."
msgstr "Buka tab `Provisioning`, lalu pilih profil instalasi otomatis yang telah Anda unggah."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:52
msgid "Click btn:[Schedule Autoinstallation and Finish].  The system downloads the required files, change the bootloader entries, reboot, and start the upgrade."
msgstr "Klik btn:[Schedule Autoinstallation and Finish].  Sistem mengunduh berkas yang diperlukan, mengubah entri bootloader, melakukan boot ulang, lalu memulai peningkatan versi."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:53
msgid "Next time the client synchronizes with the {productname} Server, it receives a re-installation job.  The re-installation job fetches the new kernel and initrd packages.  It also writes a new `/boot/grub/menu.lst` (GRUB Legacy) or `/boot/grub2/grub.cfg` (GRUB 2), containing pointers to the new kernel and initrd packages."
msgstr "Saat klien berikutnya melakukan sinkronisasi dengan Server {productname}, klien menerima tugas instalasi ulang.  Tugas instalasi ulang tersebut mengambil paket kernel dan initrd baru.  Tugas ini juga menulis `/boot/grub/menu.lst` (GRUB Legacy) atau `/boot/grub2/grub.cfg` (GRUB 2) baru, yang berisi rujukan ke paket kernel dan initrd baru."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:54
msgid "When the client next boots, it uses grub to boot the new kernel with its initrd.  PXE booting is not used during this process."
msgstr "Saat klien melakukan boot berikutnya, klien menggunakan grub untuk melakukan boot kernel baru beserta initrd-nya.  Boot PXE tidak digunakan selama proses ini."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:55
msgid "Approximately three minutes after the job was fetched, the client goes down for reboot."
msgstr "Sekitar tiga menit setelah tugas diambil, klien berhenti beroperasi untuk melakukan boot ulang."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:56
msgid "For clients, use the `spacewalk/minion_script` snippet to register the client again after migration has completed."
msgstr "Untuk klien, gunakan cuplikan `spacewalk/minion_script` untuk mendaftarkan kembali klien setelah migrasi selesai."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Product Migration"
msgstr "Migrasi Produk"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:2
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/power-management.adoc:2
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-bootstrap.adoc:2
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-cli.adoc:2
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-webui.adoc:2
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/system-set-manager.adoc:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "Pendahuluan"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:3
msgid "Product migration lets you upgrade SLE-based client systems to a newer supported product version directly from the {webui}.  This includes upgrading to a later Service Pack (SP) or minor version within the same major version, for example {sles}{nbsp}15{nbsp}SP5 to {sles}{nbsp}15{nbsp}SP6 or {sles}{nbsp}16.0 to {sles}{nbsp}16.1, as well as the major version upgrade from {sles}{nbsp}15 to {sles}{nbsp}16."
msgstr "Migrasi produk memungkinkan Anda meningkatkan versi sistem klien berbasis SLE ke versi produk lebih baru yang didukung langsung dari {webui}.  Ini mencakup peningkatan ke Service Pack (SP) atau versi minor yang lebih baru dalam versi mayor yang sama, misalnya dari {sles}{nbsp}15{nbsp}SP5 ke {sles}{nbsp}15{nbsp}SP6 atau dari {sles}{nbsp}16.0 ke {sles}{nbsp}16.1, serta peningkatan versi mayor dari {sles}{nbsp}15 ke {sles}{nbsp}16."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:4
msgid "You can also use it to upgrade clients such as {rhel} or {centos} to {sll}."
msgstr "Anda juga dapat menggunakannya untuk meningkatkan klien seperti {rhel} atau {centos} ke {sll}."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:5
msgid "Product migration requires that all repositories which are enabled on the client and which should be migrated must be valid, otherwise the migration will abort."
msgstr "Migrasi produk mengharuskan semua repositori yang diaktifkan pada klien dan akan dimigrasikan dalam kondisi valid. Jika tidak, migrasi akan dibatalkan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:6
msgid "{productname} supports the following migration paths using the product migration feature:"
msgstr "{productname} mendukung jalur migrasi berikut menggunakan fitur migrasi produk:"

#. type: Table
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Migration path | Example\n"
"\n"
"| Service Pack (SP) or minor version upgrade within the same major version\n"
"| {sles}{nbsp}15{nbsp}SP5 to {sles}{nbsp}15{nbsp}SP6, or {sles}{nbsp}16.0 to {sles}{nbsp}16.1\n"
"\n"
"| {leap} to a later minor version\n"
"| {leap}{nbsp}16.0 to {leap}{nbsp}16.1\n"
"\n"
"| {leap} to the corresponding {sles} version\n"
"| {leap}{nbsp}16.1 to {sles}{nbsp}16.1\n"
"\n"
"| {sles} to the corresponding {slesforsap} version\n"
"| {sles}{nbsp}15{nbsp}SP5 to {slesforsap}{nbsp}15{nbsp}SP5\n"
"\n"
"| Major version upgrade to {sles}{nbsp}16\n"
"| {sles}{nbsp}15{nbsp}SP7 to {sles}{nbsp}16.0, or {sles}{nbsp}15{nbsp}SP5+ to {sles}{nbsp}16.1\n"
"\n"
"| Major version upgrade to {slesforsap}{nbsp}16\n"
"| {slesforsap}{nbsp}15{nbsp}SP5+ to {slesforsap}{nbsp}16.1\n"
"\n"
"| {sle} Real Time to {sles}\n"
"| {sle}{nbsp}Real Time 15{nbsp}SP7 to {sles}{nbsp}16.1\n"
"\n"
"| {slmicro} to {sles}\n"
"| {slmicro}{nbsp}6.2 to {sles}{nbsp}16.1\n"
"\n"
"| {rhel} or {centos} to {sll}\n"
"| {rhel} to {sll}\n"
msgstr ""
"| Jalur migrasi | Contoh\n"
"\n"
"| Peningkatan Service Pack (SP) atau versi minor dalam versi mayor yang sama\n"
"| {sles}{nbsp}15{nbsp}SP5 ke {sles}{nbsp}15{nbsp}SP6, atau {sles}{nbsp}16.0 ke {sles}{nbsp}16.1\n"
"\n"
"| {leap} ke versi minor yang lebih baru\n"
"| {leap}{nbsp}16.0 ke {leap}{nbsp}16.1\n"
"\n"
"| {leap} ke versi {sles} yang sesuai\n"
"| {leap}{nbsp}16.1 ke {sles}{nbsp}16.1\n"
"\n"
"| {sles} ke versi {slesforsap} yang sesuai\n"
"| {sles}{nbsp}15{nbsp}SP5 ke {slesforsap}{nbsp}15{nbsp}SP5\n"
"\n"
"| Peningkatan versi mayor ke {sles}{nbsp}16\n"
"| {sles}{nbsp}15{nbsp}SP7 ke {sles}{nbsp}16.0, atau {sles}{nbsp}15{nbsp}SP5+ ke {sles}{nbsp}16.1\n"
"\n"
"| Peningkatan versi mayor ke {slesforsap}{nbsp}16\n"
"| {slesforsap}{nbsp}15{nbsp}SP5+ ke {slesforsap}{nbsp}16.1\n"
"\n"
"| {sle} Real Time ke {sles}\n"
"| {sle}{nbsp}Real Time 15{nbsp}SP7 ke {sles}{nbsp}16.1\n"
"\n"
"| {slmicro} ke {sles}\n"
"| {slmicro}{nbsp}6.2 ke {sles}{nbsp}16.1\n"
"\n"
"| {rhel} atau {centos} ke {sll}\n"
"| {rhel} ke {sll}\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:8
msgid "You cannot use product migration to migrate from {sles}{nbsp}12 to {sles}{nbsp}15.  To upgrade from {sles}{nbsp}12 to {sles}{nbsp}15, see xref:client-configuration:client-upgrades-major.adoc[]."
msgstr "Anda tidak dapat menggunakan migrasi produk untuk bermigrasi dari {sles}{nbsp}12 ke {sles}{nbsp}15.  Untuk meningkatkan versi dari {sles}{nbsp}12 ke {sles}{nbsp}15, lihat xref:client-configuration:client-upgrades-major.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "Major version upgrade to {sles}{nbsp}16"
msgstr "Peningkatan versi mayor ke {sles}{nbsp}16"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:10
msgid "The following applies specifically to the major version upgrade from {sles}{nbsp}15 to {sles}{nbsp}16."
msgstr "Ketentuan berikut berlaku khusus untuk peningkatan versi mayor dari {sles}{nbsp}15 ke {sles}{nbsp}16."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:11
msgid "The upgrade to {sles}{nbsp}16.0 is supported from {sles}{nbsp}15{nbsp}SP7 only."
msgstr "Peningkatan versi ke {sles}{nbsp}16.0 hanya didukung dari {sles}{nbsp}15{nbsp}SP7."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:12
msgid "The upgrade to {sles}{nbsp}16.1 is supported from {sles}{nbsp}15{nbsp}SP5, {sles}{nbsp}15{nbsp}SP6, and {sles}{nbsp}15{nbsp}SP7, as well as from {sles}{nbsp}16.0."
msgstr "Peningkatan versi ke {sles}{nbsp}16.1 didukung dari {sles}{nbsp}15{nbsp}SP5, {sles}{nbsp}15{nbsp}SP6, dan {sles}{nbsp}15{nbsp}SP7, serta dari {sles}{nbsp}16.0."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:13
msgid "The upgrade to {slesforsap}{nbsp}16.1 is supported from {slesforsap}{nbsp}15{nbsp}SP5, {slesforsap}{nbsp}15{nbsp}SP6, and {slesforsap}{nbsp}15{nbsp}SP7."
msgstr "Peningkatan versi ke {slesforsap}{nbsp}16.1 didukung dari {slesforsap}{nbsp}15{nbsp}SP5, {slesforsap}{nbsp}15{nbsp}SP6, dan {slesforsap}{nbsp}15{nbsp}SP7."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:14
msgid "The upgrade from {sle}{nbsp}Real Time 15{nbsp}SP7 to {sles}{nbsp}16.1 is also supported.  Bring the client up to the latest updates before you migrate."
msgstr "Peningkatan versi dari {sle}{nbsp}Real Time 15{nbsp}SP7 ke {sles}{nbsp}16.1 juga didukung.  Terapkan pembaruan terbaru pada klien sebelum melakukan migrasi."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:15
msgid "The migration from {sles}{nbsp}15 to {sles}{nbsp}16 is currently supported for regular (Salt) minions only.  Clients managed with Salt SSH cannot yet be migrated."
msgstr "Migrasi dari {sles}{nbsp}15 ke {sles}{nbsp}16 saat ini hanya didukung untuk minion reguler (Salt).  Klien yang dikelola menggunakan Salt SSH belum dapat dimigrasikan."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:16
msgid "The dry run option is not available when migrating from {sles}{nbsp}15 to {sles}{nbsp}16."
msgstr "Opsi uji coba tidak tersedia saat bermigrasi dari {sles}{nbsp}15 ke {sles}{nbsp}16."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:17
msgid "The migration from {sles}{nbsp}15 to {sles}{nbsp}16 happens in two steps:"
msgstr "Migrasi dari {sles}{nbsp}15 ke {sles}{nbsp}16 berlangsung dalam dua langkah:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:18
msgid "The migration action performs the actual product migration on the client using the Distribution Migration System (DMS)."
msgstr "Tindakan migrasi menjalankan migrasi produk yang sebenarnya pada klien menggunakan Distribution Migration System (DMS)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:19
msgid "Once the migration action has finished, whether it passed or failed, the system is rebooted automatically.  After the reboot, when the Salt minion connects to the {productname} Server again, the verification step starts automatically."
msgstr "Setelah tindakan migrasi selesai, baik berhasil maupun gagal, sistem melakukan boot ulang secara otomatis.  Setelah boot ulang, saat minion Salt kembali terhubung ke Server {productname}, langkah verifikasi dimulai secara otomatis."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:20
msgid "To perform this upgrade, use the standard product migration procedures described in this page: the <<single-system-migration>> procedure for a single client, or the <<product-mass-migration>> procedure for many clients at once."
msgstr "Untuk melakukan peningkatan versi ini, gunakan prosedur migrasi produk standar yang dijelaskan di halaman ini: prosedur <<single-system-migration>> untuk satu klien, atau prosedur <<product-mass-migration>> untuk banyak klien sekaligus."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:21
msgid "In {sles}{nbsp}12 and later, {suse} supports service pack skipping if {scclongform} provides it.  For example, you can upgrade from {sles}{nbsp}15 to SP2, without installing SP1."
msgstr "Pada {sles}{nbsp}12 dan versi yang lebih baru, {suse} mendukung pelompatan service pack jika tersedia melalui {scclongform}.  Misalnya, Anda dapat meningkatkan versi dari {sles}{nbsp}15 ke SP2 tanpa menginstal SP1."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:22
msgid "For supported {sles} upgrade paths, see link:https://documentation.suse.com/en-us/sles/15-SP6/html/SLES-all/cha-upgrade-paths.html#sec-upgrade-paths-supported[]."
msgstr "Untuk jalur peningkatan versi {sles} yang didukung, lihat link:https://documentation.suse.com/en-us/sles/15-SP6/html/SLES-all/cha-upgrade-paths.html#sec-upgrade-paths-supported[]."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:23
msgid "All recommended extensions are automatically enabled when you migrate."
msgstr "Semua ekstensi yang direkomendasikan diaktifkan secara otomatis saat Anda melakukan migrasi."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:24
msgid "During migration, {productname} automatically accepts any required licenses (EULAs) before installation."
msgstr "Selama migrasi, {productname} secara otomatis menerima semua lisensi yang diperlukan (EULA) sebelum instalasi."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:25
#, no-wrap
msgid "Single system migration"
msgstr "Migrasi satu sistem"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:26
msgid "Before starting the product migration:"
msgstr "Sebelum memulai migrasi produk:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:27
msgid "Ensure there are no pending updates or patches.  Check the `System Status` on the client system's menu:Details[Overview] page, and install all offered updates or patches.  If your client system is not up to date, product migration may fail."
msgstr "Pastikan tidak ada pembaruan atau patch yang tertunda.  Periksa `System Status` pada halaman menu:Details[Overview] sistem klien, lalu instal semua pembaruan atau patch yang tersedia.  Jika sistem klien Anda tidak mutakhir, migrasi produk dapat gagal."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:28
msgid "Make sure all the channels of the target product are fully synchronized.  To check the synchronization status in the {webui}, navigate to the menu:Admin[Setup Wizard > Products] page."
msgstr "Pastikan semua saluran produk tujuan telah disinkronkan sepenuhnya.  Untuk memeriksa status sinkronisasi di {webui}, buka halaman menu:Admin[Setup Wizard > Products]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:29
msgid "Ensure you have a working system backup available, in case of an emergency.  Product migration does not have a rollback feature.  When the migration procedure has begun, rolling back is not possible."
msgstr "Pastikan Anda memiliki cadangan sistem yang dapat digunakan untuk keadaan darurat.  Migrasi produk tidak memiliki fitur rollback.  Setelah prosedur migrasi dimulai, rollback tidak dapat dilakukan."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:30
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Performing a Single System Migration"
msgstr "Prosedur: Melakukan Migrasi Satu Sistem"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:31
msgid "From the menu:Systems[Overview] page, select a client."
msgstr "Dari halaman menu:Systems[Overview], pilih klien."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:32
msgid "From the system details page of the client, navigate to the menu:Software[Product Migration] tab."
msgstr "Dari halaman detail sistem klien, buka tab menu:Software[Product Migration]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:33
msgid "Select the target migration path and click btn:[Select Channels]."
msgstr "Pilih jalur migrasi tujuan, lalu klik btn:[Select Channels]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:34
msgid "From the `Product Migration - Channels` page select the correct base channel, including `Mandatory Child Channels` and any additional `Optional Child Channels`."
msgstr "Dari halaman `Product Migration - Channels`, pilih saluran dasar yang sesuai, termasuk `Mandatory Child Channels` dan `Optional Child Channels` tambahan yang diperlukan."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:35
msgid "OPTIONAL: Check `Allow Vendor Change` to allow packages that have changed vendors to be installed.  If this occurs, a notification is shown with details before the migration is started."
msgstr "OPSIONAL: Centang `Allow Vendor Change` untuk mengizinkan instalasi paket yang vendornya telah berubah.  Jika hal ini terjadi, pemberitahuan beserta detailnya ditampilkan sebelum migrasi dimulai."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:36
msgid "To migrate openSUSE Leap to {sles}, you must check the `Allow Vendor Change` option."
msgstr "Untuk memigrasikan openSUSE Leap ke {sles}, Anda harus mencentang opsi `Allow Vendor Change`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:37
msgid "Click btn:[Schedule Migration] when your channels have been configured properly."
msgstr "Klik btn:[Schedule Migration] setelah saluran Anda dikonfigurasi dengan benar."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:38
#, no-wrap
msgid "Product mass migration"
msgstr "Migrasi produk massal"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:39
msgid "If you want to migrate a large number of clients to the next SP version, you can use {productname} API calls or System Set Manager (SSM)."
msgstr "Jika Anda ingin memigrasikan banyak klien ke versi SP berikutnya, Anda dapat menggunakan panggilan API {productname} atau System Set Manager (SSM)."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:40
msgid "The `spacecmd` commandline tool provides a `system_scheduleproductmigration` sub command, which can be used to schedule a migration for a large number of clients to the next minor version."
msgstr "Alat baris perintah `spacecmd` menyediakan subperintah `system_scheduleproductmigration`, yang dapat digunakan untuk menjadwalkan migrasi banyak klien ke versi minor berikutnya."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:41
#, no-wrap
msgid "Perform a product mass migration using System Set Manager (SSM)"
msgstr "Melakukan migrasi produk massal menggunakan System Set Manager (SSM)"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:42
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Performing a Product Mass Migration using System Set Manager (SSM)"
msgstr "Prosedur: Melakukan Migrasi Produk Massal Menggunakan System Set Manager (SSM)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:43
msgid "Add the systems you want to migrate to the System Set Manager (SSM) as described in xref:client-configuration:system-groups.adoc[]."
msgstr "Tambahkan sistem yang ingin Anda migrasikan ke System Set Manager (SSM) sebagaimana dijelaskan dalam xref:client-configuration:system-groups.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:44
msgid "In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Systems[System Set Manager]."
msgstr "Di {webui} {productname}, buka menu:Systems[System Set Manager]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:45
msgid "Navigate to the `Product Migration` tab."
msgstr "Buka tab `Product Migration`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:46
msgid "Choose a target product and then click btn:[Select Channels]."
msgstr "Pilih produk tujuan, lalu klik btn:[Select Channels]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:47
msgid "On the next page, click btn:[Schedule Migration]."
msgstr "Pada halaman berikutnya, klik btn:[Schedule Migration]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:48
msgid "If you want, click btn:[Dry Run] to do a dry run first, and if everything is correct, click btn:[Migrate] to start the migration."
msgstr "Jika diinginkan, klik btn:[Dry Run] untuk melakukan uji coba terlebih dahulu, lalu jika semuanya sudah benar, klik btn:[Migrate] untuk memulai migrasi."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:49
#, no-wrap
msgid "Perform a product mass migration using API calls"
msgstr "Melakukan migrasi produk massal menggunakan panggilan API"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:50
msgid "The product mass migration operation is dangerous and the process should be tested thoroughly.  At least, do a dry-run first."
msgstr "Operasi migrasi produk massal berbahaya dan prosesnya harus diuji secara menyeluruh.  Setidaknya, lakukan uji coba terlebih dahulu."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:51
msgid "Be careful not to upgrade systems unintentionally."
msgstr "Berhati-hatilah agar tidak meningkatkan versi sistem secara tidak sengaja."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:52
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Performing a Product Mass Migration using API calls"
msgstr "Prosedur: Melakukan Migrasi Produk Massal Menggunakan Panggilan API"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:53
msgid "List available migration targets, and take note of the system IDs you want to migrate:"
msgstr "Tampilkan daftar target migrasi yang tersedia, dan catat ID sistem yang ingin Anda migrasikan:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:54
#, no-wrap
msgid "spacecmd api -- system.listMigrationTargets -A 1000010001\n"
msgstr "spacecmd api -- system.listMigrationTargets -A 1000010001\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:55
msgid "For each system ID, call `listMigrationTarget` and check that the desired target product is available."
msgstr "Untuk setiap ID sistem, panggil `listMigrationTarget` dan pastikan produk target yang diinginkan tersedia."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:56
msgid "If the system ID has an available target, call `system.scheduleProductMigration`."
msgstr "Jika ID sistem memiliki target yang tersedia, panggil `system.scheduleProductMigration`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:57
msgid "If the desired target is not available, skip the system."
msgstr "Jika target yang diinginkan tidak tersedia, lewati sistem tersebut."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:58
msgid "Adapt this template for your environment:"
msgstr "Sesuaikan templat ini dengan lingkungan Anda:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:59
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"target = '[....]'\n"
"basechannel = 'channel-label'\n"
"system_ids = [1, 2, 3]\n"
msgstr ""
"target = '[....]'\n"
"basechannel = 'channel-label'\n"
"system_ids =[1][2][3]\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:60
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"session = auth.login(user, pass)\n"
"for system in system_ids\n"
"  if system.listMigrationTargets(session, system).ident == target\n"
"    system.scheduleProductMigration(session, system, target, basechannel, [], False, <now>)\n"
"  else\n"
"    print \"Cannot migrate to requested target -- skipping system\"\n"
"  endif\n"
"endfor\n"
msgstr ""
"session = auth.login(user, pass)\n"
"for system in system_ids\n"
"  if system.listMigrationTargets(session, system).ident == target\n"
"    system.scheduleProductMigration(session, system, target, basechannel, [], False, <now>)\n"
"  else\n"
"    print \"Tidak dapat bermigrasi ke target yang diminta -- melewati sistem\"\n"
"  endif\n"
"endfor\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:61
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example: SLES 15 SP2 to SLES 15 SP3"
msgstr "Contoh: SLES 15 SP2 ke SLES 15 SP3"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:62
msgid "For this example, a group will be created temporarily to facilitate the mass migration."
msgstr "Dalam contoh ini, sebuah grup akan dibuat sementara untuk memudahkan migrasi massal."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:63
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating a Mass Product Migration Group"
msgstr "Prosedur: Membuat Grup Migrasi Produk Massal"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:64
msgid "In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Systems[System Groups], and click btn:[Create Group]."
msgstr "Di {productname} {webui}, buka menu:Systems[System Groups], lalu klik btn:[Create Group]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:65
msgid "Name the group `mpm-target-sles15sp3`."
msgstr "Beri nama grup tersebut `mpm-target-sles15sp3`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:66
msgid "Only systems subscribed to the same base channel should be added to the created group.  In the example, only systems subscribed to `SLE-Product-SLES15-SP2-Pool for x86_64` should be added to the group."
msgstr "Hanya sistem yang berlangganan saluran dasar yang sama yang boleh ditambahkan ke grup yang dibuat.  Dalam contoh ini, hanya sistem yang berlangganan `SLE-Product-SLES15-SP2-Pool for x86_64` yang boleh ditambahkan ke grup."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:67
msgid "For more information about adding clients to groups, see xref:client-configuration:system-groups.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang menambahkan klien ke grup, lihat xref:client-configuration:system-groups.adoc[]."

#. Note or warning about taking normal precautions (backups, make sure fully patched, etc)
#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:68
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Adding Systems to the Group"
msgstr "Prosedur: Menambahkan Sistem ke Grup"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:69
msgid "Get the targets for all the systems in the group by running:"
msgstr "Dapatkan target untuk semua sistem dalam grup dengan menjalankan:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:70
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:95
#, no-wrap
msgid "spacecmd -- system_listmigrationtargets group:mpm-target-sles15sp3\n"
msgstr "spacecmd -- system_listmigrationtargets group:mpm-target-sles15sp3\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:71
msgid "The command output a string of \"IDs.\""
msgstr "Perintah tersebut menghasilkan string berisi \"ID\"."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:72
msgid "Only select a target, which is reported for *all* systems."
msgstr "Pilih hanya target yang dilaporkan untuk *semua* sistem."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:73
msgid "The string is the identifier for the `MIGRATIONTARGET` of the other command."
msgstr "String tersebut merupakan pengenal untuk `MIGRATIONTARGET` pada perintah lainnya."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:74
msgid "The `spacecmd` sub-commands `system_scheduleproductmigration` and `system_listmigrationtargets` are looping over all systems that are part of the group."
msgstr "Subperintah `spacecmd`, yaitu `system_scheduleproductmigration` dan `system_listmigrationtargets`, melakukan perulangan pada semua sistem yang menjadi anggota grup."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:75
msgid "If there are 100 systems in the group, you will see 100 actions scheduled."
msgstr "Jika terdapat 100 sistem dalam grup, Anda akan melihat 100 tindakan terjadwal."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:76
msgid "All systems in the group must support the same migration target."
msgstr "Semua sistem dalam grup harus mendukung target migrasi yang sama."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:77
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Running the Mass Migration Command"
msgstr "Prosedur: Menjalankan Perintah Migrasi Massal"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:78
msgid "The syntax for the `system_scheduleproductmigration` command is as follows:"
msgstr "Sintaks perintah `system_scheduleproductmigration` adalah sebagai berikut:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:79
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"spacecmd -- system_scheduleproductmigration <SYSTEM> <BASE_CHANNEL_LABEL> \\\n"
"    <MIGRATION_TARGET> [options]\n"
msgstr ""
"spacecmd -- system_scheduleproductmigration <SYSTEM> <BASE_CHANNEL_LABEL> \\\n"
"    <MIGRATION_TARGET> [options]\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:80
msgid "For this example to upgrade all systems in the group `mpm-target-sles15sp3` from SLES 12 SP2 to SLES 15 SP, enter on the command line:"
msgstr "Dalam contoh ini, untuk meningkatkan semua sistem dalam grup `mpm-target-sles15sp3` dari SLES 12 SP2 ke SLES 15 SP, masukkan perintah berikut pada baris perintah:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:81
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"spacecmd -- system_scheduleproductmigration group:mpm-target-sles15sp3 \\\n"
"    sle-product-sles15-sp3-pool-x86_64 \"[190,203,195,1242]\" -d\n"
msgstr ""
"spacecmd -- system_scheduleproductmigration group:mpm-target-sles15sp3 \\\n"
"    sle-product-sles15-sp3-pool-x86_64 \"[190,203,195,1242]\" -d\n"

#. type: Title ====
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:82
#, no-wrap
msgid "Mandatory syntax explained"
msgstr "Penjelasan sintaks wajib"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:83
msgid "To see syntax usage and options for `system_scheduleproductmigration`, run:"
msgstr "Untuk melihat penggunaan sintaks dan opsi `system_scheduleproductmigration`, jalankan:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:84
#, no-wrap
msgid "spacecmd system_scheduleproductmigration help\n"
msgstr "spacecmd system_scheduleproductmigration help\n"

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:85
#, no-wrap
msgid "<SYSTEM>"
msgstr "<SYSTEM>"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:86
msgid "For this example we will use the group we created to select all of the systems from that group:"
msgstr "Dalam contoh ini, kita akan menggunakan grup yang telah dibuat untuk memilih semua sistem dalam grup tersebut:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:87
#, no-wrap
msgid "group:mpm-target-sles15sp3\n"
msgstr "group:mpm-target-sles15sp3\n"

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:88
#, no-wrap
msgid "<BASE_CHANNEL_LABEL>"
msgstr "<BASE_CHANNEL_LABEL>"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:89
msgid "This is the label for the target base channel.  In this case, the system is being upgraded to SLES 15 SP3, and the label is `sle-product-sles15-sp3-pool-x86_64`."
msgstr "Ini adalah label saluran dasar target.  Dalam kasus ini, sistem ditingkatkan ke SLES 15 SP3, dan labelnya adalah `sle-product-sles15-sp3-pool-x86_64`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:90
msgid "To see a list of all base channels currently mirrored, run:"
msgstr "Untuk melihat daftar semua saluran dasar yang saat ini dicerminkan, jalankan:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:91
#, no-wrap
msgid "spacecmd softwarechannel_listbasechannels\n"
msgstr "spacecmd softwarechannel_listbasechannels\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:92
msgid "Keep in mind you cannot upgrade to a channel unless it is an available target for your current base channel."
msgstr "Perlu diingat bahwa Anda tidak dapat meningkatkan sistem ke suatu saluran kecuali saluran tersebut merupakan target yang tersedia untuk saluran dasar Anda saat ini."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:93
#, no-wrap
msgid "<MIGRATION_TARGET>"
msgstr "<MIGRATION_TARGET>"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:94
msgid "To identify this value for systems in the group `group:mpm-target-sles15sp3`, run:"
msgstr "Untuk mengidentifikasi nilai ini bagi sistem dalam grup `group:mpm-target-sles15sp3`, jalankan:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:96
msgid "The `MIGRATION_TARGET` parameter must be passed in the following format; note necessary shell quotation to prevent sideeffects with brackets:"
msgstr "Parameter `MIGRATION_TARGET` harus diberikan dalam format berikut; perhatikan bahwa tanda kutip shell diperlukan untuk mencegah efek samping akibat tanda kurung siku:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:97
#, no-wrap
msgid "\"[190,203,195,1242]\"\n"
msgstr "\"[1242]\"[190][195][203]\n"

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:98
#, no-wrap
msgid "Options"
msgstr "Opsi"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:99
msgid "`-s` START_TIME"
msgstr "`-s` START_TIME"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:100
msgid "`-d` pass this flag, if you want to do a dry run (it is recommended to run a dry run before the actual migration)"
msgstr "`-d` sertakan flag ini jika Anda ingin melakukan uji coba (disarankan untuk melakukan uji coba sebelum migrasi yang sebenarnya)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:101
msgid "`-c` CHILD_CHANNELS (comma-separated child channels labels with no spaces)"
msgstr "`-c` CHILD_CHANNELS (label saluran anak yang dipisahkan koma tanpa spasi)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:102
msgid "In this case we included the `-d` option, which can be removed after a successful dry run."
msgstr "Dalam kasus ini, kita menyertakan opsi `-d`, yang dapat dihapus setelah uji coba berhasil."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:103
msgid "If successful, the command output for each scheduled system will look like this:"
msgstr "Jika berhasil, keluaran perintah untuk setiap sistem yang dijadwalkan akan terlihat seperti berikut:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:104
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Scheduling Product migration for system mpm-sles152-1\n"
"Scheduled action ID: 66\n"
msgstr ""
"Menjadwalkan migrasi Produk untuk sistem mpm-sles152-1\n"
"ID tindakan terjadwal: 66\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:105
msgid "You can also track the action, in this case the dry run, in the {webui} for a given system in the group.  From the system details page of the client, navigate to menu:Events[History].  If there are any failures during the dry run, the system should be investigated."
msgstr "Anda juga dapat melacak tindakan tersebut, dalam kasus ini uji coba, melalui {webui} untuk sistem tertentu dalam grup.  Dari halaman detail sistem klien, buka menu:Events[History].  Jika terjadi kegagalan selama uji coba, sistem tersebut harus diperiksa."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:106
msgid "If all is well, the `-d` option can be removed from the command to run the real migration.  After the migration is complete, you can reboot the system from the {productname} {webui}."
msgstr "Jika semuanya berjalan dengan baik, opsi `-d` dapat dihapus dari perintah untuk menjalankan migrasi yang sebenarnya.  Setelah migrasi selesai, Anda dapat memulai ulang sistem melalui {productname} {webui}."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-uyuni.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Upgrade Uyuni Clients"
msgstr "Meningkatkan Klien Uyuni"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-uyuni.adoc:2
msgid "In this section, we use openSUSE Leap as an example."
msgstr "Dalam bagian ini, kami menggunakan openSUSE Leap sebagai contoh."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-uyuni.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Preparing the Client Upgrade"
msgstr "Prosedur: Menyiapkan Peningkatan Klien"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-uyuni.adoc:5
msgid "At the command prompt on the {productname} Server, as root, use the `spacewalk-common-channels` command to add the appropriate channels."
msgstr "Pada prompt perintah di Server {productname}, sebagai root, gunakan perintah `spacewalk-common-channels` untuk menambahkan saluran yang sesuai."

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-uyuni.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"spacewalk-common-channels \\\n"
"opensuse_leap15_4 \\\n"
"opensuse_leap15_4-non-oss \\\n"
"opensuse_leap15_4-non-oss-updates \\\n"
"opensuse_leap15_4-updates \\\n"
"opensuse_leap15_4-uyuni-client\n"
msgstr ""
"spacewalk-common-channels \\\n"
"opensuse_leap15_4 \\\n"
"opensuse_leap15_4-non-oss \\\n"
"opensuse_leap15_4-non-oss-updates \\\n"
"opensuse_leap15_4-updates \\\n"
"opensuse_leap15_4-uyuni-client\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-uyuni.adoc:7
msgid "Fully synchronize all channels with `spacewalk-repo-sync`."
msgstr "Sinkronkan seluruh saluran sepenuhnya dengan `spacewalk-repo-sync`."

#.  These are custom channels.
#.  For more information, see xref:client-configuration:clients-opensuse.adoc[].
#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-uyuni.adoc:8
msgid "In the {productname} Server {webui}, navigate to menu:Software[Manage > Channels] and click the `Uyuni Client Tools for openSUSE Leap 15.4 (x86_64)` channel name."
msgstr "Di {webui} Server {productname}, buka menu:Software[Manage > Channels] dan klik nama saluran `Uyuni Client Tools for openSUSE Leap 15.4 (x86_64)`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-uyuni.adoc:9
msgid "In the upper right corner, click btn:[Manage Channel]."
msgstr "Di sudut kanan atas, klik btn:[Manage Channel]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-uyuni.adoc:10
msgid "Click the `Repositories` tab, and select `External - Uyuni Client Tools for openSUSE Leap 15.3 (x86_64)`."
msgstr "Klik tab `Repositories`, lalu pilih `External - Uyuni Client Tools for openSUSE Leap 15.3 (x86_64)`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-uyuni.adoc:11
msgid "Click btn:[Update Repositories]."
msgstr "Klik btn:[Update Repositories]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-uyuni.adoc:12
msgid "Navigate to menu:Repositories[Sync] subtab, and click btn:[Sync Now]."
msgstr "Buka subtab menu:Repositories[Sync], lalu klik btn:[Sync Now]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-uyuni.adoc:13
msgid "Do the same with `openSUSE Leap 15.4 (x86_64)` and `External - openSUSE Leap 15.3 (x86_64)`."
msgstr "Lakukan hal yang sama untuk `openSUSE Leap 15.4 (x86_64)` dan `External - openSUSE Leap 15.3 (x86_64)`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-uyuni.adoc:14
msgid "Unfold `openSUSE Leap 15.4 (x86_64)` to see all child channels populated with packages."
msgstr "Perluas `openSUSE Leap 15.4 (x86_64)` untuk melihat semua saluran anak yang telah terisi paket."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-uyuni.adoc:16
msgid "To upgrade a client you replace the software repositories and update the software, and finally reboot the client."
msgstr "Untuk meningkatkan klien, ganti repositori perangkat lunak dan perbarui perangkat lunaknya, lalu mulai ulang klien."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-uyuni.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Upgrading the Client"
msgstr "Prosedur: Meningkatkan Klien"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-uyuni.adoc:18
msgid "In the {productname} Server {webui}, navigate to menu:Systems[] and click the name of the client."
msgstr "Di {webui} Server {productname}, buka menu:Systems[] dan klik nama klien."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-uyuni.adoc:19
msgid "Click menu:Software[Software Channels], and as the base channel select the openSUSE Leap {opensuse-version} channel that is listed in the `Customs Channels` list."
msgstr "Klik menu:Software[Software Channels], lalu pilih saluran openSUSE Leap {opensuse-version} yang tercantum dalam daftar `Customs Channels` sebagai saluran dasar."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-uyuni.adoc:20
msgid "In the `Child Channels` pane, select the {opensuse-version} child channels."
msgstr "Di panel `Child Channels`, pilih saluran anak {opensuse-version}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-uyuni.adoc:21
msgid "Click btn:[Next], and `Confirm Software Channel Change` with btn:[Confirm]."
msgstr "Klik btn:[Next], lalu konfirmasikan pada `Confirm Software Channel Change` dengan mengeklik btn:[Confirm]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-uyuni.adoc:22
msgid "Click menu:Software[Packages > Upgrade], and select all the packages to be updated on the client, and then apply the selection.  Click btn:[Upgrade Packages], check the details, and click btn:[Confirm] to complete the update."
msgstr "Klik menu:Software[Packages > Upgrade], pilih semua paket yang akan diperbarui pada klien, lalu terapkan pilihan tersebut.  Klik btn:[Upgrade Packages], periksa detailnya, lalu klik btn:[Confirm] untuk menyelesaikan pembaruan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-uyuni.adoc:23
msgid "Reboot the client."
msgstr "Mulai ulang klien."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-uyuni.adoc:24
msgid "If you need to update many clients, you can create an action chain of this command sequence on the {productname} Server.  You can use the action chain to perform updates on multiple clients at the same time."
msgstr "Jika Anda perlu memperbarui banyak klien, Anda dapat membuat rantai tindakan dari urutan perintah ini di Server {productname}.  Anda dapat menggunakan rantai tindakan tersebut untuk melakukan pembaruan pada beberapa klien secara bersamaan."

#
#
#. . Assign the new channels to the clients instead of the old channels.
#. . Update all the packages.  This can either be done with the {webui} or better run `zypper dup` manually on the command line local on the systems or remotely as a Salt command.
#. I think the better way to document this is if giving it a try. Create an Uyuni server, sync Leap 15.1 (spacewalk-common-channels), create a Leap 15.1, onboard it, sync Leap 15.2 (spacewalk-common-channels), and then try to adjust the channels and trying to upgrade. I recommend you use VMs and take snapshots of the VMs so you can repeat steps as needed.
#. But for now you need to create and mirror at least the target channels with spacewalk-common-channels.
#. You adjust the channels for the client and best is to call "zypper dup". Either from the commandline on that system or using remote command.
#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Client Upgrades"
msgstr "Peningkatan Klien"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades.adoc:2
msgid "Clients use the versioning system of their underlying operating system, and require regular upgrades."
msgstr "Klien menggunakan sistem penomoran versi dari sistem operasi yang mendasarinya dan memerlukan peningkatan secara berkala."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades.adoc:3
msgid "For {scc} registered clients using {suse} operating systems, you can perform upgrades within the {productname} {webui}.  For supported {sle}{nbsp}15 upgrade paths, see {sles-base-os-documentation}/cha-upgrade-paths.html"
msgstr "Untuk klien yang terdaftar di {scc} dan menggunakan sistem operasi {suse}, Anda dapat melakukan peningkatan melalui {productname} {webui}.  Untuk jalur peningkatan {sle}{nbsp}15 yang didukung, lihat {sles-base-os-documentation}/cha-upgrade-paths.html"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades.adoc:4
msgid "To upgrade clients running SLE{nbsp}12 to SLE{nbsp}15, the upgrade is automated, but you need to do some preparation steps before you begin.  For more information, see xref:client-configuration:client-upgrades-major.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk meningkatkan klien yang menjalankan SLE{nbsp}12 ke SLE{nbsp}15, proses peningkatan dilakukan secara otomatis, tetapi Anda perlu melakukan beberapa langkah persiapan sebelum memulai.  Untuk informasi selengkapnya, lihat xref:client-configuration:client-upgrades-major.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades.adoc:5
msgid "You can also automate client upgrades using the content lifecycle manager.  For more information, see xref:client-configuration:client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc[]."
msgstr "Anda juga dapat mengotomatiskan peningkatan klien menggunakan pengelola siklus hidup konten.  Untuk informasi selengkapnya, lihat xref:client-configuration:client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades.adoc:6
msgid "For more information about product migration such as service pack upgrades, major version upgrades from {sles}{nbsp}15 to {sles}{nbsp}16, {leap} minor version upgrades, or {leap} to {sle} migrations, see xref:client-configuration:client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang migrasi produk, seperti peningkatan service pack, peningkatan versi mayor dari {sles}{nbsp}15 ke {sles}{nbsp}16, peningkatan versi minor {leap}, atau migrasi dari {leap} ke {sle}, lihat xref:client-configuration:client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades.adoc:7
msgid "For more information about upgrading unregistered {leap} clients, see xref:client-configuration:client-upgrades-uyuni.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang meningkatkan klien {leap} yang tidak terdaftar, lihat xref:client-configuration:client-upgrades-uyuni.adoc[]."

