#. type: Table
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-centos.adoc:20
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| OS Version | Base Channel | Client Channel       | Updates/Appstream Channel\n"
"| {centos} 7 | centos7      | centos7-uyuni-client | centos7-updates\n"
msgstr ""
"| Versi OS | Saluran Dasar | Saluran Klien       | Saluran Pembaruan/Appstream\n"
"| {centos} 7 | centos7      | centos7-uyuni-client | centos7-updates\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-centos.adoc:22
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-oracle.adoc:22
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-cdn.adoc:79
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sleses.adoc:34
msgid "If you are using modular channels, you must enable the Python 3.6 module stream on the client.  If you do not provide Python 3.6, the installation of the `spacecmd` package will fail."
msgstr "Jika Anda menggunakan saluran modular, Anda harus mengaktifkan aliran modul Python 3.6 pada klien.  Jika Anda tidak menyediakan Python 3.6, instalasi paket `spacecmd` akan gagal."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-centos.adoc:23
msgid "You might notice some disparity in the number of packages available in the AppStream channel between upstream and the {productname} channel.  You might also see different numbers if you compare the same channel added at a different point in time.  This is due to the way that {centos} manages their repositories.  {centos} removes older version of packages when a new version is released, while {productname} keeps all of them, regardless of age."
msgstr "Anda mungkin melihat perbedaan jumlah paket yang tersedia di saluran AppStream antara upstream dan saluran {productname}.  Anda juga mungkin melihat jumlah yang berbeda jika membandingkan saluran yang sama yang ditambahkan pada waktu berbeda.  Hal ini disebabkan oleh cara {centos} mengelola repositorinya.  {centos} menghapus versi paket yang lebih lama saat versi baru dirilis, sedangkan {productname} menyimpan semuanya, terlepas dari usianya."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-centos.adoc:26
msgid "You need to create an activation key that is associated with your {centos} channels."
msgstr "Anda perlu membuat kunci aktivasi yang terkait dengan saluran {centos} Anda."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-centos.adoc:36
msgid "CentOS 7 will fail to onboard due to the fact that the `/etc/yum.repos.d/CentOS-Base.repo` has URLs enabled, and thus causing `yum` to attempt to find the repositories using fastmirror.  This will cause the bootstrap to fail with the error message:"
msgstr "CentOS 7 akan gagal didaftarkan karena URL dalam `/etc/yum.repos.d/CentOS-Base.repo` diaktifkan, sehingga `yum` mencoba mencari repositori menggunakan fastmirror.  Hal ini akan menyebabkan proses bootstrap gagal dengan pesan kesalahan:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-centos.adoc:37
#, no-wrap
msgid "Could not resolve host: mirrorlist.centos.org; Unknown error\n"
msgstr "Tidak dapat me-resolve host: mirrorlist.centos.org; Kesalahan tidak diketahui\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-centos.adoc:38
msgid "To avoid the issue you can remove the `CentOS-Base.repo` file with the command:"
msgstr "Untuk menghindari masalah ini, Anda dapat menghapus berkas `CentOS-Base.repo` dengan perintah:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-centos.adoc:39
#, no-wrap
msgid "rm -f /etc/yum.repos.d/CentOS-Base.repo\n"
msgstr "rm -f /etc/yum.repos.d/CentOS-Base.repo\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-centos.adoc:40
msgid "Or, if the file needs to remain, you can add `enabled=0` to each of the URL sections."
msgstr "Atau, jika berkas tersebut harus tetap ada, Anda dapat menambahkan `enabled=0` ke setiap bagian URL."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-centos.adoc:41
msgid "In either case, then rebootstrap."
msgstr "Dalam kedua kasus tersebut, jalankan kembali proses bootstrap setelahnya."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-centos.adoc:42
#, no-wrap
msgid "Manage Errata"
msgstr "Mengelola Errata"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-centos.adoc:43
msgid "This section is only applicable to non-containerized Uyuni and it will be removed after {centos} 7 will go end-of-life."
msgstr "Bagian ini hanya berlaku untuk Uyuni yang tidak dijalankan dalam kontainer dan akan dihapus setelah {centos} 7 mencapai akhir masa dukungan."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-centos.adoc:44
msgid "When you update {centos} clients, the packages do not include metadata about the updates.  You can use a third-party errata service to obtain this information."
msgstr "Saat Anda memperbarui klien {centos}, paket-paketnya tidak menyertakan metadata tentang pembaruan.  Anda dapat menggunakan layanan errata pihak ketiga untuk memperoleh informasi ini."

#
#
#.  ifeval::[{mlm-content} == true]
#.  The third-party errata service described here, CEFS, is provided and maintained by the community.
#.  It is not supported by {suse}.
#.  endif::[]
#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-centos.adoc:45
msgid "The authors of CEFS provide patches or errata on a best-effort basis, in the hope they are useful but with no guarantees of correctness or currency.  This could mean that the patch dates could be incorrect, and in at least one case, the published data was shown to be more than a month old.  For more information on these cases, see https://github.com/stevemeier/cefs/issues/28#issuecomment-656579382 and https://github.com/stevemeier/cefs/issues/28#issuecomment-656573607."
msgstr "Pengembang CEFS menyediakan patch atau errata dengan upaya terbaik, dengan harapan dapat bermanfaat, tetapi tanpa jaminan keakuratan atau kemutakhiran.  Artinya, tanggal patch mungkin tidak akurat, dan setidaknya dalam satu kasus, data yang dipublikasikan terbukti sudah berusia lebih dari satu bulan.  Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang kasus-kasus ini, lihat https://github.com/stevemeier/cefs/issues/28#issuecomment-656579382 dan https://github.com/stevemeier/cefs/issues/28#issuecomment-656573607."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-centos.adoc:46
msgid "Any problems or delays with the patch data might result in unreliable patch information being imported to your {productname} Server.  This would cause reports, audits, CVE updates, or other patch-related information to also be incorrect.  Please consider alternatives to using this service, such as independently verifying patch data, or choosing a different operating system, depending on your security-related requirements and certifications criteria."
msgstr "Masalah atau keterlambatan pada data patch dapat mengakibatkan informasi patch yang tidak andal diimpor ke Server {productname} Anda. Hal ini juga akan menyebabkan laporan, audit, pembaruan CVE, atau informasi lain terkait patch menjadi tidak akurat.  Pertimbangkan alternatif selain menggunakan layanan ini, seperti memverifikasi data patch secara mandiri atau memilih sistem operasi lain, sesuai dengan kebutuhan keamanan dan kriteria sertifikasi Anda."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-centos.adoc:47
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Installing an Errata Service"
msgstr "Prosedur: Menginstal Layanan Errata"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-centos.adoc:48
msgid "On the {productname} Server, from the command prompt, as root, add the `sle-module-development-tools` module:"
msgstr "Di Server {productname}, melalui prompt perintah, sebagai root, tambahkan modul `sle-module-development-tools`:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-centos.adoc:49
#, no-wrap
msgid "SUSEConnect --product sle-module-development-tools/15.2/x86_64\n"
msgstr "SUSEConnect --product sle-module-development-tools/15.2/x86_64\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-centos.adoc:50
msgid "Install errata service dependencies:"
msgstr "Instal dependensi layanan errata:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-centos.adoc:51
#, no-wrap
msgid "zypper in  perl-Text-Unidecode\n"
msgstr "zypper in  perl-Text-Unidecode\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-centos.adoc:52
msgid "Add or edit this line in `/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`:"
msgstr "Tambahkan atau edit baris ini di `/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-centos.adoc:53
#, no-wrap
msgid "java.allow_adding_patches_via_api = centos7-x86_64-updates,centos7-x86_64,centos7-x86_64-extras\n"
msgstr "java.allow_adding_patches_via_api = centos7-x86_64-updates,centos7-x86_64,centos7-x86_64-extras\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-centos.adoc:54
msgid "Restart Tomcat:"
msgstr "Mulai ulang Tomcat:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-centos.adoc:55
#, no-wrap
msgid "systemctl restart tomcat\n"
msgstr "systemctl restart tomcat\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-centos.adoc:56
msgid "Create a file for your errata script:"
msgstr "Buat berkas untuk skrip errata Anda:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-centos.adoc:57
#, no-wrap
msgid "touch /usr/local/bin/cent-errata.sh\n"
msgstr "touch /usr/local/bin/cent-errata.sh\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-centos.adoc:58
msgid "Edit the new file to include this script, editing the repository details as required."
msgstr "Edit berkas baru tersebut untuk menyertakan skrip ini, dengan menyesuaikan detail repositori sesuai kebutuhan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-centos.adoc:59
msgid "This script fetches the errata details from an external errata service, unpacks it, and publishes the details:"
msgstr "Skrip ini mengambil detail errata dari layanan errata eksternal, mengekstraknya, lalu memublikasikan detail tersebut:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-centos.adoc:60
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"#!/bin/bash\n"
"mkdir -p /usr/local/centos\n"
"cd /usr/local/centos\n"
"rm *.xml\n"
"wget -c http://cefs.steve-meier.de/errata.latest.xml\n"
"wget -c https://www.redhat.com/security/data/oval/v2/RHEL7/rhel-7.oval.xml.bz2\n"
"bzip2 -d rhel-7.oval.xml.bz2\n"
"wget -c http://cefs.steve-meier.de/errata-import.tar\n"
"tar xvf errata-import.tar\n"
"chmod +x /usr/local/centos/errata-import.pl\n"
"export SPACEWALK_USER='<adminname>';export SPACEWALK_PASS='<password>'\n"
"/usr/local/centos/errata-import.pl --server '<servername>' \\\n"
"--errata /usr/local/centos/errata.latest.xml  \\\n"
"--include-channels=centos7-x86_64-updates,centos7-x86_64,centos7-x86_64-extras \\\n"
"--publish --rhsa-oval /usr/local/centos/rhel-7.oval.xml\n"
msgstr ""
"#!/bin/bash\n"
"mkdir -p /usr/local/centos\n"
"cd /usr/local/centos\n"
"rm *.xml\n"
"wget -c http://cefs.steve-meier.de/errata.latest.xml\n"
"wget -c https://www.redhat.com/security/data/oval/v2/RHEL7/rhel-7.oval.xml.bz2\n"
"bzip2 -d rhel-7.oval.xml.bz2\n"
"wget -c http://cefs.steve-meier.de/errata-import.tar\n"
"tar xvf errata-import.tar\n"
"chmod +x /usr/local/centos/errata-import.pl\n"
"export SPACEWALK_USER='<adminname>';export SPACEWALK_PASS='<password>'\n"
"/usr/local/centos/errata-import.pl --server '<servername>' \\\n"
"--errata /usr/local/centos/errata.latest.xml  \\\n"
"--include-channels=centos7-x86_64-updates,centos7-x86_64,centos7-x86_64-extras \\\n"
"--publish --rhsa-oval /usr/local/centos/rhel-7.oval.xml\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-centos.adoc:61
msgid "Set up a cron job to run the script daily:"
msgstr "Siapkan tugas cron untuk menjalankan skrip setiap hari:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-centos.adoc:62
#, no-wrap
msgid "ln -s /usr/local/bin/cent-errata.sh /etc/cron.daily\n"
msgstr "ln -s /usr/local/bin/cent-errata.sh /etc/cron.daily\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-centos.adoc:63
msgid "For more information on this tool, see https://cefs.steve-meier.de/."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang alat ini, lihat https://cefs.steve-meier.de/."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-debian.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Registering {debian} Clients"
msgstr "Mendaftarkan Klien {debian}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-debian.adoc:2
msgid "This section contains information about registering clients running {debian} operating systems."
msgstr "Bagian ini berisi informasi tentang pendaftaran klien yang menjalankan sistem operasi {debian}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-debian.adoc:3
msgid "Bootstrapping can be used with {debian} clients for performing initial state runs, and for profile updates."
msgstr "Bootstrapping dapat digunakan pada klien {debian} untuk menjalankan state awal dan memperbarui profil."

#.  Use list format: repository URLs / packages and metadata / version info
#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-debian.adoc:4
msgid "{debian} repository URLs are available from {scclongform}."
msgstr "URL repositori {debian} tersedia dari {scclongform}."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-debian.adoc:5
msgid "Packages and metadata are provided by {debian}, not by {suse}."
msgstr "Paket dan metadata disediakan oleh {debian}, bukan oleh {suse}."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-debian.adoc:6
msgid "For supported products, see the release notes and the support table at xref:client-configuration:supported-features-debian.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk produk yang didukung, lihat catatan rilis dan tabel dukungan di xref:client-configuration:supported-features-debian.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-debian.adoc:7
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-raspberrypios.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prepare to Register"
msgstr "Persiapan Pendaftaran"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-debian.adoc:8
msgid "Some preparation is required before you can register {debian} clients to the {productname} Server:"
msgstr "Beberapa persiapan diperlukan sebelum Anda dapat mendaftarkan klien {debian} ke Server {productname}:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-debian.adoc:9
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-raspberrypios.adoc:9
msgid "Ensure DNS is correctly configured and provides an entry for the client.  Alternatively, you can configure the `/etc/hosts` files on both the {productname} Server and the client with the appropriate entries."
msgstr "Pastikan DNS dikonfigurasi dengan benar dan memiliki entri untuk klien.  Sebagai alternatif, Anda dapat mengonfigurasi berkas `/etc/hosts` pada Server {productname} dan klien dengan entri yang sesuai."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-debian.adoc:10
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-raspberrypios.adoc:10
msgid "The client must have the date and time synchronized with the {productname} Server before registration."
msgstr "Tanggal dan waktu klien harus disinkronkan dengan Server {productname} sebelum pendaftaran."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-debian.adoc:12
msgid "Before you can register {debian} clients to your {productname} Server, you need to add the required software channels, and synchronize them."
msgstr "Sebelum dapat mendaftarkan klien {debian} ke Server {productname}, Anda perlu menambahkan saluran perangkat lunak yang diperlukan dan menyinkronkannya."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-debian.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "{debian} Products - WebUI"
msgstr "Produk {debian} - WebUI"

#. type: Table
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-debian.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
