#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-openeuler.adoc:6
msgid "When created at AWS, {openeuler} instances always have the same `machine-id` id at `/etc/machine-id`.  Make sure you regenerate the `machine-id` after the instance is created.  For more information, see xref:administration:troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc[]."
