"| Saluran Klien           | opensuse_micro6_1-uyuni-client | opensuse_micro5_5-uyuni-client     | opensuse_micro5_4-uyuni-client | opensuse_micro5_3-uyuni-client\n"
"| Saluran Pembaruan SLE      | NA                             | opensuse_micro5_5-sle-updates      | opensuse_micro5_4-sle-updates  | opensuse_micro5_3-sle-updates\n"
"\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-opensuseleapmicro.adoc:14
msgid "{leapmicro} channels can be very large.  Synchronization can sometimes take several hours."
msgstr "Saluran {leapmicro} dapat berukuran sangat besar.  Sinkronisasi terkadang dapat memerlukan waktu beberapa jam."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-opensuseleapmicro.adoc:19
msgid "{leapmicro} clients require reboot after registering."
msgstr "Klien {leapmicro} perlu dimulai ulang setelah didaftarkan."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-opensuseleapmicro.adoc:20
msgid "Following the bootstrapping process, automatic booting is disabled on {leapmicro}. This change was implemented due to intermittent automatic reboots, which could occur before Salt could relay the results of applying the bootstrap salt state."
msgstr "Setelah proses bootstrapping, boot otomatis dinonaktifkan pada {leapmicro}. Perubahan ini diterapkan karena mulai ulang otomatis terkadang terjadi sebelum Salt dapat menyampaikan hasil penerapan state Salt bootstrap."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-opensuseleapmicro.adoc:21
msgid "Reboot is automatically scheduled after registration is completed, but it is respecting the default reboot manager maintenance window.  This window may be several hours after the client is registered.  To speed up {leapmicro} registration, manually reboot the client after the registration script finishes."
msgstr "Mulai ulang dijadwalkan secara otomatis setelah pendaftaran selesai, tetapi tetap mengikuti jendela pemeliharaan default pengelola mulai ulang.  Jendela ini mungkin baru dimulai beberapa jam setelah klien didaftarkan.  Untuk mempercepat pendaftaran {leapmicro}, mulai ulang klien secara manual setelah skrip pendaftaran selesai."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-oracle.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Registering {oracle} Clients"
msgstr "Mendaftarkan Klien {oracle}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-oracle.adoc:2
msgid "This section contains information about registering clients running {oracle} operating systems."
msgstr "Bagian ini berisi informasi tentang pendaftaran klien yang menjalankan sistem operasi {oracle}."

#.  Use list format: repository URLs / packages and metadata / version info
#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-oracle.adoc:3
msgid "{oracle} repository URLs are available from {scclongform}."
msgstr "URL repositori {oracle} tersedia dari {scclongform}."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-oracle.adoc:4
msgid "Packages and metadata are provided by Oracle, not by {suse}."
msgstr "Paket dan metadata disediakan oleh Oracle, bukan oleh {suse}."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-oracle.adoc:5
msgid "{oracle} base media repositories are freely available for download from https://yum.oracle.com/."
msgstr "Repositori media dasar {oracle} tersedia untuk diunduh secara gratis dari https://yum.oracle.com/."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-oracle.adoc:6
msgid "For supported products, see the release notes and the support table at xref:client-configuration:supported-features-oracle.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk produk yang didukung, lihat catatan rilis dan tabel dukungan di xref:client-configuration:supported-features-oracle.adoc[]."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-oracle.adoc:7
msgid "Direct synchronizing Unbreakable Linux Network (ULN) repositories with {productname} are not currently supported.  An Oracle Local Distribution for ULN must be used.  For more information about setting up a local ULN mirror, see the Oracle documentation provided at https://docs.oracle.com/en/operating-systems/oracle-linux/software-management/sfw-mgmt-UseSoftwareDistributionMirrors.html#local-uln-mirror."
msgstr "Sinkronisasi langsung repositori Unbreakable Linux Network (ULN) dengan {productname} saat ini tidak didukung.  Oracle Local Distribution untuk ULN harus digunakan.  Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang menyiapkan mirror ULN lokal, lihat dokumentasi Oracle di https://docs.oracle.com/en/operating-systems/oracle-linux/software-management/sfw-mgmt-UseSoftwareDistributionMirrors.html#local-uln-mirror."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-oracle.adoc:9
msgid "Before you register {oracle} clients to your {productname} Server, you need to add the required software channels, and synchronize them."
msgstr "Sebelum mendaftarkan klien {oracle} ke Server {productname}, Anda perlu menambahkan saluran perangkat lunak yang diperlukan dan menyinkronkannya."

