#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-pubcloud.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Registering Clients on a Public Cloud"
msgstr "Mendaftarkan Klien di Cloud Publik"

#.  2024-04-04 OM: It had been decided in the conversation with the MLM PO 
#.  that this Public Cloud related file can stay in the Uyuni books
#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-pubcloud.adoc:2
msgid "When you have your {productname} Server set up, you are ready to start registering clients."
msgstr "Setelah Server {productname} disiapkan, Anda siap untuk mulai mendaftarkan klien."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-pubcloud.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Add Products and Synchronize Repositories"
msgstr "Menambahkan Produk dan Menyinkronkan Repositori"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-pubcloud.adoc:4
msgid "Ensure you have already added the corresponding products for your clients and synced the repositories to {productname}.  This is required to create the bootstrap repositories used for registering clients."
msgstr "Pastikan Anda telah menambahkan produk yang sesuai untuk klien Anda dan menyinkronkan repositorinya ke {productname}.  Langkah ini diperlukan untuk membuat repositori bootstrap yang digunakan untuk mendaftarkan klien."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-pubcloud.adoc:5
msgid "For more information, see xref:specialized-guides:public-cloud-guide/overview.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya, lihat xref:specialized-guides:public-cloud-guide/overview.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-pubcloud.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prepare On-demand Images"
msgstr "Menyiapkan Image Sesuai Permintaan"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-pubcloud.adoc:7
msgid "An instance started from an on-demand image provided by {suse} is automatically registered, and the update infrastructure and {sle} modules are activated.  To use your on-demand image as a {productname} client, you need to disable this automation before you begin."
msgstr "Instans yang dijalankan dari image sesuai permintaan yang disediakan oleh {suse} didaftarkan secara otomatis, dan infrastruktur pembaruan serta modul {sle} diaktifkan.  Untuk menggunakan image sesuai permintaan sebagai klien {productname}, Anda perlu menonaktifkan otomatisasi ini sebelum memulai."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-pubcloud.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Preparing On-demand Images"
msgstr "Prosedur: Menyiapkan Image Sesuai Permintaan"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-pubcloud.adoc:9
msgid "Log in to the on-demand instance."
msgstr "Masuk ke instans sesuai permintaan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-pubcloud.adoc:10
msgid "At the command prompt, as root, remove the registration data and repositories:"
msgstr "Pada prompt perintah, sebagai root, hapus data pendaftaran dan repositori:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-pubcloud.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "registercloudguest --clean\n"
msgstr "registercloudguest --clean\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-pubcloud.adoc:12
msgid "Remove the trigger service for automatic registration:"
msgstr "Nonaktifkan layanan pemicu pendaftaran otomatis:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-pubcloud.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "systemctl disable guestregister.service\n"
msgstr "systemctl disable guestregister.service\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-pubcloud.adoc:14
msgid "in Microsoft Azure, there is an additional service that needs to be disabled:"
msgstr "Di Microsoft Azure, ada layanan tambahan yang perlu dinonaktifkan:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-pubcloud.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "systemctl disable regionsrv-enabler-azure.timer\n"
msgstr "systemctl disable regionsrv-enabler-azure.timer\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-pubcloud.adoc:20
msgid "In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Systems[Bootstrapping], then fill in the `Host`, `SSH Port`, `User`, and `Password` fields.  Make sure you use stable FQDNs for the `Host` field, or {productname} cannot find your host when your Public Cloud gives you a different short-lived FQDNS."
msgstr "Di {productname} {webui}, buka menu:Systems[Bootstrapping], lalu isi kolom `Host`, `SSH Port`, `User`, dan `Password`.  Pastikan Anda menggunakan FQDN yang stabil untuk kolom `Host`; jika tidak, {productname} tidak dapat menemukan host Anda saat cloud publik memberikan FQDN sementara yang berbeda."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-pubcloud.adoc:21
msgid "Public cloud images usually do not allow SSH login with username and password, but only SSH with a certificate.  If you want to use bootstrap from the {webui}, you need to enable SSH login with username and SSH key.  You can do this by navigating to menu:Systems[Bootstrapping] and changing the authentication method."
msgstr "Image cloud publik biasanya tidak mengizinkan login SSH dengan nama pengguna dan kata sandi, melainkan hanya SSH dengan sertifikat.  Jika Anda ingin melakukan bootstrap melalui {webui}, Anda perlu mengaktifkan login SSH dengan nama pengguna dan kunci SSH.  Anda dapat melakukannya dengan membuka menu:Systems[Bootstrapping] dan mengubah metode autentikasi."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-pubcloud.adoc:22
msgid "If your cloud provider is Microsoft Azure, you can log in with username and password.  To do this, you need to allow the AzureUser to run commands as root without a password.  To do this, open the `/etc/sudoers.d/waagent` file, and add or edit this line:"
msgstr "Jika penyedia cloud Anda adalah Microsoft Azure, Anda dapat masuk dengan nama pengguna dan kata sandi.  Untuk melakukannya, Anda perlu mengizinkan AzureUser menjalankan perintah sebagai root tanpa kata sandi.  Buka berkas `/etc/sudoers.d/waagent`, lalu tambahkan atau edit baris berikut:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-pubcloud.adoc:23
#, no-wrap
msgid "AzureUser ALL=(ALL) NOPASSWD: ALL\n"
msgstr "AzureUser ALL=(ALL) NOPASSWD: ALL\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-pubcloud.adoc:24
msgid "Allowing the AzureUser to run commands as root without a password carries a security risk.  Use this method for testing only.  Do not do this for production systems."
msgstr "Mengizinkan AzureUser menjalankan perintah sebagai root tanpa kata sandi menimbulkan risiko keamanan.  Gunakan metode ini hanya untuk pengujian.  Jangan lakukan ini pada sistem produksi."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-pubcloud.adoc:25
msgid "When the bootstrap process has completed successfully, your client is listed at menu:Systems[System List]."
msgstr "Setelah proses bootstrap berhasil diselesaikan, klien Anda akan tercantum di menu:Systems[System List]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-pubcloud.adoc:26
msgid "If you want more control over the process or have to register many clients, create a bootstrap script.  For more information, see xref:client-configuration:registration-bootstrap.adoc[]."
msgstr "Jika Anda menginginkan kendali lebih besar atas proses ini atau harus mendaftarkan banyak klien, buat skrip bootstrap.  Untuk informasi selengkapnya, lihat xref:client-configuration:registration-bootstrap.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-pubcloud.adoc:27
msgid "For Salt clients and even more control over the process, executing single commands on the command line can be useful.  For more information, see xref:client-configuration:registration-cli.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk klien Salt dan kendali yang lebih besar atas proses ini, menjalankan perintah satu per satu melalui baris perintah dapat berguna.  Untuk informasi selengkapnya, lihat xref:client-configuration:registration-cli.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-pubcloud.adoc:28
msgid "When registering clients launched from a public cloud image (for example, AWS AMI), you need to do some additional configuration to prevent them from over-writing each other.  For more information about registering clones, see xref:administration:troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc[]."
msgstr "Saat mendaftarkan klien yang dijalankan dari image cloud publik (misalnya, AWS AMI), Anda perlu melakukan konfigurasi tambahan agar data pendaftaran klien tidak saling menimpa.  Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang pendaftaran klon, lihat xref:administration:troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-pubcloud.adoc:31
msgid "For more on activation keys, see xref:client-configuration:activation-keys.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang kunci aktivasi, lihat xref:client-configuration:activation-keys.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-raspberrypios.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Registering {raspberrypios} Clients"
msgstr "Mendaftarkan Klien {raspberrypios}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-raspberrypios.adoc:2
msgid "This section contains information about registering clients running {raspberrypios} operating systems."
msgstr "Bagian ini berisi informasi tentang pendaftaran klien yang menjalankan sistem operasi {raspberrypios}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-raspberrypios.adoc:3
msgid "Bootstrapping can be used with {raspberrypios} clients for performing initial state runs, and for profile updates."
msgstr "Bootstrapping dapat digunakan pada klien {raspberrypios} untuk menjalankan state awal dan memperbarui profil."

