#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-raspberrypios.adoc:25
msgid "You need all the new channels fully synchronized before bootstrapping any {raspberrypios} client."
msgstr "Anda harus memastikan semua saluran baru telah tersinkronisasi sepenuhnya sebelum melakukan bootstrap pada klien {raspberrypios} mana pun."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-raspberrypios.adoc:27
msgid "{raspberrypios} channels can be very large.  Synchronization can sometimes take several hours."
msgstr "Saluran {raspberrypios} dapat berukuran sangat besar.  Sinkronisasi terkadang dapat memerlukan waktu beberapa jam."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-raspberrypios.adoc:29
msgid "You need to create an activation key that is associated with your {raspberrypios} channels."
msgstr "Anda harus membuat kunci aktivasi yang terkait dengan saluran {raspberrypios} Anda."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-raspberrypios.adoc:35
msgid "{raspberrypios} clients can require multiple GPG keys to be installed."
msgstr "Klien {raspberrypios} mungkin memerlukan pemasangan beberapa kunci GPG."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-raspberrypios.adoc:36
msgid "When synchronizing third-party {raspberrypios} repositories, you will need to import the appropriate GPG key on the server.  If the GPG key is missing, synchronization will fail."
msgstr "Saat menyinkronkan repositori {raspberrypios} pihak ketiga, Anda harus mengimpor kunci GPG yang sesuai ke server.  Jika kunci GPG tidak tersedia, sinkronisasi akan gagal."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-raspberrypios.adoc:37
msgid "For {raspberrypios} repositories, only the metadata is signed.  Therefore importing a GPG key for the software channel is not needed.  Packages will not be re-signed by {productname}."
msgstr "Untuk repositori {raspberrypios}, hanya metadata yang ditandatangani.  Oleh karena itu, kunci GPG tidak perlu diimpor untuk saluran perangkat lunak.  Paket tidak akan ditandatangani ulang oleh {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-raspberrypios.adoc:43
msgid "The root user on {raspberrypios} is disabled by default for SSH access.  To onboard using a regular user, you must edit the `sudoers` file on the client system."
msgstr "Secara default, akses SSH untuk pengguna root pada {raspberrypios} dinonaktifkan.  Untuk melakukan onboarding menggunakan pengguna biasa, Anda harus mengedit berkas `sudoers` pada sistem klien."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-cdn.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Registering {rhel} Clients with CDN"
msgstr "Mendaftarkan Klien {rhel} melalui CDN"

#.  SUSE Liberty Linux not available at Uyuni for now
#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-cdn.adoc:2
msgid "If you are running {rhel} clients directly, rather than using {sleses}, you need to use {redhat} sources to retrieve and update packages."
msgstr "Jika Anda menjalankan klien {rhel} secara langsung, alih-alih menggunakan {sleses}, Anda harus menggunakan sumber {redhat} untuk mengambil dan memperbarui paket."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-cdn.adoc:3
msgid "This section contains information about using the {redhat} content delivery network (CDN) to register clients running {rhel} operating systems."
msgstr "Bagian ini berisi informasi tentang penggunaan jaringan pengiriman konten (CDN) {redhat} untuk mendaftarkan klien yang menjalankan sistem operasi {rhel}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-cdn.adoc:4
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-cdn.adoc:17
msgid "For information about using {redhat} update infrastructure (RHUI) instead, see xref:client-configuration:clients-rh-rhui.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi tentang penggunaan infrastruktur pembaruan {redhat} (RHUI) sebagai alternatif, lihat xref:client-configuration:clients-rh-rhui.adoc[]."

#.  SUSE Liberty Linux not available at Uyuni for now
#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-cdn.adoc:5
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-rhui.adoc:6
msgid "{rhel} clients are based on {redhat} and are unrelated to {sleses}, RES, or {sles}."
msgstr "Klien {rhel} berbasis {redhat} dan tidak terkait dengan {sleses}, RES, atau {sles}."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-cdn.adoc:6
msgid "You are responsible for arranging access to {redhat} base media repositories and {rhela} installation media, as well as connecting {productname} Server to the {redhat} content delivery network.  You must obtain support from {redhat} for all your {rhela} systems.  If you do not do this, you might be violating your terms with {redhat}."
msgstr "Anda bertanggung jawab untuk mengatur akses ke repositori media dasar {redhat} dan media instalasi {rhela}, serta menghubungkan Server {productname} ke jaringan pengiriman konten {redhat}.  Anda harus memperoleh dukungan dari {redhat} untuk semua sistem {rhela} Anda.  Jika tidak, Anda mungkin melanggar ketentuan perjanjian Anda dengan {redhat}."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-cdn.adoc:7
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-rhui.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "Import entitlements and certificates"
msgstr "Mengimpor entitlement dan sertifikat"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-cdn.adoc:8
msgid "{redhat} clients require a {redhat} certificate authority (CA) and entitlement certificate, and an entitlement key."
msgstr "Klien {redhat} memerlukan sertifikat otoritas sertifikat (CA) {redhat}, sertifikat entitlement, dan kunci entitlement."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-cdn.adoc:9
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-cdn.adoc:19
msgid "Entitlement certificates are embedded with expiration dates, which match the length of the support subscription.  To avoid disruption, you need to repeat this process at the end of every support subscription period."
msgstr "Sertifikat entitlement memuat tanggal kedaluwarsa yang sesuai dengan durasi langganan dukungan.  Untuk menghindari gangguan, Anda harus mengulangi proses ini pada akhir setiap periode langganan dukungan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-cdn.adoc:10
msgid "{redhat} supplies a subscription manager tool to manage subscription assignments.  It runs locally to track installed products and subscriptions.  Clients must be registered with the subscription manager to obtain certificates."
msgstr "{redhat} menyediakan alat pengelola langganan untuk mengelola penetapan langganan.  Alat ini berjalan secara lokal untuk melacak produk yang terinstal dan langganannya.  Klien harus didaftarkan ke pengelola langganan untuk memperoleh sertifikat."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-cdn.adoc:11
msgid "{redhat} clients use a URL to replicate repositories.  The URL changes depending on where the {redhat} client is registered."
msgstr "Klien {redhat} menggunakan URL untuk mereplikasi repositori.  URL tersebut berbeda-beda bergantung pada tempat klien {redhat} didaftarkan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-cdn.adoc:12
msgid "{redhat} clients can be registered in three different ways:"
msgstr "Klien {redhat} dapat didaftarkan melalui tiga cara berbeda:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-cdn.adoc:13
msgid "{redhat} content delivery network (CDN) at redhat.com"
msgstr "Jaringan pengiriman konten (CDN) {redhat} di redhat.com"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-cdn.adoc:14
msgid "{redhat} Satellite Server"
msgstr "Server {redhat} Satellite"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-cdn.adoc:15
msgid "{redhat} update infrastructure (RHUI) in the cloud"
msgstr "Infrastruktur pembaruan {redhat} (RHUI) di cloud"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-cdn.adoc:16
msgid "This guide covers clients registered to {redhat} CDN.  You must have at least one system registered to the CDN, with an authorized subscription for repository content."
msgstr "Panduan ini membahas klien yang terdaftar di CDN {redhat}.  Anda harus memiliki setidaknya satu sistem yang terdaftar di CDN, dengan langganan yang memberikan hak akses ke konten repositori."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-cdn.adoc:18
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-rhui.adoc:13
msgid "Satellite certificates for client systems require a Satellite server and subscription.  Clients using Satellite certificates are not supported with {productname} Server."
msgstr "Sertifikat Satellite untuk sistem klien memerlukan server dan langganan Satellite.  Klien yang menggunakan sertifikat Satellite tidak didukung oleh Server {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-cdn.adoc:20
msgid "{redhat} supplies the subscription-manager tool to manage subscription assignments.  It runs locally on the client system to track installed products and subscriptions.  Register to redhat.com with subscription-manager, then follow this procedure to obtain certificates."
msgstr "{redhat} menyediakan alat subscription-manager untuk mengelola penetapan langganan.  Alat ini berjalan secara lokal pada sistem klien untuk melacak produk yang terinstal dan langganannya.  Daftarkan sistem ke redhat.com menggunakan subscription-manager, lalu ikuti prosedur ini untuk memperoleh sertifikat."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-cdn.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Registering clients to subscription manager"
msgstr "Prosedur: Mendaftarkan klien ke pengelola langganan"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-cdn.adoc:22
msgid "On the client system, at the command prompt, register with the subscription manager tool:"
msgstr "Pada sistem klien, di prompt perintah, daftarkan sistem menggunakan alat pengelola langganan:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-cdn.adoc:23
#, no-wrap
msgid "subscription-manager register\n"
msgstr "subscription-manager register\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-cdn.adoc:24
msgid "Enter your {redhat} Portal username and password when prompted."
msgstr "Masukkan nama pengguna dan kata sandi Portal {redhat} Anda saat diminta."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-cdn.adoc:25
msgid "Run command:"
msgstr "Jalankan perintah:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-cdn.adoc:26
#, no-wrap
msgid "subscription-manager activate\n"
msgstr "subscription-manager activate\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-cdn.adoc:27
msgid "Copy your entitlement certificate and key from the client system, to a location that the {productname} Server can access:"
msgstr "Salin sertifikat dan kunci entitlement Anda dari sistem klien ke lokasi yang dapat diakses oleh Server {productname}:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-cdn.adoc:28
#, no-wrap
msgid "cp /etc/pki/entitlement/ /<example>/entitlement/\n"
msgstr "cp /etc/pki/entitlement/ /<example>/entitlement/\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-cdn.adoc:29
msgid "Your entitlement certificate and key both have a file extension of `.pem`.  The key also has `key` in the filename."
msgstr "Sertifikat dan kunci entitlement Anda memiliki ekstensi berkas `.pem`. Nama berkas kunci juga memuat `key`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-cdn.adoc:30
msgid "Copy the {redhat} CA Certificate file from the client system, to the same web location as the entitlement certificate and key:"
msgstr "Salin berkas sertifikat CA {redhat} dari sistem klien ke lokasi web yang sama dengan sertifikat dan kunci entitlement:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-cdn.adoc:31
#, no-wrap
msgid "cp /etc/rhsm/ca/redhat-uep.pem /<example>/entitlement\n"
msgstr "cp /etc/rhsm/ca/redhat-uep.pem /<example>/entitlement\n"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-cdn.adoc:32
msgid "To manage repositories on your {redhat} client, you need to import the CA and entitlement certificates to the {productname} Server.  This requires that you perform the import procedure three times, to create three entries: one each for the entitlement certificate, the entitlement key, and the {redhat} certificate."
msgstr "Untuk mengelola repositori pada klien {redhat}, Anda harus mengimpor sertifikat CA dan entitlement ke Server {productname}.  Anda harus melakukan prosedur impor sebanyak tiga kali untuk membuat tiga entri: masing-masing satu untuk sertifikat entitlement, kunci entitlement, dan sertifikat {redhat}."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-cdn.adoc:33
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Importing certificates to the server"
msgstr "Prosedur: Mengimpor sertifikat ke server"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-cdn.adoc:34
msgid "On the {productname} Server {webui}, navigate to menu:Systems[Autoinstallation > GPG and SSL Keys]."
msgstr "Pada {webui} Server {productname}, buka menu:Systems[Autoinstallation > GPG and SSL Keys]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-cdn.adoc:35
msgid "Click btn:[Create Stored Key/Cert] and set these parameters for the entitlement certificate:"
msgstr "Klik btn:[Create Stored Key/Cert] dan tetapkan parameter berikut untuk sertifikat entitlement:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-cdn.adoc:36
msgid "In the `Description` field, type `Entitlement-Cert-date`."
msgstr "Pada kolom `Description`, ketik `Entitlement-Cert-date`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-cdn.adoc:37
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-cdn.adoc:42
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-cdn.adoc:47
msgid "In the `Type` field, select `SSL`."
msgstr "Pada kolom `Type`, pilih `SSL`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-cdn.adoc:38
msgid "In the `Select file to upload` field, browse to the location where you saved the entitlement certificate, and select the `.pem` certificate file."
msgstr "Pada kolom `Select file to upload`, telusuri lokasi tempat Anda menyimpan sertifikat entitlement, lalu pilih berkas sertifikat `.pem`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-cdn.adoc:39
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-cdn.adoc:44
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-cdn.adoc:49
msgid "Click btn:[Create Key]."
msgstr "Klik btn:[Create Key]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-cdn.adoc:40
msgid "Click btn:[Create Stored Key/Cert] and set these parameters for the entitlement key:"
msgstr "Klik btn:[Create Stored Key/Cert] dan tetapkan parameter berikut untuk kunci entitlement:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-cdn.adoc:41
msgid "In the `Description` field, type `Entitlement-key-date`."
msgstr "Pada kolom `Description`, ketik `Entitlement-key-date`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-cdn.adoc:43
msgid "In the `Select file to upload` field, browse to the location where you saved the entitlement key, and select the `.pem` key file."
msgstr "Pada kolom `Select file to upload`, telusuri lokasi tempat Anda menyimpan kunci entitlement, lalu pilih berkas kunci `.pem`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-cdn.adoc:45
msgid "Click btn:[Create Stored Key/Cert] and set these parameters for the {redhat} certificate:"
msgstr "Klik btn:[Create Stored Key/Cert] dan tetapkan parameter berikut untuk sertifikat {redhat}:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-cdn.adoc:46
msgid "In the `Description` field, type `redhat-uep`."
msgstr "Pada kolom `Description`, ketik `redhat-uep`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-cdn.adoc:48
msgid "In the `Select file to upload` field, browse to the location where you saved the {redhat} certificate, and select the certificate file."
msgstr "Pada kolom `Select file to upload`, telusuri lokasi tempat Anda menyimpan sertifikat {redhat}, lalu pilih berkas sertifikat tersebut."

#.  2022-04-21, ke:
#.  Section sequence according to https://github.com/uyuni-project/uyuni-docs/pull/1535
#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-cdn.adoc:51
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-rhui.adoc:52
msgid "Before you register {redhat} clients to your {productname} Server, you need to add the required software channels, and synchronize them."
msgstr "Sebelum mendaftarkan klien {redhat} ke Server {productname}, Anda harus menambahkan saluran perangkat lunak yang diperlukan dan menyinkronkannya."

#.  ppc64le is Uyuni-only. MLM does not support ppc64le for RHEL and clones.
#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-cdn.adoc:52
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-rhui.adoc:53
msgid "The architectures currently supported are {x86_64} and {ppc64le}.  For full list of supported products and architectures, see xref:client-configuration:supported-features.adoc[]."
msgstr "Arsitektur yang saat ini didukung adalah {x86_64} dan {ppc64le}.  Untuk daftar lengkap produk dan arsitektur yang didukung, lihat xref:client-configuration:supported-features.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-cdn.adoc:53
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-rhui.adoc:54
msgid "Your {susemgr} subscription entitles you to the tools channels for {sleses} (also known as {redhat} Expanded Support or RES).  You must use the client tools channel to create the bootstrap repository.  This procedure applies to Salt clients."
msgstr "Langganan {susemgr} Anda memberikan hak akses ke saluran alat untuk {sleses} (juga dikenal sebagai {redhat} Expanded Support atau RES).  Anda harus menggunakan saluran alat klien untuk membuat repositori bootstrap.  Prosedur ini berlaku untuk klien Salt."

