msgstr "Klik btn:[Join Selected Groups]."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-cdn.adoc:127
msgid "For the {redhat} custom channels, if you want to check the `Enable GPG Check` field, you need to populate the `GPG Key URL` field.  You can use the file URL of the GPG key stored in the directory `/etc/pki/rpm-gpg` of the {redhat} minion."
msgstr "Untuk saluran kustom {redhat}, jika Anda ingin mencentang kolom `Enable GPG Check`, Anda harus mengisi kolom `GPG Key URL`.  Anda dapat menggunakan URL berkas kunci GPG yang tersimpan di direktori `/etc/pki/rpm-gpg` pada minion {redhat}."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-cdn.adoc:128
