msgstr "Contoh: `file:///etc/pki/rpm-gpg/RPM-GPG-KEY-redhat-release`"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-cdn.adoc:129
msgid "For the complete list of the {redhat} product signing keys, see https://access.redhat.com/security/team/key."
msgstr "Untuk daftar lengkap kunci penandatanganan produk {redhat}, lihat https://access.redhat.com/security/team/key."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-rhui.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Registering {rhel} clients with RHUI"
msgstr "Mendaftarkan klien {rhel} melalui RHUI"

#.  SUSE Liberty Linux not available at Uyuni for now
#.  2024-04-04 OM: It had been decided in the conversation with the mlm PO 
#.  that this Public Cloud related file can stay in the Uyuni books
#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-rhui.adoc:2
msgid "This section contains information about using {redhat} update infrastructure (RHUI) to register clients running {rhel} operating systems."
msgstr "Bagian ini berisi informasi tentang penggunaan infrastruktur pembaruan {redhat} (RHUI) untuk mendaftarkan klien yang menjalankan sistem operasi {rhel}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-rhui.adoc:3
msgid "If you are running {rhel} clients directly, rather than using {sleses}, you need to use Red Hat sources to retrieve and update packages."
msgstr "Jika Anda menjalankan klien {rhel} secara langsung, alih-alih menggunakan {sleses}, Anda harus menggunakan sumber Red Hat untuk mengambil dan memperbarui paket."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-rhui.adoc:4
msgid "If you are running clients in a public cloud, such as Amazon EC2, use this method."
msgstr "Jika Anda menjalankan klien di cloud publik, seperti Amazon EC2, gunakan metode ini."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-rhui.adoc:5
msgid "It is possible to use RHUI in conjunction with the {redhat} content delivery network (CDN) to manage your {rhel} subscriptions.  For information about using {redhat} CDN, see xref:client-configuration:clients-rh-cdn.adoc[]."
msgstr "RHUI dapat digunakan bersama jaringan pengiriman konten (CDN) {redhat} untuk mengelola langganan {rhel} Anda.  Untuk informasi tentang penggunaan CDN {redhat}, lihat xref:client-configuration:clients-rh-cdn.adoc[]."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-rhui.adoc:7
msgid "You are responsible for connecting {productname} Server to the {redhat} update infrastructure.  All clients that get updates using this RHUI certificate need to be correctly licensed, please check with your cloud provider and the {redhat} terms of service for more information."
msgstr "Anda bertanggung jawab untuk menghubungkan Server {productname} ke infrastruktur pembaruan {redhat}.  Semua klien yang memperoleh pembaruan menggunakan sertifikat RHUI ini harus memiliki lisensi yang sesuai. Untuk informasi lebih lanjut, hubungi penyedia cloud Anda dan periksa ketentuan layanan {redhat}."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-rhui.adoc:8
msgid "When {rhel} clients registered with RHUI are switched off, {redhat} might declare the certificate invalid.  In this case, you need to turn the client on again, or get a new RHUI certificate."
msgstr "Saat klien {rhel} yang terdaftar di RHUI dimatikan, {redhat} mungkin menyatakan sertifikatnya tidak valid.  Dalam hal ini, Anda harus menyalakan kembali klien tersebut atau memperoleh sertifikat RHUI baru."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-rhui.adoc:10
msgid "In the past it was required to import the certificates and entitlement data manual into {productname} Server.  This task has been automated by using the same mechanism as for SUSE {payg} instances.  For more information, see xref:specialized-guides:public-cloud-guide/payg/payg-overview.adoc[]."
msgstr "Sebelumnya, sertifikat dan data entitlement harus diimpor secara manual ke Server {productname}.  Tugas ini kini telah diotomatisasi menggunakan mekanisme yang sama seperti untuk instans SUSE {payg}.  Untuk informasi lebih lanjut, lihat xref:specialized-guides:public-cloud-guide/payg/payg-overview.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-rhui.adoc:11
msgid "This guide covers clients registered to {redhat} update infrastructure (RHUI).  You must have at least one system registered to RHUI, with an authorized subscription for repository content."
msgstr "Panduan ini membahas klien yang terdaftar di infrastruktur pembaruan {redhat} (RHUI).  Anda harus memiliki setidaknya satu sistem yang terdaftar di RHUI, dengan langganan yang memberikan hak akses ke konten repositori."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-rhui.adoc:12
msgid "For information about using {redhat} content delivery network (CDN) instead, see xref:client-configuration:clients-rh-cdn.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi tentang penggunaan jaringan pengiriman konten (CDN) {redhat} sebagai alternatif, lihat xref:client-configuration:clients-rh-cdn.adoc[]."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-rhui.adoc:14
msgid "The {payg} connection regular checks with the client to get the latest authentication data.  It is important that the client stays running and is regular updated.  If this does not happen, repository synchronization will fail with authentication errors at some point in time."
msgstr "Koneksi {payg} secara berkala memeriksa klien untuk memperoleh data autentikasi terbaru.  Klien harus tetap berjalan dan diperbarui secara berkala.  Jika tidak, sinkronisasi repositori pada akhirnya akan gagal karena kesalahan autentikasi."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-rhui.adoc:15
msgid "Update any {redhat} 7 instance before connecting it."
msgstr "Perbarui setiap instans {redhat} 7 sebelum menghubungkannya."

#.  mc: this depends on the version of Jsch we use. The current version 0.1.55 only support rsa-ssh auth
#.      which is forbidden with the DEFAULT policy. If we decide to switch to a different implementation
#.      of Jsch (0.2.9 or higher) this limitation is gone and the note can be removed
#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-rhui.adoc:16
msgid "A {redhat} 9 instance needs to be configured with the crypto policy `LEGACY` to be able to connect it.  Execute `sudo update-crypto-policies --set LEGACY` to configure it accordingly."
msgstr "Instans {redhat} 9 harus dikonfigurasi dengan kebijakan kriptografi `LEGACY` agar dapat dihubungkan.  Jalankan `sudo update-crypto-policies --set LEGACY` untuk mengonfigurasinya."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-rhui.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid "Connecting to {redhat} update infrastructure"
msgstr "Menghubungkan ke infrastruktur pembaruan {redhat}"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-rhui.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Connecting new {redhat} instance"
msgstr "Prosedur: Menghubungkan instans {redhat} baru"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-rhui.adoc:19
msgid "In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Admin[Setup Wizard > {payg}], and click btn:[Add {payg}]."
msgstr "Pada {webui} {productname}, buka menu:Admin[Setup Wizard > {payg}], lalu klik btn:[Add {payg}]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-rhui.adoc:20
msgid "Start with the page section `{payg} connection Description`."
msgstr "Mulai dari bagian halaman `{payg} connection Description`."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-rhui.adoc:21
msgid "In the `Description` field, add the description."
msgstr "Pada kolom `Description`, tambahkan deskripsi."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-rhui.adoc:22
msgid "Move to the page section `Instance SSH connection data`."
msgstr "Beralih ke bagian halaman `Instance SSH connection data`."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-rhui.adoc:23
msgid "In the `Host` field, enter the instance DNS or IP address to connect from {productname}."
msgstr "Pada kolom `Host`, masukkan nama DNS atau alamat IP instans yang akan dihubungkan dari {productname}."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-rhui.adoc:24
msgid "In the `SSH Port` field, enter the port number or use default value 22."
msgstr "Pada kolom `SSH Port`, masukkan nomor port atau gunakan nilai default 22."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-rhui.adoc:25
msgid "In the `User` field, enter the username as specified in the cloud."
msgstr "Pada kolom `User`, masukkan nama pengguna yang ditetapkan di cloud."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-rhui.adoc:26
msgid "In the `Password` field, enter the password."
msgstr "Pada kolom `Password`, masukkan kata sandi."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-rhui.adoc:27
msgid "In the `SSH Private Key` field, enter the instance key."
msgstr "Pada kolom `SSH Private Key`, masukkan kunci instans."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-rhui.adoc:28
msgid "In the `SSH Private Key Passphrase` field, enter the key passphrase."
msgstr "Pada kolom `SSH Private Key Passphrase`, masukkan frasa sandi kunci."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-rhui.adoc:29
msgid "Authentication keys must always be in PEM format."
msgstr "Kunci autentikasi harus selalu dalam format PEM."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-rhui.adoc:30
msgid "If you are not connecting directly to the instance, but via SSH bastion, proceed with <<proc-adding-ssh-bastion-connection-data>>."
msgstr "Jika Anda tidak terhubung langsung ke instans, melainkan melalui bastion SSH, lanjutkan ke <<proc-adding-ssh-bastion-connection-data>>."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-rhui.adoc:31
msgid "Otherwise, continue with <<proc-finishing-rhui-connecting>>."
msgstr "Jika tidak, lanjutkan ke <<proc-finishing-rhui-connecting>>."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-rhui.adoc:32
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Adding SSH bastion connection data"
msgstr "Prosedur: Menambahkan data koneksi bastion SSH"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-rhui.adoc:33
msgid "Navigate to the page section `Bastion SSH connection data`."
msgstr "Buka bagian halaman `Bastion SSH connection data`."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-rhui.adoc:34
msgid "In the `Host` field, enter the bastion hostname."
msgstr "Pada kolom `Host`, masukkan nama host bastion."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-rhui.adoc:35
msgid "In the `SSH Port` field, enter the bastion port number."
msgstr "Pada kolom `SSH Port`, masukkan nomor port bastion."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-rhui.adoc:36
msgid "In the `User` field, enter the bastion username."
msgstr "Pada kolom `User`, masukkan nama pengguna bastion."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-rhui.adoc:37
msgid "In the `Password` field, enter the bastion password."
msgstr "Pada kolom `Password`, masukkan kata sandi bastion."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-rhui.adoc:38
msgid "In the `SSH Private Key` field, enter the bastion key."
msgstr "Pada kolom `SSH Private Key`, masukkan kunci bastion."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-rhui.adoc:39
msgid "In the `SSH Private Key Passphrase` field, enter the bastion key passphrase."
msgstr "Pada kolom `SSH Private Key Passphrase`, masukkan frasa sandi kunci bastion."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-rhui.adoc:40
msgid "Complete the setup with <<proc-finishing-rhui-connecting>>."
msgstr "Selesaikan penyiapan dengan mengikuti <<proc-finishing-rhui-connecting>>."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-rhui.adoc:41
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Finishing {redhat} connecting"
msgstr "Prosedur: Menyelesaikan koneksi {redhat}"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-rhui.adoc:42
msgid "To complete adding new {redhat} connection data, click btn:[Create]."
msgstr "Untuk menyelesaikan penambahan data koneksi {redhat} baru, klik btn:[Create]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-rhui.adoc:43
msgid "Return to {payg} connection data `Details` page."
msgstr "Kembali ke halaman `Details` data koneksi {payg}."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-rhui.adoc:44
msgid "The updated connection status is displayed on the top section named `Information`."
msgstr "Status koneksi terbaru ditampilkan di bagian atas yang bernama `Information`."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-rhui.adoc:45
msgid "Connection status is shown in `Admin > Setup Wizard > Pay-as-you-go` screen, too."
msgstr "Status koneksi juga ditampilkan pada layar `Admin > Setup Wizard > Pay-as-you-go`."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-rhui.adoc:46
msgid "If the authentication data for the instance is correct, the column `Status` shows `Credentials successfully updated.`"
msgstr "Jika data autentikasi instans benar, kolom `Status` menampilkan `Credentials successfully updated.`"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-rhui.adoc:47
msgid "If invalid data is entered at any point, the newly created instance is shown in `Admin > Setup Wizard > {payg}`, with column `Status` displaying an error message."
msgstr "Jika data yang tidak valid dimasukkan pada tahap mana pun, instans yang baru dibuat akan ditampilkan di `Admin > Setup Wizard > {payg}`, dengan kolom `Status` menampilkan pesan kesalahan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-rhui.adoc:48
msgid "As soon as the authentication data is available on the server, repositories were added for all available repositories on the connected instance.  The repositories can be seen in `Software > Manage > Repositories`"
msgstr "Segera setelah data autentikasi tersedia di server, repositori akan ditambahkan untuk semua repositori yang tersedia pada instans yang terhubung.  Repositori tersebut dapat dilihat di `Software > Manage > Repositories`"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-rhui.adoc:49
msgid "A {redhat} connection will create custom repositories which are owned by organization 1 by default.  If a different organization should own the autogenerated repositories, configure `java.rhui_default_org_id` in `/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`."
msgstr "Koneksi {redhat} akan membuat repositori kustom yang secara default dimiliki oleh organisasi 1.  Jika repositori yang dibuat secara otomatis harus dimiliki oleh organisasi lain, konfigurasikan `java.rhui_default_org_id` di `/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-rhui.adoc:50
msgid "This only defines and updates the repositories.  If you want to use a repository for a managed client, you need to specify a Software Channel and connect the repositories to it."
msgstr "Proses ini hanya mendefinisikan dan memperbarui repositori.  Jika Anda ingin menggunakan repositori untuk klien yang dikelola, Anda harus menentukan saluran perangkat lunak dan menghubungkan repositori tersebut ke saluran itu."

