#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-slemicro.adoc:29
msgid "{sle-micro} clients require a reboot after registering."
msgstr "Klien {sle-micro} harus dimulai ulang setelah pendaftaran."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-slemicro.adoc:30
msgid "Following the bootstrapping process, automatic booting is disabled on {sle-micro} clients. This change was implemented due to intermittent automatic reboots, which could occur before {salt} could relay the results of applying the bootstrap {salt} state."
msgstr "Setelah proses bootstrap, boot otomatis dinonaktifkan pada klien {sle-micro}. Perubahan ini diterapkan karena mulai ulang otomatis terkadang terjadi sebelum {salt} dapat menyampaikan hasil penerapan state bootstrap {salt}."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-slemicro.adoc:31
msgid "Although a reboot is automatically scheduled after registration is completed, it is respecting the default reboot manager maintenance window.  This window may be several hours after the client is registered.  It is advisable to manually reboot the client after the registration script finishes, to speed up the registration and to see the system appear in the system list."
msgstr "Meskipun mulai ulang dijadwalkan secara otomatis setelah pendaftaran selesai, pelaksanaannya tetap mengikuti jendela pemeliharaan default pengelola mulai ulang.  Jendela ini mungkin baru dimulai beberapa jam setelah klien didaftarkan.  Sebaiknya mulai ulang klien secara manual setelah skrip pendaftaran selesai untuk mempercepat pendaftaran dan memastikan sistem muncul dalam daftar sistem."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-slemicro.adoc:32
msgid "When using a bootstrap script with {sle-micro} systems, ensure that the certificate section of the script has this content:"
msgstr "Saat menggunakan skrip bootstrap pada sistem {sle-micro}, pastikan bagian sertifikat dalam skrip berisi konten berikut:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-slemicro.adoc:33
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-slmicro.adoc:34
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"ORG_CA_CERT=RHN-ORG-TRUSTED-SSL-CERT\n"
"ORG_CA_CERT_IS_RPM_YN=0\n"
msgstr ""
"ORG_CA_CERT=RHN-ORG-TRUSTED-SSL-CERT\n"
"ORG_CA_CERT_IS_RPM_YN=0\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-slemicro.adoc:34
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-slmicro.adoc:35
msgid "Either edit the bootstrap script directly and add the settings, or create the bootstrap script with these parameters:"
msgstr "Edit skrip bootstrap secara langsung dan tambahkan pengaturan tersebut, atau buat skrip bootstrap dengan parameter berikut:"

#.  2023-12-12, ke: remains in /srv, see
#.  https://github.com/uyuni-project/uyuni-docs/pull/2682/files#r1423757456
#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-slemicro.adoc:35
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mgrctl exec -ti -- mgr-bootstrap --script=bootstrap-sle-micro.sh \\\n"
"    --ssl-cert=/srv/www/htdocs/pub/RHN-ORG-TRUSTED-SSL-CERT\n"
msgstr ""
"mgrctl exec -ti -- mgr-bootstrap --script=bootstrap-sle-micro.sh \\\n"
"    --ssl-cert=/srv/www/htdocs/pub/RHN-ORG-TRUSTED-SSL-CERT\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-slemicro.adoc:36
#, no-wrap
msgid "Reboot {sle-micro}"
msgstr "Memulai Ulang {sle-micro}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-slemicro.adoc:37
msgid "{sle-micro} is a transactional system.  Transactional updates in general support several reboot methods.  It is recommended to use `systemd` for rebooting in systems managed by {productname}.  Using other methods can lead to undesired behavior."
msgstr "{sle-micro} adalah sistem transaksional.  Pembaruan transaksional umumnya mendukung beberapa metode mulai ulang.  Sebaiknya gunakan `systemd` untuk memulai ulang sistem yang dikelola oleh {productname}. Penggunaan metode lain dapat menyebabkan perilaku yang tidak diinginkan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-slemicro.adoc:38
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-slmicro.adoc:39
msgid "When bootstrapping a transactional system on {productname}, `systemd` will be configured as the reboot method (`REBOOT_METHOD`), if the system is in its default configuration.  Such a configuration allows {productname} to control the reboot action, and rebooting can be performed immediately or scheduled with {productname} as wanted."
msgstr "Saat melakukan bootstrap pada sistem transaksional di {productname}, `systemd` akan dikonfigurasi sebagai metode mulai ulang (`REBOOT_METHOD`) jika sistem menggunakan konfigurasi default.  Konfigurasi ini memungkinkan {productname} mengontrol tindakan mulai ulang, sehingga mulai ulang dapat dilakukan segera atau dijadwalkan melalui {productname} sesuai kebutuhan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-slemicro.adoc:40
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-slmicro.adoc:41
msgid "By default, the reboot method during client installation is set to `auto`.  With the `auto` boot method, `rebootmgrd` will be used to reboot the system according to the configured policies if the service is running.  Policies can be to reboot instantly or during a maintenance window.  For more information, see the `rebootmgrd`(8) man page.  Otherwise if `rebootmgrd` is not running, {productname} will call `systemctl reboot`."
msgstr "Secara default, metode mulai ulang selama instalasi klien diatur ke `auto`.  Dengan metode boot `auto`, `rebootmgrd` akan digunakan untuk memulai ulang sistem sesuai kebijakan yang dikonfigurasi jika layanan tersebut berjalan.  Kebijakan dapat menetapkan mulai ulang segera atau selama jendela pemeliharaan.  Untuk informasi lebih lanjut, lihat halaman manual `rebootmgrd`(8).  Jika `rebootmgrd` tidak berjalan, {productname} akan memanggil `systemctl reboot`."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-slemicro.adoc:41
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-slmicro.adoc:42
msgid "Using any method different from `systemd` may cause undesired behavior."
msgstr "Penggunaan metode selain `systemd` dapat menyebabkan perilaku yang tidak diinginkan."

#
#.  2023-05-23, ke: The rest is commented and the user will not see the
#.                  following remarks/background info:
#. Otherwise, the only thing mlm will be able to do is to ask for a reboot and it will be managed in the peculiarities of each reboot method. Not having control of when the reboot should happen, also takes away from mlm the ability to perform the reboot on its own maintenance windows, which is not the ideal configuration.
#. The user must be able to change reboot method at any time and SUSE Manager will keep it. But in this case we should alert in the documentation that using any method different from systemd may cause undesired behavior.
#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sleses.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Registering {sll} Clients"
msgstr "Mendaftarkan Klien {sll}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sleses.adoc:2
msgid "This section contains information about registering clients running {sll} operating systems.  {sll} clients are based on {rhel} or {centos}."
msgstr "Bagian ini berisi informasi tentang pendaftaran klien yang menjalankan sistem operasi {sll}.  Klien {sll} berbasis {rhel} atau {centos}."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sleses.adoc:3
msgid "{sll} clients are sometimes also called {sleses} (SLESES), Liberty, RES or {redhat} {es}."
msgstr "Klien {sll} terkadang juga disebut {sleses} (SLESES), Liberty, RES, atau {redhat} {es}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sleses.adoc:4
msgid "The {sll} software channels provided by {suse} only provide updates to packages, they do not provide the packages themselves.  To register {sll} clients, you need to register the {sll} Product (outlined below) to create the necessary base channel, then import any required {redhat} or {centos} packages as custom child channels.  You must obtain the initial packages directly from {redhat} or {centos} before you can apply the updates provided by the {sll} software channels."
msgstr "Saluran perangkat lunak {sll} yang disediakan oleh {suse} hanya menyediakan pembaruan paket, bukan paket itu sendiri.  Untuk mendaftarkan klien {sll}, Anda harus mendaftarkan Produk {sll} (dijelaskan di bawah) untuk membuat saluran dasar yang diperlukan, lalu mengimpor paket {redhat} atau {centos} yang diperlukan sebagai saluran turunan kustom.  Anda harus memperoleh paket awal langsung dari {redhat} atau {centos} sebelum dapat menerapkan pembaruan yang disediakan oleh saluran perangkat lunak {sll}."

#.  FIXME!
#.  Use list format: repository URLs / packages and metadata / version info
#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sleses.adoc:5
msgid "{sll} repository URLs are available from {scclongform}"
msgstr "URL repositori {sll} tersedia dari {scclongform}"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sleses.adoc:6
msgid "Packages and metadata are provided by {suse}"
msgstr "Paket dan metadata disediakan oleh {suse}"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sleses.adoc:8
msgid "You are responsible for arranging access to {redhat} or {centos} base media repositories and installation media."
msgstr "Anda bertanggung jawab untuk mengatur akses ke repositori media dasar dan media instalasi {redhat} atau {centos}."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sleses.adoc:9
msgid "You must obtain support from {suse} for all your {sll} systems."
msgstr "Anda harus memperoleh dukungan dari {suse} untuk semua sistem {sll} Anda."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sleses.adoc:10
msgid "{suse} does not provide support for {sll} systems on {uyuni}."
msgstr "{suse} tidak menyediakan dukungan untuk sistem {sll} di {uyuni}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sleses.adoc:12
msgid "For {sll} clients, some required packages are contained on the {rhel} or {centos} installation media.  You must have these packages installed before you can register a {sll} client."
msgstr "Untuk klien {sll}, beberapa paket yang diperlukan tersedia pada media instalasi {rhel} atau {centos}.  Paket-paket ini harus sudah terinstal sebelum Anda dapat mendaftarkan klien {sll}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sleses.adoc:13
msgid "The {sll} product is provided by {scclongform}.  This also includes the client tools package."
msgstr "Produk {sll} disediakan oleh {scclongform}.  Produk ini juga mencakup paket alat klien."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sleses.adoc:14
msgid "Before you register {sll} clients to your {productname} Server, you need to add the required software channels, and synchronize them."
msgstr "Sebelum mendaftarkan klien {sll} ke Server {productname}, Anda harus menambahkan saluran perangkat lunak yang diperlukan dan menyinkronkannya."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sleses.adoc:15
msgid "You need to select two different sets of channels, one for {sll} and the other for the Client Tools."
msgstr "Anda harus memilih dua set saluran yang berbeda, satu untuk {sll} dan satu lagi untuk Alat Klien."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sleses.adoc:16
msgid "You need an activation key associated with the correct {sll} channels.  For more information about activation keys, see xref:client-configuration:activation-keys.adoc[]."
msgstr "Anda memerlukan kunci aktivasi yang terkait dengan saluran {sll} yang sesuai.  Untuk informasi lebih lanjut tentang kunci aktivasi, lihat xref:client-configuration:activation-keys.adoc[]."

