#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sleses.adoc:29
#, no-wrap
msgid "Add base media"
msgstr "Menambahkan media dasar"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sleses.adoc:30
msgid "The {sll} software channels only provide updates, not the packages themselves.  To register {sll} clients, first register the {sll} Product (outlined below) to create the base channel, then import the necessary Red Hat or CentOS packages as custom child channels.  Initial packages must be obtained directly from {redhat} or {centos} before applying updates from {sll}.  Importantly, you do not need to maintain your Red Hat subscriptions, but consult your legal department to check for any ongoing payment obligations to Red Hat during migration.  To ensure you have all the packages you need, use a full DVD image, not a minimal or {jeos} image."
msgstr "Saluran perangkat lunak {sll} hanya menyediakan pembaruan, bukan paket itu sendiri.  Untuk mendaftarkan klien {sll}, daftarkan terlebih dahulu Produk {sll} (dijelaskan di bawah) untuk membuat saluran dasar, lalu impor paket Red Hat atau CentOS yang diperlukan sebagai saluran turunan kustom.  Paket awal harus diperoleh langsung dari {redhat} atau {centos} sebelum menerapkan pembaruan dari {sll}.  Penting untuk diketahui bahwa Anda tidak perlu mempertahankan langganan Red Hat, tetapi konsultasikan dengan departemen hukum Anda untuk memeriksa apakah masih ada kewajiban pembayaran kepada Red Hat selama migrasi.  Untuk memastikan semua paket yang diperlukan tersedia, gunakan image DVD lengkap, bukan image minimal atau {jeos}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sleses.adoc:31
msgid "You can use {productname} custom channels to set up the {rhel} or {centos} media.  All packages on the base media must be mirrored into a child channel."
msgstr "Anda dapat menggunakan saluran kustom {productname} untuk menyiapkan media {rhel} atau {centos}.  Semua paket pada media dasar harus dicerminkan ke saluran turunan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sleses.adoc:32
msgid "You can freely choose the names for the channels."
msgstr "Anda bebas menentukan nama saluran."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sleses.adoc:33
msgid "For {redhat} 10, 9 and 8 clients, add both the Base and AppStream channels.  You require packages from both channels.  If you do not add both channels, you cannot create the bootstrap repository, due to missing packages."
msgstr "Untuk klien {redhat} 10, 9, dan 8, tambahkan saluran Base dan AppStream.  Anda memerlukan paket dari kedua saluran tersebut.  Jika tidak menambahkan keduanya, Anda tidak dapat membuat repositori bootstrap karena ada paket yang tidak tersedia."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sleses.adoc:35
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Adding base media to custom channels (RHEL 7.0 example)"
msgstr "Prosedur: Menambahkan media dasar ke saluran kustom (contoh RHEL 7.0)"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sleses.adoc:36
msgid "You must use the original installation media from {redhat}.  You must use a major version release (for example `7`), not a minor release (for example `7.9`)."
msgstr "Anda harus menggunakan media instalasi asli dari {redhat}.  Anda harus menggunakan rilis versi mayor (misalnya `7`), bukan rilis minor (misalnya `7.9`)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sleses.adoc:37
msgid "Copy the base media image to the {productname} Server container host to the `/tmp/` directory."
msgstr "Salin image media dasar ke direktori `/tmp/` pada host kontainer Server {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sleses.adoc:38
msgid "To get the base media image into the {productname} Server container, use:"
msgstr "Untuk memasukkan image media dasar ke dalam kontainer Server {productname}, gunakan:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sleses.adoc:39
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgradm distribution copy /tmp/rhel-server-7.0-x86_64-dvd.iso rhel-server-7.0\n"
msgstr "mgradm distribution copy /tmp/rhel-server-7.0-x86_64-dvd.iso rhel-server-7.0\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sleses.adoc:40
msgid "The destination in the container will be `/srv/www/distributions/rhel-server-7.0`."
msgstr "Lokasi tujuan di dalam kontainer adalah `/srv/www/distributions/rhel-server-7.0`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sleses.adoc:41
msgid "Import the packages into the child channel you created earlier:"
msgstr "Impor paket ke saluran turunan yang telah Anda buat sebelumnya:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sleses.adoc:42
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgrctl exec -- spacewalk-repo-sync -c <channel-label> -u file:///srv/www/distributions/rhel-server-7.0/\n"
msgstr "mgrctl exec -- spacewalk-repo-sync -c <channel-label> -u file:///srv/www/distributions/rhel-server-7.0/\n"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sleses.adoc:43
msgid "For version 9 and 8 clients, adjust label and directories accordingly and additionally, synchronize both the Base and AppStream channels:"
msgstr "Untuk klien versi 9 dan 8, sesuaikan label dan direktori, serta sinkronkan saluran Base dan AppStream:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sleses.adoc:44
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mgrctl exec -- spacewalk-repo-sync -c <channel-label> -u file:///srv/www/distributions/rhel-server-9.0/BaseOS\n"
"mgrctl exec -- spacewalk-repo-sync -c <channel-label> -u file:///srv/www/distributions/rhel-server-9.0/AppStream\n"
msgstr ""
"mgrctl exec -- spacewalk-repo-sync -c <channel-label> -u file:///srv/www/distributions/rhel-server-9.0/BaseOS\n"
"mgrctl exec -- spacewalk-repo-sync -c <channel-label> -u file:///srv/www/distributions/rhel-server-9.0/AppStream\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sleses.adoc:45
msgid "Or:"
msgstr "Atau:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sleses.adoc:46
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mgrctl exec -- spacewalk-repo-sync -c <channel-label> -u file:///srv/www/distributions/rhel-server-8.0/BaseOS\n"
"mgrctl exec -- spacewalk-repo-sync -c <channel-label> -u file:///srv/www/distributions/rhel-server-8.0/AppStream\n"
msgstr ""
"mgrctl exec -- spacewalk-repo-sync -c <channel-label> -u file:///srv/www/distributions/rhel-server-8.0/BaseOS\n"
"mgrctl exec -- spacewalk-repo-sync -c <channel-label> -u file:///srv/www/distributions/rhel-server-8.0/AppStream\n"

#. type: Title ====
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sleses.adoc:47
#, no-wrap
msgid "OPTIONAL: Add base media from a content URL"
msgstr "OPSIONAL: Menambahkan media dasar dari URL konten"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sleses.adoc:48
msgid "Alternatively, if you have access to a content URL provided by {redhat} CDN or {centos}, you can create a custom repository to mirror the packages."
msgstr "Sebagai alternatif, jika Anda memiliki akses ke URL konten yang disediakan oleh CDN {redhat} atau {centos}, Anda dapat membuat repositori kustom untuk mencerminkan paket."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sleses.adoc:50
#, no-wrap
msgid "ES Custom Repository Settings"
msgstr "Pengaturan Repositori Kustom ES"

#. type: Table
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sleses.adoc:51
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Option                 | Parameter\n"
"| Repository URL         | The content URL provided by {redhat} CDN or {centos}\n"
"| Has Signed Metadata?   | Uncheck all {redhat} Enterprise repositories\n"
"| SSL CA Certificate     | `redhat-uep` ({redhat} only)\n"
"| SSL Client Certificate | `Entitlement-Cert-date` ({redhat} only)\n"
"| SSL Client Key         | `Entitlement-Key-date` ({redhat} only)\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"| Opsi                   | Parameter\n"
"| URL Repositori         | URL konten yang disediakan oleh CDN {redhat} atau {centos}\n"
"| Memiliki Metadata Bertanda Tangan? | Hapus centang untuk semua repositori {redhat} Enterprise\n"
"| Sertifikat CA SSL      | `redhat-uep` (hanya {redhat})\n"
"| Sertifikat Klien SSL   | `Entitlement-Cert-date` (hanya {redhat})\n"
"| Kunci Klien SSL        | `Entitlement-Key-date` (hanya {redhat})\n"
"\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sleses.adoc:53
msgid "The {sll} channels can be very large.  The initial channel synchronization can sometimes take up to several hours."
msgstr "Saluran {sll} dapat berukuran sangat besar.  Sinkronisasi awal saluran terkadang dapat memerlukan waktu hingga beberapa jam."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sleses.adoc:54
msgid "When the initial synchronization is complete, we recommended you clone the channel before you work with it.  This gives you a backup of the original synchronization data."
msgstr "Setelah sinkronisasi awal selesai, sebaiknya kloning saluran tersebut sebelum menggunakannya.  Dengan demikian, Anda memiliki cadangan data sinkronisasi asli."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sleses.adoc:58
#, no-wrap
msgid "Register {sll} clients"
msgstr "Mendaftarkan klien {sll}"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sleses.adoc:59
#, no-wrap
msgid "Migrate Enterprise Linux (EL) clients to {sll}"
msgstr "Memigrasikan klien Enterprise Linux (EL) ke {sll}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sleses.adoc:60
msgid "If an Enterprise Linux (EL) client such as {rhel} and {centos} is already registered as a minion on {productname} and users want to migrate it to {sll} they can use a re-activation key to apply the activation key that drives the migration."
msgstr "Jika klien Enterprise Linux (EL), seperti {rhel} dan {centos}, sudah terdaftar sebagai minion di {productname} dan pengguna ingin memigrasikannya ke {sll}, pengguna dapat menggunakan kunci aktivasi ulang untuk menerapkan kunci aktivasi yang menjalankan migrasi."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sleses.adoc:61
msgid "For more information about re-activation keys, see xref:client-configuration:activation-keys.adoc#activation-keys-reactivation[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi lebih lanjut tentang kunci aktivasi ulang, lihat xref:client-configuration:activation-keys.adoc#activation-keys-reactivation[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sleses.adoc:62
msgid "The re-activation key is per minion, and can be generated with the {webui} or using the API.  For more information, see https://documentation.suse.com/multi-linux-manager/5.2/api/docs/api/system.html#apidoc-system-obtainReactivationKey-loggedInUser-sid."
msgstr "Kunci aktivasi ulang berlaku untuk masing-masing minion dan dapat dibuat melalui {webui} atau menggunakan API.  Untuk informasi lebih lanjut, lihat https://documentation.suse.com/multi-linux-manager/5.2/api/docs/api/system.html#apidoc-system-obtainReactivationKey-loggedInUser-sid."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sleses.adoc:63
msgid "To re-activate a client, the user can run the bootstrap script on the client and pass the re-activation key as an environment variable.  Example:"
msgstr "Untuk mengaktifkan ulang klien, pengguna dapat menjalankan skrip bootstrap pada klien dan meneruskan kunci aktivasi ulang sebagai variabel lingkungan.  Contoh:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sleses.adoc:64
#, no-wrap
msgid "REACTIVATION_KEY=<KEY> ./bootstrap_liberate9.sh\n"
msgstr "REACTIVATION_KEY=<KEY> ./bootstrap_liberate9.sh\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sleses.adoc:65
msgid "Another method is to add some special flags to the {salt} client configuration file located at `/etc/venv-salt-minon/minion.d/susemanager.conf` (or `/etc/salt-minon/minion.d/susemanager.conf`) the following content (join this content with the already existing one):"
msgstr "Metode lain adalah menambahkan beberapa flag khusus ke berkas konfigurasi klien {salt} yang terletak di `/etc/venv-salt-minon/minion.d/susemanager.conf` (atau `/etc/salt-minon/minion.d/susemanager.conf`) dengan konten berikut (gabungkan konten ini dengan konten yang sudah ada):"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sleses.adoc:66
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"grains:\n"
"    susemanager:\n"
"        activation_key: \"<KEY_ID>\"\n"
"        management_key: \"MINION_REACTIVATION_KEY\"\n"
msgstr ""
"grains:\n"
"    susemanager:\n"
"        activation_key: \"<KEY_ID>\"\n"
"      management_key: \"MINION_REACTIVATION_KEY\"\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sleses.adoc:67
msgid "After changing the `susemanager.conf` file, the `salt-minion` service needs to be restarted on the {salt} server.  By default with:"
msgstr "Setelah berkas `susemanager.conf` diubah, layanan `salt-minion` harus dimulai ulang pada server {salt}.  Secara default, gunakan:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sleses.adoc:68
#, no-wrap
msgid "systemctl restart venv-salt-minon\n"
msgstr "systemctl restart venv-salt-minon\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sleses.adoc:69
msgid "Or for legacy {salt} with:"
msgstr "Atau, untuk {salt} versi lama, gunakan:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sleses.adoc:70
#, no-wrap
msgid "systemctl restart salt-minon\n"
msgstr "systemctl restart salt-minon\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sleses.adoc:71
#, no-wrap
msgid "The `liberate` formula"
msgstr "Formula `liberate`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sleses.adoc:72
msgid "Migrating Enterprise Linux (EL) clients to {sll} with the `liberate` formula.  For more information, see xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc[]."
msgstr "Memigrasikan klien Enterprise Linux (EL) ke {sll} menggunakan formula `liberate`.  Untuk informasi lebih lanjut, lihat xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-slmicro.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Registering {sl-micro} Clients"
msgstr "Mendaftarkan Klien {sl-micro}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-slmicro.adoc:2
msgid "This section contains information about registering clients running {sl-micro} operating system 6.0 {x86_64}, {arm64}, and {zsystems} (s390x)."
msgstr "Bagian ini berisi informasi tentang pendaftaran klien yang menjalankan sistem operasi {sl-micro} 6.0 pada arsitektur {x86_64}, {arm64}, dan {zsystems} (s390x)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-slmicro.adoc:3
msgid "The {sl-micro} uses transactional updates.  Transactional updates are atomic (all updates are applied only if all updates succeed) and support rollbacks.  They do not affect a running system as no changes are activated until after the system is rebooted."
msgstr "{sl-micro} menggunakan pembaruan transaksional.  Pembaruan transaksional bersifat atomik (semua pembaruan diterapkan hanya jika seluruh pembaruan berhasil) dan mendukung rollback.  Pembaruan ini tidak memengaruhi sistem yang sedang berjalan karena perubahan baru diaktifkan setelah sistem dimulai ulang."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-slmicro.adoc:4
msgid "For more information on transactional updates and rebooting, see https://documentation.suse.com/sles/15-SP7/html/SLES-all/cha-transactional-updates.html.  For managing {sl-micro} with {productname}, see xref:client-configuration:transactional-systems.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi lebih lanjut tentang pembaruan transaksional dan memulai ulang sistem, lihat https://documentation.suse.com/sles/15-SP7/html/SLES-all/cha-transactional-updates.html. Untuk mengelola {sl-micro} dengan {productname}, lihat xref:client-configuration:transactional-systems.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-slmicro.adoc:6
msgid "Before you register {sl-micro} clients to the {productname} Server, you need to add the required software channels, and synchronize them."
msgstr "Sebelum mendaftarkan klien {sl-micro} ke Server {productname}, Anda harus menambahkan saluran perangkat lunak yang diperlukan dan menyinkronkannya."

