#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-slmicro.adoc:32
msgid "{sl-micro} clients require a reboot after registering.  Although a reboot is automatically scheduled after registration is completed, it is respecting the default reboot manager maintenance window.  This window may be several hours after the client is registered.  It is advisable to manually reboot the client after the registration script finishes, to speed up the registration and to see the system appear in the system list."
msgstr "Klien {sl-micro} harus dimulai ulang setelah pendaftaran.  Meskipun mulai ulang dijadwalkan secara otomatis setelah pendaftaran selesai, pelaksanaannya tetap mengikuti jendela pemeliharaan default pengelola mulai ulang.  Jendela ini mungkin baru dimulai beberapa jam setelah klien didaftarkan.  Sebaiknya mulai ulang klien secara manual setelah skrip pendaftaran selesai untuk mempercepat pendaftaran dan memastikan sistem muncul dalam daftar sistem."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-slmicro.adoc:33
msgid "When using a bootstrap script with {sl-micro} systems, ensure that the certificate section of the script has this content:"
msgstr "Saat menggunakan skrip bootstrap pada sistem {sl-micro}, pastikan bagian sertifikat dalam skrip berisi konten berikut:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-slmicro.adoc:36
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mgrctl exec -ti -- mgr-bootstrap --script=bootstrap-sl-micro.sh \\\n"
"    --ssl-cert=/srv/www/htdocs/pub/RHN-ORG-TRUSTED-SSL-CERT\n"
msgstr ""
"mgrctl exec -ti -- mgr-bootstrap --script=bootstrap-sl-micro.sh \\\n"
"    --ssl-cert=/srv/www/htdocs/pub/RHN-ORG-TRUSTED-SSL-CERT\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-slmicro.adoc:37
#, no-wrap
msgid "Reboot {sl-micro}"
msgstr "Memulai Ulang {sl-micro}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-slmicro.adoc:38
msgid "{sl-micro} is a transactional system.  Transactional updates in general support several reboot methods.  It is recommended to use `systemd` for rebooting in systems managed by {productname}.  Using other methods can lead to undesired behavior."
msgstr "{sl-micro} adalah sistem transaksional.  Pembaruan transaksional umumnya mendukung beberapa metode mulai ulang.  Sebaiknya gunakan `systemd` untuk memulai ulang sistem yang dikelola oleh {productname}. Penggunaan metode lain dapat menyebabkan perilaku yang tidak diinginkan."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-tumbleweed.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Registering {opensuse} {tumbleweed} Clients"
msgstr "Mendaftarkan Klien {opensuse} {tumbleweed}"

#. type: Plain text
