#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-ubuntu.adoc:19
msgid "You need all the new channels fully synchronized before bootstrapping any Ubuntu client."
msgstr "Anda harus memastikan semua saluran baru telah tersinkronisasi sepenuhnya sebelum melakukan bootstrap pada klien Ubuntu mana pun."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-ubuntu.adoc:20
#, no-wrap
msgid "Mirror Ubuntu ESM packages"
msgstr "Mencerminkan paket Ubuntu ESM"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-ubuntu.adoc:21
msgid "Canonical provides https://ubuntu.com/security/esm[Expanded Security Maintenance] (**ESM**) packages for https://ubuntu.com/pro[Ubuntu Pro] users and customers.  These packages offer longer maintenance (_10 to 12 years_) for several operating system components and selected applications."
msgstr "Canonical menyediakan paket https://ubuntu.com/security/esm[Expanded Security Maintenance] (**ESM**) bagi pengguna dan pelanggan https://ubuntu.com/pro[Ubuntu Pro].  Paket-paket ini menawarkan masa pemeliharaan yang lebih lama (_10 hingga 12 tahun_) untuk beberapa komponen sistem operasi dan aplikasi tertentu."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-ubuntu.adoc:22
msgid "These repositories can also be synchronized within {productname} if you extract the required **GPG keys** and your personal **Bearer Token** from a system registered to Ubuntu Pro."
msgstr "Repositori ini juga dapat disinkronkan di {productname} jika Anda mengekstrak **kunci GPG** yang diperlukan dan **Bearer Token** pribadi Anda dari sistem yang terdaftar di Ubuntu Pro."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-ubuntu.adoc:23
#, no-wrap
msgid "Extract GPG keys and Bearer Token"
msgstr "Mengekstrak kunci GPG dan Bearer Token"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-ubuntu.adoc:24
msgid "Register an Ubuntu host with Ubuntu Pro.  You will find your personal registration token in the https://ubuntu.com/pro/dashboard[Ubuntu Pro Dashbaord].  An https://login.ubuntu.com/[Ubuntu One acconut] is required for this."
msgstr "Daftarkan host Ubuntu ke Ubuntu Pro.  Anda dapat menemukan token pendaftaran pribadi Anda di https://ubuntu.com/pro/dashboard[Dasbor Ubuntu Pro].  Akun https://login.ubuntu.com/[Ubuntu One] diperlukan untuk proses ini."

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-ubuntu.adoc:25
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"sudo apt-get install ubuntu-advantage-tools\n"
"sudo pro attach <perosnal_token>\n"
msgstr ""
"sudo apt-get install ubuntu-advantage-tools\n"
"sudo pro attach <perosnal_token>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-ubuntu.adoc:26
msgid "After registration, you will find the Bearer Token in the file `/etc/apt/auth.conf.d/90ubuntu-advantage`:"
msgstr "Setelah pendaftaran, Anda dapat menemukan Bearer Token di berkas `/etc/apt/auth.conf.d/90ubuntu-advantage`:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-ubuntu.adoc:27
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"machine esm.ubuntu.com/apps/ubuntu/ login bearer password <token>  # ubuntu-pro-client\n"
"machine esm.ubuntu.com/infra/ubuntu/ login bearer password <token>  # ubuntu-pro-client\n"
msgstr ""
"machine esm.ubuntu.com/apps/ubuntu/ login bearer password <token>  # ubuntu-pro-client\n"
"machine esm.ubuntu.com/infra/ubuntu/ login bearer password <token>  # ubuntu-pro-client\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-ubuntu.adoc:28
msgid "One dedicated bearer token is used per repository."
msgstr "Satu bearer token khusus digunakan untuk setiap repositori."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-ubuntu.adoc:29
msgid "Configure the following repositories within {productname}:"
msgstr "Konfigurasikan repositori berikut di {productname}:"

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-ubuntu.adoc:30
#, no-wrap
msgid "Configure Ubuntu ESM repositories"
msgstr "Mengonfigurasi repositori Ubuntu ESM"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-ubuntu.adoc:31
msgid "Use the following URLs for creating the repositories:"
msgstr "Gunakan URL berikut untuk membuat repositori:"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-ubuntu.adoc:32
#, no-wrap
msgid "Ubuntu ESM repositories"
msgstr "Repositori Ubuntu ESM"

#. type: Table
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-ubuntu.adoc:33
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| URL     | Description\n"
"| https://bearer:<token>@esm.ubuntu.com/infra/ubuntu/dists/<release>-infra-updates/main/binary-<arch>/ | Operating system functional updates\n"
"| https://bearer:<token>@esm.ubuntu.com/infra/ubuntu/dists/<release>-infra-security/main/binary-<arch>/ | Operating system security updates\n"
"| https://bearer:<token>@esm.ubuntu.com/apps/ubuntu/dists/<release>-apps-updates/main/binary-<arch>/ | Application functional updates\n"
"| https://bearer:<token>@esm.ubuntu.com/apps/ubuntu/dists/<release>-apps-security/main/binary-<arch>/ | Application security updates\n"
msgstr ""
"| URL     | Deskripsi\n"
"| https://bearer:<token>@esm.ubuntu.com/infra/ubuntu/dists/<release>-infra-updates/main/binary-<arch>/ | Pembaruan fungsional sistem operasi\n"
"| https://bearer:<token>@esm.ubuntu.com/infra/ubuntu/dists/<release>-infra-security/main/binary-<arch>/ | Pembaruan keamanan sistem operasi\n"
"| https://bearer:<token>@esm.ubuntu.com/apps/ubuntu/dists/<release>-apps-updates/main/binary-<arch>/ | Pembaruan fungsional aplikasi\n"
"| https://bearer:<token>@esm.ubuntu.com/apps/ubuntu/dists/<release>-apps-security/main/binary-<arch>/ | Pembaruan keamanan aplikasi\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-ubuntu.adoc:34
msgid "Replace `<token>` with your personal Bearer Token. Also, `arch` and `release` must be replaced with one of the following values:"
msgstr "Ganti `<token>` dengan Bearer Token pribadi Anda. Selain itu, `arch` dan `release` harus diganti dengan salah satu nilai berikut:"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-ubuntu.adoc:35
#, no-wrap
msgid "Ubuntu ESM architectures and releases"
msgstr "Arsitektur dan rilis Ubuntu ESM"

#. type: Table
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-ubuntu.adoc:36
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Architectures | Releases\n"
"| `amd64`, `arm64`, `armel`, `armhf`, `i386`, `powerpc`, `ppc64el`, `s390x` | `bionic`, `focal`, `jammy`, `noble`, `resolute`, `trusty`, `xenial`\n"
msgstr ""
"| Arsitektur | Rilis\n"
"| `amd64`, `arm64`, `armel`, `armhf`, `i386`, `powerpc`, `ppc64el`, `s390x` | `bionic`, `focal`, `jammy`, `noble`, `resolute`, `trusty`, `xenial`\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-ubuntu.adoc:37
msgid "In order for {productname} to synchronize the repositories, the corresponding GPG keys (`ubuntu-advantage-esm-infra-trusty.gpg`, `ubuntu-advantage-esm-apps.gpg`) must be imported. These are located on a system registered with Ubuntu Pro under `/etc/apt/trusted.gpg.d`. Copy these files to the {productname} system and import them as follows:"
msgstr "Agar {productname} dapat menyinkronkan repositori, kunci GPG yang sesuai (`ubuntu-advantage-esm-infra-trusty.gpg`, `ubuntu-advantage-esm-apps.gpg`) harus diimpor. Kunci-kunci ini berada di direktori `/etc/apt/trusted.gpg.d` pada sistem yang terdaftar di Ubuntu Pro. Salin berkas-berkas ini ke sistem {productname}, lalu impor sebagai berikut:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-ubuntu.adoc:38
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgrctl gpg upload /path/to/gpg.key\n"
msgstr "mgrctl gpg upload /path/to/gpg.key\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-ubuntu.adoc:39
msgid "Create the appropriate child channels below already synchronized {ubuntu} parent channels. After that, repositories can be synchronized."
msgstr "Buat saluran turunan yang sesuai di bawah saluran induk {ubuntu} yang sudah disinkronkan. Setelah itu, repositori dapat disinkronkan."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-ubuntu.adoc:40
msgid "The procedure shown here can be used to circumvent the subscription limitations - however, this constitutes a breach of the Terms of Service and may have **legal consequences**. There must always be sufficient subscriptions for the number of systems used."
msgstr "Prosedur yang ditunjukkan di sini dapat digunakan untuk mengakali batasan langganan, tetapi tindakan ini merupakan pelanggaran Ketentuan Layanan dan dapat menimbulkan **konsekuensi hukum**. Jumlah langganan harus selalu mencukupi jumlah sistem yang digunakan."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-ubuntu.adoc:42
msgid "{ubuntu} channels can be very large.  Synchronization can sometimes take several hours."
msgstr "Saluran {ubuntu} dapat berukuran sangat besar.  Sinkronisasi terkadang dapat memerlukan waktu beberapa jam."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-ubuntu.adoc:48
msgid "The root user on {ubuntu} is disabled by default for SSH access.  To onboard using a regular user, you must edit the `sudoers` file on the client system."
msgstr "Secara default, akses SSH untuk pengguna root pada {ubuntu} dinonaktifkan.  Untuk melakukan onboarding menggunakan pengguna biasa, Anda harus mengedit berkas `sudoers` pada sistem klien."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-ubuntu.adoc:50
#, no-wrap
msgid "Bootstrap as install-created user via SSH"
msgstr "Melakukan bootstrap sebagai pengguna yang dibuat saat instalasi melalui SSH"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-ubuntu.adoc:51
msgid "To bootstrap an Ubuntu client via SSH you must add the install-created user to the sudo group.  Then run the bootstrap script from the client."
msgstr "Untuk melakukan bootstrap pada klien Ubuntu melalui SSH, Anda harus menambahkan pengguna yang dibuat saat instalasi ke grup sudo.  Kemudian, jalankan skrip bootstrap dari klien."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-ubuntu.adoc:52
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Adding install-created user to sudo group and bootstrapping via SSH"
msgstr "Prosedur: Menambahkan pengguna yang dibuat saat instalasi ke grup sudo dan melakukan bootstrap melalui SSH"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-ubuntu.adoc:53
msgid "On the client, as root, run from the command line (replace `<username>` with the name of the install-created user):"
msgstr "Pada klien, sebagai root, jalankan perintah berikut dari baris perintah (ganti `<username>` dengan nama pengguna yang dibuat saat instalasi):"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-ubuntu.adoc:54
#, no-wrap
msgid "sudo usermod -aG sudo <username>\n"
msgstr "sudo usermod -aG sudo <username>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-ubuntu.adoc:55
msgid "Bootstrap the client system from its command line (replace `<SERVER_FQDN>` with the fully qualified domain name of the {productname} Server):"
msgstr "Lakukan bootstrap pada sistem klien dari baris perintahnya (ganti `<SERVER_FQDN>` dengan nama domain lengkap Server {productname}):"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-ubuntu.adoc:56
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"sudo su -\n"
"curl -Sks https://<SERVER_FQDN>/pub/bootstrap/bootstrap-script.sh | /bin/bash\n"
msgstr ""
"sudo su -\n"
"curl -Sks https://<SERVER_FQDN>/pub/bootstrap/bootstrap-script.sh | /bin/bash\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-ubuntu.adoc:57
msgid "{ubuntu} can only be bootstrapped using the corresponding {ubuntu} bootstrap script run from the client system's command line after issuing `sudo su -` as above.  It cannot be bootstrapped via the {productname} {webui} due to the fact that the root user is disabled on {ubuntu} by default, and that the {webui} does not permit for privilege escalation of the {ubuntu} install-created user."
msgstr "Bootstrap pada {ubuntu} hanya dapat dilakukan menggunakan skrip bootstrap {ubuntu} yang sesuai, yang dijalankan dari baris perintah sistem klien setelah menjalankan `sudo su -` seperti di atas.  Bootstrap tidak dapat dilakukan melalui {webui} {productname} karena pengguna root pada {ubuntu} dinonaktifkan secara default, dan {webui} tidak mengizinkan peningkatan hak akses bagi pengguna {ubuntu} yang dibuat saat instalasi."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/configuration-basics.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Configuration Basics"
msgstr "Dasar-Dasar Konfigurasi"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/configuration-basics.adoc:2
msgid "{productname} requires a number of steps to prepare the environment for clients registration before a wide range of its operations can be utilized."
msgstr "{productname} memerlukan sejumlah langkah untuk menyiapkan lingkungan bagi pendaftaran klien sebelum berbagai operasinya dapat digunakan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/configuration-basics.adoc:3
msgid "This section contains summary of the initial configuration steps that are necessary to support environment operations following successful {productname} installation and setting up."
msgstr "Bagian ini berisi ringkasan langkah-langkah konfigurasi awal yang diperlukan untuk mendukung pengoperasian lingkungan setelah instalasi dan penyiapan {productname} berhasil diselesaikan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/configuration-basics.adoc:4
msgid "For more information about installing and setting up {productname}, see xref:installation-and-upgrade:uyuni-installation-and-upgrade-overview.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi lebih lanjut tentang instalasi dan penyiapan {productname}, lihat xref:installation-and-upgrade:uyuni-installation-and-upgrade-overview.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/configuration-management.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Configuration Management"
msgstr "Manajemen Konfigurasi"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/configuration-management.adoc:2
msgid "You can use configuration files and channels to manage configuration for your clients, rather than configuring each client manually."
msgstr "Anda dapat menggunakan berkas dan saluran konfigurasi untuk mengelola konfigurasi klien, alih-alih mengonfigurasi setiap klien secara manual."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/configuration-management.adoc:3
msgid "Configuration parameters are scripted and stored in configuration files.  You can write configuration files directly using the {productname} {webui}, or you can upload or link to files that exist in other locations."
msgstr "Parameter konfigurasi ditulis dalam skrip dan disimpan dalam berkas konfigurasi.  Anda dapat menulis berkas konfigurasi secara langsung menggunakan {webui} {productname}, atau mengunggah maupun menautkan berkas yang berada di lokasi lain."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/configuration-management.adoc:4
msgid "Configuration channels are used to organize configuration files.  You can subscribe clients to configuration channels, and deploy configuration files as required."
msgstr "Saluran konfigurasi digunakan untuk mengatur berkas konfigurasi.  Anda dapat mendaftarkan klien untuk berlangganan saluran konfigurasi dan menerapkan berkas konfigurasi sesuai kebutuhan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/configuration-management.adoc:5
msgid "Configuration files are version-controlled, so you can add configuration settings, test them on your clients, and roll back to a previous revision as required.  When you have created your configuration channels, you can also perform comparisons between various configuration files, and between revisions of the same configuration file."
msgstr "Berkas konfigurasi dikelola dengan kontrol versi, sehingga Anda dapat menambahkan pengaturan konfigurasi, mengujinya pada klien, dan mengembalikannya ke revisi sebelumnya sesuai kebutuhan.  Setelah membuat saluran konfigurasi, Anda juga dapat membandingkan berbagai berkas konfigurasi serta membandingkan revisi dari berkas konfigurasi yang sama."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/configuration-management.adoc:6
msgid "Configuration files are provided through Configuration Channels or State Channels."
msgstr "Berkas konfigurasi disediakan melalui Saluran Konfigurasi atau Saluran State."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/configuration-management.adoc:7
msgid "This table shows the supported features, where:"
msgstr "Tabel ini menunjukkan fitur yang didukung, dengan keterangan:"

