#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-overview-suse.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "SUSE Client Registration"
msgstr "Pendaftaran Klien SUSE"

#.  SUSE Liberty Linux not available at Uyuni for now
#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-overview-suse.adoc:2
msgid "You can register {sle} and {sleses} clients to {productname} Server."
msgstr "Anda dapat mendaftarkan klien {sle} dan {sleses} ke {productname} Server."

#.  SUSE Liberty Linux not available at Uyuni for now
#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-overview-suse.adoc:3
msgid "You can register {sle} clients to {productname} Server."
msgstr "Anda dapat mendaftarkan klien {sle} ke Server {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-overview-suse.adoc:4
msgid "To register a new client to {productname} Server, first synchronize software channels for the new client's operating system and architecture by using either the {webui} or command line tools."
msgstr "Untuk mendaftarkan klien baru ke Server {productname}, sinkronkan terlebih dahulu saluran perangkat lunak untuk sistem operasi dan arsitektur klien baru tersebut menggunakan {webui} atau alat baris perintah."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-overview-suse.adoc:5
msgid "Then, synchronize the client tool repository for the newly added operating system by using command line tools."
msgstr "Kemudian, sinkronkan repositori alat klien untuk sistem operasi yang baru ditambahkan menggunakan alat baris perintah."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-overview-suse.adoc:6
msgid "The method and details varies depending on the client's operating system.  This is described in the following sections."
msgstr "Metode dan perinciannya berbeda-beda, bergantung pada sistem operasi klien.  Hal ini dijelaskan pada bagian-bagian berikut."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-overview-suse.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "Preliminary Steps or Checks"
msgstr "Langkah atau Pemeriksaan Awal"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-overview-suse.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "Check Previous Registration Status"
msgstr "Periksa Status Pendaftaran Sebelumnya"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-overview-suse.adoc:12
msgid "If the client was registered to SCC, SMT, or RMT previously, remove such a registration with `SUSEConnect` before migrating the client to {productname} Server.  Do not forget to remove the old registration first.  Otherwise repositories that are no longer needed, will be added to the client after the client has been migrated to a newer version of a {suse} operating system with {productname}."
msgstr "Jika klien sebelumnya terdaftar ke SCC, SMT, atau RMT, hapus pendaftaran tersebut menggunakan `SUSEConnect` sebelum memigrasikan klien ke Server {productname}.  Jangan lupa untuk menghapus pendaftaran lama terlebih dahulu.  Jika tidak, repositori yang tidak lagi diperlukan akan ditambahkan ke klien setelah klien dimigrasikan ke versi sistem operasi {suse} yang lebih baru menggunakan {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-overview-suse.adoc:13
msgid "To de-register a {sle} 12 or 15 client, on the client, as root, execute:"
msgstr "Untuk membatalkan pendaftaran klien {sle} 12 atau 15, jalankan perintah berikut pada klien sebagai root:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-overview-suse.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"SUSEConnect --de-register\n"
"SUSEConnect --cleanup\n"
msgstr ""
"SUSEConnect --de-register\n"
"SUSEConnect --cleanup\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-overview-suse.adoc:15
msgid "For more information about detailed cleanup commands and verification steps, see https://www.suse.com/de-de/support/kb/doc/?id=000019054."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang perintah pembersihan terperinci dan langkah-langkah verifikasi, lihat https://www.suse.com/de-de/support/kb/doc/?id=000019054."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-overview-ubuntu.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Ubuntu Client Registration"
msgstr "Pendaftaran Klien Ubuntu"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-overview-ubuntu.adoc:2
msgid "You can register {ubuntu} clients to your {productname} Server.  The method and details varies depending on the operating system of the client."
msgstr "Anda dapat mendaftarkan klien {ubuntu} ke Server {productname} Anda.  Metode dan perinciannya berbeda-beda, bergantung pada sistem operasi klien."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-overview.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Client Registration"
msgstr "Pendaftaran Klien"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-overview.adoc:2
msgid "There are several ways to register clients to your {productname} Server.  This section covers the various available methods.  It also contains information specific to the operating system you intend to run on the client."
msgstr "Ada beberapa cara untuk mendaftarkan klien ke Server {productname} Anda.  Bagian ini membahas berbagai metode yang tersedia.  Bagian ini juga memuat informasi khusus untuk sistem operasi yang akan Anda jalankan pada klien."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-overview.adoc:3
msgid "Before you begin, check that:"
msgstr "Sebelum memulai, pastikan bahwa:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-overview.adoc:4
msgid "The client has the date and time synchronized correctly with the {productname} Server before registration."
msgstr "Tanggal dan waktu klien telah disinkronkan dengan benar dengan Server {productname} sebelum pendaftaran."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-overview.adoc:5
msgid "You have created an activation key.  For more information about creating activation keys, see xref:client-configuration:activation-keys.adoc[]."
msgstr "Anda telah membuat kunci aktivasi.  Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang pembuatan kunci aktivasi, lihat xref:client-configuration:activation-keys.adoc[]."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-overview.adoc:7
msgid "Once a client system has been bootstrapped, the **Installer Updates** channel should be removed.  The standard update channel already includes the necessary updates, making this channel redundant."
msgstr "Setelah proses bootstrap pada sistem klien selesai, saluran **Installer Updates** harus dihapus.  Saluran pembaruan standar sudah mencakup pembaruan yang diperlukan, sehingga saluran ini tidak lagi diperlukan."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-overview.adoc:9
msgid "Do not register the {productname} Server base OS to {productname} itself.  The {productname} Server base OS must be managed individually or by using another separate {productname} Server."
msgstr "Jangan mendaftarkan sistem operasi dasar Server {productname} ke {productname} itu sendiri.  Sistem operasi dasar Server {productname} harus dikelola secara terpisah atau menggunakan Server {productname} lain."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-overview.adoc:10
msgid "To manage {productname} Server Containers, use the `mgradm` tool."
msgstr "Untuk mengelola Kontainer Server {productname}, gunakan alat `mgradm`."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-sudo.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Root Access and sudo Configuration"
msgstr "Akses Root dan Konfigurasi sudo"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-sudo.adoc:2
msgid "Many operating systems (such as {ubuntu}, {debian}, {raspberrypios}, and {sle} 16) disable SSH access for the `root` user by default, or are installed without configuring a `root` password.  To onboard these clients, you can use a regular, unprivileged user that has passwordless `sudo` privileges configured for the necessary Python and Salt minion binaries."
msgstr "Banyak sistem operasi (seperti {ubuntu}, {debian}, {raspberrypios}, dan {sle} 16) menonaktifkan akses SSH untuk pengguna `root` secara default, atau diinstal tanpa mengonfigurasi kata sandi `root`.  Untuk mengintegrasikan klien ini, Anda dapat menggunakan pengguna biasa tanpa hak istimewa yang telah dikonfigurasi dengan hak akses `sudo` tanpa kata sandi untuk berkas biner Python dan Salt minion yang diperlukan."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-sudo.adoc:3
msgid "This configuration is required only for bootstrapping and registering the client.  Once the client is successfully registered, the {productname} agent runs with `root` privileges, and this temporary passwordless `sudo` access is no longer required.  For security reasons, we recommend removing these lines from the `sudoers` file after registration is complete."
msgstr "Konfigurasi ini hanya diperlukan untuk proses bootstrap dan pendaftaran klien.  Setelah klien berhasil didaftarkan, agen {productname} berjalan dengan hak istimewa `root`, dan akses `sudo` sementara tanpa kata sandi ini tidak lagi diperlukan.  Demi keamanan, kami menyarankan agar Anda menghapus baris-baris ini dari berkas `sudoers` setelah pendaftaran selesai."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-sudo.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "Grant non-root user sudo access"
msgstr "Berikan akses sudo kepada pengguna non-root"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-sudo.adoc:5
msgid "To onboard a client using a non-root user, you must edit the `sudoers` file on the client system to grant passwordless privilege escalation for specific commands."
msgstr "Untuk mengintegrasikan klien menggunakan pengguna non-root, Anda harus mengedit berkas `sudoers` pada sistem klien guna mengizinkan peningkatan hak istimewa tanpa kata sandi untuk perintah tertentu."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-sudo.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Granting passwordless sudo access"
msgstr "Prosedur: Memberikan akses sudo tanpa kata sandi"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-sudo.adoc:7
msgid "On the client, edit the `sudoers` file by running:"
msgstr "Pada klien, edit berkas `sudoers` dengan menjalankan:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-sudo.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "sudo visudo\n"
msgstr "sudo visudo\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-sudo.adoc:9
msgid "At the end of the file, add the following line. Replace `<user>` with the name of the user that is bootstrapping the client:"
msgstr "Tambahkan baris berikut di akhir berkas. Ganti `<user>` dengan nama pengguna yang menjalankan proses bootstrap pada klien:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-sudo.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "<user>  ALL=NOPASSWD: /var/tmp/venv-salt-minion/bin/python\n"
msgstr "<user>  ALL=NOPASSWD: /var/tmp/venv-salt-minion/bin/python\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-sudo.adoc:11
msgid "For older operating systems (such as {sle} 15) using a legacy manual `salt-minion` registration setup instead of the default Salt Bundle, `/usr/bin/python3` might still be required for privilege escalation:"
msgstr "Untuk sistem operasi lama (seperti {sle} 15) yang menggunakan konfigurasi pendaftaran `salt-minion` manual lama, bukan Salt Bundle default, `/usr/bin/python3` mungkin masih diperlukan untuk peningkatan hak istimewa:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-sudo.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid "<user>  ALL=NOPASSWD: /usr/bin/python3, /var/tmp/venv-salt-minion/bin/python\n"
msgstr "<user>  ALL=NOPASSWD: /usr/bin/python3, /var/tmp/venv-salt-minion/bin/python\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-sudo.adoc:13
msgid "Self-installed versions of operating systems require passwordless privilege escalation because the {webui} and bootstrap scripts do not support interactive password entry during the privilege escalation step.  For cloud instances, this is often handled automatically by `cloud-init`, which sets up sudoers configurations for default users."
msgstr "Sistem operasi yang diinstal sendiri memerlukan peningkatan hak istimewa tanpa kata sandi karena {webui} dan skrip bootstrap tidak mendukung pemasukan kata sandi secara interaktif selama tahap peningkatan hak istimewa.  Untuk instans cloud, hal ini sering ditangani secara otomatis oleh `cloud-init`, yang menyiapkan konfigurasi sudoers untuk pengguna default."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-webui.adoc:1
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-webui.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "Register Clients With the {webui}"
msgstr "Daftarkan Klien Menggunakan {webui}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-webui.adoc:3
msgid "Bootstrapping clients with the {webui} is using xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-ssh.adoc[Salt SSH] to execute the bootstrap process on the client.  Salt SSH uses the Salt Bundle with the Python interpreter included.  Therefore, no other Python interpreter needs to be installed on the client."
msgstr "Proses bootstrap klien melalui {webui} menggunakan xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-ssh.adoc[Salt SSH] untuk menjalankan proses bootstrap pada klien.  Salt SSH menggunakan Salt Bundle yang sudah menyertakan interpreter Python.  Oleh karena itu, tidak perlu menginstal interpreter Python lain pada klien."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-webui.adoc:4
msgid "Salt Bundle is made available together with the bootstrap repository. Therefore the bootstrap repository must be created before starting the bootstrap process for the client.  A shell script detects the operating system on the client and deploys the Salt Bundle from the appropriate bootstrap repository, using the same logic as the bootstrap script."
msgstr "Salt Bundle tersedia bersama repositori bootstrap. Oleh karena itu, repositori bootstrap harus dibuat sebelum memulai proses bootstrap klien.  Skrip shell mendeteksi sistem operasi pada klien dan menerapkan Salt Bundle dari repositori bootstrap yang sesuai, menggunakan logika yang sama dengan skrip bootstrap."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-webui.adoc:5
msgid "For more information, see xref:client-configuration:bootstrap-repository.adoc#_prepare_to_create_a_bootstrap_repository[Prepare to Create a Bootstrap Repository]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya, lihat xref:client-configuration:bootstrap-repository.adoc#_prepare_to_create_a_bootstrap_repository[Persiapan Membuat Repositori Bootstrap]."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-webui.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Registering Clients With the {webui}"
msgstr "Prosedur: Mendaftarkan Klien Menggunakan {webui}"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-webui.adoc:15
msgid "Select an `Authentication` method:"
msgstr "Pilih metode `Authentication`:"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-webui.adoc:16
msgid "To bootstrap the client with an SSH key, in the `Authentication` field, check `SSH Private Key`, and upload the SSH private key to use to log in to the client."
msgstr "Untuk menjalankan bootstrap klien dengan kunci SSH, pada kolom `Authentication`, centang `SSH Private Key`, lalu unggah kunci privat SSH yang akan digunakan untuk masuk ke klien."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-webui.adoc:17
msgid "If your SSH private key requires a passphrase, type it into the `SSH Private Key Passphrase` field, or leave it blank for no passphrase."
msgstr "Jika kunci privat SSH Anda memerlukan frasa sandi, masukkan frasa sandi tersebut pada kolom `SSH Private Key Passphrase`, atau biarkan kosong jika tidak menggunakan frasa sandi."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-webui.adoc:18
msgid "To bootstrap the client with a password, in the `Authentication` field, check `Password`, and type the password to log in to the client."
msgstr "Untuk menjalankan bootstrap klien dengan kata sandi, pada kolom `Authentication`, centang `Password`, lalu masukkan kata sandi untuk masuk ke klien."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-webui.adoc:21
msgid "OPTIONAL: In the `Reactivation Key` field, paste in the desired reactivation key."
msgstr "OPSIONAL: Pada kolom `Reactivation Key`, tempelkan kunci aktivasi ulang yang diinginkan."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-webui.adoc:22
msgid "For more information, see xref:client-configuration:activation-keys.adoc#activation-keys-reactivation[Reactivation Keys]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya, lihat xref:client-configuration:activation-keys.adoc#activation-keys-reactivation[Kunci Aktivasi Ulang]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-webui.adoc:23
msgid "OPTIONAL: In the `Proxy` field, select the proxy to register the client to."
msgstr "OPSIONAL: Pada kolom `Proxy`, pilih proksi yang akan digunakan untuk mendaftarkan klien."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-webui.adoc:27
msgid "If you check this option, the client is configured to use SSH for its connection to the server, and no other contact method is configured."
msgstr "Jika Anda mencentang opsi ini, klien dikonfigurasi untuk menggunakan SSH sebagai koneksinya ke server, dan tidak ada metode kontak lain yang dikonfigurasi."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-webui.adoc:28
msgid "For more information about contact methods, see xref:client-configuration:contact-methods-intro.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang metode kontak, lihat xref:client-configuration:contact-methods-intro.adoc[]."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-webui.adoc:31
msgid "SSH private keys are stored only for the duration of the bootstrapping process.  They are deleted from the {productname} Server as soon as bootstrapping is complete."
msgstr "Kunci privat SSH hanya disimpan selama proses bootstrapping berlangsung.  Kunci tersebut dihapus dari Server {productname} segera setelah bootstrapping selesai."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-webui.adoc:32
msgid "When new packages or updates are installed on the client using {productname}, any end user license agreements (EULAs) are automatically accepted.  To review a package EULA, open the package details page in the {webui}."
msgstr "Saat paket atau pembaruan baru diinstal pada klien menggunakan {productname}, semua perjanjian lisensi pengguna akhir (EULA) diterima secara otomatis.  Untuk meninjau EULA suatu paket, buka halaman perincian paket di {webui}."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-webui.adoc:33
#, no-wrap
msgid "Handling of Locally Assigned Repositories"
msgstr "Penanganan Repositori yang Ditetapkan Secara Lokal"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-webui.adoc:34
msgid "Having repositories assigned directly to clients not served by {productname} is not a common use case.  It can cause trouble.  Therfore bootstrapping via Salt disables all local repositories at the beginning of the bootstrap process."
msgstr "Penetapan repositori yang tidak disediakan oleh {productname} secara langsung ke klien bukanlah penggunaan yang umum.  Hal ini dapat menimbulkan masalah.  Oleh karena itu, proses bootstrap melalui Salt menonaktifkan semua repositori lokal pada awal proses bootstrap."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-webui.adoc:35
msgid "Later, during every use of the channel state, for example when executing a Highstate or a package installation, all locally assigned repositories are disabled again."
msgstr "Selanjutnya, setiap kali state saluran digunakan, misalnya saat menjalankan Highstate atau penginstalan paket, semua repositori yang ditetapkan secara lokal akan dinonaktifkan kembali."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-webui.adoc:36
msgid "All software packages which are used on the clients should come from channels served by {productname}.  For more information about creating a custom channel, see `Custom Channels` at xref:administration:custom-channels.adoc[]."
msgstr "Semua paket perangkat lunak yang digunakan pada klien harus berasal dari saluran yang disediakan oleh {productname}.  Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang pembuatan saluran kustom, lihat `Saluran Kustom` di xref:administration:custom-channels.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/repositories.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Software Repositories"
msgstr "Repositori Perangkat Lunak"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/repositories.adoc:2
msgid "Repositories are used to collect software packages.  When you have access to a software repository, you can install any of the software that the repository provides.  You must have at least one repository associated with your software channels in {productname} to assign clients to the channel and install and update packages on the client."
msgstr "Repositori digunakan untuk menghimpun paket perangkat lunak.  Jika Anda memiliki akses ke repositori perangkat lunak, Anda dapat menginstal perangkat lunak apa pun yang disediakan oleh repositori tersebut.  Anda harus memiliki setidaknya satu repositori yang terkait dengan saluran perangkat lunak Anda di {productname} agar dapat menetapkan klien ke saluran tersebut serta menginstal dan memperbarui paket pada klien."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/repositories.adoc:3
msgid "Most default channels in {productname} are already associated with the correct repositories.  If you are creating custom channels, you need to associate a repository that you have access to, or that you have created yourself."
msgstr "Sebagian besar saluran default di {productname} sudah terkait dengan repositori yang sesuai.  Jika Anda membuat saluran kustom, Anda perlu mengaitkan repositori yang dapat Anda akses atau yang Anda buat sendiri."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/repositories.adoc:4
msgid "For more information about custom repositories and channels, see xref:administration:custom-channels.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang repositori dan saluran kustom, lihat xref:administration:custom-channels.adoc[]."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/repositories.adoc:5
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/repositories.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "Local Repository Locations"
msgstr "Lokasi Repositori Lokal"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/repositories.adoc:6
msgid "You can configure local repositories on clients, to provide packages that are not supplied by {productname} channels."
msgstr "Anda dapat mengonfigurasi repositori lokal pada klien untuk menyediakan paket yang tidak disediakan oleh saluran {productname}."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/repositories.adoc:7
msgid "In most cases, client systems do not require local repositories.  Local repositories can lead to problems knowing which packages are available on the client.  This can lead to installing unexpected packages."
msgstr "Dalam kebanyakan kasus, sistem klien tidak memerlukan repositori lokal.  Repositori lokal dapat menyulitkan identifikasi paket yang tersedia pada klien.  Hal ini dapat menyebabkan penginstalan paket yang tidak diharapkan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/repositories.adoc:8
msgid "Local repositories are disabled during onboarding."
msgstr "Repositori lokal dinonaktifkan selama proses integrasi klien."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/repositories.adoc:9
msgid "Local repositories will be disabled each time a channel state is executed.  For example, when applying the highstate or performing a package action."
msgstr "Repositori lokal akan dinonaktifkan setiap kali state saluran dijalankan.  Misalnya, saat menerapkan highstate atau menjalankan tindakan paket."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/repositories.adoc:10
msgid "If local repositories should stay enabled after onboarding, the following pillar must be set for the affected client:"
msgstr "Jika repositori lokal harus tetap aktif setelah proses integrasi klien, pillar berikut harus ditetapkan untuk klien yang bersangkutan:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/repositories.adoc:11
msgid "Edit the `/srv/pillar/top.sls` file:"
msgstr "Edit berkas `/srv/pillar/top.sls`:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/repositories.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"base:\n"
"  'minionid':\n"
"    - localrepos\n"
msgstr ""
"base:\n"
"  'minionid':\n"
"    - localrepos\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/repositories.adoc:13
msgid "Edit the `/srv/pillar/localrepos.sls` file:"
msgstr "Edit berkas `/srv/pillar/localrepos.sls`:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/repositories.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgr_disable_local_repos: False\n"
msgstr "mgr_disable_local_repos: False\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/repositories.adoc:15
msgid "After a client has completed onboarding, you can add local repositories to these locations:"
msgstr "Setelah proses integrasi klien selesai, Anda dapat menambahkan repositori lokal ke lokasi berikut:"

#. type: Table
