#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/supported-features-debian.adoc:10
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/supported-features-tumbleweed.adoc:9
msgid "{star} Virtual Guest Management:"
msgstr "{star} Pengelolaan Mesin Virtual Tamu:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/supported-features-debian.adoc:11
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/supported-features-tumbleweed.adoc:10
msgid "In this table, virtual guest management is split into basic and advanced."
msgstr "Dalam tabel ini, pengelolaan mesin virtual tamu dibagi menjadi tingkat dasar dan lanjutan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/supported-features-debian.adoc:12
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/supported-features-tumbleweed.adoc:11
msgid "Basic virtual guest management includes listing VMs, slow refresh, VM lifecycle actions (start, stop, resume, pause), and modifying VM vCPU and Memory."
msgstr "Pengelolaan mesin virtual tamu tingkat dasar mencakup penayangan daftar VM, penyegaran lambat, tindakan siklus hidup VM (mulai, hentikan, lanjutkan, jeda), serta perubahan vCPU dan memori VM."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/supported-features-debian.adoc:13
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/supported-features-tumbleweed.adoc:12
msgid "Advanced virtual guest management includes all features of Basic virtual guest management plus fast refresh, VM lifecycle actions (delete, reset, power off), modifying VM disk, network, graphical display, and graphical display configuration."
msgstr "Pengelolaan mesin virtual tamu tingkat lanjutan mencakup semua fitur pengelolaan mesin virtual tamu tingkat dasar, ditambah penyegaran cepat, tindakan siklus hidup VM (hapus, reset, matikan daya), serta perubahan disk, jaringan, tampilan grafis, dan konfigurasi tampilan grafis VM."

