#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/system-set-manager.adoc:10
msgid "You can select clients for the SSM in several ways:"
msgstr "Anda dapat memilih klien untuk SSM dengan beberapa cara:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/system-set-manager.adoc:11
msgid "Navigate to menu:Systems[System List] and check the clients you want to work with."
msgstr "Buka menu:Systems[System List], lalu centang klien yang ingin Anda kelola."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/system-set-manager.adoc:12
msgid "Navigate to menu:Systems[System Groups], and click btn:[Use in SSM] for the system group you want to work with."
msgstr "Buka menu:Systems[System Groups], lalu klik btn:[Use in SSM] untuk grup sistem yang ingin Anda kelola."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/system-set-manager.adoc:13
msgid "Navigate to menu:Systems[System Groups], check the group you want to work with, and click btn:[Work with Group]."
msgstr "Buka menu:Systems[System Groups], centang grup yang ingin Anda kelola, lalu klik btn:[Work with Group]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/system-set-manager.adoc:14
msgid "When you have selected the clients you want to work with, navigate to menu:Systems[System Set Manager], or click the `systems selected` icon in the top menu bar."
msgstr "Setelah memilih klien yang ingin Anda kelola, buka menu:Systems[System Set Manager], atau klik ikon `systems selected` pada bilah menu atas."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/system-set-manager.adoc:15
msgid "The details in SSM might differ slightly from the details in other parts of the {productname} {webui}.  In SSM, all available updates are shown.  This allows you to upgrade to packages that might not be the latest version."
msgstr "Perincian dalam SSM mungkin sedikit berbeda dari perincian di bagian lain pada {webui} {productname}.  Dalam SSM, semua pembaruan yang tersedia ditampilkan.  Hal ini memungkinkan Anda meningkatkan versi ke paket yang mungkin bukan versi terbaru."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/system-set-manager.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "Change Base Channels in SSM"
msgstr "Mengubah Saluran Dasar di SSM"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/system-set-manager.adoc:17
msgid "You can use SSM to change the base channel of more than one client at the same time."
msgstr "Anda dapat menggunakan SSM untuk mengubah saluran dasar beberapa klien sekaligus."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/system-set-manager.adoc:18
msgid "Changing the base channel significantly changes the packages and patches available to the affected clients.  Use with caution."
msgstr "Mengubah saluran dasar akan mengubah secara signifikan paket dan patch yang tersedia bagi klien terkait.  Gunakan dengan hati-hati."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/system-set-manager.adoc:19
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Using SSM to Change Base Channels for Multiple Clients"
msgstr "Prosedur: Menggunakan SSM untuk Mengubah Saluran Dasar Beberapa Klien"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/system-set-manager.adoc:20
msgid "In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Systems[System List], check the clients you want to work with, and navigate to menu:Systems[System Set Manager]."
msgstr "Di {webui} {productname}, buka menu:Systems[System List], centang klien yang ingin Anda kelola, lalu buka menu:Systems[System Set Manager]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/system-set-manager.adoc:21
msgid "Navigate to the `Channels` subtab."
msgstr "Buka subtab `Channels`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/system-set-manager.adoc:22
msgid "Locate the current base channel in the list, and verify that the number shown in the `Systems` column is correct."
msgstr "Temukan saluran dasar saat ini dalam daftar, lalu pastikan angka yang ditampilkan pada kolom `Systems` sudah benar."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/system-set-manager.adoc:23
msgid "You can click the number in this column to see more details of the clients you are changing."
msgstr "Anda dapat mengeklik angka pada kolom ini untuk melihat perincian lebih lanjut tentang klien yang akan Anda ubah."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/system-set-manager.adoc:24
msgid "Select the new base channel in the `Desired base Channel` field, and click btn:[Next]."
msgstr "Pilih saluran dasar baru pada kolom `Desired base Channel`, lalu klik btn:[Next]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/system-set-manager.adoc:25
msgid "For each child channel, select `No change`, `Subscribe`, or `Unsubscribe`, and click btn:[Next]."
msgstr "Untuk setiap saluran turunan, pilih `No change`, `Subscribe`, atau `Unsubscribe`, lalu klik btn:[Next]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/system-set-manager.adoc:26
msgid "Check the changes you are making, and choose a time for the action to occur."
msgstr "Periksa perubahan yang akan Anda lakukan, lalu pilih waktu pelaksanaan tindakan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/system-set-manager.adoc:27
msgid "Click btn:[Confirm] to schedule the changes."
msgstr "Klik btn:[Confirm] untuk menjadwalkan perubahan."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/system-types.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "System Types"
msgstr "Jenis Sistem"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/system-types.adoc:2
msgid "Clients are categorized by system type.  Every client can have both a base system type, and an add-on system type assigned."
msgstr "Klien dikategorikan berdasarkan jenis sistem.  Setiap klien dapat ditetapkan jenis sistem dasar dan jenis sistem tambahan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/system-types.adoc:3
msgid "Base system type is `Salt` for all clients."
msgstr "Jenis sistem dasar untuk semua klien adalah `Salt`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/system-types.adoc:4
msgid "Add-on system types include:"
msgstr "Jenis sistem tambahan meliputi:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/system-types.adoc:5
msgid "`Virtualization Host`: Assigned to clients that operate as physical virtual hosts/hypervisors (such as KVM). Setting this system type is required to allow the daily Taskomatic job to query the system directly (via `libvirt`) and inventory its running virtual machines for display under menu:Systems[System List > Virtual Systems] and for subscription matching."
msgstr "`Virtualization Host`: Ditetapkan untuk klien yang beroperasi sebagai host virtualisasi fisik/hypervisor (seperti KVM). Penetapan jenis sistem ini diperlukan agar tugas harian Taskomatic dapat mengueri sistem secara langsung (melalui `libvirt`) dan menginventarisasi mesin virtual yang berjalan untuk ditampilkan di menu:Systems[System List > Virtual Systems] serta untuk pencocokan langganan."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/system-types.adoc:6
msgid "If the physical virtualization host is managed using the Salt Bundle (`venv-salt-minion`), it must be a SUSE-based operating system, and the system `libvirt-libs` library must be installed on the host to enable virtual machine inventory tracking. For more information, see xref:client-configuration:contact-methods-saltbundle.adoc#contact-methods-saltbundle-virt[Availability of Salt's \"virt\" module inside the Salt Bundle]."
msgstr "Jika host virtualisasi fisik dikelola menggunakan Salt Bundle (`venv-salt-minion`), host tersebut harus menjalankan sistem operasi berbasis SUSE, dan pustaka sistem `libvirt-libs` harus diinstal pada host untuk memungkinkan pelacakan inventaris mesin virtual. Untuk informasi selengkapnya, lihat xref:client-configuration:contact-methods-saltbundle.adoc#contact-methods-saltbundle-virt[Ketersediaan modul \"virt\" Salt dalam Salt Bundle]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/system-types.adoc:7
msgid "`Container Build Host`: Assigned to clients that operate as a build host."
msgstr "`Container Build Host`: Ditetapkan untuk klien yang beroperasi sebagai build host."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/system-types.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "Adjust the add-on system type"
msgstr "Menyesuaikan jenis sistem tambahan"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/system-types.adoc:9
msgid "In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Systems[System List > System Types]."
msgstr "Di {webui} {productname}, buka menu:Systems[System List > System Types]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/system-types.adoc:10
msgid "Check the clients you want to change the add-on system type for."
msgstr "Centang klien yang jenis sistem tambahannya ingin Anda ubah."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/system-types.adoc:11
msgid "Select the `Add-On System Type`."
msgstr "Pilih `Add-On System Type`."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/system-types.adoc:12
msgid "Click either btn:[Add System Type] or btn:[Remove System Type]."
msgstr "Klik btn:[Add System Type] atau btn:[Remove System Type]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/transactional-systems.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Managing Transactional Systems"
msgstr "Mengelola Sistem Transaksional"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/transactional-systems.adoc:2
msgid "{productname} identifies transactional systems using the `transactional` grain reported by the Salt minion.  For existing clients, {productname} requests updated system information when the Salt minion starts.  Restart the minion service to trigger this update, and allow time for the server to process the response."
msgstr "{productname} mengidentifikasi sistem transaksional menggunakan grain `transactional` yang dilaporkan oleh minion Salt.  Untuk klien yang sudah ada, {productname} meminta informasi sistem terbaru saat minion Salt dimulai.  Mulai ulang layanan minion untuk memicu pembaruan ini, lalu tunggu hingga server selesai memproses respons."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/transactional-systems.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Live and transactional operations"
msgstr "Operasi langsung dan transaksional"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/transactional-systems.adoc:4
msgid "Package changes and other operations that run transactionally are staged in a snapshot.  The changes become active only after the operating system boots into a snapshot that contains them.  A live operation acts on the running system.  Live execution does not make a read-only file system writable."
msgstr "Perubahan paket dan operasi lain yang dijalankan secara transaksional disiapkan dalam snapshot.  Perubahan tersebut baru aktif setelah sistem operasi melakukan boot ke snapshot yang memuatnya.  Operasi langsung bekerja pada sistem yang sedang berjalan.  Eksekusi langsung tidak membuat sistem berkas hanya-baca menjadi dapat ditulisi."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/transactional-systems.adoc:5
msgid "For explicit states and remote commands, select `Use transactional update` where the option is available to stage the operation transactionally.  Leave it unselected to run the operation live.  Highstate and formulas use their own transactional handling.  For details, see xref:reference:systems/system-details/sd-states.adoc[], xref:reference:systems/system-details/sd-remote-command.adoc[], and xref:reference:systems/system-details/sd-formulas.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk state eksplisit dan perintah jarak jauh, pilih `Use transactional update` jika opsi tersebut tersedia untuk menyiapkan operasi secara transaksional.  Biarkan opsi tersebut tidak dipilih untuk menjalankan operasi secara langsung.  Highstate dan formula menggunakan mekanisme penanganan transaksionalnya sendiri.  Untuk perinciannya, lihat xref:reference:systems/system-details/sd-states.adoc[], xref:reference:systems/system-details/sd-remote-command.adoc[], dan xref:reference:systems/system-details/sd-formulas.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/transactional-systems.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Reboot and action progress"
msgstr "Mulai ulang dan progres tindakan"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/transactional-systems.adoc:7
msgid "Some transactional actions require a reboot to activate changes staged in a snapshot. The action's progress indicates when a reboot is pending."
msgstr "Beberapa tindakan transaksional memerlukan mulai ulang untuk mengaktifkan perubahan yang disiapkan dalam snapshot. Progres tindakan menunjukkan kapan mulai ulang masih tertunda."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/transactional-systems.adoc:8
msgid "If the action only performs transactional operations, it can show as `Completed` while waiting for the reboot."
msgstr "Jika tindakan hanya menjalankan operasi transaksional, statusnya dapat ditampilkan sebagai `Completed` sambil menunggu mulai ulang."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/transactional-systems.adoc:9
msgid "If the action includes subsequent live operations (such as highstate):"
msgstr "Jika tindakan mencakup operasi langsung lanjutan (seperti highstate):"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/transactional-systems.adoc:10
msgid "If a reboot is required, the action remains in progress until you reboot the system. After the system boots into the updated snapshot, {productname} automatically resumes the live phase."
msgstr "Jika mulai ulang diperlukan, tindakan tetap berlangsung hingga Anda memulai ulang sistem. Setelah sistem melakukan boot ke snapshot yang diperbarui, {productname} secara otomatis melanjutkan tahap operasi langsung."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/transactional-systems.adoc:11
msgid "If no changes were made and no reboot is required, {productname} runs the live phase immediately."
msgstr "Jika tidak ada perubahan yang dilakukan dan mulai ulang tidak diperlukan, {productname} segera menjalankan tahap operasi langsung."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/transactional-systems.adoc:12
msgid "Reboot the operating system when the action indicates that a reboot is pending."
msgstr "Mulai ulang sistem operasi saat tindakan menunjukkan bahwa mulai ulang masih tertunda."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/transactional-systems.adoc:13
msgid "For snapshot information, see xref:reference:systems/system-details/sd-snapshots.adoc[].  For action progress, see xref:reference:systems/system-details/sd-events.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi tentang snapshot, lihat xref:reference:systems/system-details/sd-snapshots.adoc[].  Untuk progres tindakan, lihat xref:reference:systems/system-details/sd-events.adoc[]."

