#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-aws.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Virtual Host Manager and Amazon Web Services"
msgstr "Virtual Host Manager dan Amazon Web Services"

#.  2024-04-04 OM: It had been decided in the conversation with the mlm PO 
#.  that this Public Cloud related file can stay in the Uyuni books
#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-aws.adoc:2
msgid "You can use a virtual host manager (VHM) to gather instances from Amazon Web Services (AWS)."
msgstr "Anda dapat menggunakan virtual host manager (VHM) untuk mengumpulkan data instans dari Amazon Web Services (AWS)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-aws.adoc:3
msgid "The VHM allows {productname} to obtain and report information about your clusters.  For more information on VHMs, see xref:client-configuration:vhm.adoc[]."
msgstr "VHM memungkinkan {productname} memperoleh dan melaporkan informasi tentang klaster Anda.  Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang VHM, lihat xref:client-configuration:vhm.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-aws.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create an Amazon EC2 VHM"
msgstr "Membuat VHM Amazon EC2"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-aws.adoc:5
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-azure.adoc:8
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-nutanix.adoc:6
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-vmware.adoc:5
msgid "The Virtual Host Manager (VHM) runs on the {productname} Server."
msgstr "Virtual Host Manager (VHM) berjalan pada Server {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-aws.adoc:6
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-azure.adoc:9
msgid "Ensure you have installed the `virtual-host-gatherer-libcloud` package on the {productname} Server."
msgstr "Pastikan Anda telah menginstal paket `virtual-host-gatherer-libcloud` pada Server {productname}."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-aws.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating an Amazon EC2 VHM"
msgstr "Prosedur: Membuat VHM Amazon EC2"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-aws.adoc:8
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-azure.adoc:11
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-file.adoc:8
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-nutanix.adoc:10
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-vmware.adoc:11
msgid "In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Systems[Virtual Host Managers]."
msgstr "Di {webui} {productname}, buka menu:Systems[Virtual Host Managers]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-aws.adoc:9
msgid "Click btn:[Create] and select `Amazon EC2` from the drop-down menu."
msgstr "Klik btn:[Create], lalu pilih `Amazon EC2` dari menu tarik-turun."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-aws.adoc:10
msgid "In the `Add an Amazon EC2 Virtual Host Manager` section, use these parameters:"
msgstr "Pada bagian `Add an Amazon EC2 Virtual Host Manager`, gunakan parameter berikut:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-aws.adoc:11
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-azure.adoc:14
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-file.adoc:11
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-nutanix.adoc:13
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-vmware.adoc:14
msgid "In the `Label` field, type a custom name for your VHM."
msgstr "Pada kolom `Label`, masukkan nama kustom untuk VHM Anda."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-aws.adoc:12
msgid "In the `Access Key ID` field, type the access key ID provided by Amazon."
msgstr "Pada kolom `Access Key ID`, masukkan ID kunci akses yang diberikan oleh Amazon."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-aws.adoc:13
msgid "In the `Secret Access Key` field, type the secret access key associated with the Amazon instance."
msgstr "Pada kolom `Secret Access Key`, masukkan kunci akses rahasia yang terkait dengan instans Amazon."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-aws.adoc:14
msgid "In the `Region` field, type the region to use."
msgstr "Pada kolom `Region`, masukkan wilayah yang akan digunakan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-aws.adoc:15
msgid "In the `Zone` field, type the zone your VM is located in.  This is required for subscription matching to work.  For more information about setting regions and zones, see <<susesupport_and_vm_zones>>."
msgstr "Pada kolom `Zone`, masukkan zona tempat VM Anda berada.  Hal ini diperlukan agar pencocokan langganan dapat berfungsi.  Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang pengaturan wilayah dan zona, lihat <<susesupport_and_vm_zones>>."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-aws.adoc:16
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-azure.adoc:21
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-file.adoc:13
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-nutanix.adoc:18
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-vmware.adoc:19
msgid "Click btn:[Create] to save your changes and create the VHM."
msgstr "Klik btn:[Create] untuk menyimpan perubahan dan membuat VHM."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-aws.adoc:17
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-azure.adoc:22
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-file.adoc:14
msgid "On the `Virtual Host Managers` page, select the new VHM."
msgstr "Pada halaman `Virtual Host Managers`, pilih VHM baru."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-aws.adoc:18
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-azure.adoc:23
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-file.adoc:15
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-nutanix.adoc:20
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-vmware.adoc:21
msgid "On the `Properties` page, click btn:[Refresh Data] to inventory the new VHM."
msgstr "Pada halaman `Properties`, klik btn:[Refresh Data] untuk menginventarisasi VHM baru."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-aws.adoc:19
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-azure.adoc:24
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-nutanix.adoc:21
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-vmware.adoc:22
msgid "To see which objects and resources have been inventoried, navigate to menu:Systems[System List > Virtual Systems]."
msgstr "Untuk melihat objek dan sumber daya yang telah diinventarisasi, buka menu:Systems[System List > Virtual Systems]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-aws.adoc:20
msgid "Instances running on the Amazon public cloud report a UUID to the {productname} Server in the format of an `i` followed by seventeen hexadecimal digits:"
msgstr "Instans yang berjalan di cloud publik Amazon melaporkan UUID ke Server {productname} dalam format `i` yang diikuti tujuh belas digit heksadesimal:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-aws.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "I1234567890abcdef0\n"
msgstr "I1234567890abcdef0\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-aws.adoc:22
#, no-wrap
msgid "SUSE Support and VM Zones"
msgstr "Dukungan SUSE dan Zona VM"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-aws.adoc:23
msgid "Public cloud providers use regions to define the physical geographic location of the datacenter providing virtual machines.  For example, `US-East`, or `Asia`."
msgstr "Penyedia cloud publik menggunakan wilayah untuk menentukan lokasi geografis fisik pusat data yang menyediakan mesin virtual.  Misalnya, `US-East`, atau `Asia`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-aws.adoc:24
msgid "Regions are then further divided into zones.  For example, the `US-East` region might contain zones called `us-east-2a` and `us-east-2b`, among others."
msgstr "Wilayah kemudian dibagi lagi menjadi zona.  Misalnya, wilayah `US-East` dapat mencakup zona bernama `us-east-2a` dan `us-east-2b`, serta zona lainnya."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-aws.adoc:25
msgid "{suse} uses the zone of a virtual machine to determine the appropriate subscription to provide.  If all of your VMs are provided by the same zone, you are within the terms and conditions of the `1-2 Virtual Machines` subscription."
msgstr "{suse} menggunakan zona mesin virtual untuk menentukan langganan yang sesuai.  Jika semua VM Anda disediakan dari zona yang sama, Anda memenuhi syarat dan ketentuan langganan `1-2 Virtual Machines`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-aws.adoc:26
msgid "If your VMs are provided by different zones, even if they are within the same region, you might not meet the conditions of the `1-2 Virtual Machines` subscription.  In this case, check your subscription carefully."
msgstr "Jika VM Anda disediakan dari zona yang berbeda, meskipun berada dalam wilayah yang sama, Anda mungkin tidak memenuhi ketentuan langganan `1-2 Virtual Machines`.  Dalam hal ini, periksa langganan Anda dengan saksama."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-aws.adoc:27
msgid "For {byos} instances ({byoslongform}), all installed products are passed to the subscription matcher.  If your public cloud instances are {payg} ({payglongform}), their base products are excluded from the subscription matcher counting."
msgstr "Untuk instans {byos} ({byoslongform}), semua produk yang terinstal diteruskan ke pencocok langganan.  Jika instans cloud publik Anda menggunakan {payg} ({payglongform}), produk dasarnya dikecualikan dari penghitungan pencocok langganan."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-aws.adoc:28
msgid "The calculation about whether an instance is {payg} or {byos} is done at the time of registration or when a hardware refresh action is executed."
msgstr "Penentuan apakah suatu instans menggunakan {payg} atau {byos} dilakukan saat pendaftaran atau ketika tindakan penyegaran perangkat keras dijalankan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-aws.adoc:29
msgid "For more information, see https://www.suse.com/products/terms_and_conditions.pdf or contact {suse}."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya, lihat https://www.suse.com/products/terms_and_conditions.pdf atau hubungi {suse}."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-aws.adoc:30
#, no-wrap
msgid "AWS Permissions for Virtual Host Manager"
msgstr "Izin AWS untuk Virtual Host Manager"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-aws.adoc:31
msgid "For security reasons, always grant the least privilege possible for a task to be performed.  Using an Access Key with excessive permissions for users connecting to AWS is not advised."
msgstr "Demi keamanan, selalu berikan hak akses seminimal mungkin yang diperlukan untuk menjalankan suatu tugas.  Penggunaan Access Key dengan izin berlebihan bagi pengguna yang terhubung ke AWS tidak disarankan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-aws.adoc:32
msgid "For {productname} to gather the information required from AWS, the VHM needs permission to describe EC2 instances and addresses.  One method to grant this is to create a new IAM user (Identity and Access Management) specific to this task, create a policy as follows and attach to the user:"
msgstr "Agar {productname} dapat mengumpulkan informasi yang diperlukan dari AWS, VHM memerlukan izin untuk mengambil informasi tentang instans dan alamat EC2.  Salah satu cara untuk memberikan izin ini adalah dengan membuat pengguna IAM (Identity and Access Management) baru khusus untuk tugas ini, membuat kebijakan berikut, lalu melampirkannya ke pengguna tersebut:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-aws.adoc:33
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"{\n"
"    \"Version\": \"2012-10-17\",\n"
"    \"Statement\":[\n"
"        {\n"
"            \"Effect\": \"Allow\",\n"
"            \"Action\": [\n"
"                \"ec2:DescribeAddresses\",\n"
"                \"ec2:DescribeInstances\"\n"
"            ],\n"
"            \"Resource\": \"*\"\n"
"        }\n"
"    ]\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
"{\n"
"    \"Version\": \"2012-10-17\",\n"
"    \"Statement\":[\n"
"        {\n"
"  \"Effect\": \"Allow\",\n"
"            \"Action\": [\n"
"                \"ec2:DescribeAddresses\",\n"
"                \"ec2:DescribeInstances\"\n"
"            ],\n"
"            \"Resource\": \"*\"\n"
"        }\n"
"    ]\n"
"}\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-aws.adoc:34
msgid "You can limit permissions more by restricting access to specific regions.  For more information, see https://docs.aws.amazon.com/AWSEC2/latest/UserGuide/ExamplePolicies_EC2.html#iam-example-read-only."
msgstr "Anda dapat lebih membatasi izin dengan membatasi akses ke wilayah tertentu.  Untuk informasi selengkapnya, lihat https://docs.aws.amazon.com/AWSEC2/latest/UserGuide/ExamplePolicies_EC2.html#iam-example-read-only."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-azure.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Virtual Host Manager and Azure"
msgstr "Virtual Host Manager dan Azure"

#.  2024-04-04 OM: It had been decided in the conversation with the mlm PO 
#.  that this Public Cloud related file can stay in the Uyuni books
#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-azure.adoc:2
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "You can use a virtual host manager (VHM) to gather instances from Microsoft Azure."
msgid "You can use a virtual host manager (VHM) to gather instances from {azure}."
msgstr "Anda dapat menggunakan virtual host manager (VHM) untuk mengumpulkan instans dari Microsoft Azure."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-azure.adoc:3
msgid "The VHM allows {productname} to obtain and report information about your virtual machines.  For more information on VHMs, see xref:client-configuration:vhm.adoc[]."
msgstr "VHM memungkinkan {productname} memperoleh dan melaporkan informasi tentang mesin virtual Anda.  Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang VHM, lihat xref:client-configuration:vhm.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-azure.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prerequisites"
msgstr "Prasyarat"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-azure.adoc:5
msgid "The VHM you create needs to have the correct permissions assigned, in order for it to access the Azure VM."
msgstr "VHM yang Anda buat harus diberi izin yang sesuai agar dapat mengakses VM Azure."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-azure.adoc:6
msgid "Log in to your Azure account as the subscription administrator, and ensure that the Azure user account and application are in the correct groups.  The group that the application is in determines the role it has, and therefore the permissions."
msgstr "Masuk ke akun Azure Anda sebagai administrator langganan, lalu pastikan akun pengguna Azure dan aplikasi berada dalam grup yang sesuai.  Grup tempat aplikasi berada menentukan perannya, dan dengan demikian, izinnya."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-azure.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create an Azure VHM"
msgstr "Membuat VHM Azure"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-azure.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating an Azure VHM"
msgstr "Prosedur: Membuat VHM Azure"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-azure.adoc:12
msgid "Click btn:[Create] and select `Azure` from the drop-down menu."
msgstr "Klik btn:[Create] dan pilih `Azure` dari menu tarik-turun."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-azure.adoc:13
msgid "In the `Add an Azure Virtual Host Manager` section, use these parameters:"
msgstr "Di bagian `Add an Azure Virtual Host Manager`, gunakan parameter berikut:"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-azure.adoc:15
msgid "In the `Subscription ID` field, type the subscription ID found in `Azure portal > Services > Subscriptions` page."
msgstr "Di kolom `Subscription ID`, masukkan ID langganan yang terdapat di halaman `Azure portal > Services > Subscriptions`."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-azure.adoc:16
msgid "In the `Application ID` field, type the application ID that you collected when you registered the application."
msgstr "Di kolom `Application ID`, masukkan ID aplikasi yang Anda peroleh saat mendaftarkan aplikasi."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-azure.adoc:17
msgid "In the `Tenant ID` field, type the tenant ID provided by Azure that you collected when you registered the application."
msgstr "Di kolom `Tenant ID`, masukkan ID tenant yang diberikan oleh Azure dan Anda peroleh saat mendaftarkan aplikasi."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-azure.adoc:18
msgid "In the `Secret Key` field, type the secret key associated with the Azure instance."
msgstr "Di kolom `Secret Key`, masukkan kunci rahasia yang terkait dengan instans Azure."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-azure.adoc:19
msgid "In the `Zone` field, type the zone your VM is located in. For example, for West Europe, enter `westeurope`."
msgstr "Di kolom `Zone`, masukkan zona tempat VM Anda berada. Misalnya, untuk Eropa Barat, masukkan `westeurope`."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-azure.adoc:20
msgid "This is required for subscription matching to work."
msgstr "Hal ini diperlukan agar pencocokan langganan dapat berfungsi."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-azure.adoc:25
#, no-wrap
msgid "Assigning permissions"
msgstr "Menetapkan izin"

#.  OM 2022-02-28: if the UI suggestion has been implemented (#1170298 via #1170514) we may eventually be able to remove this section
#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-azure.adoc:26
msgid "If the permissions are not set correctly, you might receive an error like this when you run `virtual-host-gatherer`:"
msgstr "Jika izin tidak diatur dengan benar, Anda mungkin menerima pesan kesalahan seperti berikut saat menjalankan `virtual-host-gatherer`:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-azure.adoc:27
#, no-wrap
msgid "General error: [AuthorizationFailed] The client 'client_name' with object id 'object_ID' does not have authorization to perform action 'Microsoft.Compute/virtualMachines/read' over scope '/subscriptions/not-very-secret-subscription-id' or the scope is invalid. If access was recently granted, please refresh your credentials.\n"
msgstr "Kesalahan umum: [AuthorizationFailed] Klien 'client_name' dengan ID objek 'object_ID' tidak memiliki otorisasi untuk melakukan tindakan 'Microsoft.Compute/virtualMachines/read' pada cakupan '/subscriptions/not-very-secret-subscription-id' atau cakupan tersebut tidak valid. Jika akses baru saja diberikan, harap segarkan kredensial Anda.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-azure.adoc:28
msgid "To determine the correct credentials, run this command at the prompt on the {productname} Server:"
msgstr "Untuk menentukan kredensial yang benar, jalankan perintah ini pada prompt di Server {productname}:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-azure.adoc:29
#, no-wrap
msgid "virtual-host-gatherer -i input_azure.json -o out_azure.json -vvv\n"
msgstr "virtual-host-gatherer -i input_azure.json -o out_azure.json -vvv\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-azure.adoc:30
msgid "The `input_azure.json` file should contain this information:"
msgstr "File `input_azure.json` harus berisi informasi berikut:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-azure.adoc:31
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[\n"
"    {\n"
"        \"id\": \"azure_vhm\",\n"
"        \"module\": \"Azure\",\n"
"        \"subscription_id\": \"subscription-id\",\n"
"        \"application_id\": \"application-id\",\n"
"        \"tenant_id\": \"tenant-id\",\n"
"        \"secret_key\": \"secret-key\",\n"
"        \"zone\": \"zone\"\n"
"    }\n"
"]\n"
msgstr ""
"[\n"
"    {\n"
"        \"id\": \"azure_vhm\",\n"
"        \"module\": \"Azure\",\n"
"        \"subscription_id\": \"subscription-id\",\n"
"        \"application_id\": \"application-id\",\n"
"        \"tenant_id\": \"tenant-id\",\n"
"        \"secret_key\": \"secret-key\",\n"
"        \"zone\": \"zone\"\n"
"    }\n"
"]\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-azure.adoc:32
#, no-wrap
msgid "Azure UUID"
msgstr "UUID Azure"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-azure.adoc:33
msgid "Instances running on the Azure public cloud report this UUID to the {productname} Server:"
msgstr "Instans yang berjalan di cloud publik Azure melaporkan UUID berikut ke Server {productname}:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-azure.adoc:34
#, no-wrap
msgid "13f56399-bd52-4150-9748-7190aae1ff21\n"
msgstr "13f56399-bd52-4150-9748-7190aae1ff21\n"

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-file.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Virtualization with Other Third Party Providers"
msgstr "Virtualisasi dengan Penyedia Pihak Ketiga Lainnya"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-file.adoc:2
msgid "If you want to use a third-party virtualization provider other than Xen, KVM, or VMware, you can import a JSON configuration file to {productname}."
msgstr "Jika Anda ingin menggunakan penyedia virtualisasi pihak ketiga selain Xen, KVM, atau VMware, Anda dapat mengimpor file konfigurasi JSON ke {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-file.adoc:3
msgid "Similarly, if you have a VMware installation that does not provide direct access to the API, a file-based VHM provides you with some basic management features."
msgstr "Demikian pula, jika Anda memiliki instalasi VMware yang tidak menyediakan akses langsung ke API, VHM berbasis file menyediakan beberapa fitur pengelolaan dasar."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-file.adoc:4
msgid "This option is for importing files that have been created with the `virtual-host-gatherer` tool.  It is not designed for manually created files."
msgstr "Opsi ini digunakan untuk mengimpor file yang dibuat dengan alat `virtual-host-gatherer`.  Opsi ini tidak dirancang untuk file yang dibuat secara manual."

#.  Add instructions for custom JSON file, including example if possible. LKB 2019-10-23
#.  https://github.com/uyuni-project/uyuni-rfc/blob/master/accepted/00056-subscription-matching-in-public-clouds.md#the-output-from-a-virtual-host-gatherer-plugin
#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-file.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Exporting and Importing a JSON File"
msgstr "Prosedur: Mengekspor dan Mengimpor File JSON"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-file.adoc:6
msgid "Export the JSON configuration file by running `virtual-host-gatherer` on the VM network."
msgstr "Ekspor file konfigurasi JSON dengan menjalankan `virtual-host-gatherer` di jaringan VM."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-file.adoc:7
msgid "Save the produced file to a location accessible by your {productname} Server."
msgstr "Simpan file yang dihasilkan ke lokasi yang dapat diakses oleh Server {productname} Anda."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-file.adoc:9
msgid "Click btn:[Create] and select `File-based`."
msgstr "Klik btn:[Create] dan pilih `File-based`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-file.adoc:10
msgid "In the `Add a file-based Virtual Host Manager` section, use these parameters:"
msgstr "Di bagian `Add a file-based Virtual Host Manager`, gunakan parameter berikut:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-file.adoc:12
msgid "In the `Url` field, type the path to your exported JSON configuration file."
msgstr "Di kolom `Url`, masukkan jalur ke file konfigurasi JSON yang telah Anda ekspor."

