#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-file.adoc:19
#, no-wrap
msgid "man virtual-host-gatherer\n"
msgstr "man virtual-host-gatherer\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-file.adoc:20
msgid "The `README` file of that package provides background information about the `type` of a hypervisor, etc.:"
msgstr "File `README` dari paket tersebut menyediakan informasi latar belakang tentang `type` hypervisor dan sebagainya:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-file.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "/usr/share/doc/packages/virtual-host-gatherer/README.md\n"
msgstr "/usr/share/doc/packages/virtual-host-gatherer/README.md\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-file.adoc:22
msgid "The man page and the `README` file also contain example configuration files."
msgstr "Halaman manual dan file `README` juga berisi contoh file konfigurasi."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-nutanix.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Virtualization with Nutanix"
msgstr "Virtualisasi dengan Nutanix"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-nutanix.adoc:2
msgid "{suse} is a Nutanix ecosystem partner and {productname} has obtained the Nutanix-ready certification in the \"Nutanix AHV integrated\" category."
msgstr "{suse} merupakan mitra ekosistem Nutanix dan {productname} telah memperoleh sertifikasi Nutanix-ready dalam kategori \"Nutanix AHV integrated\"."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-nutanix.adoc:3
msgid "For more information about Nutanix integrations, see https://www.nutanix.com/partners/technology-alliances/suse"
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang integrasi Nutanix, lihat https://www.nutanix.com/partners/technology-alliances/suse"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-nutanix.adoc:4
msgid "You can use Nutanix AHV virtual machines with {productname} by setting up a virtual host manager (VHM).  To begin, you need to set up a VHM on your {productname} Server, and inventory the available VM hosts."
msgstr "Anda dapat menggunakan mesin virtual Nutanix AHV dengan {productname} dengan menyiapkan virtual host manager (VHM).  Untuk memulai, Anda perlu menyiapkan VHM di Server {productname} Anda dan menginventarisasi host VM yang tersedia."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-nutanix.adoc:5
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-vmware.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "VHM Setup"
msgstr "Penyiapan VHM"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-nutanix.adoc:7
msgid "Ensure you have installed the `virtual-host-gatherer-Nutanix` package on the {productname} Server."
msgstr "Pastikan Anda telah menginstal paket `virtual-host-gatherer-Nutanix` di Server {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-nutanix.adoc:8
msgid "To run a VHM, your {productname} Server must have port 9440 open to access the Nutanix Prism Element API."
msgstr "Untuk menjalankan VHM, Server {productname} Anda harus membuka port 9440 agar dapat mengakses API Nutanix Prism Element."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-nutanix.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating a Nutanix VHM"
msgstr "Prosedur: Membuat VHM Nutanix"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-nutanix.adoc:11
msgid "Click btn:[Create] and select `Nutanix AHV`."
msgstr "Klik btn:[Create] dan pilih `Nutanix AHV`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-nutanix.adoc:12
msgid "In the `Add a Nutanix AHV Virtual Host Manager` section, use these parameters:"
msgstr "Di bagian `Add a Nutanix AHV Virtual Host Manager`, gunakan parameter berikut:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-nutanix.adoc:14
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-vmware.adoc:15
msgid "In the `Hostname` field, type the fully qualified domain name (FQDN) or host IP address."
msgstr "Di kolom `Hostname`, masukkan nama domain yang sepenuhnya memenuhi syarat (FQDN) atau alamat IP host."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-nutanix.adoc:15
msgid "In the `Port` field, type the Prism Element API port to use (for example, `9440`)."
msgstr "Di kolom `Port`, masukkan port API Prism Element yang akan digunakan (misalnya, `9440`)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-nutanix.adoc:16
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-vmware.adoc:17
msgid "In the `Username` field, type the username associated with the VM host."
msgstr "Di kolom `Username`, masukkan nama pengguna yang terkait dengan host VM."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-nutanix.adoc:17
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-vmware.adoc:18
msgid "In the `Password` field, type the password associated with the VM host user."
msgstr "Di kolom `Password`, masukkan kata sandi yang terkait dengan pengguna host VM."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-nutanix.adoc:19
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-vmware.adoc:20
msgid "On the `Virtual Host Managers` page select the new VHM."
msgstr "Di halaman `Virtual Host Managers`, pilih VHM yang baru."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-nutanix.adoc:22
msgid "Connecting to the Nutanix Prism API server from a browser using HTTPS can sometimes log an `invalid certificate` error.  If this occurs, refreshing the data from the virtual host manager fails.  A valid SSL certificate (not self-signed) is required on your Nutanix API server.  If you are using a custom CA authority for your Nutanix SSL certificate, copy the custom CA certificate to `/etc/pki/trust/anchors` on the {productname} Server."
msgstr "Menghubungkan ke server API Nutanix Prism dari browser menggunakan HTTPS terkadang dapat mencatat kesalahan `invalid certificate`.  Jika hal ini terjadi, penyegaran data dari virtual host manager akan gagal. Server API Nutanix Anda memerlukan sertifikat SSL yang valid (bukan sertifikat yang ditandatangani sendiri).  Jika Anda menggunakan otoritas sertifikat (CA) khusus untuk sertifikat SSL Nutanix, salin sertifikat CA khusus tersebut ke `/etc/pki/trust/anchors` di Server {productname}."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-nutanix.adoc:23
msgid "Re-trust the certificate by running the `update-ca-certificates` command on the command line, and restart the spacewalk services."
msgstr "Perbarui kepercayaan terhadap sertifikat dengan menjalankan perintah `update-ca-certificates` di baris perintah, lalu mulai ulang layanan spacewalk."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-nutanix.adoc:24
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-vmware.adoc:24
msgid "After your VHM has been created and configured, Taskomatic runs data collection automatically.  If you want to manually perform data collection, navigate to menu:Systems[Virtual Host Managers], select the appropriate VHM, and click btn:[Refresh Data]."
msgstr "Setelah VHM Anda dibuat dan dikonfigurasi, Taskomatic menjalankan pengumpulan data secara otomatis.  Jika Anda ingin mengumpulkan data secara manual, buka menu:Systems[Virtual Host Managers], pilih VHM yang sesuai, lalu klik btn:[Refresh Data]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-nutanix.adoc:25
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-vmware.adoc:25
msgid "{productname} ships with a tool called `virtual-host-gatherer` that can connect to VHMs using their API, and request information about virtual hosts.  `virtual-host-gatherer` maintains the concept of optional modules, where each module enables a specific VHM.  This tool is automatically invoked nightly by Taskomatic.  Log files for the `virtual-host-gatherer` tool are located at `/var/log/rhn/gatherer.log`."
msgstr "{productname} dilengkapi dengan alat bernama `virtual-host-gatherer` yang dapat terhubung ke VHM melalui API-nya dan meminta informasi tentang host virtual.  `virtual-host-gatherer` menggunakan konsep modul opsional, dengan setiap modul mengaktifkan dukungan untuk VHM tertentu.  Alat ini dijalankan secara otomatis setiap malam oleh Taskomatic.  File log untuk alat `virtual-host-gatherer` berada di `/var/log/rhn/gatherer.log`."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-vmware.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Virtualization with VMware"
msgstr "Virtualisasi dengan VMware"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-vmware.adoc:2
msgid "You can use VMware vSphere virtual machines, including ESXi and vCenter, with {productname} by setting up a virtual host manager (VHM)."
msgstr "Anda dapat menggunakan mesin virtual VMware vSphere, termasuk ESXi dan vCenter, dengan {productname} dengan menyiapkan virtual host manager (VHM)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-vmware.adoc:3
msgid "To begin, you need to set up a VHM on your {productname} Server, and inventory the available VM hosts.  Taskomatic can then begin data collection using the VMs API."
msgstr "Untuk memulai, Anda perlu menyiapkan VHM di Server {productname} Anda dan menginventarisasi host VM yang tersedia.  Taskomatic kemudian dapat mulai mengumpulkan data menggunakan API VM."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-vmware.adoc:6
msgid "To run a VHM, your {productname} Server needs to have port 443 open, to access the VMware API."
msgstr "Untuk menjalankan VHM, Server {productname} Anda harus membuka port 443 agar dapat mengakses API VMware."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-vmware.adoc:7
msgid "VMware hosts use access roles and permissions to control access to hosts and guests.  Ensure that any VMware objects or resources that you want to be inventoried by the VHM have at least `read-only` permissions.  If you want to exclude any objects or resources, mark them with `no-access`."
msgstr "Host VMware menggunakan peran dan izin akses untuk mengontrol akses ke host dan mesin tamu.  Pastikan setiap objek atau sumber daya VMware yang ingin Anda inventarisasi melalui VHM setidaknya memiliki izin `read-only`.  Jika Anda ingin mengecualikan objek atau sumber daya tertentu, tandai dengan `no-access`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-vmware.adoc:8
msgid "When you are adding new hosts to {productname}, you need to consider if the roles and permissions that have been assigned to users and objects need to be inventoried by {productname}."
msgstr "Saat menambahkan host baru ke {productname}, Anda perlu mempertimbangkan apakah peran dan izin yang telah ditetapkan kepada pengguna dan objek perlu diinventarisasi oleh {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-vmware.adoc:9
msgid "For more information on users, roles, and permissions, see the VMware vSphere documentation: https://techdocs.broadcom.com/us/en/vmware-cis/vsphere.html"
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang pengguna, peran, dan izin, lihat dokumentasi VMware vSphere: https://techdocs.broadcom.com/us/en/vmware-cis/vsphere.html"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-vmware.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating a VMware VHM"
msgstr "Prosedur: Membuat VHM VMware"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-vmware.adoc:12
msgid "Click btn:[Create] and select `VMware-based`."
msgstr "Klik btn:[Create] dan pilih `VMware-based`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-vmware.adoc:13
msgid "In the `Add a VMware-based Virtual Host Manager` section, use these parameters:"
msgstr "Di bagian `Add a VMware-based Virtual Host Manager`, gunakan parameter berikut:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-vmware.adoc:16
msgid "In the `Port` field, type the ESXi API port to use (for example, `443`)."
msgstr "Di kolom `Port`, masukkan port API ESXi yang akan digunakan (misalnya, `443`)."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-vmware.adoc:23
msgid "Connecting to the ESXi server from a browser using HTTPS can sometimes log an `invalid certificate` error.  If this occurs, refreshing the data from the virtual hosts server fails.  To correct the problem, extract the certificate from the ESXi server, and copy it to `/etc/pki/trust/anchors`.  Re-trust the certificate by running the `update-ca-certificates` command on the command line, and restart the spacewalk services."
msgstr "Menghubungkan ke server ESXi dari browser menggunakan HTTPS terkadang dapat mencatat kesalahan `invalid certificate`.  Jika hal ini terjadi, penyegaran data dari server host virtual akan gagal.  Untuk mengatasi masalah ini, ekstrak sertifikat dari server ESXi, lalu salin ke `/etc/pki/trust/anchors`.  Perbarui kepercayaan terhadap sertifikat dengan menjalankan perintah `update-ca-certificates` di baris perintah, lalu mulai ulang layanan spacewalk."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-vmware.adoc:26
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting SSL Errors on VMware"
msgstr "Pemecahan Masalah Kesalahan SSL pada VMware"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-vmware.adoc:27
msgid "If you see SSL errors while configuring your VMware installation, you need to download the CA certificate file from VMware, and trust it on {productname}."
msgstr "Jika Anda menemukan kesalahan SSL saat mengonfigurasi instalasi VMware, Anda perlu mengunduh file sertifikat CA dari VMware dan menetapkannya sebagai tepercaya di {productname}."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-vmware.adoc:28
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Trusting VMware CA Certificates"
msgstr "Prosedur: Menetapkan Sertifikat CA VMware sebagai Tepercaya"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-vmware.adoc:29
msgid "Download the CA Certificate from your VMware installation."
msgstr "Unduh Sertifikat CA dari instalasi VMware Anda."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-vmware.adoc:30
msgid "You can do this by logging in to your vCenter {webui}, and clicking btn:[Download trusted root CA certificates]."
msgstr "Anda dapat melakukannya dengan masuk ke {webui} vCenter Anda, lalu mengeklik btn:[Download trusted root CA certificates]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-vmware.adoc:31
msgid "If the downloaded CA certificates file is in `.zip` format, extract the archive."
msgstr "Jika file sertifikat CA yang diunduh berformat `.zip`, ekstrak arsip tersebut."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-vmware.adoc:32
msgid "The certificate files have a number as an extension.  For example, `certificate.0`."
msgstr "File sertifikat memiliki ekstensi berupa angka.  Misalnya, `certificate.0`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-vmware.adoc:33
msgid "Copy the certificate files to your {productname} Server, and save them to the `/etc/pki/trust/anchors/` directory."
msgstr "Salin file sertifikat ke Server {productname} Anda, lalu simpan di direktori `/etc/pki/trust/anchors/`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-vmware.adoc:34
msgid "Change the filename suffix on the copied certificate to either `.crt` or `.pem`."
msgstr "Ubah akhiran nama file sertifikat yang telah disalin menjadi `.crt` atau `.pem`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-vmware.adoc:35
msgid "On the {productname} Server, at the command prompt, update the CA certificate record:"
msgstr "Di Server {productname}, pada prompt perintah, perbarui catatan sertifikat CA:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-vmware.adoc:36
#, no-wrap
msgid "update-ca-certificates\n"
msgstr "update-ca-certificates\n"

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Virtual Host Managers"
msgstr "Pengelola Host Virtual"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm.adoc:2
msgid "Virtual Host Managers (VHMs) are used to gather information from a range of client types."
msgstr "Virtual Host Manager (VHM) digunakan untuk mengumpulkan informasi dari berbagai jenis klien."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm.adoc:3
msgid "VHMs can be used to collect private or public cloud instances and organize them into virtualization groups.  With your virtualized clients organized this way, Taskomatic collects data on the clients for display in the {productname} {webui}.  VHMs also allow you to use subscription matching on your virtualized clients."
msgstr "VHM dapat digunakan untuk mengumpulkan instans cloud privat atau publik dan mengaturnya ke dalam grup virtualisasi.  Dengan pengaturan klien tervirtualisasi seperti ini, Taskomatic mengumpulkan data klien untuk ditampilkan di {webui} {productname}.  VHM juga memungkinkan Anda menggunakan pencocokan langganan pada klien tervirtualisasi."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm.adoc:4
msgid "You can create a VHM on your {productname} Server, and use it to inventory available public cloud instances.  You can also use a VHM to manage clusters created with {kube}."
msgstr "Anda dapat membuat VHM di Server {productname} Anda dan menggunakannya untuk menginventarisasi instans cloud publik yang tersedia.  Anda juga dapat menggunakan VHM untuk mengelola klaster yang dibuat dengan {kube}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm.adoc:5
msgid "For more information on using a VHM with Amazon Web Services, see xref:client-configuration:vhm-aws.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang penggunaan VHM dengan Amazon Web Services, lihat xref:client-configuration:vhm-aws.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm.adoc:6
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "For more information on using a VHM with Microsoft Azure, see xref:client-configuration:vhm-azure.adoc[]."
msgid "For more information on using a VHM with {azure}, see xref:client-configuration:vhm-azure.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang penggunaan VHM dengan Microsoft Azure, lihat xref:client-configuration:vhm-azure.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm.adoc:7
msgid "For more information on using a VHM with Nutanix, see xref:client-configuration:vhm-nutanix.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang penggunaan VHM dengan Nutanix, lihat xref:client-configuration:vhm-nutanix.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm.adoc:8
msgid "For more information on using a VHM with VMWare vSphere, see xref:client-configuration:vhm-vmware.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang penggunaan VHM dengan VMWare vSphere, lihat xref:client-configuration:vhm-vmware.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm.adoc:9
msgid "For more information on using a VHM with other hosts, see xref:client-configuration:vhm-file.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang penggunaan VHM dengan host lain, lihat xref:client-configuration:vhm-file.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm.adoc:10
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid "Direct Hypervisor Querying"
msgid "Direct hypervisor querying"
msgstr "Kueri Langsung ke Hypervisor"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm.adoc:11
msgid "Registered physical Linux clients acting as hypervisors (such as KVM) do not require a Virtual Host Manager (VHM) configuration. Instead, if a registered physical host has the `Virtualization Host` add-on system type assigned, {productname} queries the system directly using `libvirt` to gather virtual machine data."
msgstr "Klien Linux fisik terdaftar yang berfungsi sebagai hypervisor (seperti KVM) tidak memerlukan konfigurasi Virtual Host Manager (VHM). Sebagai gantinya, jika host fisik terdaftar telah diberi jenis sistem tambahan `Virtualization Host`, {productname} akan mengueri sistem tersebut secara langsung menggunakan `libvirt` untuk mengumpulkan data mesin virtual."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm.adoc:12
msgid "If the hypervisor is managed using the Salt Bundle (`venv-salt-minion`), see xref:client-configuration:contact-methods-saltbundle.adoc#contact-methods-saltbundle-virt[Availability of Salt's \"virt\" module inside the Salt Bundle] for the required setup."
msgstr "Jika hypervisor dikelola menggunakan Salt Bundle (`venv-salt-minion`), lihat xref:client-configuration:contact-methods-saltbundle.adoc#contact-methods-saltbundle-virt[Availability of Salt's \"virt\" module inside the Salt Bundle] untuk penyiapan yang diperlukan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm.adoc:13
msgid "For more information, see xref:client-configuration:system-types.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya, lihat xref:client-configuration:system-types.adoc[]."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/client-configuration/partials/addchannels_novendor_cli.adoc:1
#: en/modules/client-configuration/partials/addchannels_novendor_cli_multiarch.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Adding Software Channels at the Command Prompt"
msgstr "Prosedur: Menambahkan Kanal Perangkat Lunak melalui Prompt Perintah"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/client-configuration/partials/addchannels_novendor_cli.adoc:2
msgid "With the `spacewalk-common-channels` command you can add the appropriate channels.  At the command prompt on the {productname} container host, as root, execute the following command:"
msgstr "Dengan perintah `spacewalk-common-channels`, Anda dapat menambahkan kanal yang sesuai.  Pada prompt perintah di host kontainer {productname}, sebagai root, jalankan perintah berikut:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/client-configuration/partials/addchannels_novendor_cli.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mgrctl exec -ti -- spacewalk-common-channels \\\n"
"<base_channel_label> \\\n"
"<child_channel_label_1> \\\n"
"<child_channel_label_2> \\\n"
"... <child_channel_label_n>\n"
msgstr ""
"mgrctl exec -ti -- spacewalk-common-channels \\\n"
"<base_channel_label> \\\n"
"<child_channel_label_1> \\\n"
"<child_channel_label_2> \\\n"
"... <child_channel_label_n>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/partials/addchannels_novendor_cli.adoc:4
msgid "To list all available repositories, execute the command:"
msgstr "Untuk menampilkan semua repositori yang tersedia, jalankan perintah:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/client-configuration/partials/addchannels_novendor_cli.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgrctl exec -- spacewalk-common-channels -l\n"
msgstr "mgrctl exec -- spacewalk-common-channels -l\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/partials/addchannels_novendor_cli.adoc:6
msgid "If xref:administration:custom-channels.adoc#_custom_channel_synchronization[automatic synchronization] is turned off, synchronize the channels:"
msgstr "Jika xref:administration:custom-channels.adoc#_custom_channel_synchronization[automatic synchronization] dinonaktifkan, sinkronkan saluran:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/client-configuration/partials/addchannels_novendor_cli.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgrctl exec -ti -- spacewalk-repo-sync -p <base_channel_label>\n"
msgstr "mgrctl exec -ti -- spacewalk-repo-sync -p <base_channel_label>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/partials/addchannels_novendor_cli.adoc:8
#: en/modules/client-configuration/partials/addchannels_novendor_cli_multiarch.adoc:6
#: en/modules/client-configuration/partials/addchannels_vendor_cli.adoc:6
msgid "Ensure the synchronization is complete before continuing."
msgstr "Pastikan sinkronisasi selesai sebelum melanjutkan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/partials/addchannels_novendor_cli_multiarch.adoc:2
msgid "With the `spacewalk-common-channels` command you can add the appropriate channels.  At the command prompt on the {productname} container host, as root, execute the following command.  Ensure you specify the correct architecture:"
msgstr "Dengan perintah `spacewalk-common-channels`, Anda dapat menambahkan saluran yang sesuai.  Di prompt perintah pada host kontainer {productname}, sebagai root, jalankan perintah berikut.  Pastikan Anda menentukan arsitektur yang benar:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/client-configuration/partials/addchannels_novendor_cli_multiarch.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mgrctl exec -ti -- spacewalk-common-channels \\\n"
"-a <architecture> \\\n"
"<base_channel_name> \\\n"
"<child_channel_name_1> \\\n"
"<child_channel_name_2> \\\n"
"... <child_channel_name_n>\n"
msgstr ""
"mgrctl exec -ti -- spacewalk-common-channels \\\n"
"-a <architecture> \\\n"
"<base_channel_name> \\\n"
"<child_channel_name_1> \\\n"
"<child_channel_name_2> \\\n"
"... <child_channel_name_n>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/partials/addchannels_novendor_cli_multiarch.adoc:4
msgid "If xref:administration:custom-channels.adoc#_custom_channel_synchronization[automatic synchronization] is turned off, synchronize the channels on the container host with the following command:"
msgstr "Jika xref:administration:custom-channels.adoc#_custom_channel_synchronization[automatic synchronization] dinonaktifkan, sinkronkan saluran pada host kontainer dengan perintah berikut:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/client-configuration/partials/addchannels_novendor_cli_multiarch.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgrctl exec -ti -- spacewalk-repo-sync -p <base_channel_label>-<architecture>\n"
msgstr "mgrctl exec -ti -- spacewalk-repo-sync -p <base_channel_label>-<architecture>\n"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/client-configuration/partials/addchannels_vendor_cli.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Adding software channels at the command prompt"
msgstr "Prosedur: Menambahkan saluran perangkat lunak di prompt perintah"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/client-configuration/partials/addchannels_vendor_cli.adoc:2
msgid "At the command prompt on the {productname} container host, as root, add the appropriate channels:"
msgstr "Di prompt perintah pada host kontainer {productname}, sebagai root, tambahkan saluran yang sesuai:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/client-configuration/partials/addchannels_vendor_cli.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mgrctl exec -- mgr-sync add channel <channel_label_1>\n"
"mgrctl exec -- mgr-sync add channel <channel_label_2>\n"
"mgrctl exec -- mgr-sync add channel <channel_label_n>\n"
msgstr ""
"mgrctl exec -- mgr-sync add channel <channel_label_1>\n"
"mgrctl exec -- mgr-sync add channel <channel_label_2>\n"
"mgrctl exec -- mgr-sync add channel <channel_label_n>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/partials/addchannels_vendor_cli.adoc:4
msgid "Synchronization starts automatically.  If you want to synchronize the channels manually, use:"
msgstr "Sinkronisasi dimulai secara otomatis.  Jika Anda ingin menyinkronkan saluran secara manual, gunakan:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/client-configuration/partials/addchannels_vendor_cli.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgrctl exec -- mgr-sync sync --with-children <channel_name>\n"
msgstr "mgrctl exec -- mgr-sync sync --with-children <channel_name>\n"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/client-configuration/partials/addchannels_vendor_webui.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Adding software channels"
msgstr "Prosedur: Menambahkan saluran perangkat lunak"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/client-configuration/partials/addchannels_vendor_webui.adoc:2
msgid "In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Admin[Setup Wizard > Products]."
msgstr "Di {webui} {productname}, buka menu:Admin[Setup Wizard > Products]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/client-configuration/partials/addchannels_vendor_webui.adoc:3
msgid "Locate the appropriate products for your client operating system and architecture using the search bar, and check the appropriate product.  This will automatically check all mandatory channels.  Also all recommended channels are checked as long as the `include recommended` toggle is turned on.  Click the arrow to see the complete list of related products, and ensure that any extra products you require are checked."
msgstr "Temukan produk yang sesuai dengan sistem operasi dan arsitektur klien Anda menggunakan bilah pencarian, lalu centang produk yang sesuai.  Tindakan ini akan secara otomatis mencentang semua saluran wajib.  Semua saluran yang direkomendasikan juga dicentang selama tombol alih `include recommended` diaktifkan.  Klik panah untuk melihat daftar lengkap produk terkait, lalu pastikan semua produk tambahan yang Anda perlukan telah dicentang."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/client-configuration/partials/addchannels_vendor_webui.adoc:4
msgid "Click btn:[Add Products] and wait until the products have finished synchronizing."
msgstr "Klik btn:[Add Products] dan tunggu hingga sinkronisasi produk selesai."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/partials/arch-other-note.adoc:1
msgid "In the following section, descriptions often default to the `x86_64` architecture.  Replace it with other architectures if appropriate."
msgstr "Pada bagian berikut, deskripsi umumnya menggunakan arsitektur `x86_64` sebagai acuan.  Ganti dengan arsitektur lain jika diperlukan."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/client-configuration/partials/check_sync_cli.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Checking synchronization progress from the command prompt"
msgstr "Prosedur: Memeriksa kemajuan sinkronisasi dari prompt perintah"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/client-configuration/partials/check_sync_cli.adoc:2
msgid "To list available logs before tailing, on the container host, run the following command:"
msgstr "Untuk menampilkan daftar log yang tersedia sebelum memantaunya dengan tail, jalankan perintah berikut pada host kontainer:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/client-configuration/partials/check_sync_cli.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgrctl exec ls /var/log/rhn/reposync/\n"
msgstr "mgrctl exec ls /var/log/rhn/reposync/\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/partials/check_sync_cli.adoc:4
msgid "At the command prompt on the {productname} container host, as root, check the synchronization of a channel log file:"
msgstr "Di prompt perintah pada host kontainer {productname}, sebagai root, periksa sinkronisasi melalui file log saluran:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/client-configuration/partials/check_sync_cli.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgrctl exec -ti -- tail -f /var/log/rhn/reposync/<channel-label>.log\n"
msgstr "mgrctl exec -ti -- tail -f /var/log/rhn/reposync/<channel-label>.log\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/partials/check_sync_cli.adoc:6
msgid "Each child channel generates its own log during the synchronization progress.  You need to check all the base and child channel log files to be sure that the synchronization is complete."
msgstr "Setiap channel anak menghasilkan log tersendiri selama proses sinkronisasi.  Anda perlu memeriksa semua berkas log channel dasar dan anak untuk memastikan sinkronisasi telah selesai."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/client-configuration/partials/check_sync_webui_mlm.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Checking synchronization progress from the {webui}"
msgstr "Prosedur: Memeriksa kemajuan sinkronisasi dari {webui}"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/client-configuration/partials/check_sync_webui_mlm.adoc:2
msgid "In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Admin[Setup Wizard] and select the `Products` tab.  This dialog displays a completion bar for each product when they are being synchronized."
msgstr "Di {webui} {productname}, buka menu:Admin[Setup Wizard] dan pilih tab `Products`.  Dialog ini menampilkan bilah kemajuan untuk setiap produk saat sinkronisasi berlangsung."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/client-configuration/partials/check_sync_webui_mlm.adoc:3
msgid "Alternatively, you can navigate to menu:Software[Manage > Channels], then click the channel associated to the repository.  Navigate to the `Repositories` tab, then click `Sync` and check `Sync Status`."
msgstr "Sebagai alternatif, Anda dapat membuka menu:Software[Manage > Channels], lalu mengeklik saluran yang terkait dengan repositori.  Buka tab `Repositories`, lalu klik `Sync` dan periksa `Sync Status`."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/client-configuration/partials/check_sync_webui_uyuni.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Checking Synchronization Progress From the {webui} "
msgstr "Prosedur: Memeriksa Kemajuan Sinkronisasi dari {webui} "

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/partials/check_sync_webui_uyuni.adoc:2
msgid "In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Software[Manage > Channels], then click the channel associated to the repository."
msgstr "Di {webui} {productname}, buka menu:Software[Manage > Channels], lalu klik kanal yang terkait dengan repositori."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/partials/check_sync_webui_uyuni.adoc:3
msgid "Navigate to the `Repositories` tab, then click `Sync` and check `Sync Status`."
msgstr "Buka tab `Repositories`, lalu klik `Sync` dan periksa `Sync Status`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/partials/create_bootstrap_repo_register.adoc:1
msgid "To register your clients, you need a bootstrap repository.  By default, bootstrap repositories are automatically created, and regenerated daily for all synchronized products.  You can manually create the bootstrap repository from the command prompt on the container host:"
msgstr "Untuk mendaftarkan klien, Anda memerlukan repositori bootstrap.  Secara default, repositori bootstrap dibuat secara otomatis dan dibuat ulang setiap hari untuk semua produk yang telah disinkronkan.  Anda dapat membuat repositori bootstrap secara manual dari prompt perintah pada host kontainer:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/client-configuration/partials/create_bootstrap_repo_register.adoc:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgrctl exec -ti mgr-create-bootstrap-repo\n"
msgstr "mgrctl exec -ti mgr-create-bootstrap-repo\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/partials/create_bootstrap_repo_register.adoc:3
msgid "For more information on registering your clients, see xref:client-configuration:registration-overview.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang pendaftaran klien, lihat xref:client-configuration:registration-overview.adoc[]."

#. EOL Client Systems
#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/partials/eol-clients.adoc:1
msgid "When a distribution reaches its end-of-life (EOL), it enters a three-month grace period for management with {productname}. During this time, support is considered deprecated."
msgstr "Ketika suatu distribusi mencapai akhir masa pakainya (EOL), distribusi tersebut memasuki masa tenggang tiga bulan untuk pengelolaan dengan {productname}. Selama periode ini, dukungannya dianggap usang dan akan dihentikan."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/partials/eol-clients.adoc:2
msgid "Once this grace period expires, the product is officially unsupported. Any continued management functionality is provided strictly on a best-effort basis."
msgstr "Setelah masa tenggang ini berakhir, produk tersebut secara resmi tidak lagi didukung. Fungsi pengelolaan yang masih tersedia hanya disediakan berdasarkan upaya terbaik tanpa jaminan."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/partials/eol-clients.adoc:3
msgid "For third-party vendor end-of-life dates, see link:https://endoflife.date/[End of Life Dates]."
msgstr "Untuk tanggal akhir masa pakai produk vendor pihak ketiga, lihat link:https://endoflife.date/[End of Life Dates]."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/client-configuration/partials/managing_appstreams.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Managing Enabled AppStream Modules"
msgstr "Prosedur: Mengelola Modul AppStream yang Diaktifkan"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/partials/managing_appstreams.adoc:2
msgid "In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Systems[Software > AppStreams]."
msgstr "Di {webui} {productname}, buka menu:Systems[Software > AppStreams]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/partials/managing_appstreams.adoc:3
msgid "From the table of module streams, select the streams to be enabled on the client."
msgstr "Dari tabel aliran modul, pilih aliran yang akan diaktifkan pada klien."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/partials/managing_appstreams.adoc:4
msgid "Click btn:[Apply Changes]."
msgstr "Klik btn:[Apply Changes]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/partials/managing_appstreams.adoc:5
msgid "On the next page, check the list of changes to be made, and choose a time for the action to occur."
msgstr "Pada halaman berikutnya, periksa daftar perubahan yang akan dilakukan, lalu pilih waktu pelaksanaan tindakan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/partials/managing_appstreams.adoc:6
msgid "Click btn:[Confirm] to schedule the changes to be applied."
msgstr "Klik btn:[Confirm] untuk menjadwalkan penerapan perubahan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/partials/manual_associate.adoc:1
msgid "When you have created all the channels, you can associate them with the repositories you created:"
msgstr "Setelah membuat semua saluran, Anda dapat mengaitkannya dengan repositori yang telah Anda buat:"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/client-configuration/partials/manual_associate.adoc:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Associating channels with repositories"
msgstr "Prosedur: Mengaitkan saluran dengan repositori"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/client-configuration/partials/manual_associate.adoc:3
msgid "On the {productname} Server {webui}, navigate to menu:Software[Manage > Channels], and click the channel to associate."
msgstr "Di {webui} Server {productname}, buka menu:Software[Manage > Channels], lalu klik saluran yang akan dikaitkan."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/client-configuration/partials/manual_associate.adoc:4
msgid "Navigate to the `Repositories` tab, and check the repository to associate with this channel."
msgstr "Buka tab `Repositories`, lalu centang repositori yang akan dikaitkan dengan saluran ini."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/client-configuration/partials/manual_associate.adoc:5
msgid "Click btn:[Update Repositories] to associate the channel and the repository."
msgstr "Klik btn:[Update Repositories] untuk mengaitkan saluran dengan repositori."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/client-configuration/partials/manual_associate.adoc:6
msgid "Repeat for all channels and repositories you need to associate."
msgstr "Ulangi untuk semua saluran dan repositori yang perlu Anda kaitkan."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/client-configuration/partials/manual_associate.adoc:7
msgid "OPTIONAL: Navigate to the `Sync` tab to set a recurring schedule for synchronization of this repository."
msgstr "OPSIONAL: Buka tab `Sync` untuk mengatur jadwal sinkronisasi berulang bagi repositori ini."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/client-configuration/partials/manual_associate.adoc:8
msgid "Click btn:[Sync Now] to begin synchronization immediately."
msgstr "Klik btn:[Sync Now] untuk segera memulai sinkronisasi."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/client-configuration/partials/manual_channels.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating custom channels"
msgstr "Prosedur: Membuat saluran khusus"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/client-configuration/partials/manual_channels.adoc:2
msgid "On the {productname} Server {webui}, navigate to menu:Software[Manage > Channels]."
msgstr "Di {webui} Server {productname}, buka menu:Software[Manage > Channels]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/client-configuration/partials/manual_channels.adoc:3
msgid "Click btn:[Create Channel] and set the appropriate parameters for the channels."
msgstr "Klik btn:[Create Channel] dan tetapkan parameter yang sesuai untuk saluran."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/client-configuration/partials/manual_channels.adoc:4
msgid "In the `Parent Channel` field, select the appropriate base channel."
msgstr "Di kolom `Parent Channel`, pilih saluran dasar yang sesuai."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/client-configuration/partials/manual_channels.adoc:5
msgid "Click btn:[Create Channel]."
msgstr "Klik btn:[Create Channel]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/client-configuration/partials/manual_channels.adoc:6
msgid "Repeat for all channels you need to create.  There should be one custom channel for each custom repository."
msgstr "Ulangi untuk semua saluran yang perlu Anda buat.  Setiap repositori khusus harus memiliki satu saluran khusus."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/partials/manual_channels.adoc:7
msgid "You can check that you have created all the appropriate channels and repositories, by navigating to menu:Software[Channel List > All]."
msgstr "Anda dapat memastikan bahwa semua saluran dan repositori yang sesuai telah dibuat dengan membuka menu:Software[Channel List > All]."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/client-configuration/partials/manual_repos.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating custom repositories"
msgstr "Prosedur: Membuat repositori khusus"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/client-configuration/partials/manual_repos.adoc:2
msgid "On the {productname} Server {webui}, navigate to menu:Software[Manage > Repositories]."
msgstr "Di {webui} Server {productname}, buka menu:Software[Manage > Repositories]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/client-configuration/partials/manual_repos.adoc:3
msgid "Click btn:[Create Repository] and set the appropriate parameters for the repository."
msgstr "Klik btn:[Create Repository] dan tetapkan parameter yang sesuai untuk repositori."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/client-configuration/partials/manual_repos.adoc:4
msgid "Click btn:[Create Repository]."
msgstr "Klik btn:[Create Repository]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/client-configuration/partials/manual_repos.adoc:5
msgid "Repeat for all repositories you need to create."
msgstr "Ulangi untuk semua repositori yang perlu Anda buat."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/partials/rhel10_cpu_architecture_warning.adoc:1
msgid "RHEL 10 requires _x86-64-v3_ CPU architecture."
msgstr "RHEL 10 memerlukan arsitektur CPU _x86-64-v3_."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/partials/rhel10_cpu_architecture_warning.adoc:2
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Red Hat Enterprise Linux 10** has raised the minimum supported x86-64 microarchitecture baseline to _x86-64-v3_.\n"
"Systems running on _x86-64-v1_ or _x86-64-v2_ CPUs (e.g., pre-Haswell Intel or pre-Excavator AMD processors) cannot run RHEL 10 and will not be supported.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Red Hat Enterprise Linux 10** telah menaikkan batas minimum mikroarsitektur x86-64 yang didukung menjadi _x86-64-v3_.\n"
"Sistem yang menggunakan CPU _x86-64-v1_ atau _x86-64-v2_ (misalnya, prosesor Intel sebelum Haswell atau AMD sebelum Excavator) tidak dapat menjalankan RHEL 10 dan tidak akan didukung.\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/partials/rhel10_cpu_architecture_warning.adoc:3
msgid "This affects both physical hosts and virtual machines.  Hypervisors (e.g., VMware EVC, KVM, etc.) must be configured to expose AVX/AVX2 CPU capabilities to guest VMs, otherwise RHEL 10 installation or boot will fail."
msgstr "Hal ini memengaruhi host fisik maupun mesin virtual.  Hypervisor (misalnya, VMware EVC, KVM, dan sebagainya) harus dikonfigurasi untuk mengekspos kemampuan CPU AVX/AVX2 ke VM tamu. Jika tidak, instalasi atau proses boot RHEL 10 akan gagal."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/partials/rhel10_cpu_architecture_warning.adoc:4
msgid "Before deploying or upgrading to RHEL 10, verify that your hardware meets the _x86-64-v3_ requirement."
msgstr "Sebelum menerapkan atau meningkatkan versi ke RHEL 10, pastikan perangkat keras Anda memenuhi persyaratan _x86-64-v3_."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/partials/rhel10_cpu_architecture_warning.adoc:5
msgid "References:"
msgstr "Referensi:"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/partials/rhel10_cpu_architecture_warning.adoc:6
msgid "https://docs.redhat.com/en/documentation/red_hat_enterprise_linux/10/html/considerations_in_adopting_rhel_10/architectures[RHEL 10 Architecture Support – Red Hat Documentation]"
msgstr "https://docs.redhat.com/en/documentation/red_hat_enterprise_linux/10/html/considerations_in_adopting_rhel_10/architectures[RHEL 10 Architecture Support – Red Hat Documentation]"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/partials/rhel10_cpu_architecture_warning.adoc:7
msgid "https://access.redhat.com/solutions/7066628[x86-64-v3 Requirement for RHEL 10 – Red Hat Customer Portal]"
msgstr "https://access.redhat.com/solutions/7066628[x86-64-v3 Requirement for RHEL 10 – Red Hat Customer Portal]"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/partials/rhel10_cpu_architecture_warning.adoc:8
msgid "https://developers.redhat.com/articles/2024/01/02/exploring-x86-64-v3-red-hat-enterprise-linux-10[Exploring x86-64-v3 for RHEL 10 – Red Hat Developer Blog]"
msgstr "https://developers.redhat.com/articles/2024/01/02/exploring-x86-64-v3-red-hat-enterprise-linux-10[Exploring x86-64-v3 for RHEL 10 – Red Hat Developer Blog]"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/client-configuration/partials/snippet-creating-activation-key.adoc:2
msgid "In the {productname} {webui}, as an administrator, navigate to menu:Systems[Activation Keys]."
msgstr "Di {webui} {productname}, sebagai administrator, buka menu:Systems[Activation Keys]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/client-configuration/partials/snippet-creating-activation-key.adoc:3
msgid "Click the btn:[Create Key] button."
msgstr "Klik tombol btn:[Create Key]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/client-configuration/partials/snippet-creating-activation-key.adoc:4
msgid "On the `Activation Key Details` page, in the `Description` field, enter a description of the activation key."
msgstr "Di halaman `Activation Key Details`, pada kolom `Description`, masukkan deskripsi kunci aktivasi."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/client-configuration/partials/snippet-creating-activation-key.adoc:5
msgid "In the `Key` field, enter a name for the activation key.  For example, `SLES15-{sp-version}` for {sles}{nbsp}15{nbsp}{sp-version}."
msgstr "Di kolom `Key`, masukkan nama kunci aktivasi.  Misalnya, `SLES15-{sp-version}` untuk {sles}{nbsp}15{nbsp}{sp-version}."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/partials/snippet-creating-activation-key.adoc:6
msgid "Do not use commas or double quotes in the `Key` field for any {suse} products.  However, you *must* use commas for Red Hat Products."
msgstr "Jangan gunakan koma atau tanda kutip ganda di kolom `Key` untuk produk {suse} apa pun.  Namun, Anda *harus* menggunakan koma untuk Produk Red Hat."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/partials/snippet-creating-activation-key.adoc:7
msgid "All other characters are allowed, but `<> (){}` (this includes the space) are removed automatically."
msgstr "Semua karakter lainnya diperbolehkan, tetapi `<> (){}` (termasuk spasi) dihapus secara otomatis."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/partials/snippet-creating-activation-key.adoc:8
msgid "If the field is left empty, a random string is generated."
msgstr "Jika kolom dibiarkan kosong, string acak akan dibuat."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/partials/snippet-creating-activation-key.adoc:9
msgid "In the `Usage` add number of times the key can be used, or leave it blank for unlimited usage."
msgstr "Di `Usage`, masukkan jumlah penggunaan kunci yang diizinkan, atau biarkan kosong agar penggunaannya tidak dibatasi."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/partials/snippet-creating-activation-key.adoc:10
msgid "In the `Base Channels` drop-down box, select the appropriate base software channel, and allow the relevant child channels to populate.  For more information, see xref:reference:admin/setup-wizard.adoc[] and xref:administration:custom-channels.adoc[]."
msgstr "Di kotak tarik-turun `Base Channels`, pilih saluran perangkat lunak dasar yang sesuai, lalu tunggu hingga saluran turunan terkait ditampilkan.  Untuk informasi selengkapnya, lihat xref:reference:admin/setup-wizard.adoc[] dan xref:administration:custom-channels.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/partials/snippet-creating-activation-key.adoc:11
msgid "Select the `Child Channels` you need (for example, the mandatory {susemgr} tools and updates channels)."
msgstr "Pilih `Child Channels` yang Anda perlukan (misalnya, saluran alat dan pembaruan {susemgr} yang wajib)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/partials/snippet-creating-activation-key.adoc:12
msgid "Check the `Add-On System Types` checkbox if you need to enable any of the options.  For more information about system types, see xref:client-configuration:system-types.adoc[]."
msgstr "Centang kotak `Add-On System Types` jika Anda perlu mengaktifkan salah satu opsi.  Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang jenis sistem, lihat xref:client-configuration:system-types.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/partials/snippet-creating-activation-key.adoc:13
msgid "We recommend you leave the `Contact Method` set to `Default`.  For more information about contact methods, see xref:client-configuration:contact-methods-intro.adoc[]."
msgstr "Kami menyarankan agar Anda membiarkan `Contact Method` tetap diatur ke `Default`.  Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang metode kontak, lihat xref:client-configuration:contact-methods-intro.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/partials/snippet-creating-activation-key.adoc:14
msgid "We recommend you leave the `Universal Default` setting unchecked."
msgstr "Kami menyarankan agar Anda membiarkan pengaturan `Universal Default` tidak dicentang."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/partials/snippet-creating-activation-key.adoc:15
msgid "Click btn:[Create Activation Key] to create the activation key."
msgstr "Klik btn:[Create Activation Key] untuk membuat kunci aktivasi."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/partials/snippet-creating-activation-key.adoc:16
msgid "After the activation key is created, the page shows additional checkbox `Configuration File Deployment` below the list of `Add-On System Types`.  To enable deploying configuration files to systems on registration, select this checkbox."
msgstr "Setelah kunci aktivasi dibuat, halaman akan menampilkan kotak centang tambahan `Configuration File Deployment` di bawah daftar `Add-On System Types`.  Untuk mengaktifkan penerapan file konfigurasi ke sistem saat pendaftaran, centang kotak ini."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/partials/snippet-creating-activation-key.adoc:17
msgid "Click btn:[Update Activation Key] to save the change."
msgstr "Klik btn:[Update Activation Key] untuk menyimpan perubahan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/partials/trust_gpg.adoc:1
msgid "Operating systems either trust their own GPG keys directly or at least ship them installed with the minimal system.  But third party packages signed by a different GPG key need manual handling.  The clients can be successfully bootstrapped without the GPG key being trusted.  However, you cannot install new client tool packages or update them until the keys are trusted."
msgstr "Sistem operasi memercayai kunci GPG-nya sendiri secara langsung atau setidaknya menyertakannya dalam instalasi sistem minimal.  Namun, paket pihak ketiga yang ditandatangani dengan kunci GPG berbeda memerlukan penanganan manual.  Proses bootstrap klien dapat berhasil meskipun kunci GPG belum dipercaya.  Namun, Anda tidak dapat menginstal paket alat klien baru atau memperbaruinya hingga kunci tersebut dipercaya."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/partials/trust_gpg.adoc:2
msgid "Clients now use GPG key information entered for a software channel to manage the trusted keys.  When a software channel with GPG key information is assigned to a client, the key is trusted when the channel is refreshed or the first package is installed from this channel."
msgstr "Klien kini menggunakan informasi kunci GPG yang dimasukkan untuk saluran perangkat lunak guna mengelola kunci tepercaya.  Ketika saluran perangkat lunak yang memiliki informasi kunci GPG ditetapkan ke klien, kunci tersebut akan dipercaya saat saluran disegarkan atau paket pertama dari saluran tersebut diinstal."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/partials/trust_gpg.adoc:3
msgid "The GPG key URL parameter in the software channel page can contain multiple key URLs separated by \"whitespace\".  In case it is a file URL, the GPG key file must be deployed on the client before the software channel is used."
msgstr "Parameter URL kunci GPG di halaman saluran perangkat lunak dapat berisi beberapa URL kunci yang dipisahkan oleh \"whitespace\".  Jika URL tersebut berupa URL file, file kunci GPG harus diterapkan pada klien sebelum saluran perangkat lunak digunakan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/partials/trust_gpg.adoc:4
msgid "The GPG keys for the Client Tools Channels of {redhat} based clients are deployed on the client into `/etc/pki/rpm-gpg/` and can be referenced with file URLs."
msgstr "Kunci GPG untuk Saluran Alat Klien pada klien berbasis {redhat} diterapkan ke direktori `/etc/pki/rpm-gpg/` pada klien dan dapat dirujuk menggunakan URL file."

#.  SUSE Liberty Linux not available at Uyuni for now
#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/partials/trust_gpg.adoc:5
msgid "Same is the case with the GPG keys of {sll} clients."
msgstr "Hal yang sama berlaku untuk kunci GPG klien {sll}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/partials/trust_gpg.adoc:6
msgid "Only in case a software channel is assigned to the client they will be imported and trusted by the system."
msgstr "Kunci tersebut hanya akan diimpor dan dipercaya oleh sistem jika saluran perangkat lunak ditetapkan ke klien."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/client-configuration/partials/trust_gpg.adoc:7
msgid "Because Debian based systems sign only metadata, there is no need to specify extra keys for single channels.  If a user configures an own GPG key to sign the metadata as described in \"Use Your Own GPG Key\" in xref:administration:repo-metadata.adoc[] the deployment and trust of that key is executed automatically."
msgstr "Karena sistem berbasis Debian hanya menandatangani metadata, tidak perlu menentukan kunci tambahan untuk masing-masing saluran.  Jika pengguna mengonfigurasi kunci GPG sendiri untuk menandatangani metadata sebagaimana dijelaskan dalam \"Gunakan Kunci GPG Anda Sendiri\" di xref:administration:repo-metadata.adoc[], penerapan dan penetapan kepercayaan terhadap kunci tersebut dilakukan secara otomatis."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/client-configuration/partials/trust_gpg.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "User Defined GPG Keys"
msgstr "Kunci GPG yang Ditentukan Pengguna"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/partials/trust_gpg.adoc:9
msgid "Users can define custom GPG keys to be deployed to a client."
msgstr "Pengguna dapat menentukan kunci GPG khusus untuk diterapkan ke klien."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/partials/trust_gpg.adoc:10
msgid "By providing some pillar data and providing the GPG key files in the {salt} filesystem, they are automatically deployed to the client."
msgstr "Dengan menyediakan data pillar dan file kunci GPG di sistem file {salt}, kunci tersebut akan diterapkan secara otomatis ke klien."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/partials/trust_gpg.adoc:11
msgid "These keys are deployed into `/etc/pki/rpm-gpg/` on RPM based operating systems and to `/usr/share/keyrings/` on Debian systems:"
msgstr "Kunci ini diterapkan ke `/etc/pki/rpm-gpg/` pada sistem operasi berbasis RPM dan ke `/usr/share/keyrings/` pada sistem Debian:"

#.  I think the cat command is here to show the contents of the file.
#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/partials/trust_gpg.adoc:12
msgid "Define the pillar key [literal`custom_gpgkeys` for the client you want to deploy the key to and list the names of the key file."
msgstr "Tentukan kunci pillar [literal`custom_gpgkeys` untuk klien tujuan penerapan kunci, lalu cantumkan nama file kunci."

#.  In this case, the cat is superfluous.
#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/client-configuration/partials/trust_gpg.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"cat /srv/pillar/mypillar.sls\n"
"custom_gpgkeys:\n"
"  - my_first_gpg.key\n"
"  - my_second_gpgkey.gpg\n"
msgstr ""
"cat /srv/pillar/mypillar.sls\n"
"custom_gpgkeys:\n"
"  - my_first_gpg.key\n"
"  - my_second_gpgkey.gpg\n"

#.  I think the ls command is here to show the contents of the directory.
#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/partials/trust_gpg.adoc:14
msgid "Additionally in the {salt} filesystem create a directory named `gpg` and store there the GPG key files with the name specified in the `custom_gpgkeys` pillar data."
msgstr "Selain itu, buat direktori bernama `gpg` di sistem file {salt}, lalu simpan file kunci GPG di dalamnya dengan nama yang ditentukan dalam data pillar `custom_gpgkeys`."

#.  In this case, the ls is superfluous.
#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/client-configuration/partials/trust_gpg.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"ls -la /srv/salt/gpg/\n"
"/srv/salt/gpg/my_first_gpg.key\n"
"/srv/salt/gpg/my_second_gpgkey.gpg\n"
msgstr ""
"ls -la /srv/salt/gpg/\n"
"/srv/salt/gpg/my_first_gpg.key\n"
"/srv/salt/gpg/my_second_gpgkey.gpg\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/partials/trust_gpg.adoc:16
msgid "The keys are deployed to the client at `/etc/pki/rpm-gpg/my_first_gpg.key` and `/etc/pki/rpm-gpg/my_second_gpgkey.gpg`."
msgstr "Kunci diterapkan ke klien di `/etc/pki/rpm-gpg/my_first_gpg.key` dan `/etc/pki/rpm-gpg/my_second_gpgkey.gpg`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/partials/trust_gpg.adoc:17
msgid "The last step is to add the URL to the GPG key URL field of the software channel.  Navigate to menu:Software[Manage > Channels] and select the channel you want to modify.  Add to `GPG key URL` the value `file:///etc/pki/rpm-gpg/my_first_gpg.key`."
msgstr "Langkah terakhir adalah menambahkan URL ke kolom URL kunci GPG pada saluran perangkat lunak.  Buka menu:Software[Manage > Channels] dan pilih saluran yang ingin Anda ubah.  Tambahkan nilai `file:///etc/pki/rpm-gpg/my_first_gpg.key` ke `GPG key URL`."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/client-configuration/partials/trust_gpg.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "GPG Keys in Bootstrap Scripts"
msgstr "Kunci GPG dalam Skrip Bootstrap"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/client-configuration/partials/trust_gpg.adoc:19
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Trusting GPG Keys on Clients Using a Bootstrap Script"
msgstr "Prosedur: Menetapkan Kunci GPG sebagai Tepercaya pada Klien Menggunakan Skrip Bootstrap"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/partials/trust_gpg.adoc:20
msgid "On the {productname} Server, at the command prompt, check the contents of the `/srv/www/htdocs/pub/` directory.  This directory contains all available public keys.  Take a note of the key that applies to the channel assigned to the client you are registering."
msgstr "Di Server {productname}, pada prompt perintah, periksa isi direktori `/srv/www/htdocs/pub/`.  Direktori ini berisi semua kunci publik yang tersedia.  Catat kunci yang berlaku untuk saluran yang ditetapkan ke klien yang sedang Anda daftarkan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/partials/trust_gpg.adoc:21
msgid "Open the relevant bootstrap script, locate the `ORG_GPG_KEY=` parameter and add the required key.  For example:"
msgstr "Buka skrip bootstrap yang sesuai, temukan parameter `ORG_GPG_KEY=`, lalu tambahkan kunci yang diperlukan.  Misalnya:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/client-configuration/partials/trust_gpg.adoc:22
#, no-wrap
msgid "uyuni-gpg-pubkey-0d20833e.key\n"
msgstr "uyuni-gpg-pubkey-0d20833e.key\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/client-configuration/partials/trust_gpg.adoc:23
msgid "You do not need to delete any previously stored keys."
msgstr "Anda tidak perlu menghapus kunci yang telah disimpan sebelumnya."
